window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":5001,"title":"Chapter 5001 The Sword Immortals from Ten Hua Years Ago","paragraphs":["5001 The Sword Immortals from Ten Hua Years Ago","The Immortals sat down, the Heavenly Hall was silent.","Everyone took their seats. The Heavenly Palace was still empty and silent.","Jian Wushuang looked carefully at the mysterious Heavenly Palace, which was built with the entire Fifth Heaven as its foundation.","He did not know why Yu Yao had stopped them and invited them here, but he could vaguely guess that Yu Yao had an ulterior goal.","Furthermore, this woman’s courage was extraordinary, far from what ordinary Grand Yan Immortals could compare to. Furthermore, she would not be absolute in her actions, leaving room for maneuver.","One had to know that Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing did not deliberately hide their auras, and their auras were not comparable to ordinary Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals.","Facing these three terrifying Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, Yu Yao’s expression did not change, she was even as calm as before.","In such a situation, Yu Yao had only two plans. The first was that she was betting that Jian Wushuang and the others were good people.","The second was that she had something to rely on, and that something was very powerful.","Jian Wushuang guessed that the second possibility was the greatest. To be able to support such a magnificent Super Heavenly Continent, a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal might be exhausted.","It was very likely that there were at least two Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals following Yu Yao.","In this journey to the Endless Sea, there were countless Grand Yan Immortals at the initial stage, and there were also many Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, but Six and Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals were extremely rare.","This showed that even though there were countless geniuses in the Ancient Era, Six Revolutions was the true dividing line.","Once one crossed the threshold of Six Revolutions, they would have the qualifications to be called ‘Immortal Lord’.","Seeing that they were all seated, Yu Yao’s gaze slowly swept over them again. Finally, it stopped on Jian Wushuang, and her eyes revealed some doubt.","She found it unbelievable. How could a puny little Yan Immortal achieve such a dense and terrifying fate energy? Even if he was sitting side by side with a Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortal, his fate energy could still resist their influence.","Strange, it was too strange. Could it be that he knew a supreme secret technique to hide his cultivation realm?","That must be the case.","Yu Yao thought to herself and subconsciously regarded Jian Wushuang as the most dangerous existence.","Seeing that they had all taken their seats, she smiled slightly and then stretched out her hand to touch the air. Immediately, the space fluctuated.","Being within it, it felt extremely mysterious.","Just as he thought, as the galaxy in the Heavenly Hall surged, figures walked out of the ripples.","Seeing this, Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and the others were all stunned. They had all sensed the terrifying fluctuations in the galaxy.","One had to know that the only thing that could make them keep in mind was a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","Just as Jian Wushuang had expected, a total of 6 Nine Revolutions Grand Expanse Immortals stepped out of the galaxy, and boundless fate flowed out of their bodies.","The 6 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals were all in their prime, countless years had not left any marks on their Immortal bodies, they could even return to their prime with just a thought.","They were all dressed in Flowing Cloud uniform, which was exactly the same as Yu Yao’s.","Seeing them, Jian Wushuang finally understood why Yu Yao dared to stop them and expose the hinterland of the Third and Fifth Heaven.","This was because she was not afraid. A total of 7 Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortals was an unimaginable force, enough to cause a destructive blow to any part of the Endless Sea.","The 6 Nine Revolutions Grand Expanse Immortals walked out of the galaxy and their eyes naturally locked onto Jian Wushuang and the others.","Of course, their gazes would only fall on Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing.","Following that, under Yu Yao’s guidance, the 6 Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortals sat in front of a table on the other side of the Heavenly Hall, seemingly in a confrontation.","Jian Wushuang did not care about this. If Yu Yao and the others had any ill intentions, they would definitely be met with the most tragic destruction.","After all the higher-beings had taken their seats, Yu Yao slowly stood up. Every step she took was filled with power.","She smiled at Jian Wushuang and the others, then looked to the other side and said softly, “Let me introduce...”","Yu Yao had only finished half of her sentence when she was interrupted by a clean-looking Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal with an ethereal appearance.","“There’s no need for introductions. We’ve already heard of the names of Jiang Li and Yan Fan more than ten years ago.”","As he finished speaking, the other 5 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals nodded slightly.","“Oh, looks like I was too shallow,” Yu Yao said indifferently. “Immortal Lord Zun Gu, can you tell me?”","The Nine Revolutions Great Evolution Immortal named Zun Gu smiled slightly, his gaze passing Yu Yao in the center and looking at Jiang Li and Yan Fan.","“A dozen years ago, before we reached Nine Revolutions, these two Sword Immortals were already famous, their names shaking millions of domains.”","“At that time, it was said that as long as an Imperial Emperor obtained two Sword Immortals, he could destroy any Heavenly Court and establish a supreme Heavenly Court.”","“Rumor has it that the two of them are the closest existences to the Emperor.”","At this point, Immortal Lord Zun Gu laughed self-deprecatingly. “It seems that even if we can get out, we won’t be able to take revenge in our lifetime.”","The Heavenly Palace was silent. Jiang Li did not move. Yan Fan scratched his head awkwardly. He did not expect a Grand Yan Immortal to recognize him and talk about that old rumor.","Jian Wushuang was noot too surprised after hearing this. A Sword Immortal who could only practice the action of drawing a sword in a year could not be measured with ordinary common sense.","After listening to the secret story of Immortal Lord Zun Gu, Yu Yao smiled. “In that case, it seems that the Immortal Array is enough to open up a passageway.”","Hearing this, Zun Gu looked at Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and then at her. “If we can have the two Sword Immortals as our guarantee, the Immortal Array will be activated, but I’m afraid the two Sword Immortals wouldn’t agree to our request.”","Yu Yao did not say anything after hearing that. She walked to Jian Wushuang and the others with a gentle expression.","“Immortal Lords, Yu Yao would like to ask all of you to work together to activate the Galaxia Immortal Array.”","Jian Wushuang looked at Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and the others. His divine thoughts trembled slightly.","He was not the only one. Even Jiang Li and Yan Fan felt an uneasy throbbing in their hearts."]},{"number":5002,"title":"Chapter 5002 The Immortals Lords Are Working Together","paragraphs":["5002 The Immortals Lords Are Working Together","The Galaxia Immortal Array was about to activate.","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and Immortal Lord Fu Yao did not speak. Instead, they all looked at Jian Wushuang.","Yu Yao was even more surprised and shocked when she saw this scene. Then, she was even more certain that Jian Wushuang was not simple.","After pondering for a moment, he raised his head and looked at Yu Yao. “Tell us what the Galaxia Immortal Array is.”","“Of course I will.” She nodded without hesitation.","Then, she turned around and came to the center of the entire Heavenly Palace. Facing the starry sky dome above her head, she raised her arms.","In the next moment, the entire Heavenly Palace rumbled and trembled. As it trembled, the starry sky dome began to revolve.","It was as if the celestial river was roaring. The boundless aura of the stars and purple energy erupted. It was the Primordial Purple Intent.","Streams of Primordial Purple Intent fell from the celestial river like tassels, seemingly drowning the entire Heavenly Palace.","Accompanied by the endless Primordial Purple Intent, the celestial river that carried the giant sun and stars roared and surged. Even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was overwhelmed by emotions.","This kind of power was too shocking, and there was even a faint sense of transcendence.","Every drop of Primordial Purple Intent condensed and rose in the hall, gradually condensing into the appearance of a magnificent Immortal Array.","However, this Immortal Array only existed for dozens of breaths before it shattered and disappeared!","Yu Yao, who was standing in the center of the Immortal Array, was extremely pale. She could not even stand properly.","She stood up with difficulty and looked at Jian Wushuang and the others. “Immortal Lords, what I showed you just now is the Galaxia Immortal Array. Once it is fully activated, it will be time for us to leave the Endless Sea.”","When they heard that the Galaxia Immortal Array was the array that opened the passage, Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and the others were shocked.","Just being able to leave the Endless Sea was enough to make their hearts throb.","However, they remained calm and waited for Jian Wushuang to speak.","After pondering for a moment, Jian Wushuang said, “Can we really use the Immortal Array to leave the Endless Sea?”","Yu Yao said, “I can be sure that as long as the providence is sufficient, this Galaxia Immortal Array will be able to tear open the space of the Endless Sea.”","Yu Yao slowly shook her head, “No, not even once. Ever since the Galaxia Immortal Array was created, it has only existed in our imagination until now. This is because we only have one chance to tear open the Endless Sea.”","“How can I believe you? If this is just your speculation, I’m afraid the consequences will be unbearable,” Jian Wushuang looked at her and said.","Bang!","A heavy voice rang out as Immortal Lord Zun Gu slammed the table and stood up with an unfriendly expression. “Since when did a puny little Yan Immortal have the right to interrupt?”","In the next moment, a Snowflake Sword rose without any warning and stopped in front of Zun Gu almost instantly. The tip of the sword was only an inch away from his eyes!","Although it was only one sword, it was like the mountains and seas were about to collapse, causing all the Yan powers to lose their color.","Cold sweat instantly flowed down from Zun Gu’s temples. He was horrified to find that even though he had already reached the Nine Revolutions realm, he still could not have any thoughts of resisting this sword.","“Now, tell us again if he has the right to interrupt?” Yan Fan said calmly, his unconcealed killing intent bursting out.","Zun Gu did not dare to say anything. He could only struggle to sit on the ground, trying to hide his fright.","Jian Wushuang did not even look at him. He just looked at Yu Yao and said, “You haven’t answered my question.”","Yu Yao came back to her senses. She began to realize that she had made a huge mistake. Jian Wushuang and the others were never good people who could be manipulated by others. A bloody battle might even break out at any time.","Putting away her thoughts, she gritted her teeth and said, “That’s right, this Immortal Array is too grand. Even if we gather the power of the seven of us, it will be difficult to construct this Immortal Array.”","“Actually, this Galaxia Immortal Array is built with 100,000 Immortal Yan Fate as the foundation. The fate energy contained in it is something that even we can’t control.”","“Moreover, the most important point is that the location of the Third and Fifth Heaven is the weakest place in the entire Endless Sea.”","“We only need to activate the Galaxia Immortal Array and attack the weakest point to tear open the Endless Sea!”","After Yu Yao finished speaking, she looked at Jian Wushuang and the others nervously. If they did not agree, she would have no choice but to let them leave.","Once they left, it would be almost impossible to gather so many Immortal Lords.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. Yu Yao’s words were highly credible.","He had already guessed that the Endless Sea must have a weak spot. Using the power of the Immortal Array to blast open the weak spot would be quite feasible.","If this was really the weak spot, then the gathering of ten Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals and the Yan power of 100,000 Yan Immortals would definitely be able to tear open a crack.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang’s heart beat faster. If they missed this opportunity, could they leave again?","Without the help of the Young Emperor, it was not even as feasible to use the Galaxia Immortal Array to tear open the rift if he wanted to use the golden jade ring to open the passageway.","After pondering for a moment, Jian Wushuang looked at Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing.","“We can try.” Yan Fan used a voice transmission technique so that only they could hear it.","Di Qing did not say much. Jian Wushuang’s decision was his decision.","Next, he raised his head and looked at Yu Yao. “Alright, we’ll agree. However, there’s one thing. Once we discover that there’s something hidden, you won’t be able to bear the consequences.”","Yu Yao secretly heaved a sigh of relief before smiling again. She said, “We’ve been waiting for this day for far too long. We only need to work together once, and we’ll be able to leave!”","The simple conversation ended with Jian Wushuang agreeing to join.","At this moment, all the Immortal Lords worked together to prepare to activate the Galaxia Immortal Array.","The Galaxia Immortal Array, which used the life force and fate energy of 100,000 Yan Immortals as its foundation, could not be activated even with the combined power of 7 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals.","Now that Jiang Li and Yan Fan had joined in, Di Qing and the other 2 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals had a chance to activate it.","This Galaxia Immortal Array did not have an array core, but it was precisely because of this that its upper limit was even more terrifying.","Jian Wushuang was certain that once the Immortal Array was activated, it would be able to tear open the Endless Sea and open a passage out of this place.","“Will there be any unexpected changes?” Fu Ya said with a hint of worry."]},{"number":5003,"title":"Chapter 5003 Galaxia Immortal Array","paragraphs":["5003 Galaxia Immortal Array","After experiencing this series of bloody battles, she had become much more cautious and steady.","“When will it start?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Anytime. We’ve been waiting for this day for countless years,” Yu Yao said, her eyes filled with determination.","Immortal Lord Jun Gu, who was threatened by Yan Fan’s sword, had an extremely ugly expression, but he still put swallowed his pride and asked, “Have you decided on a candidate?”","Yu Yao nodded and said, “The 7 of us, plus 3 more, a total of 10 Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortals should be able to completely activate the Immortal Array.”","“No, not necessarily. I’m afraid that even if we gather the strength of the 10 of us, we still won’t be able to activate the Immortal Array,” Immortal Lord Jun Gu’s expression was somewhat solemn. “You have to know that this Immortal Array has two stages. We can control the second stage, but the first stage is probably difficult to control.”","Hearing this, Yu Yao fell silent. It was not that she did not know that it was better to have as many Grand Yan Immortals as possible, but 10Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals was already the limit.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang asked, “There are two stages in the Immortal Array. What do you mean?”","Yu Yao did not want to hide it either, so she said, “Actually, we weren’t the ones who created this Galaxia Immortal Array. It has existed since ancient times, but it’s already broken.”","“After I found the Galaxia Immortal Array, I started to repair it. However, its broken core can’t be repaired no matter what. I can only use external energy to replace it.”","“That’s why we said that this Immortal Array has two stages. The first stage is the problem of the core, which is a big problem. The second stage is the problem of activating it.”","“As for the problem of activation, we can use the power of the 10Grand Yan Immortals to activate the Immortal Array. However, I’m afraid that we won’t be able to control the core of the Immortal Array and our efforts will be in vain.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang understood what she meant.","He needed a living Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal who could use his own fate energy to fix the problem of the core during the first stage of the Immortal Array’s operation.","After a while, Jian Wushuang said softly, “Leave the first stage to me.”","As soon as he said this, Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing immediately denied it.","How could they not know what Yu Yao meant by her words earlier? As the formation core of the first stage of the Galaxia Immortal Array, the probability of dying was almost as high as 99%.","That was because it required an immense amount of fate energy to activate the Immortal Array.","Once there was a problem with the first stage of the Immortal Array, then the Yan Immortal that acted as the core of the formation could be sucked dry in an instant.","Di Qing’s gaze turned cold almost instantly. He took a step forward and said coldly, “Are you playing with us? You want us to die?”","Yu Yao was silent. She had nothing to say because if the first stage of the formation went wrong, then the Yan Immortal who acted as the core of the formation would definitely die.","“For the first stage of the formation core, it is impossible to use a puny little Yan Immortal as the formation core, what is needed is a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal!”","Immortal Lord Jun Gu glanced at Jian Wushuang and then came to Yu Yao, “I will be the one to sacrifice for the first stage of the formation core.”","Even Jian Wushuang looked at him in surprise.","The impression that Immortal Lord Zun Gu gave him was not good. It could even be described as terrible. Therefore, after he said this decision, it was still unbelievable.","Even Yu Yao was a little surprised. After which, she shook her head, “No, Immortal Lord Zun Gu, you need at least 10Nine Revolutions Power to activate the Immortal Array. Once you leave, there will only be nine left...”","The Immortal Lord Jun Gu smiled when he heard that, “This Galaxia Immortal Array indeed requires the fate energy of about 10 Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortals to activate, but it’s different now.”","At this point, he glanced at Jiang Li and Yan Fan before continuing, “If it was an ordinary Nine Revolutions, I would indeed need 10, but with 2 Sword Immortals joining, it would be enough to replace me.”","“And therefore, I can be the array formation core replacement of the first stage.”","At this point, Immortal Lord Jun Gu let out a long sigh. “This matter has been decided. I will be the array core of the first stage.”","In the end, all the Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortals present were not indecisive people. Since the formation core of the first stage had been decided, it was only a matter of time before the Galaxia Immortal Array was activated.","Yu Yao stood in the middle, and under the guidance of her arms, the majestic celestial river arrived once again!","At this moment, Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing were already standing in the center of the Heavenly Hall.","Other than Immortal Loord Jun Gu, the 9 Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortals had already formed a circle.","All of them unleashed their peak strength without holding back.","This was the most shocking scene, and all kinds of extreme peaks and powers surged up. The indescribable general trend finally converged at one point, allowing the entire magnificent Immortal Array to appear!","Among them, just the two Sword Immortals, Jiang Li and Yan Fan, contributed almost half of their strength.","Then, there was Di Qing. As a man who did not acknowledge Emperor Zhen Wuyang at all, even if his fate energy was not as great as Jiang Li and Yan Fan’s, it was not much different.","However, the other Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals were squeezed to the point where they were embarrassed.","Jian Wushuang and Immortal Lord Fu Yao, who could not contribute, stood at the outermost edge of the Galaxia Immortal Array and watched the scene closely.","Immortal Lord Jun Gu stood behind Yu Yao, his gaze firm and decisive. He seemed to have made that decision long ago without any hesitation.","Layers of Primordial Purple Intent descended from the celestial river, reinforcing the bodies of every Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, and gradually condensed into the appearance of a grand Immortal Array.","Billions of stars flowed within, filled with an ancient and desolate aura.","After being guided by Yu Yao in the center, a total of 9 grand fate energy merged into 1 and finally activated the Galaxia Immortal Array.","Under the illumination of the Primordial Purple Intent and the multicolored light, Jian Wushuang felt his Yan power growing at an extremely slow speed.","“Immortal Array, activate!”","This Immortal Array, which was almost as huge as the entire vast Heavenly Continent, finally opened.","Combining the power of fate energy of the 9 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, the Galaxia Immortal Array that had been sealed for countless years was completely activated.","The Heavenly Palace shattered into pieces, turning into powder and disappearing.","A resplendent pillar of light with endless Primordial Purple Intent shot into the sky, illuminating the dark sky."]},{"number":5004,"title":"Chapter 5004 The Change of the Immortal Array","paragraphs":["5004 The Change of the Immortal Array","At this moment, all the Grand Yan Immortals in the Third and Fifth Heaven stopped cultivating. They stood in the void and looked at the huge array with burning eyes. Their hearts were surging.","Jian Wushuang, who was standing at the periphery of the Immortal Array, looked at the scene solemnly. He was finally convinced that Yu Yao’s words were true.","Once the Galaxia Immortal Array, which gathered 10 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals and 100,000 Yan Immortals, was activated, a crack would definitely be torn open in the Endless Sea.","In the center of the Immortal Array, Yu Yao held her hands high and made a gesture of opening the sky.","9 streaks of fate energy from the Nine Revolutions Nine Great Immortals transformed into a pillar of light. Under her guidance, it was blasted onto the Galaxia Immortal Array’s array core.","Buzz...","Waves of ancient voices resounded throughout the world.","The Galaxia Immortal Array which had been silent for countless years was completely activated at this moment.","The endless Primordial Purple Intent stopped falling and stopped in the void. It began to rapidly construct flowing purple patterns.","When all the Primordial Purple Intent transformed into dense purple patterns, the Galaxia Immortal Array was formed. It was so large that it used the entire Fifth Heaven as its foundation.","The 9 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals were acting as the corners of the formation, each acting as one of the formation cores, with the array formation operating in the center. Their fate energy made the Galaxia Immortal Array start to circulate.","Looking at the magnificent Immortal Array, Jian Wushuang sharply noticed that although there seemed to be only nine formation cores, there was another formation core behind Yu Yao. However, the formation core was sealed and had not been activated yet.","Immortal Lord Zun Gu stood in the position of that formation core.","“Immortal Lords, please release all your fate energy,” Yu Yao called out loudly. She was already at her limits from supporting such a grand Immortal Array all by herself.","“Whether we can leave or not depends on this one move!!”","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing looked at each other, then both of them released their great fate energy!","Just the three of them alone released a vast amount of fate energy, pushing the Galaxia Immortal Array to its peak.","Other than Yu Yao, the remaining 5 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals did not hesitate and sent out their most majestic fate energy.","Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortals were the peak. The fate energy of a Heavenly Region Plane could not even come close to theirs. They were supreme experts and terrifying existences that could sense the fate energy of Emperors.","Thus, at this moment, when the 8 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals’ heavenly fate energy formed into one, the Galaxia Immortal Array was activated.","Immortal Lord Zun Gu stood on the silent array core behind Yu Yao and watched this scene nervously.","But now, there was hope for everything. Nothing could go wrong!","At this moment, Jian Wushuang, who was standing at the outermost area, was also solemn. This was the only time they could leave the Endless Sea.","The world had changed. The fate energy of the Grand Yan Immortals was too terrifying and grand. It allowed the entire Galaxia Immortal Array to activate.","It was like a sealed heavenly gate that shot out billions of multicolored lights.","Led by Yu Yao, the luck of the 9 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals worked together to attack the sealed gate above the Immortal Array.","Buzz...","A heavy buzz erupted between heaven and earth again. All the spectating Grand Yan Immortals were forced back by this fluctuation!","Even Jian Wushuang, who was trying to keep his mind calm, was shaken by the fluctuation.","However, even this kind of power was unable to break open the sealed gate above the Immortal Array.","Yu Yao grunted as a stream of divine blood flowed out from the corner of her mouth.","Sensing this change, Immortal Lord Zun Gu was shocked. He sensed that something was wrong and hurriedly prepared to help.","“Zun Gu, don’t move!” Yu Yao shouted. She raised arms once again, released endless power!","The two collided, and the gate exploded with a deep rumble. It was no longer as unbreakable as before.","Immortal Lord Zun Gu could only stand back at the original array core and continue to watch this scene nervously.","This stalemate lasted for a long time. They had gathered 9 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals and 100,000 Yan Immortals for this, and it reached the extreme. The purple light of the Primordial Purple Intent almost formed a mist.","In the sky, fine cracks began to appear on the sealed gate.","At this moment, even Jian Wushuang was secretly nervous. Once the sealed gate was broken, the Endless Sea would be opened!","Immortal Lord Zun Gu was even more excited. He almost went to the center of the array formation to add some strength.","The situation had reached this stage, and the Galaxia Immortal Array had successfully activated. There was no problem with the core of the first formation core. If this continued, it would only be a matter of time before he broke through the sealed gate!","The 9 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, led by Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing, continuously provided fate energy to strengthen the Immortal Array, trying to break through the gate above their heads.","The gate was unstoppable, but cracks started to appear.","Yu Yao had eight streaks of supreme fate energy and had almost fused with the Galaxia Immortal Array. She emitted a brilliant power that could not be looked at directly.","However, in the next moment, the Galaxia Immortal Array that was continuously gathering fate energy to attack the gate suddenly stopped!","In the center of the Immortal Array, Yu Yao suddenly spat out seven-colored divine blood. Her fate energy was flowing away at an unimaginable speed.","This change had happened too quickly, to the point that by the time all the Grand Yan Immortals reacted, they were already unable to reverse it!","The Immortal Array shook violently, and all the flowing purple patterns began to dim, and the fate energy reversed and actually flowed into the Immortal Array.","Then, the first formation core, which had been sealed for a long time, quietly opened at this moment.","Immortal Lord Zun Gu stood on the spot. The joy in his eyes had not even subsided. Instead, it was replaced by shock and despair.","The thing he was most worried about finally happened!","The formation core of the first stage of the Galaxia Immortal Array was damaged. In the end, it could not withstand such a degree of fate energy and began to repair itself.","The fate energy released by the 9 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals was swallowed by the Galaxia Immortal Array at that moment and flowed into the first formation core continuously.","Looking at the array core that had already been activated, Immortal Lord Zun Gu did not run or react excessively. He just stood quietly on the spot.","A few breaths later, a long sigh sounded and swept across the hearts of all the Grand Yan Immortals present.","Then, he smiled. His usually stern face became much gentler at this moment.","“Immortal Lords, Yao’er, I’ll go first and offer the last of my fate energy to you.”","His voice was like a long wind that spread across the sky... Then, his voice faded away, as if was then swallowed by the silent sea."]},{"number":5005,"title":"Chapter 5005 Burying Themselves in the Core of the Array","paragraphs":["5005 Burying Themselves in the Core of the Array","Immortal Lord Zun Gu stepped into the array core alone.","Nine Revolutions could resonate with everything, and even they could not withstand this.","There was only one outcome for Immortal Lord Zun Gu, and that was that his fate energy would be completely destroyed, and there was no possibility of him surviving.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang felt respect for him.","“No, Zun Gu, don’t...” Yu Yao shouted, her eyes filled with grief. However, she could not move a single step. If she did, the Galaxia Immortal Formation would disintegrate even faster.","Immortal Lord Zun Gu laughed loudly. From the moment he stepped into the whirlpool-like formation core, the fate energy around him could not be reversed and disappeared!","His Flying Cloud Robe shattered, and his Immortal body rapidly aged.","The role of Immortal Lord Zun Gu was to block the array core of the Immortal Array by himself and offer up his own fate energy, allowing the array core to absorb it. This was to maintain the operation of the entire Galaxia Immortal Array.","His immortal body instantly aged and shattered. Following that, primordial secret marks appeared in the shape of chains, firmly binding him in the array core.","His fate energy was devoured.","Immortal Lord Zun Gu’s eyes were filled with relief. He allowed the chains to continuously devour the fate energy before wantonly releasing all the fate energy in his Immortal body.","A Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal trying his best to release his own fate was extremely terrifying. The boundless and surging fate energy completely sealed the swirling formation core.","As the array core was completely sealed, the fate energy in the Galaxia Immortal Array stabilized and condensed again.","“Yao’er, open the heavenly gate!”","Immortal Lord Zun Gu used all his strength to utter a final sentence.","Yu Yao was in a daze, but she knew that she could not let his efforts go to waste. She could only control her fate energy and continue to charge toward the heavenly gate.","The rest of the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals had gloomy expressions, they had known each other for a long time, their old friends had died, they could not help but feel sad.","Yan Fan exhaled a mouthful of turbid breath and nodded slightly at Immortal Lord Zun Gu.","Using the life force and fate energy of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal as the core of the formation, the Galaxia Immortal Array stabilized once again!","At this moment, the Primordial Light Pillar that gathered the fate energy of the 9 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals attacked the sealed heavenly gate once again!","The fully activated Galaxia Immortal Array released a primordial light pillar that completely covered the entire sky.","The Grand Yan Immortals outside the formation were no match for this terrifying shockwave. They were all sent flying a million feet away. Those with weaker cultivation levels were shaken until divine blood flowed out of their mouths and ears.","Those with weaker Divine Sense would be in extreme pain under such an impact.","Even Fu Yao could not stand properly.","Jian Wushuang was not feeling well either, but he was not affected too much. He stretched out his hand and covered Fu Yao with his Divine Sense before looking nervously at the scene in front of him.","The impact was so intense that it was almost as terrifying as the battle with Emperor-to-be Black Cloud.","The sky was replaced by the Primordial Purple Intent. The Endless Sea stirred up tens of thousands of dust waves and then quickly evaporated.","In the sky, the sealed heavenly gate was covered in cracks, almost to the point of being completely shattered.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and stared at the scene nervously.","However, he immediately sensed that something was wrong.","Because he saw that although the heavenly gate was already shattered to the extreme, there were no signs of destruction at all. Moreover, at the edge of the heavenly gate, it actually began to slowly repair itself!","This was a bad omen!","The heavenly gate was actually slowly repairing itself. Once they were exhausted, everything would be for naught!","Receiving eight streaks of supreme fate energy, Yu Yao crazily charged at the Heaven Gate.","At this moment, Immortal Lord Zun Gu could not hold on anymore. He was standing in the swirling array core, and his Immortal body was completely shattered. The Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal’s fate energy was completely devoured by the array core.","Immortal Lord Zun Gu had been annihilated!","With his death, the Galaxia Immortal Array collapsed!","The endless fate energy no longer charged at the sealed gate. Instead, it reversed and was devoured and absorbed by the first array core.","The Immortal Array collapsed, and everything was about to go to waste!","At this moment, all the Grand Yan Immortals present were in despair. They had waited for countless years, but this was the result.","“Did we fail...” Immortal Lord Fu Yao murmured softly, and there was only bitterness in her eyes.","Even with the combined power of 10 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, they could not open the heavenly gate. Everything was already settled.","Looking at the chaotic fate energy in the Galaxia Immortal Array, Jian Wushuang knew that they had failed.","An initial-stage Grand Yan Immortal released endless fate energy without any warning and flew into the Immortal Array.","Then, under the gaze of all the Grand Yan Immortals, he released his Immortal Source and scattered his great fate energy into the swirling array core.","His great fate energy sealed the array core for a few breaths of time before it was completely devoured.","This scene was seen by all the Grand Yan Immortals present. There was only determination left in their eyes.","The next moment, the second Grand Yan Immortal flew out and entered the vortex without hesitation. He used his Immortal Source and fate energy to seal the array core.","Following the appearance of the second person, the third and fourth Grand Yan Immortals flew into the Immortal Array.","They did not hesitate and directly used their own Immortal Sources to seal the formation core.","Even though their fate energy could not compare to that of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, they still charged forward without hesitation, trying to hold on for a few breaths of time.","Flying into the array core was like a moth flying into a flame.","This scene was tragic and lonely, not a single Nine Revolutions Great Evolution Immortal persuaded them to do it, they all voluntarily offered their Immortal Source and fate energy.","It was also because they did it without hesitation that it added to the solemnity and loneliness.","At this moment, even the life of a Grand Yan Immortal was like an ant!","However, they were already supreme existences who had reached the peak and could build the Heavenly Dao with a wave of their hands!","In the Third and Fifth Heaven, all the Grand Yan Immortals moved. They silently and spontaneously destroyed themselves, just to buy ten breaths, or even a few breaths of time.","They threw themselves into the Immortal Array, and their lives were forfeit.","The Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals in the Immortal Array could no longer bear to see this scene, they all turned their faces away.","Yu Yao, who was standing in the center of the Immortal Array, was already crying.","They were once supreme mighty figures, but they died like ants.","This shocking scene was carved deeply in Jian Wushuang’s heart, and from then on, it was hard to forget.","Nearly 1,000 Grand Yan Immortals had died in the core of the Immortal Array just to fight for a little more time!","They were from the same era as Zhen Wuyang, and they had survived from the Ancient Era, where time was meaningless.","However, they were all imprisoned by Zhen Wuyang and exiled here. In the end, they did not have a good ending and died like dust.","It was only at this moment that Jian Wushuang realized that although the Endless Sea might not be cruel to him, it was truly an endless cage for the Grand Yan Immortals who were exiled here!"]},{"number":5006,"title":"Chapter 5006 The Change of Yu Yao","paragraphs":["5006 The Change of Yu Yao","The endless lifespan made the Yan Immortals and Grand Yan Immortals feel like they were living in a distorted Immortal world, living in misery.","Even the great cosmos he traversed and the Divine Power Universe were like a boundless ocean.","He had walked, step by step, breaking free from the shackles and becoming stronger. Even the Emperor’s fate energy began to favor him.","However, there was still no end to it. No matter how far he’d come, there was no end in sight.","This endless cage seemed to be something that even Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals could not break!","His Divine Sense was already completely integrated. At this moment, he thought about many things. Since even a Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortal could not break it, then what about an Emperor?","His eyes lit up, but he suddenly realized something and subconsciously looked at Yu Yao.","Yu Yao, who was originally crying in grief, was now expressionless. She began to control the eight streaks of Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal’s supreme fate energy again.","As for Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and the other 5 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, they released all their fate energy.","Jian Wushuang was shocked. He did not dare to imagine, but he could not calm down.","Yu Yao’s thoughts actually matched his thinking!","“No, stop quickly. Don’t release any more fate energy!” Jian Wushuang shouted to Jiang Li and Yan Fan.","However, they were unable to hear the sound outside the Immortal Array and completely released all their fate energy.","Yu Yao, who was in the center of the Immortal Array, seemed to have sensed something. She looked at Jian Wushuang with only coldness in her eyes.","Then, she retracted her gaze and raised her arms. She gathered the fate energy of the 8 strongest Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals and no longer struck the broken heavenly gate. Instead, she absorbed all of them.","Di Qing was the first to react. He had already sensed that something was wrong, but it was already too late. He wanted to withdraw, but he realized that he could not take back his fate energy.","At the same time, Jiang Li and Yan Hui also noticed the changes. When they saw Yu Yao absorb all their fate energy, their expressions turned extremely ugly.","They had never thought that Yu Yao would devour their energy at this moment to strengthen herself instead of destroying the gate.","The remaining 5 Nine Revolutions Grand Expanse Immortals also noticed the change, they looked at Yu Yao in disbelief.","They also did not expect Yu Yao to do this.","However, it was already too late. They could not withdraw at all. They could not even withdraw their own fate energy.","Yu Yao did not speak. Boundless fate energy began to surge into her body, and the fate of the entire Galaxia Immortal Array was at her fingertips.","Jian Wushuang could no longer sit back and watch. He condensed an Invisible Sword and flew forward, slashing down heavily.","The Invisible Sword tore through the void and smashed heavily on the Galaxia Immortal Array.","However, this Immortal Array had gathered hundreds of thousands of Yan Immortals and the fate energy of 9 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals. It was already at its peak and could not be broken through by external forces.","Even if Jian Wushuang released the Wushuang Sword Daoo, he could not break through.","“Wushuang, leave quickly!”","At this moment, Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing shouted loudly, telling him to leave as soon as possible.","However, Jian Wushuang would never retreat, because the people who were most important to him were all in the Immortal Array.","Just as he was about to activate his strongest sword strike to resist the Galaxia Immortal Array, an unimaginable power surged from Yu Yao’s body!","All the Grand Yan Immortals were terrified, including Jiang Li and Yan Fan. Their eyes were extremely solemn.","Now that things had come to this, they finally understood why Yu Yao had set up this situation.","She wanted to use 100,000 Immortals and 9 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals as a guide to create her own Emperor’s fate energy!","This was too unimaginable, to the point that none of the Grand Yan Immortals had thought of this.","But it had already happened.","A primordial purple aura slowly flowed from Yu Yao’s Immortal body.","That was the fate of an Imperial Emperor.","Jian Wushuang retreated slowly. He finally understood that Yu Yao’s intention was not to tear the Endless Sea apart, but to satisfy herself and pursue the Supreme Heavenly Dao!","At this moment, Yu Yao had condensed the Emperoro’s fate energy!","This was too terrifying. Once she had Emperor’s fate energy, it meant that she had completely stepped out of the Nine Revolutions and reached the Emperor-to-be realm.","Jian Wushuang and the others had already experienced how terrifying an Emperor-to-be was in the previous battle.","The Emperor-to-be Black Cloud was able to destroy everything with ease. He even defeated Jiang Li and Yan Fan with a flip of his hand. This was too terrifying.","If Jian Wushuang had not borrowed Emperor Zhen Wu’s Emperor fate energy, they would have all perished!","Once the Emperor’s fate energy was condensed, she would become an Emperor-to-be.","Once he became an Emperor-to-be, it would be difficult for them to reverse the situation.","Yu Yao raised her hands, and endless Primordial Purple Intent began to flow out of her body. The entire Galaxia Immortal Array lost its power and became dim.","Boundless Primordial Purple Intent was added to her body. As for the Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortals, other than Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing, the other five had their Immortal Sources shattered and their fate energy absorbed.","Even in death, they had never said a single word about Yu Yao.","Just as Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing could not hold on any longer, the Galaxia Immortal Array quietly shattered.","Covered in blood, Jian Wushuang cut a hole in the formation and shattered it!","When the Immortal Array shattered, they felt the shackles around them suddenly loosen. They almost did not think about it and escaped from the Immortal Array.","“Where are you guys going?”","A quiet and emotionless voice resounded throughout the wilderness.","Jian Wushuang’s body stiffened slightly. Then, without any hesitation, he pushed Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and Immortal Lord Fu Yao away.","An extremely cold aura condensed behind him. streams of Primordial Purple Intent in the void wrapped around him like sharp vines.","At that moment, Yu Yao, who had absorbed the power of the Galaxia Immortal Array, appeared behind Jian Wushuang. She was filled with the Emperor’s fate energy.","Her eyes had been replaced by purple, and her Immortal body was burning with magnificent purple flames.","Lines of secret runes that suppressed the void slowly flowed. They were the materialization of an Emperor’s fate energy.","The void shattered, causing endless strange phenomena to play out.","The Grand Yan Immortals at the Third and Fifth Heaven were all dead. They were all buried in the array core, not a single one was left behind.","Even the entire Third and Fifth Heaven no longer existed, replaced by endless Primordial Purple Intent.","Yu Yao was the Emperor who ascended the throne."]},{"number":5007,"title":"Chapter 5007 Emperor-To-Be Yu Yao","paragraphs":["5007 Emperor-To-Be Yu Yao","The power provided by the Galaxia Immortal Array that condensed the fate energy of more than 100,000 Yan Immortals and 9 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals pushed her towards the Emperor-to-be realm.","Jian Wushuang’s heart pounded as he felt the terrifying purple aura flame.","With his intuition, he could feel that Yu Yao’s fate energy was even stronger than the Emperor-to-be Black Cloud.","This also meant that as long as she wanted to make a move, no Yan Immortal could survive.","This moment was the most terrifying moment between life and death.","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing’s fate energy had already been sucked dry in the Galaxia Immortal Array, and they had almost no strength to resist.","One had to know that luck was not the same as the ability to regenerate. Fate energy was like an Immortal Source, it was the foundation of the Yan immortal.","Once it was damaged, it would take a long time to repair it.","Even if Jian Wushuang had Emperor-grade pills, it was impossible for him to recover Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing in a short time.","At this moment, there were only five of them left in the ruins of the Third and Fifth Heaven.","Other than that, all the other Yan Immortals and even the Nine Revolution Grand Yan Immortals became the sacrificial victims of Yu Yao, paving her way to becoming an Emperor.","Yu Yao only glanced at them once before looking away, as if she was not worried that they would escape.","She looked at her palm that was surrounded by the Primordial Purple Intent, and there was only joy and infatuation in her eyes.","“So, this is the fate energy of an Emperor...”","As Yu Yao’s voice fell, billions of primordial purple light seeped out of her Immortal body and began to outline some kind of power that could not be seen directly.","The Flying Cloud Robe was replaced by an Emperor’s clothes condensed from Primordial Purple Intent.","Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows twitched. He had been hoping for a stroke of luck that Yu Yao had failed to become an Emperor-to-be.","But now, the moment the Emperor’s clothing was condensed, everything had already been settled.","Yu Yao was undoubtedly an Emperor-to-be!","“Do you think you can escape?”","“We have already given you all our fate energy, and you already took from everyone else in the continent. You have gotten the result you wanted. Why do you have to kill us?”","“Is this the result I want?” Yu Yao slowly raised her arms and the corners of her mouth curved upwards. “No, the final result I want is to become an Emperor.”","Jian Wushuang suppressed his anger and looked at her coldly.","Yu Yao was a completely different person from before, and her actions were even worse than the Emperor-to-be Black Cloud in the City of Exile.","She coveted all the Grand Yan Immortals, even the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals... Everything was designed to kill them, only to devour their fate energy, to make herself become an Emperor-to-be.","Now, Jian Wushuang no longer hoped that the completely inhuman Emperor-to-be Yu Yao would let them go.","“All of our fate energy now belong to you. Even if you kill us all, we won’t be able to provide any more fate energy.”","Jian Wushuang tried a last-ditch effort.","Immediately after, Yu Yao’s emotionless eyes slowly swept past them.","In the end, her gaze fell on him.","“Your fate energy doesn’t belong to me.”","Jian Wushuang was stunned. Then he looked at her and said, “Okay, I’ll give you my fate energy and you can let them go.”","“Do you think you have the right to negotiate?” Emperor-to-be Yu Yao smiled contemptuously, “However, they are no longer of any value to me, so they can leave.”","Jian Wushuang let out a sigh of relief.","“No, Wushuang, you can’t stay!” Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing said anxiously at the same time.","They knew very well that she had killed all the Grand Yan Immortals under her in order to obtain the Emperor’s fate energy. If Jian Wushuang stayed, he would be completely destroyed.","Jian Wushuang turned around and winked at them. He said in a special voice that only they could hear, “Leave without worry. I have my own way to keep up with you. Don’t forget that I still have a trump card that I haven’t used.”","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing calmed down.","During the battle with Black Cloud, Jian Wushuang used his own power to wipe him out.","Although this was too unimaginable, it had actually happened.","Therefore, although they were a little worried when they saw Jian Wushuang’s confident expression, they had no better way.","Their fate energy had been drained by the Galaxia Immortal Array and their strength had declined to the extreme. Even if they stayed, they would only be a burden to Jian Wushuang.","“Then you must be careful,” Di Qing said nervously.","Jian Wushuang nodded and turned around after watching the four of them leave.","“I’m a little curious, why absorb the fate energy of a puny little Yan Immortal?” Jian Wushuang looked at her and asked.","Yu Yao looked at him and said expressionlessly, “Because I won’t let any of the Yan Immortals here leave alive.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened as a sense of crisis suddenly surged in his heart!","As if to confirm his thoughts, Yu Yao suddenly raised her arms.","As she raised her arms, endless Primordial Purple Intent quietly covered the entire sky.","Each strand of Primordial Purple Intent became extremely sharp and rained down like an endless rain of arrows.","Looking at the unimaginable rain, Jian Wushuang swallowed.","He lowered his eyes and released millions of Sword Intents!","Facing the endless Primordial Purple Intent, he resolutely attacked alone.","At this moment, the Wushuang Sword Dao collided with the Emperor-to-be fate energy once again.","The second move of the Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent.","The River.","The majestic celestial river descended from the sky, like the mountains and seas were about to collapse, roaring and sweeping forward.","Jian Wushuang sat at the head of the Sword River and squinted his eyes.","He knew that, without a doubt, he would lose.","In order to allow Jiang Li and Di Qing to leave, Jian Wushuang prepared to use all his fate energy in his Immortal body to survive.","The roaring celestial river collided with the endless Primordial Purple Intent.","There was no earth-shaking explosion, only devouring and absorption.","The Primordial Purple Intent that could break through all things easily tore apart the celestial river and swallowed all the sword intents.","Facing an Emperor-to-be, everything was powerless.","Even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal could not fight an Emperor-to-be, let alone a mere Yan Immortal?","The Sword Dao celestial river only existed for a few breaths of time before it was completely devoured.","Everything was covered by the purple light again.","Yu Yao remained standing in her original position, her face calm and composed. The purple flames on her Thousand Leaves Emperor Robe burned even more vigorously.","Behind her, one could see a tattered Immortal body, almost crushed into pieces and barely held on from falling to the ground.","Seven-colored divine blood poured out of his Immortal body, dyeing the primordial purple sky with a demonic scarlet color."]},{"number":5008,"title":"Chapter 5008 The Death of Dao","paragraphs":["5008 The Death of Dao","Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, which was still emitting a sky-blue intent, dimmed slightly at this moment, but it was not damaged at all.","However, apart from the parts protected by the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, the rest of his Immortal body was almost shattered into meat paste.","His divine blood was drained.","Jian Wushuang felt that all the power in his body was leaving, but he was still fighting!","He used all his strength to bite open the Emperor-grade pill hidden in his mouth!","In an instant, the light retracted and the energy that had been drained returned. Even his Immortal body recovered quickly.","Slowly turning around, Yu Yao’s calm eyes revealed a trace of surprise.","A mere Yan Immortal had actually withstood her Emperor-to-be fate energy?","In an instant, his Immortal body had almost recovered. Jian Wushuang turned around and looked at her solemnly.","“My guess was right, you really aren’t an ordinary Yan Immortal,” Yu Yao said meaningfully, “That clothing you’re wearing, I can’t see through it.”","Jian Wushuang ignored her words and sneered, “Don’t you think you are shameless by not letting the living Yan Immortals leave? Afraid that what you did would spread? You don’t want to be despised by all the Yan Immortals in the world?”","Yu Yao’s eyes narrowed, and her expression finally changed.","“You’re courting death!”","“I am indeed courting death, but you are not worthy of killing me. When those thousands of Grand Yan Immortals blocked the formation core with their bodies, sacrificing themselves without hesitation. Even the 9 Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals sacrificed their fate. Meanwhile, all you have are dirty thoughts!”","“So what if you have the Emperor-to-be fate energy? You’re just a clown.”","At this moment, Jian Wushuang cursed wantonly with extreme disdain.","It was as if she had been stabbed in her most painful spot, and Yu Yao could no longer remain calm. Just like before, she attacked directly and ruthlessly!","Endless Primordial Purple Intent poured out from her palm and shot forward.","This was the fate energy of an Emperor, the genuine fate energy of an Emperor!","Looking at the rising momentum, Jian Wushuang’s eyes revealed a touch of bitterness.","However, he was still not afraid!","The Dao of Protection, the Dao of Slaughter, and the Wushuang Sword Dao were reinforced once again!","Selfless True Shadow also appeared behind him. He put his palms together and slowly opened his True Eyes, revealing deep compassion!","Boundless fate energy that was as deep as hell completely bloomed, and it was actually comparable to the Emperor’s fate energy.","Yu Yao was shocked. The luck that Jian Wushuang released was so shocking that she could not ignore it.","But he was clearly just a Yan Immortal!","Due to the lack of cultivation, cracks started to appear on his Immortal body when he unleashed all three Daos.","This was already Jian Wushuang’s limit. If it was not for the support of Selfless True Shadow, he would have exploded from the fate energy of the three Daos.","The shock in Yu Yao’s eyes disappeared, replaced by a greedy look.","Even though she was already an Emperor-to-be, she was still far from reaching that level of a true Emperor.","At this moment, the fate energy on Jian Wushuang’s body made her extremely tempted.","He laughed loudly. With three supreme fate energies, he controlled the huge Selfless True Shadow behind him to brazenly attack the Primordial Purple fate energy!","Yu Yao smiled meaningfully and pointed her finger. Instantly, billions of Primordial Purple Intent condensed into one point and shot toward Jian Wushuang with an unstoppable force!","At this moment, the Selfless True Shadow, which was over a billion feet tall, pressed forward.","But he was facing Yu Yao, an Emperor-to-be.","The Selfless True Shadow’s attack could not even land. It was directly shattered into countless pieces by the demonic Primordial Purple Intent.","Then, it did not slow down and pointed at Jian Wushuang’s chest.","All of this happened too quickly, so much so that he did not even have time to react before his body was penetrated.","A pain that came from the depths of his Divine Sense made him unable to withstand it for a moment. He directly knelt down.","At the position of his heart, the only tear in the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens appeared, swaying with a hint of purple.","The Primordial Purple Intent was like maggots in his bones, completely burning in his Immortal body.","This kind of burning was enough to burn even one’s Divine Sense.","This was also the moment when Jian Wushuang faced death!","However, this was under the premise that a portion of his Divine Sense was retained.","If his Divine Sense was destroyed, there was no way Jian Wushuang could be resurrected!","Right now, his Divine Sense was burning.","Yu Yao had seen through the fatal crack on his Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, so she controlled the Primordial Purple Intent to enter his body and devour him from the inside.","Jian Wushuang knelt in the void. His immortal body had a strange dark purple color. Every meridian was burning and then turned into ashes.","Yu Yao had also quietly arrived in front of him. She then clenched her fist and lifted his entire body.","“You’re not bad, I can’t see through you,” she said softly. Other than coveting, there was also a hint of unexplainable meaning in her eyes.","Jian Wushuang could no longer speak. The purple flame was burning his Immortal body, meridians, and Divine Sense crazily.","True Death was inevitable.","“Only when all of you truly die can my fate and Divine Sense truly fuse and properly take ‘that step’. This is why I want to kill all of you.”","Yu Yao’s voice was filled with heavy dignity, “In addition, I will make good use of your fate energy.”","The purple flame had burned Jian Wushuang’s eyes to ashes and his Immortal body was rapidly withering.","Once his Divine Sense was destroyed, he would never be able to resurrect!","Yu Yao did not say anything else. In a breath, the three traces of fate energy on Jian Wushuang’s back surged out.","The golden light of the Dao of Protection, the scarlet light of the Dao of Slaughter, and the formless light of the Wushuang Sword Dao — these three great traces of fate energy had been taken away and flowed in the void without a master.","Looking at the surging fate energy in front of her, Yu Yao could not hold it in any longer. She opened her mouth slightly, and the three great traces of fate energy were swallowed into her stomach.","Even three Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals would not be able to condense such a vast amount of fate energy.","This was because these three strands of fate energy had already surpassed the boundaries of the Immortal Yan realm and reached an unknown realm.","And now, it had been devoured by Yu Yao.","In an instant, the purple flames on her body became even more vigorous, and the patterns on her imperial robe became even more vivid. It was as if she could awaken a new power at any time.","Jian Wushuang, who had lost the blessing of energy and his Divine Sense was burned, was no longer breathing. His Immortal body was shattered to the extreme.","Yu Yao was very satisfied with the three supreme traces of fate energy.","She glanced at his Immortal body, and there was no more aura, and she did not attack him again. Instead, she used a beam of Yan energy to gently lift him up and casually placed him in the void.","The Primordial Purple Intent circulated quietly and completely covered Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body."]},{"number":5009,"title":"Chapter 5009 Black Cloud, Black Cloud","paragraphs":["5009 Black Cloud, Black Cloud","The loss of three supreme fate energy meant that his Dao was dead.","This was also the reason why Yu Yao did not destroy his Immortal body.","Now that Jian Wushuang was dead, she had more important things to do. She had to capture the four Grand Yan Immortals who had escaped and kill all of them.","After Yu Yao left, she did not notice that the chest of the Immortal body that was lying in the void was heaving!","...","“Damned little fellow, what kind of trouble have you provoked this time? Do you know that if it weren’t for this Emperor’s help, you would have been completely gone!!”","The voice was laced with anger, and it rang in his ears. It woke Jian Wushuang up from his dead state.","He suddenly sat up straight and panted heavily. At the same time, the pain that came from the depths of his Divine Soul and Divine Sense made him unable to help but groan in pain.","“This, this is actually still alive. Wasn’t my Divine Sense completely burnt?”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself in disbelief. At the same time, he looked ahead subconsciously.","At this moment, he was sitting on a boundless red desert.","In this red desert, less than a few feet away from him, a huge Chi Bird that was like a flowing cloud was staring at him with its huge eyes.","As their eyes met, Jian Wushuang subconsciously swallowed a mouthful of saliva. Then, he pushed his arms against the sand and moved his butt backward.","This bird was too huge, and it was also too strange and mysterious.","It had six horns on its head, and each horn was a different color. It was beautiful and mysterious.","Its entire body seemed to be shrouded in clouds, making it impossible to see clearly.","The huge pupil was pure gold, as if it contained thousands of suns, making it impossible for people to look directly at it.","Perhaps others did not know what this huge and terrifying bird was, but Jian Wushuang knew it very well.","Only Emperor Liu Ya could have such a phenomenon and monopolize a part of his Divine Sense.","Strictly speaking, this bird was not Emperor Liu Ya because the last strand of his Divine Sense had already dissipated.","It possessed the will of Emperor Liu Ya, but it was not Emperor Liu Ya.","The bird was like an Emperor that had descended, its golden eyes carrying an imposing aura that could not be looked at directly.","“If I hadn’t protected your Divine Sense, you would have been destroyed long ago. I can feel that the power that burned your Divine Sense was not something you could resist.”","“Although I was able to protect your Divine Sense for a while, it also consumed a lot of my Emperor Source.”","“You have to remember, if you continue to be so reckless, I might not be able to withstand it and break apart, and you won’t be able to obtain the entire Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes showed a touch of bitterness when he heard that. “I understand. I won’t be rash anymore.”","“What do you understand? I’m still waiting for the day you fight with Zhen Wuyang. If you die now, wouldn’t it be a huge joke?”","“Remember this, live well. Even if you have to live a plain and boring life, you have to live until the day you become an Emperor!”","“I will try my best...”","...","After killing Jian Wushuang, Yu Yao did not stop. She controlled the Primordial Purple Intent and left the ruins of the Third and Fifth Heaven.","She wanted to find Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and the others who had escaped earlier and eliminate them one by one.","She was now an Emperor-to-be. Wherever the Primordial Purple Intent covered, it was her domain.","Feeling the fate energy that had transcended the shackles, the sadness in Yu Yao’s heart finally dissipated.","She was already an Emperor-to-be and no one could be his enemy.","Only another Emperor-to-be could fight her!","The dim sky followed Yu Yao as she continued to move forward, being devoured by the Primordial Purple Intent.","However, a moment later, a faint aura appeared, causing Yu Yao to stop in her tracks. She stood within her own Emperor’s fate energy, and her eyes turned slightly solemn.","She felt an aura that could not be ignored. It was strange and domineering.","When the end of the dark sky was replaced by an indescribable chaotic aura, Yu Yao’s pupils suddenly shrank!","Emperor? Emperor-to-be!","An Emperor-to-be!","As if to confirm her guess, a terrifying figure wearing the same imperial robe appeared along with the endless chaotic aura.","His body was surrounded by twisted and chaotic auras, which were extremely strange.","If Jian Wushuang was here, he would be surprised.","This was because the person who had come with the chaotic aura was the Emperor-to-be Black Cloud! It was the same person who was forced to self-destruct his own Emperor’s fate energy!","At this moment, he had completely recovered. It was as if he had never self-destructed the Emperor’s fate energy.","At the same time, thick chaotic chains bound the four figures in his palm.","The four figures were Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and Immortal Lord Fu Yao.","They were all caught by Black Cloud and could not escape at all. They were already on their last breaths.","Emperor-to-be Black Cloud slowly raised his head and met Yu Yao’s eyes.","Doubt, confusion, and bewilderment were revealed in his eyes, but they were soon replaced by an even stronger desire.","The fate of an Emperor-to-be made him go crazy.","Yu Yao’s expression turned completely solemn. She could sense the power of the chaotic aura. It was actually on par with her Primordial Purple Intent. Neither could do anything to the other.","She had just become an Emperor-to-be, so she had to focus on stability. It was obviously not a wise move to make an enemy of another Emperor-to-be.","However, she wanted to wipe out the few Great Yan Immortals in the hands of this mysterious Emperor-to-be. She felt troubled.","Their eyes met. The Primordial Purple Intent and the chaotic aura collided and squeezed, causing the sky to shatter.","“Wow, not bad, my luck is really quite good. To be able to meet an Emperor like me here,” Black Cloud said in a hoarse voice as he laughed.","Yu Yao felt very uncomfortable, extremely uncomfortable. She felt as if her Divine Sense was being nibbled away.","However, she finally decided to speak. She said coldly, “I was chasing after those Grand Yan Immortals. Return them to me.”","“Return them to you?” Black Cloud laughed softly. “Of course not. They are also my mortal enemies. I want to crush them into powder with my own hands!”","Yu Yao’s expression was uncertain. In the end, she did not plan to speak. To her, it did not matter who killed Jiang Li and Yan Fan, as long as they died.","She turned around and was about to leave when Black Cloud’s strange voice sounded again.” Wait, I want to ask you something.”","“I will not speak to you!” Yu Yao replied coldly, preparing to leave in an instant."]},{"number":5010,"title":"Chapter 5010 Meeting on a Narrow Road","paragraphs":["5010 Meeting on a Narrow Road","Black Cloud opened his mouth wide, and chaotic aura surged out. He smiled sinisterly. “You want to leave now?!”","“You’re courting death!” Yu Yao was furious, and she frowned. In an instant, boundless Primordial Purple Intent burst forth, brazenly welcoming the attack.","The Primordial Purple Intent was simply too overwhelming. It directly devoured the chaotic chains, leaving no trace behind.","Then, the Primordial Purple Intent did not lose its momentum and turned into billions of rain curtains that hovered above Black Cloud.","Black Cloud’s eyelids twitched violently before he waved his hand with an exaggerated expression. “Stop, stop, stop. We are all Emperors. If you do this, no one will benefit from it.”","Yu Yao coldly snorted and withdrew her Primordial Purple Intent before preparing to leave.","“Wait a minute, aren’t you going to take these few?” Black Cloud spoke again, his eyes brimming with evil.","“I don’t want them. You can do whatever you want. Just kill them all,” Yu Yao said without turning her head, as if she did not want to stay any longer.","” No, no, I suddenly changed my mind. I want to let them go and let them say what they want to say, spread it to the world.”","Yu Yao quietly stopped in her tracks, her expression completely cold. “Are you going against me?”","“I don’t have such thoughts, not even a little bit. I’m just telling the truth,” Black Cloud chuckled. “How about this, let’s make a deal. I’ll give them to you, and you tell me a piece of information.”","Suppressing the anger in her heart, Yu Yao looked at him coldly and said, “What do you want to know?”","Black Cloud stared at her and said slowly, “What I want to know is very simple. Have you seen the Yan Immortal who was with them?”","Yu Yao’s expression fluctuated slightly, but she quickly regained her composure. However, her heart was already in turmoil.","To be able to attract the covetous eyes of another Emperor-to-be, it seemed that Jian Wushuang’s group had already been targeted.","The fate energy of the three Great Daos he carried was indeed too tempting. Even Yu Yao, who had already become an Emperor-to-be, had coveted it and swallowed it.","Thinking of this, she was certain that Black Cloud was here to capture Jian Wushuang and devour his fate energy.","However, once he knew that Jian Wushuang’s fate energy had been devoured, he was afraid that there would be a battle!","After pondering for a moment, Yu Yao said, “I’ve never seen him before, so I can’t answer you.”","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and Immortal Lord Fuy Yo, who were bound by the chains of chaos, felt their hearts sink when they saw her appear alone.","“Oh, really? It seemed to be a pity.” Black Cloud shook his head slightly.","Hearing this, Black Cloud suddenly raised his head and stared at Yu Yao with his devilish eyes.","Yu Yao was startled, and the boundless Primordial Purple Intent behind her fluctuated slightly. She had never expected Di Qing and the others to speak.","“Nonsense,” Yu Yao said in a deep voice. She did not plan to stay any longer and directly turned to leave.","“I haven’t finished speaking. How can you leave?” Black Cloud laughed softly, the evil light in his eyes already solidified.","In the next moment, an endless chaotic aura burst forth, like billions of demonic snakes grabbing toward Yu Yao.","Under the impact of this chaotic aura, the Primordial Purple Intent actually dimmed!","Yu Yao was furious. She waved her imperial robe and a similarly chaotic Primordial Purple Intent burst forth.","When the two collided, the sky shattered, and the Endless Sea instantly caved in, sinking hundreds of millions of feet!","This was a battle between Emperor-to-be and Emperor-to-be. It was filled with the aura of destruction and breaking the ancient times.","If they were not in the Endless Sea, just the aura emitted by the two of them was enough to destroy a million Heavenly Regions!","Even Grand Yan Immortals were like ants!","In this first clash, the two Emperor-to-be retreated 30,000 meters, and even their Emperor’s fate energy was greatly restrained.","Yu Yao stood with her hands behind her back. Although her expression was normal, the blood in her body was already in turmoil.","Black Cloud was not any better. He was even more severely injured. After all, it had only been a short period of time since he had been revived. It was not easy for him to do this.","Neither of them had gained any advantage, so they were naturally more cautious.","It was Black Cloud who spoke first, “It seems that the fate energy of that puny little Yan Immortal has already been monopolized by you.”","“So what?” Yu Yao said in a deep voice, already prepared to respond.","“If that’s the case,” Black Cloud chuckled. “Give me half of his fate energy and I’ll let you go. How about we not disturb each other?”","Yu Yao’s expression changed slightly. She had indeed guessed that he wanted Jian Wushuang’s great fate energy and wanted to take a share of it.","However, how could she hand over the fate energy that had already been swallowed into her stomach?","“What if I say no?” Yu Yao coldly said that they were both Emperor-to-bes, so how could she be afraid?","“If that’s the case, then I’ll have to take it personally.”","Black Cloud laughed loudly. His ever-changing face was now extremely ferocious.","Yu Yao had the same thought, so she did not take even half a step back.","Facing another Emperor-to-be, she was also drooling.","This battle was a fight between Emperors!","The Emperor was the ruler of all things. All fate energy and other unspeakable things were under the Imperial Emperor’s control.","They were already supreme beings, and the only person who could cause an Emperor to die was another Emperor.","As for Emperor-to-be, they had already comprehended their own Emperor’s fate energy, but for some reason, they could not become a true Emperor.","However, an Emperor-to-be was still a supreme existence that could not be touched. Even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal could not contend against him.","This battle was a battle between the Emperors!","Boundless chaotic aura rose and covered the void as far as the eye could see.","At this moment, the Primordial Purple Intent also erupted with dazzling power.","Immortals compete for power, Emperors compete for fate energy!","Once one became an Emperor-to-be, they would fight for the fate energy. Emperors would no longer use Immortal Styles because all Immortal Styles could not bear the full release of the Emperor’s fate energy.","Instead, they used Emperor Style moves, and these supreme moves came in all forms, fitting for an Emperor’s usage.","The Chaotic Emperor’s Throne was the Emperor Style of Emperor-to-be Black Cloud.","The Primordial Immortal Array was the Emperor Style of Emperor-to-be Yu Yao.","In the next moment, they all unleashed their strongest Emperor Styles without any hesitation!","The Chaotic Emperor’s Throne was as high as the heavens, and it descended quickly. Even if a Grand Yan Immortal looked at it directly, their Divine Sense would collapse and fall into chaos.","The Primordial Immortal Array could encompass ten thousand domains. It was condensed from the blood and fate energy of countless Yan Immortals and Grand Yan Immortals. It was extremely grand."]},{"number":5011,"title":"Chapter 5011 Battle Between Emperors","paragraphs":["5011 Battle Between Emperors","The chaotic aura was as dark as a dark cloud, pressing down.","At this moment, it was a battle of fate energies between Emperor-to-be.","Everything was collapsing. If this was the Great Si Region, tens of thousands of Heavenly Regions would have been destroyed.","Black Cloud’s evil eyes stared at Yu Yao, only having the desire to devour her.","Yu Yao’s eyes were filled with disgust. She had to do everything she could to defeat him. Otherwise, if she were to fall into a stalemate, it would be extremely disadvantageous to her.","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing looked at each other with bitterness in their eyes. They were all bound and could not move at all. Once the battle started, they would definitely be affected, but they could only leave it to fate.","The next moment, Black Cloud attacked first.","He did not control the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne behind him. Instead, he released billions of chaotic chains and shot them forward.","This was a test.","Yu Yao’s Emperor fate energy had already condensed into a Primordial Immortal Array that was impossible to break.","The billions of chaotic chains shot over, but when they collided with the Primordial Immortal Array, they shattered and were absorbed.","After the first test, the chaotic chains disappeared without a trace.","Black Cloud raised his eyes slightly. He knew that Yu Yao was not a simple person, so he stopped underestimating her.","As the billions of chaotic chains were devoured, Yu Yao, who was in the center of the Immortal Array, revealed a look of disdain.","Her Immortal Array could destroy any Emperor-to-be attack. As long as she focused on defending, the enemy would not be able to break it.","However, Black Cloud smiled strangely and charged forward.","The Chaotic Emperor’s Throne, which was powerful enough to destroy the Nine Heavens, also moved out with him at this moment.","Buzz...","The Chaotic Emperor’s Throne emitted layers of ripples that pressed forward.","Under this attack, the Primordial Immortal Array could not help but fluctuate.","Standing outside the Immortal Array, Black Cloud smiled sinisterly. Then, in front of Yu Yao, he split his Immortal body into billions of Daos!","Through the Immortal Array, Yu Yao looked at Black Clouds that seemed to surround the mountain and sea outside, and she became a little nervous.","“Since you won’t come out, I can only barge in,” Black Cloud said in a low voice as he raised his arms.","In the next moment, billions of Black Clouds raised their arms at the same time. Endless chaotic aura rose and condensed into an infinite pillar of light.","Then, a Chaotic Emperor’s Throne that shook the entire area quietly condensed on the Primordial Immortal Array.","Yu Yao’s eyes widened. This throne was even more magnificent than the Primordial Immortal Array!","An indescribable aura of suppression descended from above her head. Once this Primordial Immortal Array could not withstand it, she would definitely be severely injured!","Thinking of this, Yu Yao gritted her teeth. Endless Primordial Purple Intent burst forth, supporting the entire Primordial Immortal Array with all her might!","This was the strongest collision between Emperor-to-be and Emperor-to-be.","None of them held back and went all out.","Black Cloud roared, and the super Chaos Emperor’s Throne pressed down heavily.","Boom!!!","An indescribable explosion swept through the void, and the void was destroyed into eternal nothingness.","Under this explosion, even Grand Yan Immortals would not be able to survive. Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and the others, whose luck had already been drained by Yu Yao, could not withstand this attack anymore.","They all spat out divine blood and then fainted.","In this eternal void, it was the battle between Emperor-to-be and Emperor-to-be’s fate energy!","The super Chaos Emperor’s Throne pressed down, and the Primordial Immortal Array erupted with a dazzling light.","These two Emperor Styles were actually in a stalemate for a moment!","The two forces pressed against each other, and cracks appeared in the middle.","Black Cloud was already on the verge of madness. He controlled billions of clones to attack the Primordial Immortal Array.","The void trembled as fate gathered together.","Yu Yao, who was in the center of the Immortal Array, felt her blood boiling under the pressure of the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne.","“Let’s see how long you’ll hide! If you don’t come out, I’ll go in!” Black Cloud said crazily. The endless destructive aura began to erode the Immortal array.","Looking at the cracks on the Primordial Immortal Array, Yu Yao no longer defended it.","Boom!","The purple flames exploded, and endless Emperor’s fate energy erupted.","The bottom of the Chaos Emperor’s Throne shattered, and billions of chaotic auras were obliterated into nothingness.","Black Cloud retreated heavily, and his pale face was covered with fine black patterns.","He was heavily injured, and even the billions of figures surrounding the Primordial Immortal Array shattered.","“Ah...” He cried out in pain, his Immortal body almost shattering at this moment.","He had just woken up from the destruction, and with his current strength, he was unable to deal any serious damage to Yu Yao, who was also an Emperor-to-be.","On the contrary, it was easy for him to be heavily injured.","Seeing this scene, she was secretly overjoyed. She did not have much hope for that attack just now, but she did not expect it to injure Black Cloud so badly.","In a battle between Emperor-to-be, once one side was heavily injured, the outcome would be decided.","Facing the heavily injured Black Cloud, no matter how cautious Yu Yao was, she could not remain calm.","If she could successfully devour Black Cloud’s Emperor’s fate energy, she would definitely become a true Emperor!","Emperor-to-be and a true Emperor. The difference was unimaginable.","Only by becoming a true Emperor would one have the qualifications to fight with Zhen Wuyang.","As Yu Yao thought about this, she no longer hesitated. She brought the entire Primordial Immortal Array and swallowed Black Cloud.","Looking at the void that had been covered by the Primordial Purple Intent, a hint of fear appeared in Black Cloud’s eyes.","He was already in a weakened state and had been heavily injured, so he was no longer able to withstand Yu Yao’s Emperor’s fate energy.","The great horror of life and death had already made Black Cloud ignore everything.","He opened his mouth and shouted at the void, “I promise you, I promise you. As long as you let me recover completely, I’m willing to become your emissary!”","As Black Cloud’s voice fell, a layer of ripples suddenly appeared in the void with him as the center.","Then, a pair of pale palms without any blood reached out from the ripples and hovered above his head.","Countless tiny dust particles emitted an indescribable aura of fate energy. They fell from the palms and poured around Black Cloud.","Looking at this strange scene, Yu Yao felt a sense of foreboding. In order to prevent this from happening, she immediately unleashed an unimaginable amount of fate energy.","She condensed another Dao-Breaking Purple Spear and shot it toward Black Cloud.","If this attack hit him, he would definitely die, and his Emperor’s fate energy would dissipate.","But in the next moment, something unexpected happened!","Black Cloud, who was on the verge of death, suddenly opened his eyes. His pale face looked straight ahead with a faint smile.","He actually had no intention of dodging!"]},{"number":5012,"title":"Chapter 5012 Nightmare Reappears","paragraphs":["5012 Nightmare Reappears","Facing the primordial Dao-Breaking Purple Spear that was filled with an ancient power, Black Cloud smiled sinisterly.","He did not dodge. He slowly raised his right arm and pointed forward.","The Dao-Breaking Purple Spear tore through the void and shot over.","The spear tip was forcefully stopped against the fingertip!","Strands of extremely pure chaotic aura surged out from his fingertips and covered the entire spear.","Then, it shattered in an instant.","The Dao-Breaking Purple Spear was shattered by a single finger. Yu Yao was shocked and hurriedly retreated. The Primordial Immortal Array was also summoned.","Standing up slowly, Black Cloud looked at his repaired Immortal body. His body was in its peak state, and he felt great satisfaction.","At this moment, his Emperor’s fate energy and his Immortal body had completely recovered to their peak state.","This was the reason why he could destroy Yu Yao’s Emperor Style with a single finger.","He had completely recovered, and his previously weakened state disappeared.","Facing Yu Yao, Black Cloud’s eyes were filled with greed and hatred.","Yu Yao, who had sensed that something was wrong, could no longer retreat because she was surrounded.","“This time, I will smash you into pieces and swallow you into my stomach bit by bit.”","Black Cloud suppressed her and and roared crazily. At the same time, a super Chaotic Emperor’s Throne descended again!","He raised his arms high and smashed down heavily on the Primordial Immortal Array.","Boom!","Boundless shockwaves exploded out, engulfing the void and destroying everything.","Black Cloud raised the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne again and smashed it down heavily.","The attacks became heavier and faster.","The Primordial Immortal Array could not withstand it at all. Cracks covered it and it could shatter at any moment.","Looking at the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne above her head, Yu Yao remained calm. A True Sword that was surrounded by Primordial Purple Intent quietly condensed in her palm.","In the next moment, she drew her sword and flew up. As the entire Immortal Array collapsed, her entire body turned into a flash and she brazenly crashed into the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne.","Billions of multicolored light shot out, causing a loud cry.","Under the impact of this attack, the billions of clones released by Black Cloud were directly shattered into powder, and he had no choice but to retreat 10,000 feet.","With her sword strike, Black Cloud’s Emperor Style collapsed.","When the super Chaotic Emperor’s Throne shattered, Yu Yao stood in the air with her sword, her face pale.","The palm that she placed behind her holding the Primordial True Sword was already drenched in divine blood.","The sword strike that broke the Emperor Style was a huge drain on her. Although Black Cloud was also damaged, it was definitely not as serious as hers.","The originally good situation had already been quietly reversed at this moment.","Black Cloud’s body swayed unsteadily, like a tangible cloud, and he instantly arrived in front of Yu Yao.","“I’ve said before that you only need to hand over half of that little Yan Immortal’s fate energy, and I’ll let you go, but you’re too selfish, and you’ve rejected my request.”","He sighed faintly. “In that case, I have no choice but to swallow your aura.”","Hearing this, Yu Yao sneered, “Are you that confident that you can take me down?”","“Do you think you can continue to struggle?” Black Cloud revealed a mysterious smile, and then he quietly raised his arms.","Ripples appeared in the air, and a painting appeared, causing Yu Yao’s eyes to widen.","“Immortal Lords, Yao’er, I’ll go ahead and offer you my last bit of fate energy.”","Along with this familiar voice, the figure of the Immortal Lord Zun Gu appeared!","He was dressed in a Flying Cloud Robe. His expression was indifferent, but he looked at Yu Yao with a longing look. Then, he stepped into the swirling array core.","In an instant, his Immortal body shattered and turned into powder to fill the array core.","...","“No, no, why is this scene happening again?!” Yu Yao’s eyes were filled with terror as she subconsciously retreated.","As Immortal Lord Zun Gu fell into the core of the array, the scene changed again. Thousands, even tens of thousands of Grand Yan Immortals rushed into the core of the array like moths to a flame.","This scene was too tragic. The Grand Yan Immortals sacrificed all their fate energy just to buy a few breaths of time.","When the dust settled, Yu Yao was the only one left in the painting. Boundless fate energy poured into her body.","“Tsk tsk, I thought that I was the only one who would resort to such unscrupulous means in order to gain enlightenment of the Emperor’s fate energy. I didn’t expect that compared to you, my deeds were insignificant.”","Black Cloud’s mocking voice rang out faintly, “In order to comprehend the Emperor’s fate energy, you lured and killed all the Grand Yan Immortals under you. I want to learn from you on this point.”","Yu Yao’s eyes were wide open, unable to extricate herself from the pain.","In that painting, everything was a nightmare. It was the past that she had tried her best to hide and forget. She did not expect it to appear again and become her real nightmare!","This trauma caused Yu Yao’s Divine Sense to fluctuate, unable to fuse and reach perfection!","Looking at her in pain, Black Cloud’s lips curled into a smile.","Seeing through the nightmare in her heart and magnifying it several times to show it again was his true specialty.","As long as her Divine Sense had not reached perfection, nothing could escape his eyes.","Black Cloud had yet to see a person whose Divine Sense had reached perfection.","She could no longer control the pain of being trapped in chaos. Black Cloud also disappeared at this moment.","When he reappeared, he was already in front of Yu Yao.","Chains of chaos burst out from his palm like real swords, stabbing into her Immortal body.","Slice-","Hundreds of chaotic chains pierced Yu Yao’s limbs and Immortal body, firmly locking her in the void.","She could not suppress the pain, but it was already too late.","Divine blood splattered everywhere, and the Emperor’s fate energy began to dissipate rapidly.","“What a pity. I didn’t expect an Emperor-to-be’s Divine Sense to be so weak. Even a single image is enough to destroy it.”","Black Cloud looked at her, half regretful and half mocking. “But it’s no wonder. It must be a wonderful feeling to trap and kill one’s loyal subordinates.”","“Your scheming makes me tremble. You’ve been waiting for this day, and it seems like you’ve already decided from the very beginning.”","“If your dead subordinates knew that you had already set up this situation from the beginning, what would they think?”","By the end of his sentence, Black Cloud had already started laughing maniacally. He seemed to be enjoying this feeling.","Yu Yao’s face was completely pale, and her eyes had already lost their luster.","“How boring. You designed it for so long, but in the end, you still gave everything you took to me.” Black Cloud shook his head. He could not wait to devour it.","As long as he swallowed the fate energy of an Emperor-to-be, he would definitely become an Emperor!","In the next moment, Yu Yao, whose eyes had already lost their luster, quietly raised her head and looked at Black Cloud with a faint smile. Then, she raised her broken right arm.","A True Sword surrounded by Primordial Purple Essence emitted an unparalleled light."]},{"number":5013,"title":"Chapter 5013 The Returning Sword Strike","paragraphs":["5013 The Returning Sword Strike","Black Cloud was speechless as he watched the Primordial True Sword stab into his chest.","The Emperor’s robe shattered, and endless Primordial Purple Intent erupted.","At this moment, the two incompatible Emperor’s fate energy fused and quickly canceled each other out.","The terror of life and death made Black Cloud roar. Chains of chaos shot out and broke through the purple mist, stabbing into Yu Yao’s Immortal body again.","Endless divine blood spilled down.","This was already a situation that would not end until one of them died!","They had all gone crazy and given up on controlling their own Emperor’s fate energy. They were using their own bodies to fight.","Although had not reached the realm of Emperor, their Immortal bodies were one level stronger than a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal. They were still Immortal bodies and not Emperor bodies.","However, the Emperor-to-be had something that the Grand Yan Immortal didn’t, and that was the Emperor Bone.","The Emperor Bone was the foundation of an Emperor-to-be, and it was an important item that led to becoming an Emperor.","Although the Emperor-to-be still had an Immortal body, with the Emperor Bone, even if his Immortal body was broken, he could quickly recover.","Emperor-to-be Yu Yao’s Immortal body was almost completely damaged by the chaotic chains, but it was rapidly recovering.","All of this was because of the Emperor Bone.","However, Black Cloud, who had the upper hand earlier, was now in an even more miserable state.","Even though he had been restored to his peak state by the unknown power, his Immortal body could not withstand Yu Yao’s attack because Jian Wushuang had extracted his Emperor Bone.","His Immortal body shattered even more, and the damage he received far exceeded the speed of recovery. He was retreating slowly.","Although Yu Yao’s injuries were less severe than Black Cloud’s, her Divine Sense was already in chaos, and she was struggling to hold on.","If they continued to risk their life like this, Black Cloud, who did not have Emperor Bone, would be the first to perish!","Both of them were already at the end of their rope, but neither of them was willing to be the first to retreat. This was because if they were ambushed while retreating, even if they did not die, they would be powerless to turn the situation around.","The chaotic aura and the Primordial Purple Intent had already completely clashed.","Hundreds and thousands of chaotic chains pierced through Yu Yao’s Immortal body, devouring and strangling her.","Yu Yao held the Primordial True Sword in one hand and the Dao-Breaking Primordial Purple Spear in the other. She also stabbed into Black Cloud’s chest.","Divine blood splattered everywhere, and the Emperor’s fate energy was also being destroyed.","No matter how crazy Black Cloud was, he knew the severity of the situation. Looking at Yu Yao, whose Divine Sense was gradually becoming clearer, he gritted his teeth and ripples appeared in the void.","As the ripples spread out, Black Cloud’s figure disappeared and was replaced by Immortal Lord Zun Gu!","Divine blood gushed out of his eyes and ears. Only his True Eyes were still clear, revealing a complicated expression.","“Yao’er, I am the Zun Gu.”","Yu Yao was shocked, and the Primordial Purple Spear in her hand instantly fell into the void.","“No, no, you’re not. Zun Gu is already dead.”","The Immortal Lord Zun Gu’s eyes turned into pain again. In the end, he said, “Yao ‘er, why did you do that? You know that we only want to get out...”","Yu Yao’s entire body trembled, and her Emperor’s fate energy nearly dissipated!","At this moment, her Divine Sense was completely in chaos.","“No, no, it’s all fake! Zun Gu, I also want to go out, but what can I do if I go out? Zhen Wuyang won’t let us off!”","The Immortal Lord Zun Gu did not say anything else and only looked at her in pain.","Then, the Grand Yan Immortals who had died in the Galaxia Ammortal array all walked out from the void ripples. They looked at Yu Yao with sorrowful expressions and did not say a word.","Looking at the tens of thousands of Grand Yan Immortals that she once served, Yu Yao had completely collapsed!","Although she was already an Emperor-to-be, the collapse of her Divine Sense made her unable to move.","That tragic scene became a nightmare in her heart.","In order to become an Emperoor, she had weaved a lie that lasted for countless years. And this lie had killed all the Yan Immortals who had followed her.","Divine blood flowed out of her eyes along with her tears. The endless Primordial Purple Intent was also destroyed at this moment.","Immortal Lord Zun Gu and all the Grand Yan Immortals slowly dissipated, leaving only Black Cloud standing where they were.","An indecipherable look flashed in the depths of his eyes before he returned to normal.","Arriving in front of Yu Yao, he slowly raised his right palm. Chains of primal chaos shot out from his palm and bound Yu Yao.","Her Divine Sense had collapsed, and she no longer had the will to fight. Her Emperor’s fate energy had been destroyed.","“Give me all your fate energy. I will live well for you.”The corners of Black Cloud’s mouth curled up as the chaotic chains began to devour her fate energy.","At this moment, Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Di Qing had already woken up. Only the weak Immortal Lord Fu Uao was still unconscious.","They looked at each other and nodded. Although they were still bound by the chains of chaos, they could still do simple actions.","After making the decision, they quickly fled. Di Qing looked at the unconscious Fu Yao and felt sorry for her. In the end, he gritted his teeth and prepared to leave with her.","However, Black Cloud’s sinister voice rang out, “You want to leave? Stay here!”","After saying that, four chaotic chains shot over and caught them in an instant, dragging them in front of Black Cloud.","“All of you belong to me.” He gave a strange smile, and the chaotic chains directly absorbed the fate energy.","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and Fu Yao were all in pain. Their fate energy had already been devoured by Yu Yao, and now that it was being devoured again, they could only die.","“Their fate energy has already been absorbed by me. Let them leave and I’ll give all my fate energy to you.”","Yu Yao, whose hair was disheveled and had lost her will to fight, suddenly said softly.","Black Cloud was stunned, then he grinned. “Pretending to be merciful? Now that you’re all in my hands, you’re still negotiating terms? I want them all!”","Yu Yao did not say anything more. She looked up at them, then lowered her head.","Even if Di Qing refused to accept his fate, he was already powerless to turn the situation around.","It seemed that their final destination was to die completely.","Black Cloud had gone completely mad. The fate energy of a Emperor-to-be and 3 Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortals was in his hands.","He could no longer be stopped from becoming a true Emperor!","At this moment, the entire void had been engulfed by the chaotic aura. The endless chaotic chains covered everything.","He did not notice that in the void of silence, from the end of the endless, a light quietly appeared.","This light was too vast, as if it was descending from the Nine Heavens.","When Black Clouds and the others finally noticed it, the light had long covered the world and bloomed.","It was a sword strike!","It was as if billions of tassels were falling. Each Sword Intent easily cut open the void.","It was said that in every Heavenly Region, there was a peak of a divine mountain, and on the peak, there would be a Seven-Leaf Sword Grass.","When the Seven-Leaf Sword Grass bloomed completely, even the stellar sun would dim.","At this moment, countless Seven-leaf Sword Grass seemed to have bloomed in the entire void. It was impossible to look directly at them."]},{"number":5014,"title":"Chapter 5014 The Arrival of the Emperor","paragraphs":["5014 The Arrival of the Emperor","This sword strike was too powerful. Every strand of Sword Intent easily cut through the chaotic aura and then bloomed wantonly.","An unparalleled and pure force completely erupted.","Black Cloud’s eyes suddenly widened. Even though he was already an Emperor-to-be, facing this sword strike, only the terror of life and death surged into his heart!","He could easily feel that if he did not retreat, this sword strike would definitely injure him severely or even kill him!","But how could he let go of the Emperor-to-be fate energy in his hands?","“Ah!”","Black Cloud roared, and in the next moment, he actually tried to drag the chains along with Yu Yao.","However, Yu Yao suddenly grabbed the chaotic chains in her body and gave a strange smile. She used all her strength to drag him under the sword curtain!","Billions of Sword Intents intersected with each other, bringing with them a clear sword hum as they descended.","At this moment, in the eternal void, there was only Sword Intent.","Everything was being destroyed.","Yu Yao held Black Cloud tightly, exposing herself to the sword screen without any intention of resisting.","Only Black Cloud’s roar continued, and it was soon swallowed up.","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and Fu Yao all shut their eyes tightly, resigned themselves to fate.","The Sword Dao was eternal.","The vast Sword Intent that covered the eternal void lasted for a long time.","When the Sword Intent dissipated, Jiang Li and Di Qing opened their eyes at the same time. Then, they were so shocked that they could not speak.","Jian Wushuang reappeared in front of them.","His chest was bare, and his entire body was enveloped by an unknown dark green aura. It was completely different from the Emperor aura that flowed around him previously, but it was even deeper.","They gulped in unison.","“I’m late. Sorry to have kept you guys waiting.”","Jian Wushuang instructed and turned around slowly.","As he turned around, the dark green aura flowing around his body rose and circulated.","The sword curtain dissipated, and Black Cloud covered his chest. He spat out large mouthfuls of divine blood and shattered Emperor’s fate energy.","At that moment, Yu Yao, who had been seeking death wholeheartedly, suffered even more injuries. Her entire immortal body was almost completely shattered, and her divine blood had already been drained. Only the Emperor’s fate energy was supporting her life.","Seeing that it was Jian Wushuang, Yu Yao’s eyes were filled with disbelief and an indescribable sense of relief.","Black Cloud was terrified, completely terrified.","He had never thought that the nightmare would return again, and in an unimaginable manner.","Black Clouds trembled. He could feel that Jian Wushuang was still terrifying.","The dark green aura of the flowing clouds blocked everything and made Jian Wushuang look like a supreme Emperor.","This scene caused Black Cloud to tremble from the bottom of his heart. It was as if the past had returned.","Countless years ago, Zhen Wuyang, who had destroyed his body and soul with a single slap, had appeared just like this. His eyes were indifferent, and with supreme fate energy, he had easily destroyed a Heavenly Court.","Now, Jian Wushuang gave him the same feeling.","“No, no, it has nothing to do with me. I didn’t do anything. If you want to blame someone, blame that woman.”","Black Cloud spoke in fear, no longer caring about his dignity.","Looking at Black Cloud who was about to kneel on the ground in fear, Yu Yao was a little surprised. It was easy for an Emperor-to-be to kill a Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortal, so why would he be afraid of a puny little Yan Immortal?","Furthermore, this puny little Yan Immortal had died in her hands.","Although Yu Yao was shocked that Jian Wushuang had come back from the dead, it did not mean that she was afraid.","Therefore, she was puzzled by Black Cloud’s abnormal behavior.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and said in an indifferent voice, “You know what you have done. Today, one of you will settle the score with the other. Neither of you will leave here alive.”","Black Cloud’s body trembled as if his fate had been sealed.","His gaze shifted from Black Cloud to Yu Yao.","Their eyes met. Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with cold and murderous intent.","Yu Yao felt a chill down her spine. At the same time, she felt that the aura he was emitting was not something that a Yan Immortal could have!","“Hey, don’t just stand there. If you don’t want to die today, we must join forces!” Black Cloud said in a trembling voice.","Yu Yao completely ignored him, even feeling that it was somewhat ridiculous.","A puny little Yan Immortal could actually scare an Emperor-to-be to this extent?","“Tell me, are you going to join hands or not?!” Black Cloud shouted anxiously.","“Get lost!” Yu Yao looked at him and roared angrily. A Primordial True Sword suddenly condensed in her hand.","Her mentality of seeking death had already changed, leaving only endless killing intent.","Not only was Black Cloud not enraged by the scolding, he was even more delighted than before. This was exactly what he wanted to see.","Once they fought, he could use this opportunity to leave!","Thinking of this, Black Cloud quietly retreated.","When he faced Yu Yao, who had already become an Emperor-to-be, Jian Wushuang was still not afraid. He only felt contempt.","Yu Yao couldn’t help but feel ashamed and angry, as well as endless killing intent.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang quietly condensed an Invisible Sword.","This time, the Invisible Sword was no longer formless. Instead, its entire body was covered in a dark green color, and it was deep and strange.","The tip of the dark green Invisible Sword was pointed at Yu Yao as he said calmly, “Today, I only have one goal, and that is to kill you here.”","She only felt that it was ridiculous. A Yan Immortal who had died in her hands not long ago would actually say such arrogant words.","“Although I don’t know how you survived, since you’ve appeared in front of me today, you’re bound to die in my hands again,” Yu Yao said coldly, and her boundless killing intent exploded.","Jian Wushuang smiled and his golden eyes turned dark green.","A deep and vigorous aura burst out from his body.","This was an unprecedented and mysterious aura. It was different from before, but it was vast and surging.","Black Cloud was so nervous that he could not speak. He could feel the change in Jian Wushuang, so he was terrified.","This time, the aura was even gloomier and more brutal. It was filled with a sinister coldness.","Black Cloud had a feeling that if he did not run away the moment they fought, he would never have the chance to escape.","Thinking of this, he was already planning a way out.","Yu Yao was also extremely furious. Facing Jian Wushuang, she held the Primordial True Sword and slashed forward without hesitation!","‘Now’s the time, run!’","Black Cloud did noot hesitate at all. The instant they exchanged blows, his figure completely disappeared and he fled frantically.","Jian Wushuang smiled contemptuously as the endless Primordial Purple Intent poured down. Then, he held the sword hilt with both hands and slashed out casually.","The dark green longsword slashed out in the endless void. In an instant, it expanded by hundreds of millions of feet!","At this moment, even the void was sliced apart by the ink-green sword.","The Primordial Purple Intent clashed with the trillion-meter-long ink-green sword slash.","It was as if a brocade was torn apart, the celestial river was cut off, and the endless Primordial Purple Intent was cut apart, as if without resistance at all."]},{"number":5015,"title":"Chapter 5015 Destroying Yu Yao With a Single Sword Strike","paragraphs":["5015 Destroying Yu Yao With a Single Sword Strike","The Primordial Purple Intent shattered and turned into billions of tassels that fell from the void.","The indescribable horror shocked her. She did not even think about it and raised her Primordial True Sword in front of her to block.","Ding–!","The crisp and melodious sword chime was fleeting and disappeared in an instant.","The Primordial Purple Intent was completely shattered, and the inky-green sword slash disappeared. It was as if nothing had ever happened.","However, in the next moment, the long hair on Yu Yao’s left ear broke, and the Primordial True Sword in front of her also broke into two from the tip of the sword!","The power of a single sword had forced an Emperor-to-be to be backed into a corner!","Yu Yao was completely shocked. She di not dare to believe it. She had clearly killed this guy easily before, so why did he give her a feeling that she could not fathom him now?","Black Cloud, who was fleeing for his life, naturally saw this scene. Seeing Yu Yao being crushed, he could not help but smile.","However, when he turned around, he was shocked to find that the path ahead was blocked by a dark green barrier!","The barrier was extremely tough, as if it was made of layers of dark green feathers. It was extremely treacherous.","Cold sweat dripped from his temples. He suddenly realized that Jian Wushuang had no intention of letting them leave alive when he attacked.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were completely replaced by an inky-green color and his entire body emitted a powerful aura.","He had used Liu Ya’s Divine Sense and one of the Six Paths Emperor’s Fate Energy.","The Emperor Liu Ya’s surging Emperor’s fate energy had already surged into his Immortal body.","Thanks to the strange characteristics of the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body, Jian Wushuang could almost perfectly absorb and integrate with any Emperor’s fate energy and unleash its full power.","The fate energy of a true Emperor and Emperor Liu Ya were now fully unleashed in his body.","It was so terrifying that even Jian Wushuang could not explain it. He was only a peak Immortal Yan realm expert, but he could fight an Emperor-to-be.","Recovering from her shock, Yu Yao looked at him with a complicated expression.","Jian Wushuang was too lazy to waste his breath on her. For a person who had set up such a vicious plan to kill all the Yan Immortals who followed her, even if she became an Emperor-to-be, there would only be one outcome.","Holding the dark green longsword in his hand, at this moment, thousands of Sword Intents merged into one.","The River.","The majestic celestial river flowed out of the eternal void. Billions of Sword Intent condensed together, forming a super sword river.","Different from before, the sword river this time was like the Endless Sea, filled with dead silence, coldness, and desolation.","It was as if it had flowed from ancient times and had never been extinguished.","This sword had surpassed the realm and was indescribable.","As for Yu Yao, she finally understood why Black Cloud had lost his composure and begged for mercy.","This was because the variables of this sword move were too great.","Without any time to think, Yu Yao directly brought out the Primordial Immortal Array. At the same time, a Dao-Breaking Primordial Purple Spear condensed in her hand!","A tit-for-tat confrontation had already appeared!","The majestic black celestial river swept over, and the entire Primordial Immortal Array was instantly devoured.","Yu Yao, who was in the center of the Immortal Array, felt her eyes turn dark, and there was no other color.","An even more unbelievable scene appeared. The Primordial Immortal Array, which was so strong that even Black Clouds could not break, actually shattered into countless fine cracks the moment they collided.","It shattered in an instant!","The chaotic black sword river roared and tore apart the Primordial Immortal Array, devouring Yu Yao.","Yu Yao could no longer remain calm. She held the Dao-Breaking Primordial Purple Spear and stabbed it toward the sword river.","In an instant, the frenzied sword river was split into two.","Yu Yao, who was at the center of the sword river tide, was trembling slightly.","The sword river seemed endless, devouring her Divine Sense bit by bit.","She struggled to hold on, and the arm holding the spear trembled even more.","Just as Yu Yao was about to retreat, the endless sword river suddenly dissipated.","However, before she could breathe a sigh of relief, at the end of the sword river, Jian Wushuang appeared quietly like a ghost, holding a dark green longsword!","As the sword stabbed forward, Yu Yao subconsciously raised her Dao-Breaking Primordial Purple Spear to block.","The tip of the sword easily shattered the tip of the spear, and the forward thrust did not lose its momentum.","The entire Dao-Breaking Primordial Purple Spear exploded inch by inch, along with Yu Yao’s right arm that was holding the spear.","Slash!","An extremely faint sound rang out, and then everything was silenced.","She only felt an unbearable pain in her Immortal body, and then she lowered her head to look.","A dark green sword pierced through her right rib and pierced through her entire Immortal body.","Divine blood gushed out from the wound and sprinkled in the air.","Her imperial robe shattered and her entire right arm disappeared.","Under this sword strike, Yu Yao was utterly defeated.","Her eyes were still filled with disbelief. As soon as she opened her mouth, divine blood flowed out.","Jian Wushuang took half a step back, his eyes still cold.","“W-why? How did you do it? You’re clearly just a Yan Immortal...”","Yu Yao said in pain. She could feel the Emperor’s fate energy within her Immortal body rapidly dissipating.","Jian Wushuang did not answer her, his eyes still filled with contempt.","Immediately after, a cry that seemed to come from the Nine Heavens resounded.","Screech-","Then, behind Jian Wushuang, a huge totem made of dark green aura appeared.","That totem was huge and filled with supreme pressure. The entire totem only depicted a large bird.","The bird was like a flowing cloud. It was dark green and had six horns on its head. It was covered in thousands of feathers and was filled with supreme pressure.","With the appearance of the huge totem, Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body revealed an aura that had never appeared before.","Yu Yao’s eyes widened as she staggered backward.","She clearly knew what that aura represented, and it was precisely because of this that she was shocked.","That was the Emperor’s fate energy!","A Yan Immortal actually possessed the fate energy of an Emperor?!","After a long while, she said bitterly, “Why do you have the Emperor’s fate energy?”","Jian Wushuang did not answer her question, but said calmly, “Do you want me to do it or do you want to do it yourself?”","Yu Yao was stunned, but she already knew what Jian Wushuang meant.","She was speechless. She already knew that there was nothing she could do.","With just a single sword strike, her Immortal body was shattered. Yu Yao simply could not think of any way to resist.","“Preposterous. This is simply too preposterous. The Emperor’s fate energy that I desired so much... Now I’m in such a state.”","She shed tears, and her Immortal body withered to the extreme at this moment.","“I regret it.”","“If you knew this would happen, why did you do it in the first place?” Jian Wushuang said slowly."]},{"number":5016,"title":"Chapter 5016 Another Emperor Bone","paragraphs":["5016 Another Emperor Bone","Jian Wushuang had no pity for her.","If the Galaxia Immortal Array had not been activated, would all of this not have happened?","There were no ifs. Even an Emperor-to-be would have to pay the price.","When the ink-green longsword that had fused with Emperor Liu Ya’s fate energy stabbed into her Immortal body, the dust had already settled.","Even if Yu Yao resisted, Jian Wushuang had several ways to kill her.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang was not worried that she would resist because no one could save her now that she had the desire to die.","The next step was for her to release her own fate energy.","“You guys are the variables. When you came to the Third and Fifth Heaven, I felt some changes in the unseen world.”","Yu Yao let out another wisp of divine blood. Her aura had already weakened. “But I didn’t expect things to go in the opposite direction.”","“Now, I realize that even if I control the fate energy of an Emperor, it will still be taken away by some unknown calamity. If it’s not mine, it won’t be mine in the end.”","“My Emperor’s fate energy belongs to you now, you can take it.”","After she said that, she did not speak again. Instead, she released her Emperor’s fate energy and directed it to floow toward Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly and waved his hand to discard the Emperor’s fate energy.","“I don’t want to. You can release it yourself.”","Yu Yao’s body froze, and a trace of sadness flashed across her eyes.","“Alright, then I’ll undo it myself!”","After saying that, she did not stop and immediately dispelled her Emperor’s fate energy!","In an instant, a gust of wind blew, and even the eternal void trembled.","However, the scene of destruction did not appear again. After the wind swept across hundreds of millions of miles, it fell silent.","The Primordial Purple Intent resolved itself and completely returned to the void.","Jian Wushuang stood in front of her and watched the scene calmly.","All of this should have had nothing to do with him, but in the end, it was all tainted by karma.","It was just like when he was in the Sand Demon Cave, Sha Qing had pushed him into the Blood Sea and tainted him with unknown karma.","Jian Wushuang had always been in a passive position, but there was nothing he could do.","Immediately after, the simple discussion with Konglun under the Blood Sea also surfaced in his mind.","Everything seemed to be coming to an end, but at the same time, it also seemed to have never ended.","As the Emperor’s fate energy continued to dissipate, Yu Yao’s Immortal body became almost transparent.","Then, she suddenly opened her eyes and looked at Jian Wushuang.","“If you want to leave this place, the heavenly gate of the Third and Fifth Layer of Heaven is indeed the weakest point in the entire Endless Sea. I’ve never lied to you about this.”","She was about to die, and her words were also good.","Jian Wushuang nodded slowly.","Yu Yao continued, “Actually, when I activated the Galaxia Immortal Array at the end, I changed my mind for a moment, but in the end, I couldn’t resist the temptation.”","Hearing her words, Jian Wushuang knew that this was her final redemption.","After saying this, Yu Yao’s Immortal body shattered into pieces without the support of the Emperor’s fate energy.","The endless Primordial Purple Intent dissipated and filled the entire void as if it had never appeared.","Jian Wushuang raised his hand to retrieve the dark green sword and stood with his hands behind his back.","“S-she died?”","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and Immortal Fu Yao came behind Jian Wushuang and looked at the place where Emperor-to-be Yu Yao disappeared in shock.","They had all witnessed this battle and had yet to recover from the shock.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and a hint of fatigue flashed in the depths of his eyes. He could not control the Imperial Emperor’s fate energy that he had absorbed from the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes. If this continued, his Immortal body would collapse.","However, he still did not plan to disperse Emperor Liu Ya’s fate energy because he still had things to do.","Emperor-to-be Yu Yao’s fate was completely destroyed and the Primordial Purple Intent dissipated.","Jian Wushuang thought that there was nothing left behind, but something rose from the place where Yu Yao disappeared.","The dense Primordial Purple Intent that was almost impossible to dissipate wrapped around a piece of sparkling white bone.","As if it had sensed something, the Primordial Purple Intent in the air brought the Emperor Bone to Jian Wushuang.","The Emperor Bone was one of the biggest differences between an Emperor-to-be and a Yan Immortal. Once the Emperor Bone was formed, it meant that there would be no more obstacles in the path of the Emperor.","The ownerless Primordial Intent smelled Jian Wushuang’s powerful aura and submitted to him, offering Yu Yao’s Emperor Bone.","Jian Wushuang did not even accept her Emperor fate energy, so he naturally did not want to accept this Emperor bone.","Although the Emperor Bone was the symbol of an Emperor-to-be and carried an unimaginable power, it did not seem to have any effect on him.","After thinking for a moment, Jian Wushuang finally decided to accept the Emperor Bone.","With a wave of his hand, the Emperor Bone, which was emitting a primordial purple aura, fell into his palm.","The warmth in his hand was completely different from Black Cloud’s Emperor Bone.","This was a hot potato, the less Grand Yan Immortals knew about it, the more secure it would be.","Jian Wushuang now had two pieces of Emperor Bone.","Although the Emperor Bones were useless, he still decided to keep tem.","After putting Yu Yao’s Emperor Bone into the Boyang Bottle, he took out several Emperor-grade pills that could strengthen one’s foundation and protect one’s origin, giving them to Jiang Li and Yan Fan.","Although his providence was still unable to recover, it had already been completely stabilized after consuming the Emperor-grade pills. It was only a matter of time before he fully recovered.","Jian Wushuang’s body was still surging with fate energy, and the brilliance was so intense that one could not look directly at him. Then, he looked into the distance.","There was still a problem that had not been solved. What he needed to do was to solve it.","Being blocked by some kind of black feather barrier, Black Clouod was already panicking to the extreme.","In addition, he had personally witnessed Emperor-to-be Yu Yao’s self-destruction, causing him to feel even more despair.","He raised the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne high and tried to break the barrier.","However, this ink-green feather barrier was even stronger than Yu Yao’s Primordial Immortal Array. He could not break it at all.","Feeling the chill from his back, Black Cloud stopped what he was doing and slowly turned around.","That nightmare-like Yan Immortal was standing behind him, looking at him with a sinister smile.","“You, you’ve already killed me once. You’ve already extracted my Emperor Bone, so there’s no reason for you to kill me again.”","Black Cloud took a deep breath and said.","Hearing that, Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows slightly. “Oh, is that so? But why are you still alive? I remember that you have completely perished before.”"]},{"number":5017,"title":"Chapter 5017 The True Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes","paragraphs":["5017 The True Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes","Black Cloud’s heart skipped a beat. He could feel the cold killing intent in Jian Wushuang’s voice.","“Nothing. I just want you to die completely,” Jian Wushuang said in a low voice and the dark green longsword condensed again.","Feeling the surging aura, Black Cloud was shocked. Without thinking, he immediately flew away.","“You want to leave?”","Jian Wushuang did not stop. He pierced through the space with his sword!","In an instant, the void collapsed. An unimaginable Sword Intent shot out and stabbed into the back of Black Cloud.","Boom!","Under this sword, his body was directly shattered into countless fragments.","However, Jian Wushuang did not think that Black Cloud would die so easily. He was a special existence and his Immortal body was almost useless.","As expected, when his Immortal body shattered, hundreds of Black Cloud clones appeared. They looked back at Jian Wushuang and then flew away in all directions.","Seeing this, Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and the others were anxious, but there was nothing they could do. Once an Emperor-to-be wanted to escape, no one could stop him.","However, Jian Wushuang remained calm. Even though hundreds of Black Cloud figures had appeared, he was not worried.","In the next moment, he stretched out his hand and waved. A boundless ink-green feather barrier descended.","The escaping Black Cloud figures all crashed into the barrier and turned into ashes. Only the real Black Cloud had a gloomy expression.","The path was completely blocked and Jian Wushuang was determined to kill him!","Black Cloud’s face was gloomy. He turned around and looked at Jian Wushuang, who was already approaching. He said coldly, “Do you really think you can defeat me?”","“Isn’t that so?” Jian Wushuang looked at him calmly.","He smiled sinisterly, “Although I don’t know how you obtained the Emperor’s fate energy, I can tell that you are still a puny little Yan Immortal. If I continue to waste my time with you, will I exhaust you to death?”","“Then I want to see how you exhaust me to death,” Jian Wushuang laughed and said.","A trapped beast had to fight. Once defeated, only death awaited.","At this moment, a vast and strange chaotic aura completely covered the entire green feather barrier.","In order to not have any worries, Jian Wushuang had already pushed Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Di Qing, and Fu Yao out of the barrier.","At this moment, they were the only ones inside the barrier.","Black Cloud attacked first. In order to gain the upper hand, he controlled the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne and smashed it at Jian Wushuang.","The Chaotic Emperor’s Throne, which occupied half of the barrier, was too terrifying. Even Jian Wushuang, who was blessed with Emperor fate energy, could not underestimate it.","One had to know that he was only a peak-stage Yan Immortal. If he was not careful, he would die on the spot.","Therefore, when he saw the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne flying over, Jian Wushuang drew his sword and did not dare to be careless.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, first move.","Star.","An ordinary sword slashed out, but in the next moment, it shook the world.","This sword made the void curl, and thousands of pillars of dark green light exploded.","The two collided, and the super Chaotic Emperor’s Throne shook violently. Then, endless chaotic aura gushed out.","Black Cloud’s expression changed drastically. The Chaotic Emperor’s Throne was almost shattered after just one exchange and was on the verge of collapsing.","He gritted his teeth, and his Immortal body surged with endless chaotic aura again, reinforcing the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne.","The aura was so strong that Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and the others outside the dark green feather barrier were a little shocked.","“Will something happen to Wushuang?” Yan Fan was rather nervous.","“I don’t think so. Wushuang’s fate energy is too great. It’s over,” Jiang Li said. “Everything will be settled in less than ten seconds.”","Within the black feather enchantment, the situation was over.","The Chaotic Emperor’s Throne was gone, leaving only the eternal void.","Jian Wushuang stood with his sword and looked ahead indifferently.","Black Cloud was weakened, and the chaotic aura was mostly destroyed by that sword strike.","A strange stream of black blood flowed out from the corner of his mouth.","“It’s time to end it. Should I do it, or should you resolve your own fate?” Jian Wushuang said calmly, but his voice was filled with an undeniable majesty.","There was only one ending.","However, he still smiled sinisterly. “You’re asking me to resolve my own fate? Do you think you can force me into a desperate situation?”","Jian Wushuang’s face turned cold and a totem that covered the sky suddenly appeared behind him.","With the appearance of this totem, the chaotic aura in the entire ink-green feather barrier was instantly cleared!","It was a Chasing Bird!","It had six horns on its head, and it was covered in colorful feathers that could not be looked at directly.","Even the endless void could not withstand its arrival and began to collapse and curl up again.","Following the appearance of the totem, another image appeared behind Jian Wushuang.","It was a Black Feather Flowing Cloud Emperor Robe. It reflected the extreme of all things in the world. Each feather was like a small world, containing endless power.","A true Emperor!","Not a single Grand Yan Immortal could see his true face. He seemed to have walked out of the ancient era and arrived here.","He stood quietly behind Jian Wushuang, shining with the huge Chasing Bird totem.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and 100,000 inky-green intent burst out.","Not only that, but the brilliant Emperor behind him also opened his eyes at this moment.","A vast power, Annihilation of Ocean and Dust! The universe collapsed. Everything was under his gaze.","Black Cloud had even forgotten to escape. He instantly died under this mighty power.","Almost at the same time, Jian Wushuang spat out a mouthful of divine blood and his aura instantly weakened to the extreme.","This was the true power of the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes. Just the first move was enough to almost destroy Jian Wushuang’s Divine Sense.","Furthermore, he was unable to use the first move at all. He was only able to use this move by relying on Emperor Liu Ya’s fate energy.","The reason why he was unable to cultivate the Liu Ya Heavenly Emperor Runes was because he had to be at least a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal to be qualified...","The void was bright. This aura lasted for a long time before it slowly dissipated.","The entire void had already been completely flattened. Even the Endless Sea beneath him had caved in by who knew how many trillions of feet.","In the eternal void, there were only wisps of dark green aura flowing.","Jian Wushuang was the only one who was still standing.","Black Cloud had completely disappeared, not even a trace of fate energy left behind.","Everything was settled.","Jian Wushuang’s aura was weak. He could feel the Emperor’s fate energy in his body dissipating.","The Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body also began to shatter.","After using two different Emperor’s fate energy, his Immortal body was like a container that was about to shatter.","His face was pale, and his hand reached for the Boyang Bottle at his waist."]},{"number":5018,"title":"Chapter 5018 The Final Battle at the Heavenly Gates","paragraphs":["5018 The Final Battle at the Heavenly Gates","Jian Wushuang took out nearly 20 Emperor-grade pills and stuffed them into his mouth.","The medicinal effects of 20 Emperor-grade pills were just enough to offset the side effects of using the Emperor’s fate energy so rampantly.","If he did not have these miracle pills, he would have died.","“How is it? Is it serious?” Di Qing walked up quickly and said solemnly.","“It’s not a big deal, but I’m afraid I’ll be weak for a period of time.” He smiled bitterly.","“It’s fine. Everything is over. It’s time for you to have a good rest,” Yan Fan patted his shoulder and said.","Jian Wushuang nodded. Everything had been settled. The two Emperor-to-be were dead and there were no more obstacles.","The next thing was to leave the Endless Sea.","Jian Wushuang turned around slowly and looked at the void in the distance.","At this moment, they did not notice that layers of ripples suddenly appeared in the void behind them. Then, two figures walked out from it.","In the next moment, the two figures suddenly shot up, and a vigorous silk directly wrapped around Di Qing and Immortal Lord Fu Yao.","Caught off guard, they were all hit.","By the time Jian Wushuang reacted, the two figures had already dragged Di Qing and Fu Yao and dashed forward.","“You’re courting death!”","Jian Wushuang shouted and instantly rushed forward, followed by Jiang Li and Yan Fan.","A total of seven figures were chasing crazily under the sky that had become a void.","When the two figures dragging Di Qing and Fu Yao stopped, Jian Wushuang stopped as well.","The sky was still broken, but in the middle of the broken sky, an almost completely broken heavenly gate came into view.","This was the ruins of the Third and Fifth Heaven, and also the place where Yu Yao killed her subordinate Yan Immortals to become an Emperor-to-be.","“Wu Shuang, long time no see.”","Immediately after, the fog slowly dissipated, and the two figures were revealed.","Those two figures were actually Bian Ziyuan and the Young Prince beside him!","Their reappearance made Jian Wushuang feel a strange change in his mood.","Bian Ziyuan’s gaze was cold, and there was only cold killing intent left in his gaze.","The Young Prince stood with his hands behind his back, watching the scene with interest.","“Everyone is here. It looks like a good show will start soon.”","The Young Prince smiled strangely and stretched out his pale hands.","As his palm moved, billions of tiny dust particles suddenly gathered in the void.","Then, a figure condensed again.","Black Cloud!","At this moment, even Jian Wushuang was completely shocked. Black Cloud, who had been completely obliterated, had actually revived. This was simply unimaginable.","He slowly opened his eyes. At first, he was confused, but then he was overjoyed.","“I... I actually survived?”","Retracting his palm, the Young Prince’s face turned even paler. He glanced at Black Cloud and said softly, “Don’t be happy too early. Your enemy is right in front of you.”","Black Cloud was stunned and looked at Jian Wushuang subconsciously. He trembled and there was only fear in his eyes.","He had not walked out of the terrible destruction. Now that he saw Jian Wushuang again, he almost could not even stand steadily.","This Yan Immortal who had killed him twice and extracted his Emperor Bone had become the most terrifying nightmare in his heart.","The Young Prince who saw Black Cloud’s expression could not help but reveal a look of disgust. Then, he said coldly, “Your mission this time is to kill any Grand Yan Immortal you see. Otherwise, you should know what will happen to you.”","Hearing this, Black Cloud revealed a bitter expression. “Then I’ll try my best.”","Ignoring him, the Young Prince looked at Bian Ziyuan and said, “Ziyuan, I’ll leave them to you.”","“No, I only want him!” Bian Ziyuan’s voice was low as he raised his palm and pointed at Jian Wushuang.","He nodded. “Let’s begin then.”","The familiar chaotic aura spread out again. Although Black Cloud was scared out of his wits, he still chose to fight.","“Let them go, I’ll fight you.”","Jian Wushuang said coldly.","“Are you negotiating with me?” He smiled coldly. “Come and get it yourself!”","As soon as he finished speaking, an endless amount of exquisite mist rose up and instantly covered half of the void.","Jiang Li and Yan Fan gritted their teeth. Although they were still at the peak of their cultivation realms, they could not use more than ten percent of their power right now.","Facing Black Cloud, they were completely powerless.","At this moment, the Emperor’s fate energy that Jian Wushuang carried had dissipated and his strength had weakened to a certain level.","Without the Emperr’s fate energy, he could only fight with a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal by using three streaks fate energy.","Black Cloud had been scared out of his wits by Jian Wushuang, so he did not dare to move forward rashly. He only released his chaotic aura behind him as a distraction.","This undoubtedly gave Jian Wushuang a chance to catch his breath.","His immortal body was already exhausted to the extreme, but he still gritted his teeth and released the Selfless True Shadow.","With the addition of Selfless True Shadow, Jian Wushuang forced himself to carry three streaks of fate energy.","However, before he could channel the three streaks of fate energy, Bian Ziyuan had already charged over brazenly like a ghost.","A fist was swung out heavily, as if millions of mountains and divine peaks were coming.","Jian Wushuang was forced to resist, but he was suddenly knocked back 10,000 feet!","He flew and plowed open a ravine in the void before he could barely stop himself. The blood in his Immortal body churned.","Bian Ziyuan’s aura seemed to have changed!","Jian Wushuang became serious. In the previous battle, Bian Ziyuan’s cultivation realm was Six Revolutions, but he was killed by Jian Wushuang who had the three traces of fate energy.","And now, the resurrected Bian Ziyuan gave him an extremely strange feeling. His cultivation realm was also hard to fathom for a moment.","Jiang Li and Yan Fan saw that Jian Wushuang was no match for them and were about to rush forward to help, but they were blocked by Black Cloud.","“I’m very hungry.”","Black Cloud chuckled, his eyes filled with greed.","On the ruins of the Third and Fifth Heaven, under the broken heavenly gate, a huge battle erupted.","The Yan power from the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal caused the void to shatter even more violently, and fine cracks appeared on the heavenly gate above the void again.","Waving his hand to block off all the ripples of energy, the pale and gloomy Young Prince turned to look at Di Qing and Fu Yao.","“All of you are not bad. How about being my envoys? In return, I will bring you out of the Endless Sea.”","He smiled slightly, his eyes filled with a strange bewitchment.","Di Qing was disgusted and looked at him coldly.","As a prodigy who had walked out of the ancient era, he had his own pride."]},{"number":5019,"title":"Chapter 5019 The Giant Beast and the Old Shepherd","paragraphs":["5019 The Giant Beast and the Old Shepherd","If Di Qing’s fate energy had not dissipated, he would have given this unfathomable Young Prince a thunderous blow even if he had to die.","Di Qing looked at him coldly. Just as he was about to curse, Fu Yao suddenly said, “I agree.”","“Hmm?” Di Qing was puzzled and looked at her in surprise.","“I said, I’m willing,” Fu Yao took a deep breath and said.","He smiled. “Not bad, you know the situation very well. This is a wise move.”","Right after, Fu Yao said, “However, you have to agree to one condition of mine. Let this man go. I’m worth several times more than him.”","The Young Prince was startled when he heard that, and then he said with interest, “Several times more valuable? He is a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal while you are only Six Revolutions, how can you say that you are several times more valuable?”","“Of course I’m several times more valuable. His fate energy has already been drained, so it’ll probably take countless years for him to fully recover. My fate energy is abundant, and I can break through to a higher realm at any time.”","“Not only that, I’m also the master of the sky and control hundreds of Grand Yan Immortals, so is my value several times that of his?”","Fu Yao said solemnly, looking at him calmly.","The Young Prince’s brows were tightly knitted. He seemed to be moved by Fu Yao’s words and turned to Di Qing to investigate carefully.","Di Qing could no longer speak as he stared at her.","“Indeed, your fate energy has already been sucked dry.” The Young Prince sighed in pity and finally looked up at Fu Yao. “You... You’re not bad. I agree to the condition you mentioned.”","Fu Yao’s body trembled slightly before her face turned pale. “Alright.”","Without any hesitation, he waved his hand and removed the energy flowing around Di Qing.","“Leave before I change my mind,” the Young Prince said slowly. “You should thank this lady. Otherwise, I would never have let you leave alive.”","Di Qing was speechless.","Fu Yao smiled for the last time before she regained her composure.","“Hurry up and leave. Your companion seems to be unable to hold on any longer.” he said slowly.","Finally, Di Qing gritted his teeth and left.","Boundless blue energy burst out and blasted Di Qing’s back.","She wanted to go and help but was held back by the Young Prince, “Nothing will happen to him. I didn’t kill him. I just let him sleep.”","As his voice fell, a giant beast that was a million feet in size suddenly jumped up from the deep Endless Sea!","It had nine heads that were like the sun. It raised its head and swallowed Di Qing before quickly hiding under the sea.","Seeing this, the Young Prince’s eyes flashed with satisfaction.","There were ancient beasts that were not weaker than Grand Yan Immortals residing in the Endless Sea. They had the ability to penetrate the heavens and earth. They usually slept under the sea, and no one knew when they would wake up.","Right now, Di Qing had been devoured by the ancient beast, which was the best situation for him.","...","Above the ruins of the Third and Fifth Heaven, under the broken heavenly gate, the fierce battle still continued.","Bian Ziyuan suppressed Jian Wushuang so much that he could not even channel the three streaks of fate energy. The speed of their battle was even faster than the battle between Black Cloud against Jiang Li and Yan Fan.","Divine blood sprinkled into the void. Only the void was eternal.","...","“You must not swallow him into your stomach!”","Under the boundless sea, it was deep and desolate, like the void of the universe, boundless.","Among them, a giant beast shuttled through the deep sea. Its body surged with a strange color, isolating it from the corrosion of the seawater.","On the largest head in the middle of its nine heads, an old man in tattered linen clothes was lying on its head with his arms on its raised brow bones.","The giant beast gave a human-like contemptuous smile, and its nine sun-like heads opened their mouths at the same time.","“Are you ordering me around?”","The old man smiled bitterly, “I wouldn’t dare, I wouldn’t dare. I only said that this Grand Yan Immortal is my benefactor’s companion.”","The nine heads of the giant beast snorted in unison. Then, the middle head raised itself and spat out a broken body.","The old man hurriedly took it and let out a long breath.","“I hate the smell on his body. It’s very similar to one of my old enemies, but that enemy of mine has long died. I think he’s not far from death,” the giant beast said with some ridicule.","“Oh no, it looks like he really can’t take it.” The old man’s expression changed drastically because Di Qing’s shattered Immortal body could no longer circulate his energy properly.","Although it was called dragon saliva, it was actually a thick layer of transparent mucus that completely wrapped Di Qing within.","The old man quickly calmed down because he realized that Di Qing’s weak breathing was indeed slowly improving.","He let out a long sigh. “In this way, our benefactor will have nothing to worry about.”","“You’re right.” The giant beast shuttled under the lonely chaotic sea and said, “One of my heads was cut off by your benefactor.”","The old man’s mouth twitched. “Is that so? My benefactor does have a bad temper.”","...","In the eternal void, endless Yan power exploded, dyeing everything like an ancient battlefield.","The two Sword Immortals, Jiang Li and Yan Fan, were already at the end of their rope. It was already unimaginable that they could last so long under Black Cloud’s oppressive attacks without any fate energy.","Although Black Cloud’s Emperor Bone had been extracted by Jian Wushuang and he had died twice, his strength was still at its peak after he was resurrected.","Without the restraint, he became the most terrifying existence on the entire battlefield.","Under Bian Ziyuan’s frenzied attacks, Jian Wushuang was forced to retreat. His Immortal Body, which had been almost emptied of the Emperor’s fate energy, was suffering from side effects.","He could not even freely use his Yan power, and he could not even freely release his Sword Intent.","“Aren’t you very powerful? Bring out the aura that you have when you killed an Emperor!” There was only madness in Bian Ziyuan’s eyes. He punched Jian Wushuang’s chest again and again, “Why are you so weak now?”","“If that’s the case, then when you die by my hands, we’ll be even!” Bai Ziyuan shouted as he landed a strong punch on Jian Wushuang. The punch, which contained endless Yan power, sent Jian Wushuang flying a million feet away!","He could not resist and could only let his Immortal body fly backward.","Boom!!!","An extremely loud sound rang out as Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body smashed heavily on the heavenly gate.","The cracks became finer and more numerous..."]},{"number":5020,"title":"Chapter 5020 Heavenly Gate Shattered","paragraphs":["5020 Heavenly Gate Shattered","At this moment, the Young Prince’s eyebrows twitched!","His heart was beating like a drum.","“Cough cough...”","Lowering his head and coughing out a mouthful of blood, Jian Wushuang’s aura completely weakened and his chest caved in.","His Immortal body had been completely drained by the Emperor’s fate energy, and he was no longer able to fight Bian Ziyuan.","A dark and ruthless aura spread throughout the entire void.","Bian Ziyuan rose into the air and arrived in front of him.","At this moment, the endless exquisite mist was completely revealed.","“Are you going to destroy your own fate energy, or do you want me to do it?” Bian Ziyuan said with a sinister smile.","Jian Wushuang raised his hand to wipe the divine blood from the corner of his mouth. His expression was still calm and emotionless. “You? You can’t do it.”","When he heard this, his expression instantly turned cold again.","From the beginning to the end, Jian Wushuang had never acknowledged him. He had never even been a real opponent.","A puny little Yan Immortal walked out from the White Bone Path under the Blood River, sweeping away almost all his enemies, killing tens of times more opponents.","This mighty attitude made Bian Ziyuan deeply fearful and jealous.","The best way to resolve the fear and jealousy in the depths of one’s heart was to destroy them at their roots!","The exquisite mist had already become completely violent. Its power was enough to crush the Heavenly Dao, and it started to fluctuate violently.","Behind Bian Ziyuan, with the power of ten thousand heavens, a misty image materialized.","Billions of clouds of water mist condensed, and the Water Mist Image Form grew to almost cover the entire void. It opened its True Eyes.","His True Eyes were crimson red, filled with pure killing intent.","“Die, I will never forget you.” Bian Ziyuan smiled strangely and then shook his arms.","As his arms shook, the Water Mist Image Form opened its palms and smashed at Jian Wushuang.","With image form had the strength of a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, even his Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body could not withstand the attack.","Rumble!","At this moment, even the void trembled. Jian Wushuang, who was already an arrow at the end of its flight, could not move at all. He could only bear the pain brought by each strike.","His Immortal body was fiercely embedded in the heavenly gate, while Bian Ziyuan controlled the Water Mist Image Form to bombard him with punches.","Even the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body had been completely shattered and his Immortal bones had turned into powder. If it weren’t for the protection of the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body would have been completely dismembered.","As the punches became heavier and heavier, the cracks on the gate increased greatly, almost to the point of shattering.","The Young Prince, who was watching from afar, felt his heart beat like a drum. He smelled an aura fluctuation that did not belong to the Endless Sea.","That kind of aura fluctuation was an extremely ordinary aura before he was exiled to the Endless Sea.","That was the outside world!","Beyond the heavenly gate was the outside world!","“Quick, Ziyuan, blast open the heavenly gate with all your might!” The Young Prince was too excited, so his voice was hoarse.","However, Bian Ziyuan, who only wanted to kill Jian Wushuang, did not hear any other sounds and just attacked with all his might.","A sword slash quietly appeared behind him, swinging down with tremendous force.","Clang!","With the sound of the heavens and the earth, the metal trembled. An unparalleled sword slash cut off the right arm of the Water Mist Image Form and continued to slash at Bian Ziyuan.","He had already gone crazy and did not care about the movement behind him. By the time he reacted, his entire right arm had been cut off.","“Ah!”","Bian Ziyuan was shocked and furious. He held his broken arm and turned around.","Jiang Li held her sword with one hand. Her heroic eyes were extremely indifferent. “If you touch him again, you will die without a burial place!”","A large amount of divine blood flowed out from his fingertip. Bian Ziyuan’s eyes twitched. He realized that his severed right arm could not be healed at all.","He slowly retreated. He knew Jiang Li was not simple.","Seeing that Jiang Li had injured Bian Ziyuan, Yan Fan quickly rushed to help Jian Wushuang.","However, Black Cloud would not let him act. After sending him flying with a slap, he went straight for Jian Wushuang.","At that time, who could stop him?","His body turned into billions of chaotic auras and quickly wrapped around Jian Wushuang.","Bian Ziyuan was furious, but he did not dare to say anything. No matter how weak Black Cloud was, he was still an Emperor-to-be. Killing him was as easy as killing an ant.","He swallowed the hatred in his heart and continued to confront Jiang Li.","The heavenly gate was shattered and Black Cloud finally gathered in front of the heavenly gate. His greedy and crazy glance swept onto Jian Wushuang, who was embedded in the heavenly gate like a bloody man.","He could clearly feel that Jian Wushuang’s aura was extremely weak and he could no longer fight back.","Black Cloud was greedy, and he needed no other reason. He opened his mouth and planned to swallow Jian Wushuang directly.","However, in the next moment, two wisps of scarlet-gold light shot out from the sunken heavenly gate. Jian Wushuang had already quietly opened his True Eyes!","Black Cloud was so frightened that he almost knelt in the air. His face was pale and his legs were trembling.","“A small fry dares to fight for glory?”","Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice, his words filled with supreme authority.","Black Cloud’s face was pale as he slowly retreated. “M-My Lord, I’ll leave now and never oppose you again.”","“Get lost!” A deep and angry voice resounded.","Black Cloud nodded and retreated.","In the next moment, when he retreated to a certain distance, he suddenly smiled darkly.","Then, he raised his arms, and a huge Chaotic Emperor’s Throne appeared, smashing heavily towards the heavenly gate!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The void trembled and the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne was embedded into the heavenly gate, destroying Jian Wushuang’s body.","Black Cloud laughed maniacally. He raised the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne and smashed it into the heavenly gate.","The heavenly gate, which had been sealed for thousands of years, was now mending its cracks. At the same time, new cracks appeared, causing the heavenly gate to be on the verge of shattering!","The Young Prince could no longer hide the palpitations in his heart. He roared with all his might, “When the heavenly gate opens, it’s time to leave this Endless Sea!”","Black Cloud also smelled the unusual aura fluctuation, so he attacked the heavenly gate even more furiously.","The heavenly gate shattered even more violently, as if it could completely open at any moment.","But in the next moment, something happened!","Black Cloud’s expression suddenly froze. He realized that after the Chaos Emperor’s Throne was embedded in the heavenly gate, it could not move an inch further!","Buzz!","Billions of rays of light suddenly erupted and instantly shattered the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne.","Along with the Chaotic Emperor’s Throne, the heavenly gate that had been sealed for thousands of years also shattered."]},{"number":5021,"title":"Chapter 5021 Yu Chang Appears","paragraphs":["5021 Yu Chang Appears","With the heavenly gate shattered, and the usually still ancient Endless Sea seemed to have awakened its vitality as it roared and swept up!","Billions of dust billowed up from the pitch-black seawater, almost reaching the sky.","At this moment, the entire Endless Sea was boiling.","The gate shattered, and the sealed passage opened. This was originally a formless and boundless sea, but it collided with the aura of the real outside world.","Large areas of the Endless Sea evaporated, and cracks began to appear at the edge.","All of this would definitely be destroyed!","Black Cloud was so terrified that he could not speak. He felt an unprecedented aura, a real aura.","The Chaotic Emperor’s Throne was easily torn apart. All their gazes were focused on one spot.","In front of the broken heavenly gate, Jian Wushuang’s broken Immortal body was now intact.","His bare chest was completely covered by the magnificent divine pattern, and his black hair had turned into a pure gold color, dancing wildly in the air.","His two true eyes also turned into the purest golden color.","It was so brilliant that it could not be looked at directly. It suppressed the Heavenly Dao and defeated the ancient times.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was beyond the imagination of all the Grand Yan Immortals.","Black Cloud could not even think of escaping. He stood on the spot with an ashen face.","The Young Prince’s initial madness turned into trembling. He smelled the most familiar aura.","That aura belonged to the true Emperor.","Bian Ziyuan was completely stunned, and then there was only deep jealousy and madness left in his eyes.","He was clearly an ant-like Yan Immortal, but he killed all his enemies with his own strength, how could this be the doing of a Yan Immortal?","He could not look straight at Jian Wushuang’s brilliance, and his aura could not even touch Jian Wushuang.","He slowly raised his palm and looked at the extremely dense fate energy flowing in it, appearing very satisfied.","“This Immortal body is not bad. It’s worthy of being used by an Emperor.”","The exit to completely leave the Endless Sea was right behind him, but all the Grand Yan Immortals did not dare to leave at all. They did not even dare to move.","Black Cloud swallowed with difficulty. He glanced at Bian Ziyuan from the corner of his eye and suddenly had a plan.","The next moment, he gritted his teeth and pushed Bian Ziyuan toward Jian Wushuang.","At the same time, his body turned into billions of chaotic auras and swept across the wilderness.","Everything happened so quickly that Bian Ziyuan was pushed in front of Jian Wushuang before he could react.","Swish!","A soft sound rang out, and his pupils suddenly widened to the maximum.","The indescribable pain, the loss of fate energy, and the loss of Immortal Source made him subconsciously look at his chest.","It was completely shattered there, and the Immortal Source of providence had dried up in an instant.","And this was all because of a single finger.","Jian Wushuang pointed at Bian Ziyuan from a distance and killed him. The supreme fate energy that was like seven-colored light passed through his back and enveloped the Endless Sea without slowing down.","It contained the entire land, almost shrinking it.","Black Cloud, who had already turned into chaotic aura and fled immediately revealed his true form.","He was in complete despair. He roared loudly, but in the end, he could not change the outcome.","Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand and with a wave, the supreme fate energy crushed Bian Ziyuan into powder.","Then, he grabbed Black Cloud and brought him in front of him.","“Emperor, Emperor, please let me go, on account that cultivation is not easy...” Black Cloud’s face was ashen. He could tell that Jian Wushuang was not himself anymore.","Jian Wushuang did not care about anything. In his eyes, there was only contempt and indifference, as if he was looking at an insect.","“Are you going to release your own fate energy, or do you want me to do it?”","Black Cloud was in complete despair. He knew that if he died this time, he would truly die.","“There’s no need for you to act, great Emperor. I’ll resolve my own fate energy.”","After saying this, Black Cloud did not say another word. He died very quickly, leaving no trace behind.","Jian Wushuang was very satisfied.","He waved his hand, and a pair of scarlet-golden eyes slowly swept over. He was a supreme existence, and no one dared to look directly at him.","In the end, he looked at the Young Prince who was retreating and grabbed him with a wave of his hand.","Looking at him, Jian Wushuang was confused. “I think I’ve seen you before?”","The Young Prince’s eyes twitched, “I-I am...”","Before he could finish, he was interrupted.","“It doesn’t matter who you are. What’s important is your ending.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang clenched his fist and killed him without hesitation.","Everything was completed in an instant, and it could even be said that it was effortless.","He turned his neck slightly and pulled Fu Yao in front of him, but he did not make a move. After a flash of doubt in his eyes, he felt relieved. “You are one of his friends. I won’t make a move, so you can retreat.”","There was deep fear in Fu Yao’s eyes, but she did not retreat. Instead, she said in a trembling voice, “Y-you are not him. Please return him.”","“Oh? How interesting. Do you think I’ll let him come back?” The corner of Jian Wushuang’s mouth moved slightly and he revealed a strange smile. “From now on, the master of this Immortal body is me, not him.”","After he finished speaking, he seemed to be lacking in interest. He immediately waved his hand and pushed Fu Yao away, turning around to look at the passageway behind him.","Behind the shattered heavenly gate was a passageway that led to the real outside world.","At this moment, even he was moved.","It had been too long, too long, so long that he had almost forgotten the past.","It was unknown how many reincarnations the Heavenly Dao had gone through, and what the outside world had become.","Now, he could finally go out.","Just as he was about to step into the passage, two Sword Intents that covered the sky crushed toward him.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned cold and he turned around. With just a sweep of his True Eyes, the unparalleled Sword Intents instantly shattered and dissipated.","Jiang Li and Yan Fan retreated at the same time. They spat out divine blood and their auras became weak.","Suppressing the killing intent in his eyes, he did not kill them in the end. He turned around and prepared to enter the passage.","However, in the next moment, billions of seven-colored lights suddenly shot out from the depths of the passage, shining endlessly.","Jian Wushuang was shocked. He raised his hand to block the attack and flew back instantly.","“How have you been, Emperor Zhen Wu?”","Boundless and unhurried aura covered everything. This ancient voice seemed to contain the ultimate laws, causing the Heavenly Dao to begin to appear.","Hearing this voice, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed and he clenched his fists tightly.","Along with the endless aura, a skinny old man in a black robe stepped into the Endless Sea.","It was as if the rules of the Great Dao flowed through his body, and there were lines of profound characters slowly circulating.","His eyes were cloudy, and nothing could be reflected in his pupils.","Looking at the figure, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","“Yu Chang, are you here to stop me?”","“It is my duty.” The skinny old man nodded slightly, looking rather amiable."]},{"number":5022,"title":"Chapter 5022 Continue the Battle From Ten Hua Years Ago","paragraphs":["5022 Continue the Battle From Ten Hua Years Ago","Jian Wushuang, who was originally arrogant, had a look of fear in his golden eyes.","He seemed to have recalled something and did not act rashly.","The seven-colored radiance dissipated. Yu Chang, who had been following Emperor Zhen Wuyang and was extremely mysterious, was not afraid even when facing Jian Wushuang, whose Immortal body had been occupied by Emperor Zhen Wu.","After seeing his true appearance, Jiang Li and Yan Fan’s eyes were round and a great fear flashed across them. They muttered, “Yu Chang...”","The collision of formless and intangible with reality would only bring about destruction.","The Endless Sea was already on the verge of shattering, and even the void had fine cracks.","Seeing this, Yu Chang waved his hand and sealed the passage to the outside world behind him with great luck. Only then did the Endless Sea return to its original state.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold and his killing intent was unparalleled. “Aren’t you afraid that I will keep you here?”","“If I’m afraid, I naturally won’t come,” he said. His voice was calm and filled with an indescribable aura.","“Do you really intend to fight me?”","Yu Chang said, “If you insist on leaving this place, then this battle is unavoidable.”","Jian Wushuang stopped talking. The corners of his mouth curled up and he laughed loudly, “Fine, fine. Then I will continue the battle from ten Hua Years ago!”","“There will be no winner or loser in that battle,” Yu Chang said softly, “I won’t let you die.”","When he heard this, a hint of anger flashed across his face. “You despise me?”","Yu Chang said, “We dare not, but for Emperor Zhen Wuyang, you must stay here.”","“You’re courting death!” Jian Wushuang was really angry. “I will make you stay here today!”","After he finished speaking, the boundless Emperoro’s fate energy burst forth, and an unimaginable Emperor’s Radiance enveloped the boundless void.","Under the Emperor’s Radiance, even a terrifying existence like Jiang Li and Yan Fan felt that their movements were restricted. They could not even circulate their Yan energy.","With the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body, Emperor Zhen Wu was able to completely release his Emperoro’s fate energy.","The Emperor’s Radiance was extremely mighty, and the Yan power was extinguished.","The Endless Sea was a place where the laws of the Heavenly Dao collapsed. If it was in the outside world, the Emperor’s fate energy he released would probably be able to instantly wipe out thousands of Heavenly Regions.","Emperor Zhen Wuyang was a true Emperor, unlike Black Cloud and Yu Yao, who had just comprehended the Emperor’s fate energy.","The arrival of the Emperor made everything dim and gloomy.","Yu Chang’s expression was calm, as if he was not facing an Emperor, but an old friend.","“Yu Chang, I will take your life!”","Jian Wushuang was no longer around. His Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body had been seized by Emperor Zhen Wu.","He said angrily, his voice heavy.","At this moment, his entire body was wrapped in the Emperor’s fate energy. His emotionless True Eyes shot out golden light.","An extremely pure sword condensed from the Emperor’s fate energy was held in his hand, the tip of the sword pointed at Yu Chang.","“Please go easy on me, Emperor Zen Wu.” Yu Chang stood with his hands behind his back and smiled.","Emperor Zhen Wu snorted coldly and slashed forward with his Emperor Sword.","In an instant, even the eternal void could not withstand it and completely distorted and collapsed.","It seemed like a simple slash, but it contained the fate energy of countless Emperors. It was enough to exterminate an Emperor-to-be.","Facing this sword, Yu Chang stood where he was, still unperturbed.","In the next moment, he moved. The palm under the black robe swept in front of him. Immediately, a deep ripple like a mirror appeared.","Then, the Emperor Sword came with destructive power.","The two collided, and a strange scene appeared.","This sword did not pierce through the ripples. Instead, it directly sank into the rippling mirror and disappeared without a trace.","Emperor Zhen Wu did not think that this attack would work. At the same time, he controlled Jian Wushuang’s immortal body and rushed forward.","The Emperor Sword slashed down heavily.","In an instant, a terrifying Sword Intent shook the entire place.","The Sword Intent was split into nine columns, each column carrying a heaven-covering force as it pressed toward Yu Chang.","The Emperor’s Radiance was indeed mighty.","At this moment, a layer of mysterious black patterns quietly surged around Yu Chang’s body, filled with a desolate and ancient aura.","Even Grand Yan Immortals would fall for that aura.","Then, he stood still and the mysterious black lines around him formed a barrier.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","A loud sound rang out as Emperor Zhen Wu retreated a thousand feet. The barrier around Yu Chang also collapsed and he retreated a thousand feet as well.","The Emperor’s splendor was overflowing with sparks.","A trillion miles around them had already turned into a battlefield. No Grand Yan Immortal could get close.","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and Fu Yao had long been swept out of the battlefield by the dense Emperor Radiance.","“Yu Chang, let me leave. You know you can’t restrain me,” Emperor Zhen Wu said in a deep voice. The Emperor Sword was already in front of him.","“Emperor Zhen Wu, you can’t leave this place. Even if I stay here, you won’t be able to leave,” Yu Chang nodded and said with determination.","When Emperor Zhen Wu heard this, he was already furious. “Is it really that easy for a lackey like Wuyang? Do you know how long you’ve been his lackey? You’ll only do whatever he asks you to do, regardless of whether it’s right or not?!”","He continued, “Those are not my responsibilities.”","“Then your duty is to create endless evil karma with Zhen Wuyang?” Emperor Zhen Wu sneered. “What you’ve done is enough to destroy you a thousand times over. Your deaths are not worth regretting!”","Yu Chang did not say a word. Finally, he said, “There’s no point in saying more. Continue sleeping.”","“Why should I sleep? The one who should sleep is Zhen Wuyang. I have more right than him to sit in the Heavenly Court and control the entire Great Si Region!”","Emperor Zhen Wu raged. The Emperor’s Radiance around his body had already been completely ignited.","“You should be the ones sleeping here.”","His eyes burned and exploded with billions of Emperor’s Radiance, destroying everything.","The void, which had become an eternal void, began to show fine dark golden cracks.","At the same time, the Endless Sea began to return to the tide and rapidly evaporated.","The Emperor’s Radiance was so dense that it was almost tangible.","In the next moment, Emperor Zhen Wu wielded his Emperor Sword and slashed at Yu Chang.","The entire void was covered by the scarlet-golden aura. The Heavenly Dao laws belonging to Emperor Zhen Wu were constructing it, providing it with endless Great Dao energy.","As for Yu Chang, he was no longer as calm as before. Mysterious black runes surged into the sky, carrying a desolate and ancient aura.","The two supreme fate energy clashed and then completely erupted.","The sword strike coould break through the realm!","The pure golden intent clashed with the primordial black patterns.","At that moment, even the Great Dao was destroyed by such an impact.","Words could no longer describe the terror of this battle. It was so grand that it even overshadowed the battle between Emperor-to-bes.","The laws of the Great Dao were peeling off. The Endless Sea, which was originally a lawless land, was disappearing on a large scale at this moment."]},{"number":5023,"title":"Chapter 5023 Six Sun True Emperor’s Eyes","paragraphs":["5023 Six Sun True Emperor’s Eyes","There was no safe space left in the void. No Immortal Prefectures, the Demonic Lands, or even the desolate Secret Realms could truly withstand a battle with an Emperor.","The Yan Immortal was an existence that suppressed the Heavenly Dao, the Grand Yan Immortal was an existence that created the fate of the Heavenly Dao, but what about the Imperial Emperor?","No Yan Immortal or even Grand Yan Immortal knew what Imperial Emperors could do. They were so powerful that words could not describe them.","The destruction of the sea and the shattering of the ancient Heavenly Dao were all done with a single thought.","They were so powerful that they were meaningless. They did not even know why they existed.","When an Emperor was enraged, everything would be destroyed.","Even Jiang Li, Yan Fan, and the others who were a million billion miles away were affected. They felt a sweetness in their throats and coughed out a mouthful of divine blood.","At this moment, the void was completely covered by the fate energy of the Great Dao that had fused together.","The pure gold blended with the primordial black runes, forming a dark golden color of destruction.","The shattered Emperor Heavenly Dao slowly dissipated. The two of them looked at each other, and neither of them retreated at all.","“Jian Wushuang” looked at Yu Chang coldly. His Immortal body was rapidly breaking and repairing at the same time.","As for Yu Chang, although his expression was still calm, his slightly red face also showed that he was not relaxed.","The edges of the black robe on his body were somewhat torn.","Although they were no longer clashing, the indescribable power of the Heavenly Dao was still competing with each other.","Emperor Zhen Wu stared at him and raised his palms slightly. An even more indescribable aura transcended everything and covered the sky.","He looked a little regretful. “I originally wanted to leave this place and seal Zhen Wuyang before letting you follow me.”","“Alas, it’s a pity, Yu Chang.”","Yu Chang smiled and did not comment.","He continued, “You’ll stay here now. I’ll get Zhen Wuyang to follow you sooon.”","After this sentence, there was no more communication.","The real battle had begun!","The Emperor’s Radiance was too bright, and no one could look straight at it.","At this moment, the golden light of the Emperor’s Radiance swept up and covered the void and even the Endless Sea.","Emperor Zhen Wu raised his arms. The Emperor Sword in his hand contained the power of the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao and was extremely dazzling.","On his naked back, six invisible traces of fate energy appeared.","Along with the six streams of fate energy, six of the originally closed Emperor’s True Eyes appeared.","Every True Eye hung around Emperor Zhen Wu. It was as if they had been silent for countless years and could wake up at any time.","Seeing this scene, Yu Chang’s expression began to turn solemn.","He had never thought that Emperor Zhen Wu, who had been exiled and sleeping in the Endless Sea, would grow to such an extent.","“Six Sun True Emperor’s Eyes...”","Zhen Wu Emperor smiled and opened his eyes.","It was as if it encompassed everything in the universe, and in front of the True Emperor’s Eyes, everything was reduced to nothingness.","“Yu Chang, will you retreat now?”","“I won’t,” He said calmly, and endless primordial black patterns surged around his body again.","Emperor Zhen Wu did not say anything else. He raised his sword and pointed at Yu Chang.","“Annihilate!”","In an instant, Yu Chang’s figure was reflected in the Emperor’s Eyes. Then, billions of invisible forces surged out from the Emperor’s Eyes and wrapped around him.","This formless power ignored the fate energy of any Emperor, ignored the Heavenly Dao of any Emperor. Even if they were Emperors, they would not be able to avoid it.","Facing the invisible force that covered the sky, a long sword had appeared in Yu Chang’s hand.","The blade of the sword was dark green and was engraved with dense black patterns.","With the appearance of this long sword, he raised his sword to meet the attack!","However, a strange scene appeared. The invisible force that shot out from the Emperor’s True Eyes actually ignored Yu Chang’s attack and poured into his body.","At this moment, only an invisible force was surging in the void.","Emperor Zhen Wu did not attack again. He stared ahead.","Under the power of the Great Dao released by the first Emperor’s True Eye, Yu Chang’s body was completely destroyed.","He could not even resist at all. His body was completely torn into powder and then disappeared.","As the first Imperial Emperor’s True Eye disappeared, the surging invisible force also disappeared.","Yu Chang’s body was crushed into dust, not even leaving a trace of his aura behind.","However, the Zhen Wu Emperor was not in a hurry to move. He looked ahead calmly as if he already knew what was going to happen next.","After a few dozen breaths, a gust of wind blew in the void covered by the Emperor’s fate energy.","Then, a wisp of aura quietly started to condense. that had appeared at some unknown time quietly condensed.","A desolate and ancient fate spread out, as if billions of stars had descended.","A skinny figure in a black robe appeared.","His expression was still and calm, as if nothing had happened.","“Emperor Zhen Wu, stop fantasizing. With me here, you won’t be able to leave this place.”","“Even if I have already grown to the level of Zhen Wuyang, I still can’t leave? Hmph!” Emperor Zhen Wu sneered. “Now that I have the Six Sun True Emperor’s Eyes, you think I can’t get out of the Endless Sea?”","“Try it,” Yu Chang said.","“Then I’ll give it a try!” Emperor Zhen Wu shouted loudly.","Then, the second Emperor’s True Eye opened quietly and released a brilliant golden light.","The limitless golden light enveloped his body. At this moment, Emperor Zhen Wu was even more unpredictable and purer than before.","As a result, the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was unable to support such a Great Dao of fate energy and began to rapidly shatter.","However, at the same time, it was rapidly repairing itself, and it was in a strange state of balance.","Golden light shone brightly as Emperor Zhen Wu moved. He activated the great void force and crashed forward.","Yu Chang’s expression was solemn as he held the longsword with the green engravings and pressed forward!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The explosion of power that could not be described with words instantly shattered the already fragile Endless Sea.","The explosion that could easily destroy all Heavenly Dao and Heavenly Regions swept across a trillion miles in an instant, or even more.","Wherever the explosion passed, the Endless Sea quickly evaporated. Even this entire invisible and formless mysterious realm was collapsing.","A trillion miles away, Jiang Li looked at the broken pole and said with a trembling voice.","“Wushuang... Is it too for Wushuang...”","Yan Fan’s eyes dimmed. Such a terrifying battle was not something they could hope to achieve. Even if he wanted to save Jian Wushuang, he would not even be able to get close to them and would be crushed into powder.","Just as he was about to comfort Jiang Li, the extreme point shook again, and then a flow of fate energy swept over.","“Run!” Yan Fan shouted, but it was too late.","In the next moment, they were directly devoured by the great power of fate energy.","Everything returned to chaos.","The entire treacherous realm was about to turn into ruins.","And they were still fighting.","This battle was a continuation of the battle from ten Hua Years ago. The final outcome would only end when one side fell into a deep sleep.","“Yu Chang, my guess is indeed correct...”","Emperor Zhen Wu’s voice resounded in the shattered pole, but it soon fell silent."]},{"number":5024,"title":"Chapter 5024 Yu Chang Is Also an Emperor","paragraphs":["5024 Yu Chang Is Also an Emperor","In the void, for all eternity.","“Don’t tell me all three of them are dead. If they don’t wake up, I’ll swallow them all.”","“No, I can see that they might be benefactor’s good friends. Don’t act decisively, or it will be difficult to explain.”","“Well, benefactor or not, if you don’t treat me well, I’ll eat them all!”","...","Yan Fan opened his eyes abruptly when he heard the noise. He saw a head the size of a star staring at him with vertical pupils.","Startled, he reached out to the hilt of his sword.","“Don’t waste your energy. You’re able to survive because of my kindness. It won’t be good if you act resolutely.”","The nine-headed beast said in a low voice.","Yan Fan was also at the end of his rope and could not even draw his sword. Hearing that the giant beast had no ill intentions, he decided not to attack. He propped up the air with his hands and sat up.","Then, Jiang Li and Fu Yao woke up and looked at the changes around them in shock.","As far as his eyes could see, the sky had completely shattered into nothingness. Even the Endless Sea beneath him had completely evaporated, turning into an endless abyss.","Everything appeared barren.","“How did this place become like this?” Fu Yao murmured softly.","“Isn’t it good that it has become like this? They only need to use a little more strength and this cage will completely shatter.”","The giant beast said calmly, its eyes filled with hope.","“Now, let’s just leave it to fate.”","...","The sea evaporated and became desolate.","Everywhere was filled with broken Emperor’s fate energy and even Emperor Heavenly Dao.","At this moment, there were only two figures, two figures that seemed to have walked out of the ancient era, confronting each other.","They were so brilliant that they could not be looked at directly. Each of them had indescribable fate energy flowing around them.","One of them was Jian Wushuang and the other was Yu Chang.","“I was right. Yu Chang, you have always been an Emperor.”","Emperor Zhen Wu said slowly. His words were filled with supreme authority.","“However, what makes me curious is that you’re clearly an Emperor, so why are you following Zhen Wuyang?”","Yu Chang was silent. After a moment, he said, “That’s not important, but it’s all in the past.”","Emperor Zhenwu said, “You still don’t want to let me leave?”","He said slowly, “It’s my duty. Please don’t blame me, Emperor Zhen Wu.”","“You know that you can’t break my Six Sun True Emperor’s Eyes,” Emperor Zhen Wu said.","Yu Chang said, “You can’t overcome me either.”","Emperor Zhen Wu was a little angry. “Then, are we going to continue fighting like this? Fight for a full ten Hua Years?”","“If Emperor Zhen Wu is willing, I can accompany you, fighting for ten Hua Years.”","“Then what if I drag you along with me?” Emperor Zhen Wu’s face was extremely gloomy. He was completely furious.","Yu Chang nodded. “In that case, I won’t resist.”","“Idiot, so stubborn! I really want to know what method Zhen Wuyang used to convince you to serve him like this,” Emperor Zhen Wu sighed.","Yu Chang spoke again, his voice was a little tired. “Stop. You know that this will never end.”","“Do you think I’ll stop? Do you know how many years I’ve been sleeping here? What sin have I committed to be banished here!!”","“In terms of sin, he is the one who is guilty. He let me down!”","Emperor Zhen Wu roared in anger, “Yu Chang, don’t you know anything about what he has done to me?”","He fell silent and finally said, “I know, but this cannot be changed. The birth of some Great Daos is actually original sin.”","“So I was exiled here? Hmph!” Emperor Zhen Wu sneered. “Even if I die now, I’ll make sure that Zhen Wuyang confronts me!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the Six Sun True Emperor’s Eyes merged into one, turning into a boundless river that flowed.","Then, he stabbed forward with the Emperor Sword.","This sword strike transcended everything. It was the sword of an Emperor’s ultimate fury.","When the Emperor was angry, all things would perish.","Facing this sword strike, Yu Chang did not retreat or block. He just stood there and used his Emperor Body to withstand the attack.","It was as if the water moon had gathered together and returned to one.","Without any sound, the Emperor Sword tore through his Emperor Body without any resistance and struck his heart.","Billions of light shot out from Yu Chang’s back, tearing his Emperor Body apart.","Holding the hilt of his sword, Emperor Zhen Wu said, “Why didn’t you resist?”","This sword had severely injured him and shattered his Emperor Body.","Endless Emperor’s fate energy scattered in the eternal void, turning into great suns and stars, once again enshrouding some unknown Heavenly Dao.","Yu Chang coughed lightly. “I can’t dodge this sword strike even if I wanted to. I’ll take this sword strike, think of it as an apology on behalf of Emperor Wu Yang.”","“I want Zhen Wuyang to admit his mistake personally!” Emperor Zhen Wu roared, and his terrifying Emperor’s fate energy fluctuated continuously.","“He is an Emperor, and you know he won’t admit his mistakes,” Yu Chang said.","Emperor Zhen Wu’s fate energy trembled. He did not say anything else. He did not want to let such a skinny old man die.","He was about to pull out the Emperor Sword, but Yu Chang suddenly stretched out his hand and pressed it against his chest, preventing him from pulling it out.","“Are you really courting death?” he said coldly.","Yu Chang raised his head and looked apologetic. “Emperor Zhen Wu, please don’t blame me.”","Emperor Zhen Wu was startled. Then, he was shocked and wanted to retreat.","However, it was too late. Yu Chang had used himself as bait, causing him to fall into the trap.","At this moment, he realized that he could no longer retreat. His entire body was wrapped in a desolate and ancient aura.","Strands of ancient black runes flowed silently, binding him tightly!","This primordial black rune was also the fate energy of an Emperor.","“Let me go!” Emperor Zhen Wu roared, but there was nothing he could do.","Endless primordial black runes wrapped around him, directly destroying the Emperor’s fate energy on his body, rendering him unable to move!","As more and more primordial black patterns appeared, Emperor Zhen Wu gradually fell into a deep sleep.","The magnificent Emperor’s Radiance dissipated, and his True Shadow fell into a deep sleep.","Strands of divine blood flowed out of the Immortal body, and the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body fell into the void.","Jian Wushuang seemed to have fallen into a deep sleep. Although his Immortal body was constantly breaking and recovering, there was no sign of him waking up.","Yu Chang’s face was pale as he looked calmly at Jian Wushuang who was floating in the void.","Then, he stretched out his palm, and the endless primordial black patterns completely sank into his Immortal body, stripping out the True Shadow of the Emperor Zhen Wu.","“Ah...”","Jian Wushuang suddenly sat up. Endless pain was revealed in his eyes. His Immortal body was constantly shattered and reconstructed, making him extremely painful.","As Emperor Zhen Wu’s True Shadow was extracted, the pain was magnified countless times, almost causing him to die.","The power of an emperor was simply too terrifying. Even if it was just a remnant leaving his body, it was not something that he could withstand."]},{"number":5025,"title":"Chapter 5025 Leaving","paragraphs":["5025 Leaving","This caused his Divine Sense, which was originally perfect, to be about to shatter.","The Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body could not withstand the continuous bitter battles, and it shattered even more.","Without the support of Emperor Zhen Wu’s fate energy, he was already on the verge of destruction.","He could no longer think clearly. His Divine Sense and Immortal body had reached an unprecedented level of pain.","Facing Jian Wushuang, who was burning with destruction, Yu Chang waved his hand and sent down a wisp of the purest primordial black mark to cover him.","Jian Wushuang stopped roaring and fainted.","After a moment of silence, an aura that seemed to be sighing disappeared. Yu Chang reached out to hold it and prepared to leave.","At this moment, several weak flows of energy rushed over from afar.","Yu Chang stopped and turned around.","Jiang Li, Yan Fan, Fu Yao, the nine-headed beast, and the Old Shepherd all rushed over.","Even though they had been exiled here for countless years and their hearts had long withered, they could not remain calm after seeing the passage to the outside world.","However, none of them took that step because they knew that they had no way to resist Yu Chang, who was standing in front of the passageway.","Looking at them, Yu Chang said softly, “You guys can’t leave.”","At this moment, no one spoke. There was only bitterness in their eyes.","Covering the disappointment in his eyes, Yan Fan took a step forward and said, “Please take care of his injuries.”","Yu Chang smiled. “I recognize you. You are the Sword Immortal from back then.”","“It’s all in the past. Let’s not talk about it.” Yan Fan smiled bitterly. “Please let that kid live well.”","Yu Chang nodded. Just as he was about to leave, another voice stopped him.","“Please wait!”","The Old Shepherd’s voice was slightly trembling as he carried Di Qing, who was still in deep sleep, to the front of him.","“Can you let this person out?”","Yu Chang did not say anything. He reached out and took Di Qing with his fate energy. Then, he turned around and left, disappearing into the passageway.","As he left, the passage closed.","The broken sky began to heal, and the dry Endless Sea surged again.","Everything that had happened before started to disappear without a trace. Everything returned to its original state.","“Our fate energy has also been restored.”","Yan Fan muttered as he looked at the completely closed heavenly gate passageway.","“Everything that’s happened...” Jiang Li was a little lost. “It’s like nothing happened.”","“Believe me, we will leave one day.”","...","It hurt.","The Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body seemed to have entered some kind of cycle. It was constantly destroyed and reconstructed.","The pain was indescribable.","Every 360 breaths, his Immortal body would shatter and reconstruct, and endless divine blood would flow.","Even if his Divine Sense was perfect, he still could not endure it.","When his immortal body had been shattered and reconstructed 36,000 times, Jian Wushuang finally fell asleep.","...","The world was silent and the wind was blowing.","He could faintly hear the children’s laughter and the cool wind blowing past. It was an indescribable pleasure.","However, this kind of satisfaction was still unable to overcome the pain brought by his dizziness.","The pain in his mind forced Jian Wushuang to wake up and get out of the pain.","His pupils barely focused, and what entered his eyes was a slightly low-lying grass.","There were also several upside-down faces of children.","Among the faces of the children, there was a child with braids on his head and a smirk on his face. He pinched an Immortal herb and stuffed it into Jian Wushuang’s nose.","He could not stand the tickling and itching, and then he sneezed loudly.","With this sneeze, his already weak Immortal body almost fell apart.","“Yay, you’re finally awake!” The group of children laughed excitedly.","His head was dizzy and his Immortal body was in great pain. Jian Wushuang was about to struggle to get up, but he soon realized that something was wrong.","He was hanging upside down under an Immortal Tree, dangling from one leg.","“Hey, you naughty children, quickly put me down...”","Jian Wushuang shouted weakly. He wanted to break free with his own strength, but it was futile. He could only beg the children for mercy.","It was still the same naughty boy who teased him. His lively eyes turned, and he smacked his lips and said, “You can come down if you want, but you have to have something to exchange for it, such as candy.”","“Candy? I have a lot of candies. Put me down first and I’ll give them to you,” Jian Wushuang continued to speak weakly.","“You liar! You only have a pair of pants left, how can you have a place to hide candy?” Wan Tong said loudly with his hands on his hips. The other children also echoed.","He was stunned and hurriedly looked down. As expected, there was only a pair of pants left.","Apart from his pants, even the Boyang Bttle at his waist had disappeared.","Although he had a vague impression of what happened after Emperor Zhen Wu took over his Immortal body, he was still in a state of shock.","After all, the Boyang Bottle contained all the treasures and the three Emperors’ True Souls. If they were lost, the losses would be immeasurable.","“You guys, put me down quickly. Otherwise, I’ll teach all of you a good lesson!” Jian Wushuang shouted anxiously.","He did noot expect that these jade doll-like children were not afraid at all and made faces at him.","He was helpless against this, but he could not even use a single bit of his Yan power.","This situation did not last for long. When a little girl with red lips and white teeth ran over, they all scattered like birds and beasts.","“Hmph, if you dare to tease the guests again, I will make sure that you will suffer!”","The little girl placed her hands on her hips, her toot little face filled with anger.","After chasing away the group of naughty children, the little girl hurriedly ran to Jian Wushuang and cut off the Immortal vine with a wave of his hand, allowing him to land on the ground.","His body landed on the ground, and he groaned. He was in a daze.","“Brother Jian, I knew it was you!”","A crisp and soft voice came from the child’s mouth. Then, she jumped into Jian Wushuang’s arms excitedly.","This pounce almost knocked him out of breath.","His eyes turned black, and then stars appeared.","“Ah, Brother Jian, what’s wrong?”","“I... I’m fine.”","Jian Wushuang forced his Immortal body to move. He smiled and sat up with the boy in his arms.","The little girl had her hair tied up in a bun. She had red lips and white teeth. She looked like a jade doll. She was none other than the first welcoming boy that Jian Wushuang met when he first arrived at the Heavenly Court, Little Amy.","“Amy, why are you here? It’s very dangerous here,” Jian Wushuang hugged her tightly and said warily.","“What? It’s not dangerous, Brother Jian, this is the Heavenly Court,” Amy blinked and said in a lively manner."]},{"number":5026,"title":"Chapter 5026 Little World Mountain","paragraphs":["5026 Little World Mountain","Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Then, all the memories from before surged into his mind.","The Endless Sea that had shattered the void, the crazed Emperor Zhen Wu, and the calm Yu Chang all appeared in his Divine Sense.","“This is the Heavenly Court, this is the Heavenly Court...”","“I-it was him who brought me out of the Endless Sea?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was solemn and complicated. He was worried about many things and did not know what to do.","“Big Brother Jian, how are you? You look terrible.” Amy was a little nervous. Her lively eyes were extremely clear.","Looking into her eyes, Jian Wushuang’s anxious heart gradually calmed down.","“It’s fine, Amy.” He shook his head and forced a smile. “Is this really the Heavenly Court?”","“That’s right.” Amy nodded with absolute certainty. “This is Little World Mountain, which belongs to the Heavenly Court. It’s where Grandpa lives.”","He nodded.","Other than that person, no one else was qualified to be called grandfather by Amy.","After weighing the pros and cons, Jian Wushuang said, “Then can you take me to see Uncle Yu?”","“Of course. Those who can come to Little World Mountain are all important guests.” Amy said with a smile, then jumped down and pulled Jian Wushuang away.","“Amy, walk slowly...”","The extremely rich origin energy was flowing slowly. The Immortal grass was growing and the clear spring was flowing.","This place was a true paradise.","Jian Wushuang, who was being pulled forward by Amy, was slowly recovering his Immortal body.","“Big Brother Jian, hurry up. I’ll take you to see grandfather,” Amy said excitedly.","Jian Wushuang nodded. All his worries and doubts could only be resolved when he met Yu Chang or Zhen Wuyang.","Under Amy’s guidance, the entire Little World Mountain and its happenings were continuously captured in his mind.","Here, there were no Immortal-foundation pavilions or grand halls. There were only long grass and clear springs.","Just as Jian Wushuang was moving forward and seizing the time to repair his Immortal body, a figure dressed in plain clothes stepped on the clouds and came over. The True Sword in his hand surged with a powerful Yan power.","“Stop!”","Wherever the sword pointed, the grass and leaves flew.","This was a handsome young man with sharp eyebrows and sharp eyes, looking extremely cold.","Seeing this young man, Amy stopped in her tracks, feeling a little nervous.","“Who are you? Why did you come to Little World Mountain?” he shouted loudly, killing intent bursting out of his eyes.","Jian Wushuang did not move. He blocked Amy behind him and said calmly, “I want to see Uncle Yu. You should know the truth if you tell him.”","When the handsome young man heard this, his expression turned even colder. “In other words, you barged into Little World Mountain without permission?”","He sighed. A bloody battle was probably inevitable.","But right at this moment, a clear and melodious voice rang out. “He is a guest here in Little World Mountain. I can be a witness.”","Jian Wushuang looked over and saw a figure riding the breeze and arriving at the center.","It was a woman dressed in plain clothes. Her face was cold and delicate.","The handsome young man frowned slightly when he saw this woman. “Chang Ling, how do you prove it?”","The woman named Chang Ling took a step forward and said in a cold and sharp tone, “Then I have to ask you first. When has a Yan Immortal from the Great Si Region entered the Small World Mountain without permission?”","The handsome young man’s expression stiffened and he said uneasily, “I’m just guarding against the infiltration of external enemies. You know how important Little World Mountain is.”","Hearing this, the corners of Chang Ling’s mouth curled up. “Qing Shan, what if your words reach the ears of Uncle Yu, or even the elders?”","“Chang Ling, what do you mean?” the handsome young man took a step back and said nervously.","“If you don’t want to cause any more trouble, move aside,” she said in a low voice, then turned to look at Jian Wushuang and tilted her head slightly.","Qing Shan was furious, but he did not dare to stop them. He could only glare at them and continue to move forward.","Seeing Qing Shan leave, Amy, who was hiding behind him, hurriedly threw herself into Jian Wushuang’s arms.","“Fortunately, Sister Ling helped us. Otherwise, we would have been in trouble,” Amy patted her small body and said.","Jian Wushuang nodded and looked at Chang Ling beside him. “Thank you for your help.”","Chang Ling looked at him meaningfully, “Ever since I can remember, there has never been a Yan Immortal from outside stepping foot here. You are the first one ever.”","“Clearly, your identity is not simple.”","He shook his head. “You’re thinking too much. Even I don’t know how I got here.”","At this moment, Amy said, “Big Brother Jian, you’re here to look for Uncle Yu.”","“You’re indeed not simple. Good luck,” Chang Ling said. “Uncle Yu is very mysterious. If you want to find him, you just need to move forward.”","“Only need to move forward?”","Chang Ling nodded, “This Little World Mountain is boundless, no Yan Immortal can explore this entire place. If you want to find Uncle Yu, you have to see if he wants to see you.”","“Don’t worry, big brother Jian. With Amy here, you will definitely find Uncle Yu.” Amy patted her small body and promised.","Chang Ling could not help but laugh. She reached out and rubbed her small bun. “Amy, do you want to follow me?”","Amy shook her head, stretched out her chubby little arms, and tightly wrapped them around Jian Wushuang’s neck. “No, I have to take care of my grandfather.”","“Alright, I’m just teasing you.” Chang Ling smiled and looked at Jian Wushuang. “You are the only one who can make Amy so dependent on you, other than the Emperor’s First Prince. I’m surprised.”","“Big Brother Jian is a good friend of the Young Emperor, which makes him my big brother,” Amy blinked and said.","“I see. Then I wish you good luck and find Uncle Yu as soon as possible.” Chang Ling smiled slightly and stopped on the spot.","Jian Wushuang nodded and left quickly with Amy in his arms.","In the distance, Amy’s voice sounded again. “Sister Ling, isn’t Big Brother Jian very handsome?”","“...”","He had learned from Chang Ling that Little World Mountain was infinitely large, and reality had proven it to be so.","Jian Wushuang, who was carrying Amy, was not very fast. However, he could cross a Heavenly Region every ten breaths.","Even so, the path ahead was still filled with Immortal grass and clear springs.","“Amy, do you know how to find Uncle Yu or the Young Emperor?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Amy, who was already lying on his back and was a little sleepy, shook her little head. “I don’t know. We can only see Grandpa if he wants to see us. Other than that, we can’t find him.”","“That’s a little troublesome.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. Although his injuries were slowly recovering, it was not enough to sustain his continuous consumption.","Even though the Yan power in this Little World Mountain was extremely dense, there was not much that could be absorbed.","If he continued to search aimlessly, he would be exhausted before he could find Uncle Yu.","After all, it had not been long since he was bullied by the group of naughty children."]},{"number":5027,"title":"Chapter 5027 Physique of Endurance","paragraphs":["5027 Physique of Endurance","However, Jian Wushuang was not anxious. Instead, he gradually calmed down.","The celestial soil under his feet was part of the Small World Mountain. It was the Celestial Realm where Zhen Wuyang lived.","He did not believe that Uncle Yu or even Zhen Wuyang himself would not know that an unfamiliar Yan Immortal had entered Little World Mountain.","It was very likely that they were observing in secret.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang remained calm and sent out his Divine Sense to investigate.","The result was naturally nothing.","Helpless, he could only move forward quickly again.","The Immortal grass grew and the wind blew. Jian Wushuang carried Amy on his back and moved forward quickly. However, other than various Immortal traces, there was no trace of the aura of a Yan Immortal.","This made him feel a little uncertain.","Why did Uncle Yu bring him to Little World Mountain, and why didn’t he appear?","Just as he was deep in thought, his footsteps stopped.","He felt some mud under his feet. If he was not paying close attention, he would have missed it.","In the next moment, countless mysterious black patterns spread out from under his feet, carrying a desolate and ancient aura.","Jian Wushuang felt desolate and lonely.","“Not bad. Your Divine Sense is very powerful. You found my aura in such a short time.”","As the elderly voice rang out, a skinny figure condensed from ancient black runes stood in front of him.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed. He knew that this was Yu Chang, Uncle Yu.","The mysterious mighty figure who had single-handedly put Emperor Zhen Wu to sleep.","Yu Chang’s expression was calm as he carefully sized him up. He seemed to be quite satisfied.","On the other hand, he was a little anxious to know the whereabouts of Di Qing, Jiang Li, and Yan Fan.","Seemingly having guessed his thoughts, Yu Chang said slowly, “I will answer your question, but not now.”","He looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “Now, you answer my question.”","“Alright.” Jian Wushuang nodded without hesitation.","“What are you best at?”","He was stunned. After pondering for a moment, he said, “The sword.”","“Sword, that sounds good.” Yu Chang nodded and smiled kindly. “Why don’t we have a competition?”","“...”","The corner of Jian Wushuang’s eyes twitched. “Well... Uncle Yu, don’t joke around...”","What a joke. The old man in front of him was a ruthless character who could fight with an Emperoor. His strength was unimaginable.","An Emperor-to-be was no longer an existence that could be spoken carelessly, let alone an Emperor.","Jian Wushuang believed that as long as Zhen Wuyang or Yu Chang had the slightest intention to kill him, he would not be able to survive for even a second. He would not even be able to resist.","This was also why he was very resistant to displaying his strength.","However, everything that happened next was not something he could control.","A long sword that was completely dark green and engraved with countless dense patterns appeared in Yu Chang’s hand.","“Come on, let me see where your limits are,” he said as he pointed his sword forward.","Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows twitched and there was only bitterness in his eyes.","It was an Emperor Sword. It had the power to destroy everything.","Even though he had the strongest Sword Principle, he still did not think it was comparable.","One was a Yan Immoortal, the other was an Imperial Emperor. Every step between them was an insurmountable chasm.","This was no longer a fight. He was simply courting death.","Obviously, Jian Wushuang did not want to die.","However, this was no longer up to him.","As far as the eye could see, it had already become Yu Chang’s domain. Endless primordial black patterns were flowing, forming a grand Dao Arena.","And this battle of disparity had already begun.","Yu Chang wielded the Emperor Sword and slashed downward.","In an instant, the sword swing that seemed like it was about to topple the mountains and seas turned into a million-feet sword slash that quickly slashed down.","A chill ran down Jian Wushuang’s spine. He had no choice but to resist the terror of life and death.","This was a deadly sword strike, one that did not leave him any way out.","Even an Emperor-to-be would be killed by this sword strike.","Jian Wushuang guessed that Yu Chang already knew the secret of the Boyang Bottle, which was why he wanted to kill him.","Knowing that he was about to die, he calmed down instead.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Ocean Sword Intent, first move, second move.","Star, River.","The two moves were used at the same time.","Even under Yu Chang’s control, the Sword Intent was still unstoppable.","The majestic heavenly river swept over. Jian Wushuang stood at the head of the tide and resolutely raised his sword to meet it.","Facing that sword slash, the Invisible Sword was extremely dazzling.","Clang-","The sound of metal clashing resounded, and then everything returned to silence.","The celestial river of sword shattered, turning into endless Sword Intent and dissipating.","Jian Wushuang stood rooted to the ground. The Invisible Sword in his hand had also shattered into powder.","Above his bare chest, a shocking sword slash almost cut him in half.","Golden divine blood spurted out and scattered in the air.","It was an indescribable pain, as if even his Divine Sill had been destroyed.","However, this pain lasted for less than ten breaths before it disappeared without a trace as the wound healed.","Jian Wushuang did not even have time to express his opinion before his Immortal body had already recovered.","“H-how could this be?”","He was shocked and pressed his chest in disbelief.","Yu Chang, who saw this scene from afar, smiled and slashed again.","This time, there were ten sword slashes.","Jian Wushuang turned pale with fright. He could not even withstand one sword slash, and now there were nine more. Destruction was inevitable!","He tried to resist, but as expected, his Sword Dao was easily shattered, and even his Immortal body was almost torn into pieces.","Jian Wushuang was confused as he covered his wound with his palm.","Because he found that the Immortal body was recovering at an unimaginable speed.","This was simply unbelievable.","It should be known that even though the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was transformed from a super Perfect Chaotic Lifeform and was a heaven-defying existence, it did not have an exaggerated recovery speed.","Not only did he not get destroyed by the Emperor’s sword strike, but he even withstood it and recovered quickly. This was simply unimaginable.","Jian Wushuang was only at the Yan Immortal realm. With the strength of the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body and the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, even if he could resist the attack of a Six Revolutions or even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he would not be able to withstand the power of an Emperor.","“Could it be because of the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens?”","Jian Wushuang thought nervously, completely unaware that Yu Chang had already put away his sword and arrived in front of him.","“How’s your body?”","“I, I feel pretty good...”","“Not bad indeed. He’s able to endure attacks and withstand the power of an Emperoor.”","Yu Chang praised endlessly,” This Immortal body of yours is no longer the same as before.","Jian Wushuang looked at him in confusion. At the same time, he did not know what had caused this change.","“Do you remember everything that happened in the Endless Sea?”","Jian Wushuang nodded, “I remember, but I’m not sure. Could it be related to him?”","“It does. At the last moment, I expelled his True Shadow, but he still left something important in your body.”"]},{"number":5028,"title":"Chapter 5028 The Sky Filled With Giants","paragraphs":["5028 The Sky Filled With Giants","Jian Wushuang’s eyes twitched when he heard that.","Yu Chang continued, “Have you noticed any strange changes in your Immortal body?”","After pondering for a moment, he said, “It’s very strong. My recovery speed is almost incomparable to before. More importantly, I can withstand the power of an Emperor now.”","If this had happened before, it would have been unimaginable. Even if the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was terrifying and heaven-defying, it was still impossible for it to withstand the power of an Emperor.","The Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body had an upper limit. OOrdinary Six Revolutions or even Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals could severely injure his Immortal body or even destroy it.","After all, Jian Wushuang was only in the Yan Immortal realm, but now, he had completely withstood Yu Chang’s full-powered attack.","That was a ruthless character who could fight against an Emperor!","“Do you want to know what Emperor Zhen Wu left in your body?” Yu Chang said.","Jian Wushuang nodded.","“The Emperor Body.”","“Emperor Body? Emperor Body!”","His eyes instantly widened, and he could not even speak properly.","The Emperor Body!","Emperor Zhen Wu had actually left his Emperor Body to him. No wonder the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body could withstand Yu Chang’s attack.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang’s heart beat like a drum and throbbed uncontrollably.","This improvement was too terrifying, completely beyond his imagination.","One had to know that he was only at the peak of the Yan Immortal realm and his Immortal body could block the Emperor’s attacks. What if he stepped into the Grand Yan Immortal realm in the future?","The Immortal body grew with the growth of the realm. Jian Wushuang dared not imagine what it would be like if he became a Grand Yan Immortal one day.","But soon, he woke up and was a little worried.","Since Emperor Zhen Wu’s Immortal body had really fallen into his custody, it was not strange that Yu Chang had brought him to the Heavenly Court.","The True Martial Emperor’s True Shadow fell into a deep sleep in the Endless Sea again, so his Emperor Body should have been taken over by the Heavenly Court.","“Are you preparing to extract his Emperor Body out of me?” Jian Wushuang looked up at him and asked.","Yu Chang smiled faintly and did not comment. “It’s still too early. Since this is your first time coming to Little World Mountain, you should travel around first.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang had a rough idea that the Emperor Body would be extracted from him soon.","Therefore, he decided not to dwell on it. No matter how powerful the Emperor Body was, it had already been detected by the Heavenly Court and the Emperor. There was no way for him to keep it.","Heaven and earth were silent. The endless black runes retreated and the world of the Small World Mountain was revealed again.","Stepping on the Immortal grass under their feet, the two of them moved forward.","“Little Friend, why did you go to the Endless Sea?” Yu Chang walked in front and asked.","“I went to save him.” Jian Wushuang looked at him nervously.","“You want to ask if he is currently in the Endless Sea or has already left that place?”","“Yes.”","“Then you can rest assured. I’ve already brought him out. Just like you, he’s in this Little World Mountain.”","Hearing this news, Jian Wushuang let out a long sigh. His trip to the Endless Sea had not been in vain.","But then, his heart tightened as he thought of Jiang Li and Yan Fan.","Yu Chang also said, “Other than Di Qing, the rest of the Yan Immortals who are exiled in the Endless Sea are not allowed to leave. This is the Emperor’s order.”","Jian Wushuang sighed and there was only sadness in his eyes.","He felt that the Yan Immortals who were exiled in the Endless Sea were not unforgivable, and even had no fault, but they had suffered unimaginable pain.","To the immortal with endless lifespan, being imprisoned in a cage was the coldest and cruelest punishment.","“Little Friend, are you the Heavenly Official by the Young Emperor’s side?”","“Yes, yes, but not for long.”","“Are you leaving, or is it because of something else?”","“Perhaps I’ll be traveling after a while, so I won’t be able to settle down. As for the position of Heavenly Official, I think there should be someone more suitable than me.”","Yu Chang nodded and said nothing more.","A step for ten thousand miles. Their speed was not slow, but the scenery in their eyes did not change at all. It was as if there was no real destination.","After an unknown period of time, when the children who were guiding them appeared one after another, this Little World Mountain that was filled with Immortal Qi finally regained some life.","Then, a Dao Arena formed by pure Yan power appeared.","In every Dao Arena filled with Immortal energy, there were figures sitting or lying down.","With just one glance, Jian Wushuang could not help but swallow. That was because the figures in each Dao Arena were all carrying the Yan Power Wheel and surging with an indescribable force.","In other words, each of them was a Nine Revolutions Great Yan Immortal, a great expert who helped Zhen Wuyang develop the Great Si Region.","Moreover, there was more than one such ancient power. Looking around, there were hundreds of grand Dao Arenas...","“Let’s go. I’ll bring you to see the Emperor,” Yu Chang smiled and walked forward.","It was not until then that Jian Wushuang noticed that in the center of the square Dao Arenas, there was an even more magnificent and peaceful Dao Arena, like stars surrounding the moon.","The endless moonlight was like a tassel silk that slowly spun around the edge of the Dao Arena. It was impossible to point at it.","Yu Chang led the way forward, the warm jade steps under his feet extending into the distance.","Suppressing the palpitations in his heart, Jian Wushuang braced himself and quickly followed.","As he moved forward, the silent Dao Arena around him began to exude a sense of awakening. Then, figures flew out one after another.","They did not even need to be deliberate. That kind of aura that was like the mountains and seas collapsing and crushing the Heavenly Dao was completely emitted.","Each elder cast a curious look at Jian Wushuang and then walked forward together.","Jian Wushuang glanced at the prestigious elders beside him from the corner of his eye and became extremely nervous.","There was no other reason than that the fate energy released by those ancient elders was too powerful and terrifying.","Jian Wushuang, who was already weak, had to do his best to resist the pressure around him.","He was miserable, but he could only barely deal with it.","Yu Chang walked at the forefront. With a wave of his palm, the moonlight enchantment was activated, revealing the true appearance of the Dao Arena.","Colorful lotuses sprouted from beneath his feet and extended into the Dao Arena.","This was a magnificent lotus path.","All the giants in the sky had smiles on their faces as they walked into the Dao Arena.","“Little Friend, please follow me.”","Yu Chang turned around with a smile and extended his hand to receive him.","Jian Wushuang returned the greeting and took a deep breath. He stepped on the magnificent lotus pathway and entered the magnificent Dao Arena.","Billions of colorful lotuses grew, and the top-notch fate energy of the Great Dao flowed slowly in the Dao Arena.","With that kind of fate energy, it was enough to give birth to the most powerful warriors.","Jian Wushuang stood in the Dao Arena and looked around. He was surrounded by mighty figures. It was as if the sky was filled with giants.","At this moment, the ancient bell rang gently, and the sky became one."]},{"number":5029,"title":"Chapter 5029 Ten Thousand Years in a Flash","paragraphs":["5029 Ten Thousand Years in a Flash","Every elder was a supreme being who had walked out from the ancient era.","Even in Zhen Wuyang’s Emperor Dao Palace, they each had their own small world.","The stars surrounded the moon, and the moon and stars intertwined.","In the center of this grand training hall sat a middle-aged man in white.","He closed his eyes and his clothes floated around him. Billions of fate energy were connected and he could not look straight at them.","Jian Wushuang, who had been to the Heavenly Court several times, knew very well that the figure was the Emperor of the entire Grand Si Region, Zhen Wuyang.","As the sky full of giants sat down in their respective small worlds, Jian Wushuang also sat down in his small world under Yu Chang’s invitation.","Yu Chang’s position was the seat closest to Emperor Zhen Wuyang, and they sat almost side by side. The other ancient Grand Elders were like stars around them.","Jian Wushuang felt like he was sitting on pins and needles as he looked at Emperor Zhen Wuyang, who was sitting almost side by side.","This was the first time he had been so close to the Zhen Wuyang. He felt uncomfortable, especially when he was faced with the gazes of so many ancient elders.","However, Jian Wushuang was once a Universe Master, so his Divine Sense was firm. He quickly returned to normal and began to look down.","At the same time, Zhen Wuyang, who had been meditating with his eyes closed, suddenly opened his eyes.","He did not look at the elders but at Jian Wushuang.","Their eyes met, and an indescribable fate energy seemed to cross the ages and hit them.","It was a gaze that was filled with absolute suppression.","This was an involuntary pressure that came from his Divine Sense.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were calm, but his hands were clenched under his robe.","Even though his Divine Sense had already fused and stabilized, he still felt dizzy.","However, this pressure only existed for a few breaths of time before it was slowly withdrawn along with Zhen Wuyang’s ambiguous gaze.","Then, he spoke, his voice gentle and steady, “I’ve seen you before, the little Yan Immortal who stirred up the storm in front of the Six Heavens.”","Jian Wushuang was speechless and did not know how to answer.","Zhen Wuyang continued, “It’s just that you’re not with Yan’er. Why did you run to the Endless Sea?”","He knew that he was asking the obvious, but he could only bite the bullet and say, “To save a Yan Immortal.”","Zhen Wuyang laughed when he heard that. “You’re quite honest.”","...","Jian Wushuang wanted to find an excuse to get away with it, but it was already set in stone. One had to know that the last battle in the Endless Sea had even alarmed Yu Chang.","Since Yu Chang was alarmed, it was naturally impossible for Zhen Wuyang not to notice. Therefore, he was asking the obvious.","“Yan’er opened the door for you?”","“... yes.”","“How bold. Not only did the two of you dare to think, you even dared to do it. A puny little Yan Immortal dared to barge into the Banished Lands, aren’t you scared of dying?”","“I’m scared, but I can’t help it.”","Zhen Wuyang looked at him and did not say anything else.","After a moment, he said, “It’s already unimaginable that you can walk out of the Endless Sea alive. But since everything has already happened and ended, I won’t hold you responsible anymore.”","“Continue to be a Great Heavenly Official by Yan’er’s side and protect him well.”","Jian Wushuang remained silent and finally said apologetically, “I’m sorry, I’m afraid I can’t do it. The reason why I temporarily took up the position of Heavenly Official beside him was actually because of an agreement between us.”","“Once 70 years pass, I will leave.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the Emperor Dao Arena fell silent.","All the elders looked at him with surprise in their eyes.","Because for a Yan Immortal, to be able to become a Heavenly Official of the Imperial Emperor lineage, the path of cultivation in the future would basically be a thousand times smoother.","The position of a Heavenly Official was not as simple as a position. It represented that one could enjoy the fate energy of the Emperor’s lineage!","That kind of fate energy was enough for a Yan Immortal to easily step into the Grand Yan Immortal realm, and as time passed, it would not be difficult for him to break through to Six Revolutions!","To a Yan Immortal who had an almost endless lifespan, needless to say, this was a miraculous position to be in.","Even for the elders, it was a rather generous condition.","One had to know that Emperor fate energy was too important, so important that even Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals coveted it.","But now, he was rejected by a Yan Immortal.","At this moment, Yu Chang said, “Little Friend, do you know how many years have passed in the outside world after you entered the Endless Sea?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned and shook his head, “I don’t know.”","“10,000 years.”","“What... 10,000 years?”","He was in a trance for a moment, and even his Divine Sense fluctuated.","It had been 10,000 years since he came to the Great Yan Domain from the Divine Power Universe.","He did not even have the time to do anything, and yet, 10,000 years have passed.","Yu Chang nodded. “It has indeed been 10,000 years since you entered the Endless Sea.”","Suppressing his absent-minded expression, Jian Wushuang nodded. “Thank you for telling me.”","Zhen Wuyang said, “Where do you think you’re going after that agreement?”","He shook his head. “I don’t know. I think I’ll travel around.”","“Haha!” Zhen Wuyang laughed out loud. “Then do you think I’ll let you leave?”","“You won’t,” Jian Wushuang said straightforwardly.","“You’re right, I won’t let a puny little Yan Immortal who can shake a Grand Yan Immortal leave the Grand Si Region. Furthermore, this Yan Immortal is the only one who managed to escape unscathed from the Endless Sea.”","Jian Wushuang remained silent. Zhen Wuyang did not want him to leave. He could only accept it.","Zhen Wuyang looked at him and said, “But there are exceptions to everything. If you want to leave, there is still a way.”","“What is it?”","“Defeat the Heavenly Official I chose for Yan’er, and you can leave on your own.”","“Alright, I agree,” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and said firmly.","He could already imagine that Zhen Wuyang would randomly appoint an elder beside him to be the Young Emperor’s Heavenly Official.","If that happened, he would have no chance of winning.","However, what happened next was unexpected. Zhen Wuyang did not randomly appoint a senior statesman. Instead, he looked at Yu Chang.","Yu Chang nodded, then stood up and waved his sleeve, opening the gate of the Dao Arena.","Immediately after, dozens of children entered in a line. Surrounded by them, a young man with a sword on his back and extremely sharp eyes stepped into the dojo.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed in surprise.","This was because the person who had come was none other than the young man who had made things difficult for him when he first came to Little World Mountain.","Chang Ling called him Qing Shan.","It was too much of a coincidence. Jian Wushuang knew that Qing Shan was the Heavenly Official that Zhen Wuyang had chosen for the Young Emperor.","Just as he had expected, Zhen Wuyang later declared that Qing Shan was the candidate for the position of Heavenly Official.","Their eyes met. At this moment, Qing Shan, who was standing in the center of the training hall, was extremely shocked.","He had never thought that they would meet again in the Emperor’s Dao Arena."]},{"number":5030,"title":"Chapter 5030 Qing Shan Is Not as Good as Jian Wushuang","paragraphs":["5030 Qing Shan Is Not as Good as Jian Wushuang","What was even more terrifying was that there was actually such a connection between the two of them.","Qing Shan had never thought that they would have a fight.","“I heard that you are strong enough to defeat a Grand Yan Immortal. Now, if you can defeat Qing Shan, I can let you go, and I won’t force you to stay by Yan’er’s side.”","Jian Wushuang nodded, “Sure.”","“Go ahead.”","Zhen Wuyang said in the end. Boundless fate energy transformed into a breeze that carried him to the center of the Dao Arena.","Qing Shan still had not come back to his senses and looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief.","The two of them faced each other from afar, but Jian Wushuang did not take a step back.","In front of him, Qing Shan was a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal. Because he had cultivated in Little World Mountain, the aura of Yan power on his body was extremely vast.","As long as there was a chance to break through, he would easily reach Six Revolutions.","They did not know where the breeze came from, and it blew their clothes.","An Invisible Sword had already quietly formed.","“You want to attack me?” Qing Shan felt that it was somewhat absurd. A puny little Yan Immortal actually had the desire to fight him.","“I have no choice,” Jian Wushuang said as the Invisible Sword in his hand shone brightly.","“In that case, let’s begin,” Qing Shan said coldly, his True Sword already in his hand.","A violent wind blew, ready to erupt at any moment.","“Sister Ling, Big Brother Jian is going to fight with him. What should we do?”","In front of the Heaven Gate, Amy anxiously shook Chang Ling’s finger.","Chang Ling’s expression was grave. Apparently, Jian Wushuang’s actions were no different from suicide in her eyes.","A Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal and a Yan Immortal, the difference between them could not be described with words.","They did not even need to fight, and the outcome was already decided.","Even though Chang Ling was secretly anxious, she had no choice at all because they were not even allowed to enter the Dao Arena. They could only stand outside the gate and watch everything that was happening inside the Dao Arena training hall.","Then, she squatted down, looked at Amy, and said, “Your Big Brother Jian will be fine. Big Brother Jian is really powerful, right?”","Amy quickly said, “He is very powerful, as powerful as the Young Emperor!”","“That’s right, your Big Brother Jian will definitely win,” Chang Ling said with a smile.","“Then... Will big brother Jian definitely win?”","“Definitely. We’ll just watch from here.”","...","“Yu Chang, what do you think will be the outcome?”","Zhen Wuyang turned to Yu Chang and said with a smile.","He did not say anything. His turbid eyes looked down and only spoke after a long while.","“Qing Shan is not as good as Jian Wushuang.”","When Zhen Wuyang heard this, he did not comment. He just watched this extremely unfair battle with interest.","Then, a scene that surprised all the elders appeared.","None of them had expected that Jian Wushuang would make the first move. With an indomitable momentum, he crushed toward Qing Shan.","The vast Sword Intent swept up, stirring up a huge wave of dust in the dojo and instantly surrounding the front.","Qing Shan’s eyes narrowed, and his cultivation state and Yan power erupted.","The terrifying Yan power force of the Three Revolutions realm was almost completely overwhelming once it was released.","The magnificent Yan power turned into a flash of light and cut through the dust wave formed by the Sword Intent. Then, it pierced toward Jian Wushuang without any reduction in its momentum.","Clang!","A loud sound rang out and Jian Wushuang was sent flying back thousands of feet!","Sparks flew everywhere.","He only stopped when he was 10,000 feet away.","Even though he had been hit hard, he was not injured at all.","He had the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens and the protection of the Emperor Body. Not to mention Qing Shan alone, even if there were 10,000 other warriors like Qing Shan, it would be impossible for them to break through the defense.","This was what made Jian Wushuang, who was still in a weak state, have the confidence to fight.","Qing Shan was calm. In this first confrontation, he seemed to have the upper hand, but he did not feel relaxed.","He could feel that Jian Wushuang was not simple, so he began to be careful.","However, Jian Wushuang was different. His Immortal body’s defense could not be broken for the time being, so he rushed forward without any hesitation.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, second move.","River.","The majestic celestial river swept down and swept up a huge wave of dust again, covering forward.","Qing Shan did not dare to underestimate Jian Wushuang. Although he was a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, Jian Wushuang gave him an inexplicable sense of pressure.","Especially under this Sword Intent, he actually had a feeling of shock.","Retracting his thoughts, he held his sword in front of him, the terrifying might of a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was displayed without a doubt.","The dark green Yan power also swept up, like pillars of the mountains and seas, smashing toward the Sword Dao River.","The two collided, and the power of the battle was at stake!","At this moment, even the Emperor’s Dao Arena trembled.","All the elders looked at this scene in shock. They could not believe that such power was actually released by a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal and a Yan Immortal.","The dark green Yan power kept retreating, but the Sword Dao Heavenly River was also rapidly shattering.","Gritting his teeth, Qing Shan, who was walking forward, was shocked beyond words.","He was actually evenly matched with a Yan Immortal?!","This was something he could not tolerate at all.","He was furious, and a heaven-shaking image form condensed at this moment.","Then, the Natal Image Form opened its eyes, and with the power of the mountains and seas, it waved its palm and smashed toward the Sword Dao Heavenly River.","Rumble!","The majestic celestial river shattered instantly, turning into countless tassels that scattered and disappeared.","However, at the same time, a cold light appeared in Qing Shan’s eyes.","He turned pale with fright. He had never thought that Jian Wushuang would actually hide in the sword river and attack him.","This was a supreme sword strike, an unstoppable sword strike, a sword strike that put his own life at risk.","Qing Shan knew how terrifying this sword strike was, so he released his Natal Image Form to block it at all costs.","However, it was already too late.","A cold light appeared and pierced into the Natal Image Form.","Time seemed to stop and Jian Wushuang’s strike hit the target.","In the next moment, with his heart as the center, billions of blue cracks instantly covered his Natal Image Form.","His aura dissipated and his Yan power collapsed.","With the destruction of the Natal Image Form, Qing Shan, who was wearing a white robe, was shocked. He retreated heavily, and the white robe on his chest was soaked in divine blood.","The Dao Arena was silent. All the elders raised their heads and looked at Qing Shan.","They were all in disbelief.","A Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was actually forced into a corner by a Yan Immortal, how was this possible?!","A cross-realm battle was something that had never happened before, but it was happening now.","Even rare geniuses in the world probably could not do it. This shocked all the elders.","Including Zhen Wuyang.","He frowned slightly. The Emperor had never looked so serious before.","He had been in control of countless Heavenly Regions and had seen too many geniuses. He was completely moved.","“Qing Shan is not as good as Jian Wushuang. Indeed, this is the case...” he muttered to himself."]},{"number":5031,"title":"Chapter 5031 Outstanding","paragraphs":["5031 Outstanding","Jian Wushuang stood with his sword in his hand. His face turned red because he used too much strength.","He was still in a weak state, and he had no time to recover at all. In fact, the battle had worsened the serious consequences.","However, he still forced the Yan power in his body to circulate normally.","Qing Shan was a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, so he would not be defeated easily. Even if he was injured by the Extinctive Sword for the first time, he could still avoid it.","After all, the difference between a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal and a Yan Immortal was too great.","His sword strike severely injured Qing Shan, but it was not fatal, and it did not hurt his Life Source.","The real battle was about to begin.","Qing Shan slowly raised his head. His gaze was as sharp as swords and filled with cold killing intent.","In the next moment, he took a step forward and dashed toward Jian Wushuang like an arrow.","Jian Wushuang squinted. He did not dodge, but instead, he charged at Qing Shan.","Boom!","The two of them collided directly, shaking the world.","The resulting explosion swept up, and endless power exploded, wreaking havoc in the entire Dao Arena.","Yu Chang reached out his hand in time and used his supreme fate energy to envelop the explosion within the barrier.","At this moment, all the elders sat up straight with shock in their eyes.","Outside the gate, Chang Ling found it hard to believe. She knew Qing Shan’s cultivation base very well, and it was because she knew it too well that she was shocked.","She knew how weak Jian Wushuang was. It was because of his weakness that she had helped him.","However, the scene before her completely overturned her imagination.","Jian Wushuang, who looked weak, had actually exploded with such power.","At the same time when the explosion reached its peak, Chang Ling covered Amy’s eyes with her hand in time.","She did not want Amy to see Jian Wushuang defeated.","In Chang Ling’s heart, she was certain that Jian Wushuang was going to lose.","Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals were worlds apart from Yan Immortals, they could not be changed just by risking their lives.","The dust dissipated.","When the two figures stood opposite each other, Chang Ling’s eyes widened to the max.","Jian Wushuang’s robe was torn to shreds, but he was unharmed.","Qing Shan’s entire left shoulder was completely shattered. Divine blood spurted out and was repairing it with great difficulty.","The result was a complete reversal. All the ancient elders, including Zhen Wuyang, were completely shocked.","How could this be the power of a Yan Immortal?!","Qing Shan clutched his broken right arm and retreated. He looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief and surprise.","If the first confrontation did not mean anything, then the second confrontation had already explained everything.","Qing Shan was no match.","Jian Wushuang was also in a bad state. The blood in his Immortal body was in turmoil and his Yan power was almost exhausted.","If he did not have the support of the Emperor Body, he would not have risked exhausting his Yan power to fight against Qing Shan like this.","As his right arm reformed with difficulty, Qing Shan slowly said, “Are you really just a Yan Immortal?”","Jian Wushuang did not answer him. He said, “Just admit defeat. I just want to leave this place. I don’t want to be your enemy.”","He was stunned, and then the corners of his eyes trembled. “Are you insulting me?”","“No, I just want to end this meaningless fight–”","Before Jian Wushuang could finish his sentence, Qing Shan was already furious. He waved his arms and the endless Power power instantly turned into millions of green sword curtains and swept up!","The green sword screens surrounded Jian Wushuang almost instantly.","At this moment, all the ancient elders were looking forward to see this move.","Qing Shan roared, pushing the endless green sword curtains, slashing downward.","Then, Jian Wushuang, who was in the middle of the sword curtains, made a shocking move.","He completely gave up on defending himself, and rushed toward Qing Shan with his bare chest against the sword screens that were pouring down.","This scene shocked all the elders. Zhen Wuyang frowned slightly, as if he had noticed something. After a moment, he came to a realization.","Immediately, he was a little annoyed, “Yu Chang, why didn’t you remind me?”","Yu Chang smiled. “Lord Emperoor, it’s not that I didn’t remind you, but that you didn’t give me the chance to do so.”","“I miscalculated. How could I have forgotten about the abnormality in this kid’s Immortal body?” Zhen Wu Yang smiled bitterly. “This time, it seems like there’s no suspense.”","Yu Chang then asked, “If our Little Friend Wushuang wins, will you let him leave, Lord Emperor?”","“Of course I will let him leave. No matter how talented he is, if he is not on the same side as Yan’er, I will not force him to stay. Unfortunately, Yan’er...”","Zhen Wuyang did not continue. After letting out a long sigh, he looked back at the battle in the Dao Arena.","Qing Shan had already forgotten everything. There was only shock in his eyes. The figure flew toward him, growing bigger and bigger in his pupils, and finally occupying his entire vision.","The endless green sword screens did not even damage Jian Wushuang’s Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, let alone his Emperor Body.","A scarlet light burst out, stabbing toward the Qing Shan’s Immortal Source without any pause.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were red. He had used the power of the Slaughter Dao, and he was currently consumed by bloodthirst.","If this attack hit the target, it would be impossible for Qing Shan to survive.","But in the next moment, the scarlet light did not pierce through Qing Shan’s Immortal Source, but brushed past Qing Shan’s chest.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang exerted strength with his shoulder and pressed heavily against his chest, sending him flying!","Rumble!","It was as if the mountains and seas were about to collapse, and the divine mountain was about to collapse. He heavily slammed into the barrier and then fell back onto the training hall.","The Dao Arena was silent, and all the elders had solemn expressions.","Chang Ling, who was standing outside the gate, was completely stunned. She looked at Jian Wushuang in a daze.","Amy pushed her palm away and saw this scene. She immediately shouted excitedly, “Big Brother Jian, Big Brother Jian won! Big Brother Jian won!”","Lying on his back in the hall, Qing Shan was bleeding from his mouth. He forced himself to swallow a mouthful of divine blood. He struggled to get up and looked at Jian Wushuang with a complicated expression.","His Immortal body was completely unharmed and had not suffered any serious injuries. The only mouthful of blood he spat out was from the collision.","Jian Wushuang had temporarily withdrawn his power. He was suffering the backlash. If it was not for his strong Immortal body, it was possible that he would have fainted on the spot.","He swallowed the blood in his throat and slowly turned around to look at Zhen Wuyang.","At this moment, all the elders held their breaths and looked at Zhen Wuyang.","“Everything that happened counts.”","Zhen Wuyang nodded slightly and said in a cryptic manner.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief and then cupped his hands in thanks.","But right after, Zhen Wuyang spoke again, his voice filled with supreme authority. “Since you’re not willing to be Yan’er’s Heavenly Official, I won’t force you.”","“However, I’m asking you now. Are you willing to be my Heavenly Official?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened.","The elders of the heavens also twitched their eyes and widened their eyes.","Emperor Zhen Wuyang, the supreme existence of the entire Grand Si Region, was actually extending this position to a mere Yan Immortal?!"]},{"number":5032,"title":"Chapter 5032 Desolation","paragraphs":["5032 Desolation","Inviting a puny little Yan Immortal to be the Great Heavenly Official of the Emperor?!","This was simply too absurd, so much so that Yu Chang turned to look at Zhen Wuyang.","“Are you willing?”","Each word was loud and reverberated in the Dao Arena.","All the elders, including Chang Ling who was standing outside the gate, became nervous.","This seemed to be the most absurd decision the Emperor had ever made.","“Aiyo, Sister Ling, you’re hurting me,” Amy pouted and said, pulling her small hand out of Chang Ling’s tightly clenched palm.","Chang Ling recovered from her shock and hurriedly apologized. Then, she once again focused her attention on everything that was happening in the training hall.","Jian Wushuang stood alone in the vast Dao Arena. Clouds and mist rose and fell around him, making him look like a proud and aloof Immortal.","“Lord Emperor, I am not willing.”","The Dao Arena was silent. All the elders were stunned. They could no longer imagine the reason for their rejection.","Yu Chang looked at Jian Wushuang and his murky eyes sparkled with clarity.","Zhen Wuyang laughed. “Interesting. Tell me the reason.”","After a moment of silence, Jian Wushuang said,” I can’t settle down here. I’m just a passerby.”","“Is that all?”","“That’s all.”","Zhen Wuyang did not say anything else. The sound of a pin dropping could be heard in the Dao Arena.","“Those who are not restrained are often the most terrifying.”","...","The mist was like a wisp of black and gray silk. It blew against Jian Wushuang’s face along with a strong wind that came from nowhere.","Everything he saw was barren.","This kind of desolation was absolute. There was noo aura of any living being. It was a land of death.","Jian Wushuang wanted to escape, but he had no way to do so.","This was because there were nearly 50 ancient elders behind him, while in front of him were Zhen Wuyang and Yu Chang.","They were the supreme existences of the Great Si Region, and they had transcended the ages.","Jian Wushuang was completely surrounded by such a group of existences. He did not even have the intention to resist.","However, he was not too worried. If Zhen Wuyang did not want him to stay, he would not have gone through so much trouble to bring him here.","From the limited information he got from Yu Chang, this place had almost never been set foot by a Yan Immortal since it was born. It was a realm that only belonged to the Emperor. It was his Emperor’s Realm.","Zhen Wuyang called this place “Desolation”.","Desolation, a deathly silence, the only one in history.","Jian Wushuang had already guessed that Zhen Wuyang had brought him here to strip him of his Emperor Body.","He sighed in his heart and had no choice but to accept reality.","As Zhen Wuyang’s Emperor’s Realm, Desolation was too oppressive. Even the Yan power was slowly disappearing here, unable to exist.","Nothing could exist. Only nothingness was eternal.","This place was too suitable for stripping the Emperor Body.","As he continued to move forward, Jian Wushuang, who had almost exhausted all of his power in his body, started to become restless.","He felt that something was wrong. He felt that some kind of power was awakening in his body.","At the same time, Yu Chang and Zhen Wuyang also sensed it.","At this moment, all the elders looked solemn. Then, a series of Yan powers came out of their palms and turned into chains, binding Jian Wushuang.","That kind of pressure almost instantly squeezed him until he could not speak.","“No, there’s no need to do this... I’m going to suffocate to death...”","Jian Wushuang spoke with difficulty. However, in the next moment, an unimaginable power erupted from the depths of his Immortal body.","The power was so great that it tore apart the chains around him in an instant.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Boundless energy burst forth, and nearly 50 elders were blasted away.","Almost at the same time, Yu Chang reacted. Thousands of wisps of dark green power shot out from his fingertips and bound Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang smiled coldly and waved his arm to extinguish Yu Chang’s attack.","“You think you can trap me? You overestimate yourself!”","After he finished speaking, he prepared to escape.","“You want to leave? Zhen Wu, take a look at who I am!”","With supreme prestige, Zhen Wuyang shouted coldly.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned serious. “Zhen Wuyang, you still don’t plan to let me go?”","Zhen Wuyang said in a deep voice, “Why should I let you go? Your destination is the Endless Sea. I’ll give you two choices.”","“The first is to return to the Endless Sea voluntarily. The second is to be imprisoned here forever.”","The deep voice shook the entire Emperor’s Realm.","Jian Wushuang laughed evilly. “I choose the third option!”","“I have a share of this land. Why should you be the true Emperor and I be banished by you?!”","“My appearance means that our identities will be exchanged!”","“Hmph!” Zhen Wuyang snorted coldly. “Do you think you have a chance to leave?”","“Why don’t we give it a try?”","Jian Wushuang laughed arrogantly and his Immortal body emitted endless Emperor’s fate energy.","His naked chest turned golden at this moment, and Emperor patterns covered it.","“Who dares to stop me?!”","Nearly 50 ancient elders were struggling to get close at this moment. In fact, they could not even get close.","Only Zhen Wuyang and Yu Chang could fight.","At that moment, the golden Emperor’s Radiance spread out, and the entire Emperor’s Realm shook.","The Emperor’s Radiance was extremely bright, and no one could look straight at it.","Jian Wushuang raised his hands and endless Emperor’s Radiance began to radiate. It was even more vast and terrifying than when he was in the Endless Sea.","Moreover, the fateSix Paths Emperor’s Fate Energy began to appear behind him.","Accompanied by the dense fate energy of the Six Path, six closed True Eyes appeared.","Seeing this change, Zhen Wuyang’s expression turned solemn.","“Six Sun True Emperor’s Eyes?”","Yu Chang nodded. “That’s right. I’ve already experienced it in the Endless Sea.”","“How is it compared to me?” Zhen Wuyang looked at him.","Yu Chang said, “They are equally matched. If his Emperor Body has also escaped the restraints of the Endless Sea, it will become even more challenging.”","“I see. No wonder he’s so arrogant,” Zhen Wuyang said in a deep voice.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang lowered his eyebrows and said coldly, “Zhen Wuyang, let me go. I will leave the Grand Si Region and will not disturb you again.”","“If you insist on sealing me here, I’m afraid you won’t be able to bear the consequences.”","“I’m afraid you’ll have to stay here forever.” Zhen Wuyang sneered. “If I can trap you once, I can trap you again.”","“Then let’s give it a try!”","Jian Wushuang shouted and an Emperor Sword condensed from Emperor’s Radiance appeared in his palm.","With the appearance of the Emperor Sword, his aura changed as if he was ready to fight to the death.","Zhen Wuyang and Yu Chang were solemn as well. Their Emperor’s fate energy was quietly released.","As supreme existences, the foundation of their strength could no longer bear the weight of their fate energy.","In the end, the only thing that mattered was the Emperor’s fate energy.","Apart from Zhen Wuyang, Yu Chang also revealed his Emperor’s fate energy.","A realm could not tolerate two masters, but it was hard to imagine that Zhen Wuyang had another Emperor by his side."]},{"number":5033,"title":"Chapter 5033 Battle in the Desolation","paragraphs":["5033 Battle in the Desolation","Most importantly, even when Yu Chang was an Emperor, he was still a devoted follower of Zhen Wuyang. This was the most unbelievable thing.","The three Emperors had gathered for a battle.","With them as the center, not even the ancient elders could set foot within billions of miles.","“Zhen Wu, do you really dare to fight us?” Zhen Wuyang continued to exert pressure.","“Why wouldn’t I dare?” Jian Wushuang was proud. His six True Eyes were floating around him as if they would open at any time.","Zhen Wuyang did not speak anymore. Six True Eyes appeared around him in an instant.","A true battle between monarchs","“Destroy!”","“Destroy!”","Jian Wushuang and Zhen Wuyang spoke at the same time.","The two Imperial Emperor’s True Eyes opened at the same time, and an unimaginable aura of nothingness descended.","This formless aura could ignore any Emperor’s fate energy or Heavenly Dao. It was the most tyrannical.","In the Endless Sea, Yu Chang, who was also an Emperor, suffered a huge blow, his Emperor Body was almost destroyed.","This was Zhen Wuyang’s Emperor Style. Even Emperors of the same realm had to be extremely vigilant.","The formless aura penetrated through all the Emperor’s fate energy and the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao.","Jian Wushuang and Zhen Wuyang’s expressions changed at the same time!","Then, they retreated a thousand feet!","If one looked closely, one could see cracks appearing on Zhen Wuyang’s Emperor Body and his Emperor’s Radiance fading away.","Emperor Zhen Wu, who had occupied Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body, was even more severely injured. His entire Immortal body was almost shattered.","However, the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens saved his life and prevented his Immortal body from being destroyed.","This move was too terrifying and illogical. It surpassed the meaning of any Heavenly Dao or even the Great Dao of Yan power. It did not use any medium and directly pressed onto Jian Wushuang’s Emperor Body.","“You’re bullying my Emperor Body? Don’t you think I’ll try for a Perfect Fusion?”","Jian Wushuang shouted angrily as his immortal body was being repaired.","Zhen Wuyang laughed coldly, “So what if I bully you? Do you really think that you can defeat me just because you escaped from the Endless Sea?”","Jian Wushuang stopped talking and smiled darkly. His Immortal body, which was wrapped in the golden Emperor’s Radiance, suddenly shattered!","Countless drops of divine blood dripped from the cracks, spilling into the void.","Following this abnormal scene, the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was undergoing some strange changes.","Tens of thousands of Emperor patterns were growing, and they were extremely dazzling.","“You’re trying to forcefully integrate the Emperor Body?!” Yu Chang’s expression was solemn.” Emperor Zhen Wu wants to transform Wushuang’s Immortal body into a full-fledged Emperor Body!”","“What the hell? Is this guy courting death? Does he think that a mere Immortal body can withstand the pressure of a full Emperor Body?”","Zhen Wuyang frowned and said in a half-confused and half-angry voice.","Yu Chang was silent. Then, he turned to look at him and said, “This Immortal body is not ordinary. I investigated it when I was in the Endless Sea, but I couldn’t see through it.”","Zhen Wuyang continued to frown. “But this can’t be compared to the Emperor Body, let alone Perfect Fusion.”","“I’m afraid that it really can.” Yu Chang’s expression turned grave.","As soon as he finished speaking, a gilded thousand-patterned robe appeared. It was the Hundred-Leaves Battle Emperor Robe. It materialized and landed on Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body.","Zhen Wuyang, who was about to retort, had a change in expression. “He’s really condensed an Emperor Body?!”","“No, it hasn’t completely condensed yet,” Yu Chang said in a deep voice. “Once he transforms into a complete Emperor Body, I’m afraid there will be a huge change!”","“Then what are we waiting for? Let’s fight first! Die!” Zhen Wuyang shouted in a low voice. An Emperor Sword suddenly condensed in his hand.","He slashed down heavily with his sword!","In an instant, the mountains and seas were destroyed, and the earth shattered.","The Emperor Realm, Desolation, which had been silent for countless years, was shattered hundreds of millions of feet under this sword strike.","Jian Wushuang, who was already wearing the gilded Hundred-Leaves Battle Emperor Robe, was calm and composed. He even had a seductive smile on his face.","Faced with this Emperor Sword that could destroy the Mountains and Seas, he lowered his arms and a similar Emperor Sword materialized before him.","Rumble!","The earth shattered, and Emperor’s Realm, Desolation, fell into chaos.","With his sword, none of the elders could get close at all. They looked at this scene in fear.","The battle between the Emperors was not something they could talk about. If they were not in Desolation, they would have run as far away as they could.","Billions of miles of dust slowly dissipated, leaving behind a deep abyss. Jian Wushuang’s figure was nowhere to be seen.","Zhen Wuyang and Yu Chang did not relax. They did not think that this sword strike could seriously injure Zhen Wu.","In the next moment, a violent fluctuation suddenly appeared around them. An extremely dazzling figure broke through the void and descended.","It was a sword, an Emperor Sword that was completely condensed from Emperor’s Radiance.","Jian Wushuang wielded the Emperor Sword and slashed down fiercely.","Yu Chang raised his head, and he tossed the dark green Emperor Sword into the air, intercepting Jian Wushuang’s attack. It turned into a long rainbow as it flew.","The two collided, and a shockwave was created, endless power swept out.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold and he barely managed to slash the rainbow apart with his sword, and then he stood in the void.","“Yu Chang, this matter has nothing to do with you. This is a matter between me and Zhen Wuyang.”","“Emperor Zhen Wu, please stop. There is no end to this,” Yu Chang slowly persuaded.","“If there’s no end, then I’ll fight until there is one today!” Jian Wushuang shouted loudly and the Emperor Sword in his hand exploded with power.","“If you refuse to come to your senses, then you will be buried here today!” Zhen Wuyang said angrily.","Then, he directly stepped on the air and flew forward. He was shining so bright that one could not look straight at him.","At this moment, the white robe on his body disappeared. In its place was a gilded Hundred-Leaves Battle Emperor Robe!","With the Emperor Robe, he returned to the Ancient Era. He returned to his peak, where even Emperors fell under his sword.","The power was brilliant, and boundless Emperor’s fate energy was being rebuilt.","The Emperor could not be stopped!","Jian Wushuang’s scarlet-gold eyes flashed with solemnity and fear.","The Six Sun True Emperor’s Eyes opened at this moment.","Zhen Wuyang stepped onto the air and slashed forward with the Emperor Sword in his hand without any hesitation.","Jian Wushuang did not retreat. His eyes were cold as he slashed back at Zhen Wuyang with his Emperor Sword!","The Emperor Sword met, and the Emperor’s Realm seemed to start wailing. In Desolation, the sky shattered and the earth cracked.","Seeing this, Yu Chang hurriedly extended his hand to release the Emperor’s fate energy to repair the shattered void and the ground.","To Emperors, destroying any Heavenly Region or Secret Realm was a simple matter.","Not to mention, this was a battle between Emperors. Just the fate energy that was emitted was enough to destroy everything.","If Yu Chang did not stop it, the entire Desolation would shatter.","An Emperor fighting another Emperor, and the Emperor’s Radiance shone endlessly.","Their eyes met. Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with killing intent and hatred.","On the other hand, Zhen Wuyang’s eyes were indifferent, as if he was doing something that was only natural.","“Zhen Wuyang, you want me to die? How is that possible?”","“I’m telling you. Not only will I survive, but I will also live a good life. Just you watch! I will completely destroy your Great Si Region and bury you with it!”","“I’ll let you have a good taste of eternal exile!”"]},{"number":5034,"title":"Chapter 5034 Defeat","paragraphs":["5034 Defeat","When an Emperor was enraged, the mountains and seas would be destroyed.","At that moment, the entire realm was on the verge of collapse, even with the blessing of Yu Chang’s fate energy.","The Emperor’s Radiance was resplendent as the two Emperor Bodies collided fiercely.","As the Emperor Sword collided with each other, Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows were sharp and there was only endless killing intent left in his scarlet-gold Emperor Eyes.","As their eyes met, billions of wisps of Emperor’s fate energy bloomed from his back and attacked Zhen Wuyang.","Wherever this fate energy passed, everything turned to dust, even the void.","Each wisp of Emperor’s fate energy was like a blooming chrysanthemum petal that completely enveloped Zhen Wuyang before exploding.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Yu Chang’s fate energy was scattered by this explosion, and all the elders who wanted to rush forward to help were sent flying.","The entire Emperor’s Realm was in chaos, and everything was broken.","Almost at the same time, Jian Wushuang retreated quickly and looked at the center of the explosion with his cold Emperor’s Eyes.","This explosion surpassed the Great Dao and the laws of Yan power. Only Emperors could control and release it.","The magnificent explosion engulfed Desolation, which had been silent since its creation.","Yu Chang’s current mission was to do his best to protect the Emperor’s Realm, Desolation.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void and looked coldly at Zhen Wuyang, who was entangled in the explosion. He even had a slightly flirtatious look on his handsome face.","He was confident that although Zhen Wuyang would not die, he would definitely suffer unimaginable injuries.","But the next moment, the result was completely different from what he had expected.","A figure that suppressed the ancient Heavenly Dao slowly stepped out from the broken and burning Emperor’s Radiance.","The explosion was so violent that even the Emperor’s fate energy was repelled. The fate energy automatically shrink back the moment it got close to him.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened and he subconsciously took a few steps back.","Zhen Wu Yang was not injured at all. Only the robe on his body was slightly damaged.","His gaze became even colder, as if he had returned to the peak of the Ancient Era.","Facing Jian Wushuang, he raised his right hand and pointed.","In an instant, endless Emperor’s Heavenly Dao was condensed into this finger, and it advanced without any obstruction.","He did not have time to think and immediately raised the Emperor Sword to block in front of him, hoping to block Zhen Wuyang’s attack.","But the result was beyond his imagination.","With a single finger, the Emperor Sword was instantly shattered.","Jian Wushuang’s chest caved in. At this moment, even the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens dimmed.","He was sent flying for a million feet.","At the same time, Zhen Wuyang followed closely behind. He completely abandoned the Emperor Sword and smashed his fists heavily on Jian Wushuang’s body.","Bang!!!","With a punch, the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao collapsed. He did not even have time to make a sound before he was blasted into the abyss.","The ground shattered, and the entire Desolation was in a terrible state.","Furthermore, Zhen Wuyang did not stop at all. He blasted the ground out of the abyss and continued to chase after him.","In the next moment, billions of beams of Emperor’s Radiance burst out from the abyss, shattering Desolation!","Yu Chang’s expression changed. Even his Emperor’s fate energy was unable to stop it. The Emperor’s Realm was beginning to be destroyed by the Emperor’s Radiance.","The plane shattered, and all the elders in the outer circle were shocked.","However, they did not retreat. Instead, they released their own fate energy and Heavenly Dao to repair Desolation, which was on the verge of destruction.","As the Emperor’s Radiance burst forth, the entire plane began to tremble and collapse.","Then, a figure was blasted out from the depths of the earth abyss like a sun and a star.","At this moment, the gilded Hundred-Leaves Battle Emperor Robe was burning. Zhen Wuyang stepped out of the abyss and punched Jian Wushuang’s chest.","His Emperor Body shattered!","In an instant, millions of traces of Emperor’s fate energy gushed out from his back like blooming Immortal chrysanthemum petals!","Emperor blood started to flow into the void.","His eyes widened in disbelief.","All of this happened too quickly, almost in an instant. He did not have any ability to retaliate.","This was almost a one-sided slaughter. Zhen Wuyang had broken through the defenses of his Emperor Body through sheer brute strength!","Jian Wushuang covered his chest with his hands.","What was strange was that although the Nine Heavens Raiment was extremely dim, it was not broken at all. Not a single wound was left behind.","However, he was certain that the Emperor Body behind the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens had indeed shattered.","The Emperor’s fate energy was flowing and disappearing.","Zhen Wuyang stood in the broken void and did not make any further moves. Instead, he looked at Jian Wushuang calmly.","The Battle Emperor Robe on his body was also torn. It was obvious that he had experienced a bloody battle.","After coughing out a wisp of Emperor Blood, Jian Wushuang’s aura became weak and his pair of crimson-gold Emperor Eyes became dim.","“Zhen Wuyang, oh Zhen Wuyang, you’re still as vicious as ever. Not only are you ruthless to all living beings, but you’re even more ruthless to yourself.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “I thought I was abominable. Now that I think about it, you are the abominable lord.”","“Have you said enough?” Zhen Wuyang’s emotionless voice rang out as he raised his palm.","In his palm, the endless Emperor Heavenly Dao was constructed, enough to destroy all enemies.","“How is this enough? I don’t want to leave out any of your evil deeds!” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and looked extremely evil.","“You’re courting death!” Zhen Wuyang’s face frowned as he slammed down with the Emperor’s Heavenly Dao.","But then, everything changed.","Jian Wushuang, whose aura was already weak, smiled wickedly. He shook his arms and shattered Zhen Wuyang’s Emperor Heavenly Dao.","“You think that I’m no match for you and have lost, but you have to know that there are variables! Don’t get so smug!”","Boom!","The unparalleled fate energy of the Emperor exploded, and it swept across the entire Desolation like a tidal wave.","This Emperor’s fate energy was the purest and most extreme fate energy.","“How is this possible? The Emperor Body has actually completely fused with this kid?!”","Yu Chang could not remain calm anymore as he cried out involuntarily. His turbid eyes became clear.","Zhen Wuyang’s expression turned grave. He had never expected that Emperor Zhen Wu, who had almost died a moment ago, would recover completely in the next moment. He had even become even more terrifying.","The shattered Battle Emperor Robe turned into crimson ashes and lava, covering Jian Wushuang’s Emperor Body once again.","“A fully fused Emperor Body... It feels really good. I haven’t felt this for a long time,” he slowly raised his arms and said in a somewhat absent-minded manner.","“Zhen Wuyang, I really have to thank you for letting me obtain a perfect Emperor Body... As my thanks, I will return everything that happened before to you!”","“Die!” he shouted loudly. Endless Emperor’s Radiance swept out and crushed the Zhen Wuyang.","At this moment, Yu Chang stopped watching. His Emperor Body instantly arrived beside Zhen Wuyang and resisted Zhen Wu’s Emperor’s Radiance together.","“It seems... I miscalculated this time.”"]},{"number":5035,"title":"Chapter 5035 Annihilation","paragraphs":["5035 Annihilation","Zhen Wuyang sighed, his eyes dimmed.","Yu Chang continued,” This isn’t your fault. No one would have thought that the True Martial Emperor would be able to fuse with the Sovereign Body. It’s simply unbelievable.”","As they conversed, endless Emperor’s splendor finally descended and engulfed the sky.","Jian Wushuang’s Emperor Body was already complete. He didn’t stop at all. He leaped in front of them and smashed down with his Emperor Fist.","The void shattered, and the Desolate Emperor Realm was in complete chaos.","The might of the Emperor’s Fist could even shake an Emperor!","Zhen Wuyang and Yu Chang retreated a million feet at the same time to resist this power.","However, Jian Wushuang, whose body was covered in red lava, continued to turn his body and smash as if he didn’t know fatigue.","One punch, one million shadows!","Not only that, but he also released the Six Sun True Emperor’s Eyes.","True Emperor Six-Daos opened his eyes at the same time, and an unparalleled Emperor Will bloomed. It directly ignored the fate of any Imperial Lord and the Heavenly Dao of any Imperial Lord as it descended.","Yu Chang’s expression changed, and his old face instantly turned red.","In the final battle of the Endless Ocean, he had already been injured. At this moment, he was unable to withstand the six Six Sun True Emperor’s Eyes.","Zhen Wuyang sensed this change and immediately blocked Yu Chang behind him, using his Martial Emperor Realm body to withstand all the attacks.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","No Yan Xian could see through the Six Six Sun True Emperor’s Eyes, not even Imperial Emperors.","Since he couldn’t see through it, he could only endure it completely. Even Zhen Wuyang, who had created this imperial style, could only endure it.","This was the full-powered attack of Emperor True Martial after he had fused with his Sovereign Body.","The Martial Emperor Realm robe on Zhen Wuyang’s body shattered. His Martial Emperor Realm body could not withstand it and was on the verge of destruction.","But immediately after, Yu Chang stretched out his hand and released his Imperial Lord providence, blocking the huge attack.","“Yu Chang!” Zhen Wuyang reached out to grab it, but he fell into the void because he had taken most of the attack.","“You want to leave? You can’t even protect yourself!” Jian Wushuang smiled ferociously. He suddenly lifted his palms and held Zhen Wuyang in place, preventing him from moving.","“Zhen Wu, you’re courting death!” He shouted and broke through the obstruction without caring about anything else, crashing into Jian Wushuang.","“So you still have this day!” Jian Wushuang smiled coldly and threw a punch.","The two fists met, and the emperor’s power was emptied!","They retreated thousands of feet at the same time, but Zhen Wuyang was faster and crashed into Jian Wushuang again.","The emperor’s splendor condensed into a precious image, as if it had awakened from the ancient era, and it pressed down with a domineering aura.","This was also a full-powered attack, a true rage of a God Emperor.","Jian Wushuang responded in time, but it was too late.","The indescribable fate of the Emperor made everything dim, devouring everything.","Even the Emperor Body was rapidly being destroyed by this Emperor Lord Treasure Image.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s face was ferocious. He could feel that his luck was swallowed.","“Zhenwu, I want you dead!”","The loud sound that contained the Limitless Heavenly Dao made the entire Desolate Emperor Realm tremble and shatter even more.","Jian Wushuang laughed crazily,” If I die, do you dare to let me die? As long as I die, you will be severely injured in an instant and the Emperor’s Way of Heaven will also disappear!”","” Let me ask you, do you dare?!”","Zhen Wuyang didn’t speak. He looked at Jian Wushuang, who was enveloped by the fate of the Endless Emperor, and his eyes were filled with killing intent.","“Since that’s the case, then you can die.”","He closed his fingers and clenched his fist.","In that instant, the mountains and seas were destroyed, and the emperor’s might shattered the sky.","The entire Desolate Emperor Realm was shattered into dust and turned into an ancient void.","Almost at the same time, Little World Mountain, which was enveloped by auspicious clouds and rich in derivative energy, shook violently.","The tremors lasted for a long time, waking all the elders from their slumber and looking at the boundless void.","Chang Ling, who was sitting on the Immortal Tree, also sensed this change at the first possible moment.","For the first time in countless years of peace and quiet, a violent wind suddenly blew on the Little World Mountain. The auspicious clouds in the sky turned dark red.","Chang Ling’s heart inexplicably throbbed, producing an extremely bad premonition.","“Sister Ling, what are you looking at? How did Little World Mountain become like this?”Ah Mi shook her hand as she raised her head and asked.","Chang Ling came back to her senses and rubbed her little head.” It’s nothing. Something should have happened, but it won’t affect you.”","Ah Mi nodded obediently and then asked,” Will that affect Brother Jian?”","Chang Ling’s heart trembled when she heard this. She then forced a smile and said,” Don’t think too much. Your Big Brother Jian is very good. No one will hurt him.”","Ah Mi nodded and stopped asking.","However, the worry in her eyes grew more and more serious. She clearly remembered that Jian Wushuang had disappeared not long after he defeated Qing Shan.","Emperor Zhen Wuyang, Uncle Yu, and the elders of Wanggu also disappeared.","Now that such a commotion had occurred in Little World Mountain, it was probably related to their departure.","“Could it be that all these strange movements were caused by him?”","..","The Desolate Emperor Realm was completely destroyed. The sky was shattered, and all that could be seen were floating rocks.","With the help of the elders, Yu Chang looked up into the sky.","There were two Emperors there.","One Emperor stood, and the other Emperor was also standing. However, he was already on the verge of collapse, as if he could fall asleep at any moment.","The Emperor Blood that contained the shackles of fate energy seeped out of the Emperor Body and then scattered in the eternal void.","His face was pale, but his eyes were still cold, unyielding, and filled with hatred.","Zhen Wuyang was standing in front of him, calm and collected.","Then, Zhen Wuyang raised his palm, which was filled with pure killing intent.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened. He was so terrified that he could not even speak.","“Zhen Wuyang, you dare to kill me?”","“Why not?” he said. There was no reluctance in his voice, only coldness.","Killing intent enveloped the area, and endless emperor radiance shone down.","However, in the next moment, an old palm was placed on Zhen Wuyang’s raised arm.","“Lord Emperor, you can’t.”","It was Yu Chang.","Zhen Wuyang looked at him. “Why?”","“Because this is unfair to Little Friend Wushuang,” Yu Chang said slowly. “Emperor Zhen Wu should bear the punishment and sin. You can’t impose it on Wushuang.”","“Because he didn’t do anything. If he’s destroyed because of the sins of others, it’s unfair to him.”","After hearing this, Zhen Wuyang glanced at Jian Wushuang and said, “But what about Zhen Wu? As long as he is not eliminated, the Great Si Region will be unstable.”","Yu Chang also fell silent because he did not know what to do.","Emperor Zhen Wu’s Emperor body had completely fused with Jian Wushuang. Even Jian Wushuang’s Divine Sense might have been devoured and absorbed.","Jian Wushuang had almost become Emperor Zhen Wu.","Even Yu Chang was not sure if Jian Wushuang was still alive.","If there was really no way to expel Emperor Zhen Wu from Jian Wushuang’s body, then the only outcome left was to kill him together."]},{"number":5036,"title":"Chapter 5036 Sealed Indefinitely","paragraphs":["5036 Sealed Indefinitely","The result of being killed together was something that Yu Chang did not want to see.","It was because he had a unique feeling about Jian Wushuang. It was a feeling of intimacy and some unknown factors.","It would be the biggest mistake to kill him just like that.","Seeing the two Emperors in a stalemate, Jian Wushuang, who was on the verge of death, smiled secretly.","He had never thought that the owner of the Immortal body he occupied would actually be able to make Yu Changdu plead for mercy.","If that was the case, Zhen Wuyang would probably not kill him.","Just as he had thought, Zhen Wuyang fell silent and did not attack.","This was because he was a part of Zhen Wuyang. Once he died, Zhen Wuyang would not have an easy time either. He might not even be an Emperor anymore.","Before he could smile, his expression suddenly changed. His Emperor Body actually accelerated and shattered.","“No, no, how... How was this possible? How can you still be alive?!”","Jian Wushuang cried out and his body was on the verge of collapse.","“Hmm?”","Zhen Wuyang and Yu Chang were puzzled at the same time. They did not know why Zhen Wu would lose his composure.","However, following that, he seemed to be bleeding Emperor Blood and Emperor’s fate energy at an accelerated pace, and they did not know what was happening.","“Could it be that Little Friend Wushuang, whose Immortal body was seized, didn’t die?” Yu Chang said in surprise.","Zhen Wu Yang could not believe it. Even if Jian Wushuang could defeat a Three Revolutions Grand Immortal, it was impossible for him to last so long and not die under the devouring of the Emperor’s fate energy.","However, the changes in the Emperor Body made them believe that Jian Wushuang had not died!","...","In the ethereal realm of Divine Sense.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang stood in the sand and looked ahead with a pale face.","In front of him was the furious Emperor Zhen Wu.","“Give me back my Immortal body and I’ll let you go,” Jian Wushuang said weakly.","He had personally witnessed the battle between the Emperors. Even though his Divine Sense was perfect, it was on the verge of collapse.","The True Martial Emperor was exasperated. He had not expected Jian Wushuang to still be alive.","“You? You’re courting death! Now that you’re willing to fall into a deep sleep, I’ll spare your life. Otherwise, I’ll destroy your soul on the spot!”","Jian Wushuang sighed and said no more.","In the next moment, a black feather that blotted out the sky appeared behind his back!","As the black feather spread out, a Chasing Bird image form Divine Sense appeared. It was so large that it occupied almost half the ethereal space","It was covered in dark green wings and had six horns on its head. Each horn was a different color. It was beautiful and mysterious.","Then, it slowly opened its eye chakra. Its extremely pure golden eyes seemed to see through everything in the universe.","It was a divine and primordial aura, and it came from the Ancient Era. It was unimaginable.","With the appearance of the Chasing Bird and Jian Wushuang’s transformation, Emperor Zhen Wu, who was originally flustered and exasperated, felt a deep chill in his heart.","He never expected that there would be an Emperor’s Aura in the depths of Jian Wushuang’s Divine Sense!!","“Argh-”","The Emperor’s fate energy was shattered, and his Emperor Blood gushed out. His Emperor Body was in a miserable state.","In the eternal void, Jian Wushuang was struggling and his fate energy was rapidly declining.","Zhen Wuyang and Yu Chang looked at each other before attacking together. The Emperor’s fate energy transformed into chains that bound him completely.","Immediately after, the ancient elders were also in position. They worked together to release their fate energy and rebuild the Emperor’s Realm, Desolation!","The void was mending, and the endless fragments gathered again. The fate energy of the nearly 50 ancient elders was too terrifying, enough to repair any realm.","Desolation was completely restored in a few dozen breaths.","Seeing this, Zhen Wuyang waved his hand and the ground rose, forming a majestic divine mountain.","Then, the two Emperors worked together and tied Jian Wushuang to the divine mountain.","As the last trace of the Emperor’s fate energy dissipated, he stopped moving.","“Is Emperor Zhen Wu dead?” Yu Chang looked at Zhen Wuyang and asked.","He nodded. “No, but I can feel that he has fallen into a deep sleep.”","Yu Chang said again, “Then can you let Little Friend Wushuang leave?”","Zhen Wuyang frowned and shook his head. “No, as long as Zhen Wu is not removed, I cannot do that. He will be sealed here until Zhen Wu is removed from his body.”","Yu Chang was silent. He could not make a decision, but Zhen Wu Yang’s decision was indeed the best solution.","As long as the Zhen Wu was not stripped, it would be a disaster. Jian Wushuang naturally could not escape from the shackles.","Zhen Wuyang still wanted to say something, but in the end, all he could do was sigh.","In this battle between Emperors, the final result was not as he wished.","Emperor Zhen Wu fell into a deep sleep. His Emperor Body was already broken, but he could no longer be separated from Jian Wushuang’s Immortal body. They had completely fused.","This was an ending without an ending, and it ended hastily.","To Jian Wushuang, this was a complete disaster. He did not do anything and was sealed in Desolation for countless years.","The Emperor finally left, and the Emperor’s Realm fell into eternal silence.","In the endless darkness, the figure that was chained to the peak of the divine mountain quietly opened his eyes.","“I’m now sealed indefinitely... Zhen Wu, you’ll pay for this!”","...","Auspicious clouds returned, and Immortal aura filled the air. Everything returned to peace.","“Hey, hey, did you see that the elders and the others all returned with injuries? Some of them were even heavily injured.”","“What is this? I saw that even Uncle Yu was injured!”","“W-what? Where did you see it? Don’t spout nonsense.”","“Why would I lie to you? I saw it with my own eyes. Although I only saw it from afar, it’s definitely true.”","“That’s still not possible. Who could hurt Uncle Yu? I’m afraid that even all respective ancestors combined won’t be enough to even scratch him...”","“There’s something fishy about this. The injuries of the ancestors are probably all due to that forbidden area.”","“Forbidden land, Desolation? Forget it, forget it, we shouldn’t talk about such a thing.”","The discussions erupted everywhere. Chang Ling, who was sitting under the Immortal Tree, quietly opened her eyes.","Those who were discussing were the disciples of the various elders. They were the candidates for the Heavenly Official position of the Seventh Prince under Zhen Wuyang.","At this moment, their discussion had a certain degree of credibility.","The anomaly that happened in Little World Mountain was very likely related to that forbidden area.","Chang Ling could nothelp but think of Jian Wushuang, who had defeated the Grand Yan Immortal single-handedly in the Dao Arena.","“Did he leave or go somewhere else?”","“Don’t tell me that the anomaly of Little World Mountain has something to do with him?”","Her thoughts were swirling like a whirlpool, and she could not stop thinking about him.","Chang Ling stood up and looked at the boundless void in front of her.","“He must have left. How could the changes in Little World Mountain be related to him?”"]},{"number":5037,"title":"Chapter 5037 Chang Ling","paragraphs":["5037 Chang Ling","Thinking about it for a moment, Chang Ling once again returned to the Immortal tree and sat down with her eyes closed.","However, this meditation did not last long. Her slightly furrowed brows betrayed her current state of mind.","“No way, could it be that the anomaly of Little World Mountain is really related to him?”","At this time, a crisp voice suddenly sounded out, and immediately following that, a small figure laid on Chang Ling’s lap.","“What does it have to do with him, Sister Ling?”","It was Amy, and her delicate little face was looking at her curiously.","Chang Ling came back to her senses and rubbed her little head. “It’s nothing. Did you see your Big Brother Jian?”","Amy said, “Big Brother Sword? Didn’t he leave with Grandpa? I saw it with my own eyes.”","Hearing up to here, Chang Ling’s heart trembled, a bad premonition surging into her heart.","She had already guessed that the change in Small World Mountain was related to Jian Wushuang.","“Sister Ling, what are you thinking about? Is there any news from Brother Jian?” Amy asked eagerly.","Chang Ling smiled slightly. “No, you don’t have to worry. Cultivate well and don’t slack off, understand?”","“Oh...” Amy replied, then sat down at the side and focused on sitting up with her eyes closed.","“What’s going on? Why am I so concerned about him? We’ve only met once...”","“What am I thinking?”","She shook her head in a self-deprecating manner and sat down together.","Auspicious clouds curled up. The entire Little World Mountain was peaceful and peaceful, just like when it was created.","There were fairies and Heavenly Officials candidates who were cultivating and meditating with the elders. It was a true Immortal Realm.","However, in this peaceful and quiet Immortal Realm, there was a fairy who seemed extremely anxious. Her brows were occasionally relaxed and occasionally furrowed, as if she was thinking about something.","Soon, she opened her eyes again and looked around quietly. Then, she lowered her voice and said, “Amy, do you want to see your Big Brother Jian?”","...","In the midst of the wind and dust, a thin figure with seven-colored light was moving forward at a constant speed.","It was a woman, Chang Ling.","She left the Small World Mountain alone and walked toward Desolation. She had never set foot in before.","She did not know where Desolation was. Besides the ancient elders, there were no other fairies or Heavenly Official candidates in the Small World Mountain.","However, with Amy as a guide, she still knew the approximate location of Desolation. Then, she quietly moved forward.","Originally, Amy also strongly requested to go with them, but how could Chang Ling let her follow? She used a little trick to make her stay behind at Little World Mountain and went to Desolation alone.","...","Emperor’s Realm, Desolation.","This was a place that no Yan Immortal had ever set foot in, it was a Secret Realm. It was strange and mysterious.","Everything was shrouded in a dark mist. Even a Grand Yan Immortal would feel a strong sense of unease when they stepped foot here.","This place was extremely dangerous for Chang Ling, who had just stepped into the Grand Yan Immortal realm 50 million years ago!","She focused her mind and covered her Immortal body with a layer of Yan power before she heaved a sigh of relief.","However, looking at the place filled with an ancient desolate aura, Chang Ling sighed again.","“What am I doing? I must be crazy, I actually came to such a strange place just to look for a Yan Immortal...”","“Forget it. For Amy’s sake, I’ll reluctantly go and look for him.”","In the ancient wilderness, there was only a slender figure moving forward slowly but firmly.","As she moved forward, she did not notice that the black and gray mist around her was slowly gathering.","“Where can he be? Will it be more dangerous the further I go?”","Facing the clouds and mist that covered the sky, Chang Ling was somewhat worried.","However, the next moment, the crisis came much faster than she had expected. An unprecedented life-and-death crisis suddenly surged into her heart!","She used almost all of her Yan power and her Immortal body instantly rose into the air.","Following closely behind was a huge claw that spanned about 100,000 miles!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The earth shattered, and natural chasm cracks instantly spread out for millions of miles!","The dust billowed ten thousand feet.","The huge claw was practically pressing down right behind her, nearly missing her Chang Ling was already so shocked that she could not speak as she stared at this scene in a daze.","This giant claw was like a giant pillar that reached out from the clouds and easily split the earth.","The entire claw was covered in a layer of thick and dense silver-gray scales. The five claws were enough to tear five celestial rivers.","Chang Ling did not doubt in the slightest that if she did not dodge in time just now, she would have instantly died under this enormous claw swipe.","Time seemed to have stopped. She was still standing in the void, not knowing whether to escape or not.","At this moment, the clouds and smoke suddenly surged violently, and a huge beast head stretched out from within.","It had bright amber vertical pupils that were like the spring water of the Heavenly River, completely reflecting Chang Ling’s slender figure within.","This beast head looked like a dragon, but it was not a dragon. It looked like a beast, but it was not a beast. It was filled with a strange aura of chaos.","“Puny Yan Immortal, who allowed you to come here without permission?”","The loud voice was deep and suppressed the heavens and earth, making all living things tremble and bow.","Chang Ling was startled and swallowed with difficulty. “I, I just unintentionally barged into this place. I never thought that this place was a forbidden area...”","Heaven and earth were silent. The giant beast that was hidden in the clouds and smoke did not speak again. It looked at her with its eyes that were like the spring water of the Heavenly River, as if it was trying to determine whether her words were true or false.","After what seemed like an eternity, the beast spoke again. “In that case, I’ll pardon you. Leave this place immediately and don’t enter again!”","When Chang Ling heard this, she lightly exhaled. Her hanging heart also finally relaxed.","The giant beast did not intend to make things difficult for her. After warning her, it disappeared into the endless cloud of smoke.","Looking at the ground that had been torn apart for nearly a million miles, she still had a lingering fear.","That kind of oppression was truly too terrifying, to the point that even a Grand Yan Immortal was unable resist.","Everything returned to silence, as if nothing had happened.","Retracting her thoughts, Chang Ling did not dare to stay any longer, urging her body to prepare to escape this place.","However, after she turned around and took a few steps back, she stopped again, as if she was fighting something in her heart.","Then, she secretly raised her head and pretended to casually check the situation around her.","After seeing that there was nothing unusual, Chang Ling gritted her teeth and seemed to have made a decision. She suddenly turned back and prepared to enter the depths of Desolation.","However, as she turned around, another huge claw stretched out from the cloud of smoke and stood erect, blocking her path.","“I-I’ll leave now.”","Chang Ling spoke with difficulty, muttering before fleeing from the plane, Desolation.","Almost at the same time, the figure tied to the top of the divine mountain in the depths of the Desolation opened his eyes. He grunted and contemplated for a moment before falling silent again."]},{"number":5038,"title":"Chapter 5038 Meeting the Young Emperor","paragraphs":["5038 Meeting the Young Emperor","After leaving Desolation, she still had lingering fears.","She did not even want to recall that kind of soul-stirring oppression.","“What kind of place is that? Why is there such a terrifying creature there?”","She was secretly shocked because she could feel the aura of the giant beast. It was not weaker than the Grand Elders from the Ancient Era in Little World Mountain.","And at the last moment, she saw an unimaginable scene. The huge claw of the giant beast that hung down from the clouds was actually bound by tens of thousands of chains!","“Who has the strength to imprison it there? Could it be the Emperor?”","Thinking up to here, Chang Ling was shocked to the extreme. At the same time, she was even more certain that only a God Monarch had such strength.","“Could he have been imprisoned there by the Emperor?”","She gritted her teeth. Clearly, she already had an answer in her heart, but this answer was too unfair.","He was able to fight a Grand Yan Immortal under Zhen Wuyang with the power of a Yan Immortal. Just because of that, should he be banished and imprisoned?","The tallest trees in the forest would be the ones exposed to the strongest winds... Chang Ling understood this concept. However, it was also precisely because she knew that unwillingness arose in her heart again.","However, there was nothing she could do about it. She could not do anything at all. She could even enter Desolation.","Thinking of this, she sighed and returned to Little World Mountain.","“Sister Ling, I, I actually fell asleep...”","In the Little World Mountain shrouded by auspicious clouds, under the Immortal Tree, Amy lowered her head and said. Her two toot hands were placed behind her back, looking like she had done something wrong.","Chang Ling forced a smile and stretched out her slender palm to rub her head. “It’s alright, Amy. Don’t blame yourself. That place was never a place you should have gone to.”","Amy nodded and then hurriedly said, “Then, Sister Ling, did you see Big Brother Jian when you went there?”","She smiled bitterly. “I didn’t.”","Then, Chang Ling roughly told Amy about everything that happened there.","“Ah, no way. Is that place that scary?” Amy exclaimed in surprise after hearing it.","Chang Ling sighed slightly. “It’s far more terrifying than I described. Hence, it’s almost impossible to see him.”","“Then what should we do? Hopefully, nothing has happened to Big Brother Jian. Otherwise, Young Emperor...” At this point, Amy face was filled with anxiety as she paused. Then, she suddenly raised her head and looked at Chang Ling with hope in her eyes.","“Yes, Young Emperor, Brother Yan!”","Chang Ling was puzzled. “What does it have to do with the Young Emperor?”","As if grasping at a life-saving straw, Amy said, “Sister Ling, you don’t know this. Brother Jian and the Young Emperor are best friends. If the Young Emperor knows that Brother Jian is trapped in the Secret Realm of Desolation, he will definitely come to help!”","“...”","After hearing this, Chang Ling was speechless. Even though she had been cultivating and meditating in Little World Mountain since she was young, she still knew some things about the Heavenly Regions outside.","She was especially clear about the situation of the seven princes, because this was the most basic criteria for a candidate to be a Heavenly Official.","It was rumored that the eldest prince of Zhen Wuyang was the most violent and eccentric, he never befriended any Yan Immortals and even treated his six brothers as enemies.","A few years ago, Chang Ling had once looked at the eldest prince, Prince Yan, from afar. It was basically in line with the rumors. His face was pale, devilishly handsome, and eccentric and ruthless.","They were hostile towards all the Yan Immortals in the Heavenly Court.","This also caused even the elders of the Ancient Era to avoid him and give him respect.","There were even rumors that Prince Yan had fought alongside Zhen Wuyang when he was still a minor. He had even used a scheme to help Zhen Wuyang conquer the last Heavenly Court in the Great Si Region.","All these amazing feats added together caused him to be infamous. In the entire Grand Si Region and even the Heavenly Court, no Yan Immortal and Grand Yan Immortals dared to underestimate this “trashy” prince.","This was also the reason why she was surprised by what Amy said.","In her opinion, it was impossible for the First Prince, Prince Yan, to have anyone close to him, let alone a good friend.","Moreover, seeing how Jian Wushuang was severely injured and brought to the Small World Mountain by Uncle Yu alone, she did not think that there was any relationship between the two.","After thinking about it for a while, Chang Ling said, “Amy, you can’t say things carelessly. How could they be related?”","Seeing that Chang Ling did not believe her, Amy hurriedly said, “It’s true. I won’t lie to you, Sister Ling. Not long ago, Big Brother Jian came with Big Brother Yan to the Heavenly Court’s banquet. They even got the Immortal Peach from that banquet together!”","Chang Ling’s beautiful eyebrows trembled. She finally had an impression. The Immortal Peach winner from the last Heavenly Court banquet was indeed the First Prince, Prince Yan.","She also heard that Prince Yan split the Immortal Peach into two and gave the other half to a young Immortal.","Thinking of Jian Wushuang’s shocking performance in Emperor Dao Arena, Chang Ling finally believed Amy’s words.","“But, would the First Prince be willing to take the risk to save him?”","Chang Ling asked, her words filled with doubt.","Amy smiled, her big eyes narrowing into the shape of a crescent moon. “Don’t worry, Sister Ling. I can feel that Brother Yan’s feelings for Brother Jian are different. He will definitely come and save Brother Jian!”","She hesitated for a while and finally made up her mind. “Then, shall we go see the Young Emperor?”","Amy nodded desperately.","“But, the candidates for the Heavenly Official positions are not allowed to leave the Small World Mountain as they please...”","“There’s no such thing as a ‘but’, Sister Ling. I will have a way to let you leave this place.”","“Alright, alright.”","...","The clouds and smoke swirled around, and then they returned.","As if he was in a dream-like cloud, a figure leaned on the jade steps.","He was dressed in luxurious clothes with mountains and rivers painted on it, looking like a whale swallowing the sky.","Leaning on the jade steps, he was half asleep and half awake, not knowing what the flow of heaven and earth was.","In the Heavenly Palace, it was so quiet that one could hear it. There was not a single aura of a Yan Immortal.","After an unknown period of time, the tightly sealed Heavenly Palace’s gates slowly opened. Then, a thin and small purple-robed man entered the palace with light footsteps.","The thin purple-robed man quietly came to the side of the prince. He bent over and whispered, “Your Highness, there is a fairy who came to see you six days ago. She said that she has something important to discuss with Your Highness.”","The figure on the jade steps did not even open his eyes, as if he was still sleeping.","Meanwhile, the thin purple-robed man stood still and waited for a reply.","After a long time, a cold voice sounded.","“No. If she doesn’t leave, kill her.”","The thin and small man in purple nodded. He would carry out every order firmly and never asked for an explanation.","He turned around and was about to leave, but after taking a few steps, he stopped and turned around to add another sentence.","“Your Highness, that fairy is a Grand Yan Immortal. I can sense from her aura that she probably came from Little World Mountain.”","“Not interested. Ask her too leave.” The figure on the jade steps said. There was only cold killing intent in his words.","The thin and small purple robe was silent. Finally, he said, “Your Highness, it was Little Amy who asked her to come and see you.”","On the jade steps, he quietly opened his eyes, which contained supreme might."]},{"number":5039,"title":"Chapter 5039 Strong Feelings","paragraphs":["5039 Strong Feelings","Immortal clouds surged, and the Heaven Palace was solemn and grand.","This was the first time Chang Ling had truly left Little World Mountain. She was extremely nervous, but at the same time, she was filled with intense curiosity about everything.","Especially when she arrived at the Six Heavens Realm where the First Prince was, her curiosity reached its peak because she smelled the scent of destruction in the void.","Although the smell of destruction had almost disappeared, she could still sense it.","She was very curious about what the Six Heavens Realm had experienced before that it was filled with the aura of destruction.","Standing in Great Lonely Heaven and looking at the Heavenly Palace that was still tightly shut, Chang Ling was already somewhat angry.","After all, she was a Grand Yan Immortal, a first-class existence in the entire Grand Si Region. She had never thought that she would be left outside waiting at the door during their first meeting.","Although the person she was meeting was the son of the Emperor, it still made her angry.","Just as she was considering whether she should turn around and leave, the Heavenly Palace’s gate opened. The thin purple-robed man flew in front of her and was responsible for receiving her.","Suppressing the unhappiness in her heart, Chang Ling entered the Heavenly Hall.","Clouds and smoke curled up, and a slightly sweet and fishy fragrance wafted in the hall. The first time one smelled it, it made one feel uncomfortable, but one would unknowingly be immersed in it.","Chang Ling’s nose twitched slightly, clearly feeling discomfort towards this kind of strange fragrance in the hall.","After the thin purple-robed man led her into the hall, he quickly left and closed the door.","Her heart trembled, and a sense of danger welled up in her heart.","Thinking of the unreasonable and ruthless Young Emperor, she became nervous. Even though she was a Grand Yan Immortal, she had the urge to escape at any moment.","Just as she was letting her imagination run wild, a cold voice sounded. “What are you doing in Six Heavens?”","Accompanied by this voice, a figure dressed in luxurious clothes slowly walked out from the depths of the hall.","Chang Ling held her breath and became even more nervous.","Even after several years, she could still recognize the First Prince, Prince Yan.","The Young Emperor frowned slightly. Clearly, his patience was gradually running out.","“Tell me, you waited six days to see me. What do you want?”","After regaining her senses, Chang Ling said nervously, “Your Highness, I want to ask you to save a Yan Immortal.”","When he heard this, he raised his eyebrows slightly and sneered. “Do we know each other? Don’t you think it’s a little ridiculous to make such silly requests?”","Chang Ling also felt that the way she asked was a little wrong, but she still said, “Although it’s a little absurd, I believe that he’s still somewhat important to you, so please help him.”","The Young Emperor was already losing interest. He immediately turned around and waved his hand. “Not interested. You can leave now. Don’t let me see you again.”","Chang Ling was startled. She had never thought that he would be so cold and straightforward. Immediately, the suppressed resentment and unhappiness in her heart. She could not hide the anger in her voice as she said, “If I had known that you were so heartless, I wouldn’t have come here to see you even if I had to die.”","“In that case, let him die in Desolation!”","After saying that, she prepared to leave without looking back.","At this moment, the Young Emperor’s voice sounded again. “What’s his name?”","Even though Chang Ling was resentful, she still spoke. “I only know that his name has the word ‘Jian’ in it. Amy calls him Big Brother Jian.”","On the jade steps, the luxuriously dressed figure suddenly trembled. After which, he immediately leaped down the jade steps and arrived in front of Chang Ling.","Then, he reached out his hands and held her arms tightly. He almost lost his composure and said, “Jian, is his name Jian Wushuang?! Answer me!”","Chang Ling, who was shocked by the sudden change, momentarily forgot how to speak. “I-I think that’s his name, yes.”","After getting the answer, the Young Emperor’s eyes trembled. After he released his hand, he sat down on the jade steps as if he had been drained of all his strength.","Looking at the huge change in demeanor, Chang Ling was shocked. At the same time, the anxiety in her heart was finally settled.","She asked, “Are you going to save her or not?”","The dejected Young Emperor slowly raised his head and looked at her. “You came from Little World Mountain? Tell me everything about him. Don’t hide anything.”","Chang Ling nodded and told him everything that had happened since the first time she met Jian Wushuang.","“That’s all I know. After that, I tried to enter Desolationo to find him, but I failed. That’s why I came to you.”","She took a deep breath and said. Then, she looked at the Young Emperor sincerely. “Please save him.”","The Young Emperor’s back was facing her, and he was motionless like a statue.","After a long time, he slowly turned around. A complicated and scrutinizing look flashed in his eyes. “What’s your relationship with him?”","Chang Ling was startled, clearly not realizing that his line of questioning would actually be so strange.","“Uh, we’ve only met by chance. We’ve only met once. We can only be considered ordinary friends.”","“Ordinary friends?” The Young Emperor smiled faintly. “Would an ordinary friend be willing to put herself in danger? Why would you secretly leave Little World Mountain to ask for the help of a Yan Immortal that you’ve only met once?”","Chang Ling was speechless, not knowing how to answer for a moment.","The Young Emperor smiled faintly as he stepped forward.","Chang Ling continuously retreated, incomparably nervous.","He slowly bent over, and his eyes revealed a seductive charm. “Since you’re from Little World Mountain and a Grand Yan Immortal, you must be a candidate for the Heavenly Official position of the Emperor’s sons, right?”","“W-what do you want to do?”","Unknowingly, Chang Ling was pressed against the stone pillar.","“Me? Of course, I want many things.” The Young Emperor smiled wickedly. “I already have someone in mind for the position of Great Heavenly Official, and it will never change. However, you are to my liking, and I don’t want to give up.”","“So I want to ask you, are you willing to be the Empress? My Imperial Empress.”","The Divine Sense in her mind seemed to have exploded with ten thousand tons of lightning. At this moment, Chang Ling’s mind was completely blank.","She had never thought that the Young Emperor would say such words to her on their first meeting.","Ridiculous, this was simply too absurd!","While she was still in shock, the Young Emperor reached out his palm and lifted her beautiful jaw.","Chang Ling instantly became clear-headed, and her face also turned cold. Facing the Young Emperor who was taking advantage of her, she directly stretched out her hand and slapped him.","However, before the slap landed, the Young Emperor raised his hand to stop it.","“Don’t let your palm strike a prince. The consequences are far beyond what you can bear.”","Chang Ling hesitated. Ever since she had gained sentience, she had been cultivating and meditating in Little World Mountain. Everything she had was given to her by the Emperor.","Naturally, the orders coming from the Emperor and his sons could not be disobeyed.","And now, as the Crown Prince, Prince Yan could do anything he wanted to her. She did not dare to disobey.","Even if she was a Grand Yan Immortal, she did not dare to disobey.","Looking at Chang Ling, who chose to endure it silently, the Young Emperor raised his eyebrows and smiled. Then, without any warning, he leaned over and kissed her on the lips."]},{"number":5040,"title":"Chapter 5040 Entering Desolation","paragraphs":["5040 Entering Desolation","Chang Ling’s pupils instantly dilated, and the corners of her ears were red as if they were about to drip blood.","That was because he was overly nervous.","The black hair merged together, covering everything that had happened.","Chang Ling’s clear Divine Sense collapsed in an instant. This kind of impact was truly too great to her, causing her mind’s Divine Sense to go blank.","His attitude was borderline rude and unexpected, breaking all her defenses, including her sense of shame.","That feeling was passionate and terrifying, but he did not know how to resist it.","At this moment, the door of the Heavenly Palace opened. The thin purple-robed man stretched out his body to check the situation in the palace. When he saw the intimate scene, he consciously retracted his body and closed the door.","Chang Ling finally regained her senses. A great sense of humiliation and hatred flashed across her eyes. Then, she used her pearly white teeth and bit down forcefully like a little beast.","Dark red divine blood flowed down her mouth, and a line of blood flowed down her beautiful jaw.","The Young Emperor opened his eyes, exuding a supreme cold aura.","Chang Ling retreated, her back against the stone pillar. She looked at him with a humiliated gaze, without any worry or fear.","The wound on the Young Emperor’s thin lips also healed in an instant.","It was as if nothing had happened, and his gaze returned to its cold, distant look.","After tidying up his messy clothes, the Young Emperor said calmly, “Just pretend that nothing happened. If word gets out, I’ll take your life.”","Chang Ling’s body trembled, and the humiliation in her eyes was completely replaced by anger. She sneered, and she did not even bother to wipe the divine blood from the corner of her mouth. “You were the one who took advantage of me first, but you’re using this to threaten me?”","“Even if you’re the First Prince, I don’t believe that the Emperor would be so biased!”","When the Young Emperor heard this, he smiled. “It won’t do you any good to spread the word. It’s fine as long as you and I know about it. If you want to be my Empress, that’s another matter.”","“Dream on. Even if I die, I will never be your Empress!” Chang Ling angrily said.","He seemed to be uninterested in this and turned around to walk into the depths of the Heavenly Palace.","“Are you going to save him or not?” Chang Ling gritted her teeth and said anxiously.","“I’ll save him. You don’t have to meddle in the matters between us.” After he finished speaking, his figure disappeared into the depths of the hall.","Chang Ling stomped her feet in anger, wishing she could eat him alive.","“Damn it, not only is he frivolous and lecherous, but he’s also so perverse and violent. Whoever becomes his Heavenly Official in the future will definitely not have a good ending!!”","The Heavenly Palace’s gates opened again. She did not want to stay any longer. She left the Heavenly Palace and waited in Great Lonely Heaven.","“Your Highness, you shouldn’t have treated the Heavenly Official candidate like that. If she returned to Little World Mountain and spoke a few more words to the Emperor, I’m afraid...”","The thin purple-robed man did not continue.","The Young Emperor said, “Don’t worry. She won’t say a word. I did that to her because... Well, there’s a reason.”","“Also, Wushuang came out of the Endless Sea alive, but he should be imprisoned Desolation by the Imperial Father.”","The originally extremely calm skinny purple-robed man’s body suddenly trembled when he heard this. His turbid eyes were filled with disbelief.","“Lord, Lord Jian... He actually returned alive from the Endless Sea...”","“Don’t tell anyone about this, especially those from Little Lonely Heaven. Don’t let them know.”","The thin and small violet-robed man nodded in agreement and retreated out of the Heavenly Hall.","This time, he did not let Chang Ling wait outside for too long before the Young Emperor walked out of the Heavenly Hall.","What surprised her was that this time, he did not wear luxurious clothes that depicted mountains and rivers. Instead, he changed into a plain and casual outfit.","Moreover, his long hair was no longer draped over his shoulders. Instead, his hair was casually tied behind him with a golden string, giving off an indescribable warmth.","“Let’s go. You’re in charge of leading the way.” The Young Emperor placed his hands behind his back, and his voice was cold and distant. “Also, don’t look at me like that. It’s an insult to the Emperor.”","Chang Ling grit her teeth so hard that her silver teeth were about to shatter. She practically used all her strength to fiercely glare at him before she angrily charged out of Great Lonely Heaven.","The two figures were like two streams of starlight, quickly disappearing into the depths of the void.","“Are you sure that Wushuang is imprisoned in Desolation?”","“I’m not too sure, but there’s a high possibility. I can’t go in and check, it’s too dangerous.”","On the way, the Young Emperor frowned. He had only heard of Desolation, but he was sure that it was the Zhen Wuyang’s Emperor’s Realm. It was extremely mysterious.","Furthermore, the number of Yan Immortals who knew about that place was extremely few.","If Jian Wushuang really walked out of the Endless Sea and was detected by Zhen Wuyang, it was very likely that he was imprisoned in Desolation.","Desolation was mysterious. No Yan Immortal knew what was hidden there. It was a place of great mystery.","However, even so, the Young Emperor still planned to venture into Desolation alone.","Desolation was an unnamed world. It was impossible to find the entrance from the outside world. One could only enter from Little World Mountain.","As for Little World Mountain, it was where Zhen Wuyang and the group of elders lived. Outsiders would probably be discovered as soon as they stepped into the place.","However, the Young Emperor did not care about this. He did not even bother to conceal his aura as he entered Little World Mountain.","“Hey, restrain yourself. We’re going to save him. If we’re discovered before we even enter, won’t it be a waste of our efforts?” Chang Ling’s heart was broken as she persuaded him nicely.","The Young Emperor glanced at her from the corner of his eyes and continued walking forward.","Chang Ling gritted her teeth, but she had no choice but to quickly head to Desolation.","“This is Desolation?”","He was a little surprised. Although he had heard of it, he still had a vague idea of where Desolation really was.","Chang Ling nodded and did not say much. She entered first without any hesitation.","Upon seeing this scene, a complicated look flashed across the depths of the Young Emperor’s eyes. After a moment of silence, he stepped in as well.","The desolate silence was the unchanging main color of Desolation. Even time would become meaningless here.","The mist mixed with gray and black threads almost covered the entire world. The visibility was less than a thousand miles.","In this place, desolation and deathly stillness accompanied each other.","“Pay attention, there is a huge beast in the clouds. Even I am no match for it.”","Looking around, Chang Ling reminded in a low voice, not even daring to breathe loudly.","The Young Emperor glanced at her from the corner of his eyes. “Since you’re no match for the beast, why did you come here to die?”","“I...” For a moment, she was speechless. For some reason, she felt that his comment made sense.","A moment later, she came to her senses and said angrily, “None of your business! I don’t believe you can defeat it!”","He did noto argue and walked forward alone. His eyes turned sharp in an instant.","When he had entered this place, he had sensed a powerful aura that was faintly discernible but could not be ignored.","This aura was beyond imagination, it was not something a Yan Immorotal could contend against.","However, he continued to move forward resolutely."]},{"number":5041,"title":"Chapter 5041 The Beast in the Prison","paragraphs":["5041 The Beast in the Prison","Chang Ling pursed her thin lips, thinking about whether to leave here or move forward together.","At this moment, she had no power to influence anything, but she still persisted.","Even she herself did not know what benefits these things would bring her.","However, when she thought of the amazing talent that Jian Wushuang had displayed in the Dao Arena and the miserable situation that he had to face, she could not bear it.","Although Chang Ling firmly believed that the Emperor would not be jealous of talent, Jian Wushuang’s performance back then was too shocking. He was able to defeat a Grand Yan Immortal with just the power of a Yan Immortal. This was an unprecedented talent.","From the Emperor’s perspective, even if he was not imprisoned or sealed, killing him was an acceptable outcome.","To Chang Ling, A rare genius with an unimaginable cultivation path should not die in silence like this.","Chang Ling’s gaze gradually became firm, and then she also walked forward resolutely.","The Young Emperor ignored her and moved forward.","“You can’t do this. It’s easy for that big guy to discover you,” Chang Ling advised worriedly.","In the next moment, layers of clouds and mist were pushed aside, and an eye several times larger than the giant sun quietly opened.","The pure amber color was like the tranquil spring water of the Heavenly River. The vertical pupil in the center was pitch-black to the extreme, completely reflecting the figures of the Young Emperor and Chang Ling.","They gulped at the same time and slowly retreated.","“Yan Immortal, this isn’t a place you can enter. Leave quickly and I’ll spare your lives.”","In the clouds, the giant beast issued a warning.","Chang Ling’s gaze was solemn, already not knowing whether to fight or retreat.","The Young Emperor quickly regained his composure. Facing the giant beast, he said solemnly, “I came to this world to find a Yan Immortal. As long as I find him, I will leave immediately.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the clouds and smoke in the void swept violently. An unimaginably large beast head poked out from the clouds and smoke. There was only endless dignity left in its huge sun-like eyes.","“Not allowed!”","Loud sounds rang out, the sense of suppression almost rendering them powerless.","The Young Emperor’s expression turned cold. “What if I insist on entering?”","“Then you’ll stay here forever.” The head of a beast that looked like a dragon descended from the sky with endless might.","The distance between the two was less than a thousand feet.","He smiled wickedly, his eyes sharp. “Then I’ll teach you a lessoon today!”","After he finished speaking, boundless power exploded, shaking the heavens and earth, instantly tearing apart all the clouds and mist.","At the same time, a beam of light shot out. It contained billions of terrifying energy and stabbed at the giant beast’s eye chakra.","“You dare provoke me?”","The giant beast was furious. It had never thought that an ant-like fellow would attack him.","It was completely enraged, and a desolate aura gushed out of its nose.","The extremely pure flash, no matter how sharp it was, could not blind the eyes of the giant beast. It even shattered after colliding with the desolate aura.","As for the Young Emperor, he had been waiting for this opportunity. Almost at the instant the radiance bloomed, his figure had already shot out 10,000 feet!","Chang Ling also reacted at the right time, her gaze resolute as she released her Yan power.","The Yan power was like a waterfall, sweeping through the air and coiling around the head of the giant beast in an instant.","“You’re courting death!” the beast roared.","The giant beast was furious. Its loud voice was like layers of vortexes erupting, easily shattering the energy pillar.","Chang Ling also retreated 10,000 feet, the blood in her Immortal body churned, but she did not stop. She flew up again, and endless energy streams escaped from her hands.","She was buying time for the Young Emperor!","Their eyes met. The Young Emperor turned around to look at her, then quickly flew into the depths of Desolation.","But in the next moment, the chaotic clouds suddenly broke apart, and a huge claw that covered the sky descended.","The giant claw was too huge. It could cover a hundred thousand miles of the world and block the Young Emperor’s path.","He was shocked, and the flexible sword in his hand stabbed towards the giant claw.","However, this sword strike only destroyed hundreds of scales and was unable to shake the giant claw at all.","The Young Emperor frowned. He knew that he could not take it head-on. He made a prompt decision and ran in another direction.","At the same time, Chang Ling was resisting the attack of the giant beast’s head with great difficulty. Although she was already a Grand Yan Immortal, she still found it difficult to put up a fight against this ancient beast.","Every breath of the giant beast gave her immense pressure.","She understood that she should hold on for another ten breaths.","“Mischievous people will have to pay the price!” The giant beast let out a terrifying sound. The loud sound carried with it a scorching breath, completely enveloping Chang Ling.","She groaned as her energy was cut off in an instant.","Then, a giant claw bound by nearly a thousand black chains stretched out from the cloud and smoke, grabbing Chang Ling.","She instantly felt that her Immortal body was about to shatter, and her Yan power was completely blocked by some unknown force.","Furthermore, the huge claw that was wrapped around the chain was constantly tightening its grip.","“I have tried to dissuade you again and again, but you still refuse to repent. Since that is the case, then you’ll fall into my stomach today.”","The giant beast said in a deep voice. Then, it opened its huge mouth that was enough to swallow the countless Heavenly Rivers.","Chang Ling was in despair, but she was completely unable to control her own fate. She could only helplessly fall into that huge mouth.","In the next moment, something unexpected happened!","Thousands of extremely pure Yan power streams broke through the layers of clouds and mist, wrapping around Chang Ling’s Immortal body. Then, they quickly withdrew, saving her from the mouth of the giant beast at the critical moment.","Chang Ling was shocked, and her mind went blank. When she finally reacted, she realized that it was the First Prince, Prince Yan, who had saved her!","“How dare you?!” The giant beast was completely enraged, and its giant claws, which were completely bound by chains, came crashing down.","The Young Emperor was extremely calm in the face of this overwhelming power. “I’ll stay here. You go and find Jian Wushuang. Remember, if you dare spout nonsense to him, I’ll kill you.”","After saying this last sentence, he pushed Chang Ling, sending her a million feet away.","Then, he resolutely faced the giant beast.","The power that covered the sky easily shattered the Young Emperor’s power.","The giant claw clenched and completely restrained him, making him unable to move at all.","“Puny ant, how dare you come here?” the giant beast roared in a deep voice. Its huge sun-like pupils reflected his already red face.","“Did you call me an ant? In front of me, you are the one who’s the little ant!” the Young Emperor said with difficulty. Due to the immense force, a wisp of divine blood flowed out of the corner of his mouth. It was seven-colored divine blood.","“Hmm?”","At this moment, the giant beast’s eyes widened, and its vertical pupils constricted. “Imperial Emperor’s blood? You belong to the Emperor’s lineage?”","The Young Emperor looked at him coldly, his eyes filled with contempt and disdain.","In the next moment, the giant beast laughed loudly. Its huge sun-like eyes were filled with the joy of revenge.","“It’s a pleasure to be fed with someone from the Emperor’s bloodline. You must be one of Zhen Wuyang’s princes. I’ll let him have a taste of the pain of losing a son!”","The Young Emperor was shocked. He had not expected such an outcome."]},{"number":5042,"title":"Chapter 5042 Boy With the Green Bull","paragraphs":["5042 Boy With the Green Bull","Not only was the Prison Dragon not afraid of his Emperor’s bloodline, but it was also prepared to devour him.","However, the Young Emperor was powerless to turn the situation around. He could only watch helplessly as he fell into the giant mouth.","However, he did not intend to die. Almost at the same time, an extreme stream of light bloomed from his palm.","It was a sword, a flexible sword that had never left his body.","The flexible sword carried an immense force, and it was like a dazzling light that contained endless charm.","Then, it shot up and went straight for the giant beast’s eye.","As everything happened too quickly, the beast was so engrossed in devouring the Young Emperor that it did not notice it in time.","By the time it noticed, it was already too late!","The endless power gathered at one point and then released completely. This was undoubtedly terrifying.","The seven-colored energy burst out instantly. The soft sword pierced into the eye chakra of the giant beast, unleashing extreme radiance.","At this moment, the giant beast howled in pain, and even the void was shattered.","Its giant claws also loosened.","The Young Emperor took this opportunity to escape without any hesitation.","The void was cracking, and endless clouds were surging violently.","“I’m going to kill you!!!”","The giant beast roared furiously. Its right eye had already dimmed. In the center of its pupil, a soft sword was firmly embedded, and endless streams of light surged out from the wound.","Facing the Young Emperor who was trying to escape, it opened its huge mouth, and an ancient, desolate, and deathly aura gushed out.","That was the power of great fate energy. It could not be carried by any medium. Once it appeared, it could not be avoided and could only be endured.","The Young Emperor, who was flying through the void, felt that his Immortal body was instantly augmented by some strange force, which directly caused his Immortal body to shatter and his meridians to shrink.","He did not even have the time to activate the last wisp of Yan power before he coughed out a mouthful of divine blood and fell headfirst into the void.","At this critical moment, Chang Ling appeared quietly. She reached out to support the falling body of the Young Emperor and then flew into the depths of Desolution without looking back.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The void and the earth trembled.","Then, a shocking scene appeared.","The cloud of smoke that filled the entire void surged violently at this moment and then disappeared.","When the cloud of smoke completely disappeared, the giant beast hidden in the cloud of smoke completely appeared.","Its body was almost endless. Its dragon-like body was covered in silver-gray scales that almost pierced through the sky of Desolation.","At the same time, chains that could tear a Heavenly Region pierced through its body and bound it firmly in the sky.","This scene was too shocking and depressing.","Chang Ling looked at the body of the giant beasts that filled the sky. Her state of mind had already fallen to rock bottom, but she did not give up. Carrying the Young Emperor on her back, she flew under the void.","The giant beast had lost one of its eyes and had gone completely crazy. It ignored the chains that had pierced through its body and moved its four claws at the same time.","At this moment, the chains that imprisoned the giant beast were all stretched taut, so much so that even the void was destroyed.","Desolation shook, and Chang Ling was extremely shocked.","This was the first time she had encountered a life-and-death crisis since she was young. She was almost unable to make any effective judgments and could only watch the huge claw come down.","“Listen, throw me away. You should escape first...”","A weak voice sounded. The Young Emperor, who was covered in blood, barely opened his eyes and said.","Hearing the familiar voice behind her, Chang Ling calmed down.","She gritted her teeth and said, “That’s impossible. I won’t leave you alone. To Heavenly Officials, this is the most basic rule.”","“You’re just a candidate. Which Emperor would want you?”","“... Shut up if you don’t want to die. If you say one more word, I’ll leave you here!”","Chang Ling’s expression calmed down. She turned around to look, and the giant claw was already within reach.","With a quick thought, she turned around resolutely and released all of her Yan power, clashing with the giant claw!","Boom!!!","Heaven and earth shook, and the light of the Yan power splashed everywhere.","However, this Grand Yan Immortal’s full-powered attack only managed to block the giant claw for an instant before disappearing.","Bang!","A loud sound resounded, the huge claw ruthlessly slapped at Chang Ling.","She suddenly spat out a mouthful of divine blood and was slapped down into the void.","At this moment, the world fell silent.","The moment she fell to the ground, she felt a soft groan from her lower body, and then there was no more sound.","Lying on the barren land, Chang Ling’s eyes were empty. Her Immortal body was shattered and was no longer enough to support her movements.","Looking at the approaching giant claw, she sighed and closed her eyes.","However, the destruction of body and soul that she had imagined did not happen. In fact, there was no pain.","Chang Ling slowly opened her eyes, shocked to the extreme.","She realized that the giant claw did not descend. Instead, it was hovering in the air, unable to descend even an inch.","This was because of the chains, which completely restricted the movements of the giant beast.","It was unwilling and furious. It almost tore the sky apart, but it was useless.","Chang Ling laughed, and before she knew it, she fainted.","...","Desolation was silent.","After an unknown period of time, she was jolted awake when she heard a slight rustling sound.","Then, she saw a huge and sturdy Green Bull.","“Moo-”","The Green Bull let out a muffled cry, then stared at Chang Ling with its large watery eyes and tilted its head.","She was shocked. Then, as if she had thought of something, she hurriedly looked down. Only then did she see that the Young Emperor’s figure was almost completely embedded in the ground.","Chang Ling secretly knew that things were not good and hurriedly released her Yan power to protect his Immortal body before letting out a long breath.","“How did you guys come here?”","A crisp child’s voice rang out without any warning.","Chang Ling raised her head and only then did she notice that on that broad and sturdy back of the Green Bull, there was actually a child wearing a bamboo hat. He was lying down on the ox.","He lay on the back of the Green Bull, his hands supporting his head as he looked at her gently.","Their eyes met. Chang Ling was extremely nervous. She did not believe that a little boy riding an ox would appear in this terrifying world.","This was too strange and unbelievable.","“How did you guys come here? This place is very dangerous.”","On the back of the Green Bull, the small child repeated what he said earlier. His gaze was still gentle as he looked at Chang Ling, waiting for an answer with extreme patience.","Although she was at a loss, she quickly calmed down, “We are here to find a Yan Immortal. After we find him, we will leave immediately and will not stay here.”","The child continued, “Oh, then do you know where the Yan Immortal you’re looking for is? If you don’t know where he is, it would be difficult to find.”","Chang Ling was speechless. She was not even sure that Jian Wushuang was imprisoned in Desolation, let alone confirm his exact location.","However, she was not in a hurry to speak. Instead, she focused her gaze on the child lying on the Green Bull.","For some reason, she had a feeling that this little boy seemed to know something."]},{"number":5043,"title":"Chapter 5043 Crossing the Heavenly River","paragraphs":["5043 Crossing the Heavenly River","It was impossible for a harmless little boy to exist in Desolation, which was a world that had been silent for countless years.","Now that such a situation had occurred, it was even more suspicious.","This had to make Chang Ling speculate more, because it was really too out of common sense.","She began to think about how to retreat.","Seeing that she did not speak, the little boy who was lying on the back of the green bull suddenly sat up straight. His pair of dark and bright eyes looked straight at Chang Ling. “Are you afraid of me?”","She remained silent, not knowing how to answer.","At this moment, an angry voice sounded, “Get lost!”","Chang Ling turned pale with fright. Only now did she remember that she was still pressing down on the Young Emperor and hurriedly stood up to retreat.","“S-Sorry...” Her face flushed red as she spoke in embarrassment.","The Young Emperor sat up abruptly and looked at her with cold killing intent. “If there’s a next time, I’ll take your life!”","Chang Ling knew that she was in the wrong and could not argue, she could only sulk.","Then, he propped himself up and stood up with difficulty. He was almost on the verge of collapsing.","It was only at this moment that the Young Emperor saw a boy riding a bull behind him.","He subconsciously touched his waist, only to realize that his soft sword had been left in the beast’s eyes.","“Who are you?”","The Young Emperor slowly retreated and stared at the child on the back of the Green Bull.","“Can’t you tell? I’m a cow herder,” the little boy said crisply.","He was stunned. Herding cows? Herding cows in Desolation?","This was unbelievable.","“What, you don’t believe me?” the little boy spoke again.","The cautious and suspicious Young Emperor did not say much. Instead, he was thinking about how to leave.","At this moment, Chang Ling opened her mouth, “Yes, of course I do. It’s just that it’s so dangerous here, how did you manage to survive until now?”","When the little boy heard this, he took off the bamboo hat on his head. “No, I’ve always been here alone. Well, I guess I also have this bull as company. We’ve always been like this. How could there be any danger?””","Chang Ling and the Young Emperor were slightly startled, and they were beginning to have doubts.","Just the giant beast that almost killed them could prove that Desolation was not simple.","However, when she saw the serious look on the little boy’s face, she was puzzled.","At this moment, the Young Emperor dragged his Immortal body that had yet to recover and left.","Seeing this scene, Chang Ling also subconsciously wanted to follow, but she stopped in her tracks, somewhat at a loss.","“Who are you looking for?”","The small child leaped down from the back of the Green Bull and landed steadily on the ground. He raised his head and looked sincerely at Chang Ling.","She hesitated for a moment before saying softly, “Have you seen a young Immortal here? The kind with a unique aura, the kind that’s unforgettable.”","When the child heard this, he grinned, “I have never seen him before. I said that ever since I had spiritual consciousness, there was only me and a Green Bull here. There were no other Yan Immortals.”","Chang Ling was speechless. She really wanted to retort and prove that there was no one else here, but she felt that there was no need.","She forced a smile. “In that case, I shall not bother you any longer. I’ll go and look for him alone.”","After Chang Ling finished speaking, she nodded slightly and continued forward.","The boy turned his head and looked at the figure that had disappeared into the distance. “I’ll search with you.”","Just as Chang Ling was about to decline, she realized that the GrBen bull had already come to her side. It raised its head and let out a heavy voice, as if it was urging her to move forward.","“Moo-”","She was helpless, but seeing that Green Bull Boy had no ill intentions, she decided to go together.","In the vast expansive world, the ancient clouds and mist could not be dispersed. Everything was occupied by desolation and loneliness. Time had long lost its meaning.","In this world, the only real thing was loneliness.","“Moo-”","...","His body was covered in blood, and his white clothes were stained. His thin and weak figure was on the verge of collapse, as if he could fall at any time.","However, he was extremely tenacious. Although he was on the verge of collapse, he still moved forward firmly.","Chang Ling followed closely behind, maintaining a distance that was not too close. She wanted to step forward to support him, but she was also somewhat afraid.","Looking at that determined figure, the impression she had deep down in her heart had quietly changed.","At the same time, she had many doubts in her heart. The Young Emperor did not seem to be as unreasonable, violent, and unreasonable as the rumors said. Although he was a little frivolous and lecherous, he was still approachable.","Chang Ling let her imagination run wild as she followed him unhurriedly into the depths of Desolation.","There was no sound except for the low cry of the Green Bull.","After an unknown period of time, a Heavenly River blocked their path.","The width of the Heavenly River almost split Desolation into two.","The dark and lightless celestial river was like a void that had been silent for thousands of years, enough to devour everything.","Chang Ling also caught up to him, standing beside this boundless river, her gaze somewhat solemn.","Just as she was thinking about how to cross the Heavenly River, the Young Emperor did not hesitate to fly into the sky.","Then, his Immortal body’s injuries were far from recovering. Coupled with his dizzy mind, he directly fell into the Heavenly River after flying less than a hundred miles.","There were no splashes. It was as if he had directly fused into it, which was extremely strange.","Seeing this scene, Chang Ling trembled. In shock, she did not have time to think and also flew into the river.","However, an even more bizarre scene appeared. Almost at the same time she stepped on the river, her Immortal body lost control and she could noot use the Yan power in her meridians at all.","The river below her had an indescribable and irresistible suction force that made her, as a Grand Yan Immortal, unable to cross it.","In an instant, she followed in the footsteps of the Young Emperor and fell straight into the river. There was not even a single splash.","A faint sigh came from the shore. The little boy sitting on the back of the Green Bull shook his head. There was an old look in his eyes that did not match his appearance.","Then, facing the boundless Heavenly River, he rode down on his bull.","The green bull raised its head and mooed. Then, its huge body swam on the surface of the water and actually did not sink.","It was like a lone boat, moving forward in the Heavenly River.","The little boy riding on the back of the Green Bull seemed to be used to it, driving the bull under him to cross slowly.","When it passed by the place where they landed, the Green Bull’s head dived down and then an unconscious figure appeared.","The little boy stretched out his hand to receive it, then placed the unconscious Chang Ling on the bull’s back and continued forward.","After a few dozen breaths, the Young Emperor’s figure was also found and placed on the back of the Green Bull.","It was like sitting in a lonely boat, moving forward alone.","At the end of the Heavenly River, the barren mountains that towered into the sky were filled with a silent and desolate aura.","The Green Bull surfaced and stood on the shore.","The little boy patted its horns, turned around, and gently waved his hand, placing the Young Emperor and Chang Ling on the ground."]},{"number":5044,"title":"Chapter 5044 Canghai Bracelet","paragraphs":["5044 Canghai Bracelet","They were all drowned in the Heavenly River and had passed out. It seemed that they would not wake up for a short time.","Sitting on the back of the Green Bull, the little boy stared at them and let out another faint sigh.","Then, he stretched out his small hand and touched the Green Bull’s neck.","There was a black and silver collar.","He took off the collar on the Green Bull’s neck and threw it at the Young Emperor.","The collar shrank in the wind. When it landed beside the Young Emperor, it had already become the size of a bracelet and was wrapped around his wrist.","After doing all this, the little boy did not stay any longer. He clamped his legs on the cow’s belly and turned around to swim into the river.","Everything returned to silence.","After an unknown amount of time, Chang Ling who was lying on the shore was the first to wake up. Her beautiful eyes were filled with lingering fear and panic.","When she saw that she was out of danger and had come ashore, she heaved a sigh of relief.","“Hmm, First Prince?”","At this moment, the Young Emperor was lying beside her. His handsome face was stained with blood, making him look even colder and weaker.","Chang Ling gulped subconsciously, then stretched out her slender palm, preparing to put him into a comfortable position.","However, when her palm was about to touch the Young Emperor, he suddenly opened his eyes.","When their eyes met, Chang Ling’s face turned red and she hurriedly withdrew her hand. “No, it’s not what you think...”","The Young Emperor glared at her coldly and propped himself up. Then, he said in a deep voice, “Know your place. You’re just a candidate for the Heavenly Official position. Don’t do anything out of line.”","Chang Ling was startled, the depths of her eyes revealing a dejected humiliation, tears filling her eyes.","No matter what she did, the Young Emperor stood up and headed straight for the depths of the mountain.","The barren mountain was silent, like a demon god standing tall.","For some reason, the Young Emperor suddenly had a strong and familiar intuition. It was indescribable, but it made his heart beat faster.","Somehow, he realized that he was getting closer and closer.","There were many barren mountains and clouds.","He had never been so anxious before. Even though his body was still on the verge of shattering, he was still moving forward with all his might.","One barren mountain after another was left behind, but there were even more barren mountains in front of him, blocking everything.","“Wushuang, Jian Wushuang–”","He simply shouted loudly, his voice echoing in the barren mountain.","As if he had been sleeping for billions of years, his soul had fallen into an ethereal state. On the peak of the divine mountain in the center, a figure imprisoned by tens of thousands of fate chains slowly opened his eyes.","His eyes were dark red, as if he had been asleep for countless years. They were filled with desolation and loneliness.","He heard a familiar voice and a familiar name.","“Jian Wushuang, why do I have a familiar feeling about this name?”","The figure bound by the chains was confused. He felt that the Divine Sense in his mind was fragmented, and his memories were fragmented. He could only vaguely remember everything.","But the next moment, the wind and clouds dispersed.","As a thin figure covered in blood appeared, his shattered spiritual will memories began to tremble violently.","“Wu, Wushuang!”","His body trembled, almost on the verge of collapsing. However, he stood firmly in the void, his eyes filled with disbelief.","When Chang Ling, who had arrived shortly after, saw this scene, she also exclaimed in her heart. Her eyes were filled with disbelief.","This scene was too shocking and depressing.","On the peak of the divine mountain, nearly ten thousand black-gold chains containing supreme fate descended from the void, and they were firmly binding someone.","Fate energy interweaved, causing him to be imprisoned in the mountains.","Their eyes met, and the corners of the Young Emperor’s eyes trembled.","Then, he did not stop and directly leaped forward.","However, at the same time, nearly 10,000 chains emitted boundless brilliance at the same time, isolating all external forces.","Standing outside the enchantment, the Young Emperor punched the barrier in an attempt to break it.","Jian Wushuang, who was bound by the fate energy ghains, looked at him again and asked, “Who are you?”","His body trembled, and there was only disbelief in his eyes. “You don’t remember me?!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with pain and confusion. The memories of his Divine Sense had been shattered in the battle.","Therefore, although he still retained his memories, they had already become fragmented and could not be connected at all.","He only had an impression of the Young Emperor, but he could not recognize him at all.","“You are my old friend?”","The corners of the Young Emperor’s eyes trembled slightly, and a hint of sadness flashed in his eyes. “How could you not remember me?”","Chang Ling also came to the barrier. Looking at Jian Wushuang who was imprisoned by countless chains, she thought of Jian Wushuang who had fought against Qing Shan in the Emperor’s Dao Arena.","Compared to the two, the situation was miserable.","There was only shock and sadness in her eyes.","Jian Wushuang stopped talking and slowly closed his dark red chaotic True Eyes.","The fate energy chains binding him were formed by the Emperor’s Great Dao. It was impossible to break them.","Outside the barrier, the Young Emperor, who was less than ten steps away from him, had a determined look in his eyes.","“I’ll take you away.” He only said this sentence before he used all his strength to smash the barrier.","His trusty soft sword had already been lost. He simply turned his palm into a fist and smashed down, again and again.","However, with the power of the Yan Immortal, how could it destroy the Emperor’s fate energy?","Divine blood splattered everywhere. His palm had already been shattered by the repeated attacks.","Chang Ling could not bear to watch any longer and wanted to attack the barrier together.","“Get lost!” The Young Emperor’s voice was filled with anger. His gaze towards her was ice-cold.","She gritted her teeth and finally retreated dejectedly.","He ordered Chang Ling to retreat and continued to attack the barrier, as if he did not know pain or fatigue.","However, his power was too insignificant in front of the Emperor’s fate energy. It did nothing at all.","“Give up, you can’t break it.” Jian Wushuang spoke slowly, his eyes calm.","Boom!","When the last punch landed, the fist bone shattered, and the Immortal bone fragments broke through his skin, revealing a hideous sight.","Divine blood splattered in the air.","The Young Emperor’s entire right fist was shattered, but he was expressionless.","The divine blood flowed along his palm and quietly gathered on his wrist.","In an instant, the black-silver bracelet emitted a warm and beautiful light. The sealed patterns on it were soaked in the divine blood and lit up.","The lines were like a barren mountain with layers of clouds, but also like a vast sea that suddenly rose, magnificent and not to be looked at directly.","Under the influence of the Young Emperor’s divine blood, the patterns were completely unsealed, and the entire black-silver bracelet turned dark red.","Then, it left his wrist and flew into the void.","Thousands of strands of light scattered on the peak of the divine mountain like the purest tassels.","It was as if an ancient bell was ringing in the wilderness, the loud sound was deep and clear."]},{"number":5045,"title":"Chapter 5045 Wandering for Ten Thousand Years","paragraphs":["5045 Wandering for Ten Thousand Years","The bracelet that contained the barren mountains and the vast sea shone with endless brilliance.","At this moment, the barrier condensed from the Emperor’s fate actually shattered and dissipated.","As the barrier collapsed, nearly 10,000 fate energy chains trembled.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and stared at the mysterious bracelet in the void above his head with his chaotic dark-red True Eyes.","He could feel that the chains binding him were beginning to loosen.","The Young Emperor did not take a single step back as he watched this scene nervously. He also had a feeling that all the restrictions were dissipating!","Whoosh...","It was as if the sea had been overturned and the water had retreated.","All the fate energy chains were trembling.","Then, all the chains shattered!","The void trembled and the divine mountain shook.","When all the chains shattered, the bracelet suspended in the void began to shrink rapidly and fell in front of Jian Wushuang.","Just like before, the bracelet was placed on his wrist.","The world was silent, and an unprecedented surge of fate energy erupted from Jian Wushuang’s body.","That was the Emperor’s fate energy!","It was the broken and slumbering fate energy of Emperor Zhen Wu!","“Ugh-”","He cried out in pain, and his entire Immortal body was once again enveloped by the terrifying Emperor’s fate energy.","Under the impact of the providence, the Young Emperor and Chang Ling were forced back 30,000 meters, unable to get close at all.","The entire dark and desolate Deserted World was illuminated.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang was in extreme pain. He felt his Immortal body shattering inch by inch and being reconstructed very quickly.","In his round pupils, chaotic dark red and clarity were constantly alternating, and the fragmented Divine Sense was also being reconstructed with difficulty.","This process was destined to be painful and long.","Jian Wushuang stumbled and lost control of his brilliant Immortal body. He crashed into the divine mountain.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The momentum exploded, and the barren mountains were shattered and collapsed.","The Deserted World was shaking, as if it was on the verge of collapse.","Wiping away the divine blood at the corner of his mouth, the Young Emperor leaped forward.","Chang Ling gritted her teeth and followed.","He saw Jian Wushuang lying in the rubble of the mountain.","As his body swayed, he rushed over and reached out to help him up.","Even though his Yan power was exhausted, the Young Emperor still released it to repair Jian Wushuang’s broken Immortal body.","Ten breaths later, he slowly opened his eyes. The chaos in his eyes was no longer there, replaced by clarity.","“Y-Young Emperor? Why are you here?”","The Young Emperor smiled tiredly and said, “I’ll take you away.”","Jian Wushuang wanted to say something, but he was already at the end of his rope and fainted.","“Have a good sleep. Everything will be over after a good sleep...”","Then, the Young Emperor bowed and left the barren mountain.","Chang Ling stood rooted to the ground, staring blankly at the gradually disappearing figure.","The surroundings were filled with broken rocks, and she was surrounded by endless loneliness.","...","The wind is gentle and gentle, and the power flows.","The boundless breeze blew his long hair and sleeves, causing them to flutter in the wind.","“How long have I been gone?”","“It has already been 50,000 years.”","“It’s been a long time.”","“Not long. I thought that after you left, you would never come back.”","“This time, if you come back, you can stay longer.”","The conversation ended there, and there was no reply.","The Young Emperor turned around and looked at Jian Wushuang, who had fallen asleep again. He smiled helplessly.","...","In a pavilion covered in Immortal grass, Wei Liujia, who had a gentle expression, sat in the middle of the pavilion. He held a star in his hand and closed his eyes in contemplation.","In front of him was a hexagram with hundreds of stars revolving around it, with the void as the foundation.","He was constantly deducing.","Every few hundred breaths, he would open his eyes and place the stars in his hand into the chessboard.","This had been going on for thousands of years.","Next to Wei Liujia was a burly man who looked like a mountain, snoring loudly.","This burly man was Feng Shan. Wei Liujia completely ignored him and only focused on deducing the divination on the chessboard.","He had already deduced for thousands of years, but he still could not sense where that aura was. Moreover, as time passed, that aura became weaker and weaker, and it could even disappear at any time.","This was not a good sign, but Wei Liujia didn’t believe it. He continued to deduce it over and over again. Even though the divinations were different every time, he still did not give up.","This time, a hint of doubt flashed across his eyes.","Because at this moment, all the stars in the Star Luo Chessboard in front of Wei Liujia were slowly moving and began to inject weak energy into the wisp of Divine Sense fate energy in the center.","“F-Fengshan, the divination seems to have changed...”","Feng Shan grunted and changed his position to fall asleep again, completely ignoring Wei Liujia, who was extremely shocked.","Pa.","The star on his fingertip fell, and everything returned to its original position.","...","In the Immortal clouds, the giant palace was built with an entire Heavenly Region as its foundation. It was extremely grand.","Furthermore, with the many Yan Immortals gathered here, it was as if tens of thousands of Immortals had come to pay their respects.","The words ‘Eternal Wushuang’ clearly indicated that this was an auction house, and its reputation resounded throughout the lands.","Here, one could see treasures that even a Yan Immortal would drool over. There were even pills that could not be traded even if you offered up an entire Heavenly Region.","Every 500 years, the Eternal Wushuang Auction House would open. Every time it opened, a storm of blood would be stirred up. A peerless-grade pill could cause more than ten Heavenly Regions to fall into a bloody battle.","Every time the Eternal Wushuang was opened, it was equivalent to a huge opportunity. Other than the peerless-grade pills that the lord of the Heavenly Region could only look up to, there were also countless precious treasures.","This was a huge opportunity for every Yan Immortal. Even after the Eternal Wushuang Auction House had developed to this day, it was a great honor to be invited here.","Among them, there was no lack of Heaven Region lords who came personally to take a look at the peerless-grade pill.","After nearly 20,000 years of development, the Wushuang Auction House grown into a giant with a complicated foundation.","Many Heavenly Regions coveted the supreme treasures in the Eternal Wushuang Auction House and tried to snatch them by force.","However, in one night, they all disappeared, along with all the living beings in the Heavenly Regions. It was as if they had evaporated.","After nearly 20 Heavenly Regions that tried to destroy the Eternal Wushuang Auction House disappeared, all the regions quieted down. No one dared to attack them anymore.","The lords of each Heavenly Region were all Yan Immortals who had lived for countless years. Although they didn’t know the details of this auction house, they didn’t act on their own.","Because just from the looks of it, there were three powerful Yan Immortals. It was rumored that one of them was about to break through to the Grand Yan Immortal."]},{"number":5046,"title":"Chapter 5046 Eternal Wushuang","paragraphs":["5046 Eternal Wushuang","Even though the Eternal Wushuang Auction House only had three Yan Immortals on the surface, any Heavenly Region lord with a clear mind would not think so.","This was because all the lords of the Heavenly Regions who were not clear-headed, those who wanted to pillage the Eternal Wushuang had long disappeared without a trace in the past 20,000 years.","No one knew that after 20,000 years of development, the hidden strength of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House was deeply intertwined.","Because from the fact that one evening, the number of Heavenly Regions was destroyed, and the methods they were destroyed were incredible. From this, the Eternal Wushuang was already a giant that was above ordinary Heavenly Regions.","In 20,000 years, no Yan Immortal or even lord of Heavenly Regions dared to challenge them anymore.","After all, it was an irrefutable principle for an auction house like this to bid for a treasure.","As time passed, the Peerless Auction House changed from accepting Sky Crystals to only accepting Black Mountain Crystals.","Moreover, the coveted Emperor-grade pill could be bought with Black Mountain Crystals. However, even the price of the starting bid reached an unimaginable level.","Even if the lord of a Heavenly Region controlled three to five Heavenly Region planes, he might not be able to get a single Emperor-grade pill with all the resources in his Heavenly Regions.","Therefore, in the past 20,000 years, there were only a few Emperor-grade pills that were auctioned off.","This was also the reason why the lords of the Heavenly Region were willing to risk their lives to attack the auction house. It was because they really could not afford their treasures...","Fortunately, in the Eternal Wushuang, other than using Black Mountain Crystals to trade, they also supported bartering.","And this was also the reason why many Yan Immortals could not take out a huge amount of Black Mountain Crystals, but they still tried their best to enter the auction house. Because they had treasures, they could exchange for treasures of the same value.","This was a grand banquet and a supreme opportunity.","Another 500 years had passed, and the Eternal Wushuang Auction House had opened.","It opened the doors of the hall and the Yan Immortals who were invited came one after another. Among them, there was no lack of lords of the Heavenly Region who came personally just to see the peerless-grade pill that only the Eternal Wushuang could possess.","The door opened and the Yan Immortals arrived.","The auction house was built with the entire Heavenly Region as its foundation. After several changes, it had reached its peak and could accommodate hundreds of thousands of peak cultivators and Yan Immortals.","The Heavenly Palace, which was almost made of all kinds of precious jade and warm jade, was extremely grand. It had changed from the original three levels to five levels in a strict order.","The ordinary sect’s Yan Immortals and top cultivators sat on the first level. Some hidden great sects or great clans that controlled many Heavenly Regions were placed on the second level.","As for the second level and above, it was the lords of the various Super Heavenly Regions, the lords of the Heavenly Sects, and the lords of the Heavenly Regions who had made several or even dozens of transactions.","Only the highest level was sealed.","No Yan Immortal knew who that position belonged to, and very few Yan Immortals cared about it. They came here to obtain the treasures.","Under the guidance of the maids, thousands of Yan Immortals entered the auction house, waiting for it to open.","As the atmosphere in the hall gradually warmed up, a spring breeze caressed the jade, and a beautiful fairy with an extraordinary figure appeared slowly, finally standing in the center of the hall.","This candidate fairy that Chen Qing had kidnapped from the Heavenly Court was called Qing Ling. She had been auctioning in the Eternal Wushuang Auction House for nearly 20,000 years and had become an indispensable sight.","With her appearance, the auction officially began.","“Ladies and gentlemen, another 500 years have passed. This time in Eternal Wushuang, there are a total of 40 items in this auction. Among them, there must be...”","As the crisp voice resounded in the Heavenly Palace, all the seated Yan Immortals focused their attention and listened quietly.","In the space around the third floor, there were faint undercurrents.","“Any confirmation?”","A rather refined and easy-going voice sounded in the dark space.","Immediately after, a figure that was extremely hidden, like a black shadow that could not be dispersed, bowed and said in a low voice, “There is confirmed news, Young Master. There are indeed two pills that contain that kind of special fate energy in the finale of this auction. It has been confirmed.”","“But...”","“But what?”","“However, these two pills have already been reserved by Guhai City...”","“A reservation? Do they have the strength to do that?” The elegant and easy-going voice had a hint of coldness and disdain. “You should know that the price of that piece is an entire mountain of Black Mountain Crystals. No matter how deep their foundation is, do they have that many resources?”","The black shadow whispered, “Young Master, have you forgotten? 10,000 years ago, when the 10 lords of the Heavenly Regions wanted to destroy the Eternal Wushuang Auction House, the old guys of Guhai City secretly helped and protected this place.”","The elegant and easy-going voice sounded again, “Oh, I forgot about this. However, just by relying on the help from 10,000 years ago, I’m afraid it’s not enough to snatch two pills.”","The black shadow said in a low voice, “I’m afraid that it’s already set in stone, Young Master. When I looked at the Young Master of Guhai City earlier, he already had victory in his hands. I’m afraid that this time...”","“Alright, stop talking.”","The voice changed from lazy to cold and decisive.","Then, he slowly got up. His luxurious clothes were interwoven with gold, blue, and silver, giving off an indescribable deep and magnificent feeling.","Surging derivative energy surged around his body.","Under the warm moonlight, he looked extraordinary and handsome.","“Before the final result is decided, everything is just nonsense. I really want to see just how amazing Guhai City is to reserve two pills.”","...","Meanwhile, in another chamber on the same level, a figure exuding the same majestic aura sat upright on a jade throne, propping up their head with their hand, bored out of their mind as they watched one auction item after another.","It was widely known that auctions at the Eternal Wushaung Auction House were rather tedious affairs. This was because the failure rate for each priceless treasure was exceedingly high.","In fact, after a single auction, it wasn’t even guaranteed that ten priceless treasures would be sold.","And even when priceless treasures were sold, there was a high likelihood that they would be exchanged for other goods.","This was because the price of True Treasures here had reached an unimaginable level, and they could only be traded with Black Mountain Crystals.","One had to know that the Black Mountain Crystal, which contained abundant Yan power and even weak fate energy, was too extravagant to be used as a currency.","However, the Eternal Wushaung Auction House only accepted Black Mountain Crystals as their designated currency, leading to an exceptionally high failure rate for True Treasures and making barter-style transactions even more prevalent.","This situation remained unchanged from countless millennia ago until now.","So, for a multitude of reasons, it was the most tedious of auctions in the Eternal Wushuang Auction House."]},{"number":5047,"title":"Chapter 5047 An Unbelievable Price","paragraphs":["5047 An Unbelievable Price","As the most renowned scion within the ancient city of Guhai, he naturally had no interest in such a bustling auction.","But he still came, not for anything else, but to catch a glimpse of the real deal.","He had long heard that in the vast expanse of the Great Si Region, the only method capable of enlightening and possibly breaking through the shackles for cultivators like him was the premium pills found exclusively at the Eternal Wushuang Auction House.","Regarding this peerless-grade pill, all the Yan Immortals knew very little, or even nothing at all. However, from the pill that was passed down tens of thousands of years ago, it was very terrifying.","The first to acquire these pills, the inhabitants of the Heavenly Regions, even had rumors suggesting that the shackles binding their cultivation had begun to loosen.","This undoubtedly heightened the frenzy not only among other Heavenly Regions but also among the cultivators themselves.","They had endless lifespans but had to endure the cruel confinement of unbreakable shackles. It was undeniably harsh.","But now, there seemed to be a way up this path, even though it remained a distant hope. Every cultivator was eager to give it a try.","The grand finale of the auction was the ultimate focus for all cultivators and even the lords of the Heavenly Regions.","At this moment, the young scion from Guhai City was not worried at all. It was as if the outcome was already decided and victory was in his hands.","What he needed to do now was to go through the motions.","With nearly a ninety percent unsold rate, the pace of the auction for the forty precious treasures was surprisingly swift.","Often, the auctioneer would swiftly move on to the next precious item right after introducing one, as if in a hurry.","At this rate, all 40 precious treasures could be introduced within a mere ten hours or so.","As time passed, the first 20 precious treasures went unsold.","And the real finale had just begun.","In the following period of time, there were finally some Yan Immortals who bid.","After nearly 20,000 years of accumulation, the number of supreme treasures in the Eternal Wushuang Auction House had reached an unprecedented level.","It was rumored that the Eternal Wushuang was the wealthiest place in the entire Great Si Region.","He looked at the strange and mysterious treasures that appeared one after another.","As each enigmatic and mystical treasure was revealed one by one, the lords of various Heavenly Regions could not help but hold their breath, their attention riveted.","Finally, the thirty-eighth treasure made its appearance.","He could sense that the entire hall had quieted down, with hidden currents surging beneath the surface.","Traditionally, the showstopper was always the pill that only the Eternal Wushuang Auction House possessed.","The thirty-ninth true treasure was the sign of the climax!","At this moment, all the strong individuals on the three tiers stood up in unison, their gaze fixed on the center of the hall.","Even the usually apathetic young lord of Guhai City abruptly rose from his seat, his expression tinged with nervousness as he looked downward.","Qing Ling smiled faintly, her slender hand flipping open to reveal a dark sandalwood box.","As this sandalwood box appeared, an intensely rich medicinal fragrance instantly swept through the entire heavenly hall, emanating from Qing Ling.","It was a peculiar aroma!","“My Lords, My Ladies, this is the thirty-ninth item up for auction, the Canglian Pill, containing an immense aura of vitality.”","“If consumed by an ordinary peak cultivator, they will surely break through their shackles and achieve the cultivation of a Yan Immortal within 10,000 years. However, if a Yan Immortal consumes it, they will be able to comprehend the breakthrough of the Grand Yan Immortal realm.”","“The starting price of this pill is 600 millioon Black Mountain Crystals.”","Qing Ling smiled, then, after uttering these last words, she waved her hand to open the sandalwood box.","In an instant, a supreme, iridescent radiance burst forth. These lights interconnected, forming a hovering rainbow that enveloped the entire heavenly hall.","Inside the box, the pill was translucent as crystal, containing a myriad of swirling fate energies.","Seeing this, all the Yan Immortals were moved, even the lords of the Heavenly Regions could not remain calm.","This Canglian Pill was truly terrifying, roughly equivalent to a guaranteed breakthrough to the Yan Immortal realm, and capable of breaking through to the Grand Yan Immortal realm. This was simply unimaginable.","A starting price of 600 million Black Mountain Crystals was sufficient proof of the pill’s dreadfulness.","Ordinary Yan Immortals wore grim expressions; they had lost their bidding qualifications. With such a terrifying starting price, it was extremely rare, even in the history of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House.","Even the lord of a normal Heavenly Regionos would not be able to produce so many Black Mountain Crystals.","The Heavenly Palace fell into a brief silence.","However, this silence only lasted for a few breaths before a bidding voice shattered it.","“600 million.”","There was a commotion all around, and all the Yan Immortals were astonished, then they all turned to look at the source of the voice.","There, on the third floor, shrouded in a vast Yan power barrier, concealed to the extreme.","The bidding voice was full of vigor, exuding an air of dominance.","Almost simultaneously, another low-pitched bidding voice sounded, “610 million.”","Before this bidding voice could even finish, a lazy and elegant voice completely unveiled the bidding war.","“650 million.”","The hall was buzzing with low voices; 650 million Black Mountain Crystals, this was an unimaginable number, almost forming a small mountain, but it was treated casually at the moment.","“700 million!”","The forceful voice once again shook the entire audience.","Qing Ling, holding the box made of lignum vitae, was completely shocked.","She knew very well that the reason for the high starting price of this pill was to prevent competitive bidding.","But she never imagined that such an absurd price would lead to a bidding war?!","“710 million.”","“730 million.”","“800 million.”","A stiff smile appeared on Qing Ling’s face, and the situation was starting to exceed her imagination.","Then, with a more secretive gaze, she looked towards the central space on the third floor.","“Damn, who’s opposing us?!”","The young master who came from Guhai City had a solemn and cold expression.","Behind him, there were ten Yan Immortals.","Then, an old man stepped forward. “Young Master, it’s the Shangjun Sect.”","“Shangjun Sect? Do they dare to bid against us?” He was already on the verge of anger.","You see, Guhai City, which included 13 Heavenly Regions, had already reached its limit with 600 million Black Mountain Crystals.","And now, 800 billion was far too much.","To the point where the previously confident young master from the ancient Guhai City felt worry and immense pressure.","If this bidding continued, he would definitely not be able to bear it.","“Young Master, if this continues, the foundation of our Heavenly Region may be shaken...”","The elder Yan Immortal behind him was already anxiously trying to persuade him.","“In that case, let this pill go.” He shook his head, his gaze filled with anger.","Following that, this Canglian Pill was eventually sold for 800 million.","In the depths of Qing Ling’s eyes, there was a trace of helplessness. After all, this pill should have belonged to the Heavenly Region of Guhai City.","But everything had changed, and the Emperor-grade pill was ultimately taken by the owner of that powerful bidding voice."]},{"number":5048,"title":"Chapter 5048 Tit-For-Tat","paragraphs":["5048 Tit-For-Tat","Thirty-nine True Treasures had been auctioned, and in the end, there was only one treasure left.","The last treasure was also a Canglian Pill.","Qing Ling held it in her palm, not even having the chance to announce the starting bid before a lazy, refined voice preempted her.","“700 million.”","The entire hall erupted in astonishment. All the Yan Immortals, even the lords of the Heavenly Realms, turned their attention to the third-floor space.","Directly surpassing the starting price by 100 million was equivalent to telling the other Yan Immortals that this final Canglian Pill was a must-have.","Qing Ling became nervous. She knew this bidder was not from Guhai City but belonged to the Shangjun Sect.","Bang!","In the space belonging to Guhai City, the young master was furious, smashing the jade chair beside him.","“Is the Shangjun Sect looking for death?”","“Young Master, we can’t give up on this last pill,” an elder Yan Immortal said nervously.","“No need for your reminder,” he said sternly, then made his bid.","“750 million!”","Immediately after, the languid and elegant voice sounded again.","“800 million.”","The Eternal Wushuang Auction House was dead silent, all the Yan Immortals and even the lords of the Heaven Regions looked towards the third floor.","This was just the first round of bidding, and it had already exceeded the price of the previous pill.","However, this was not the end but the beginning.","“830 million!”","“850 million.”","“880 million!”","“900 million.”","The hall fell into a dead silence. After all the Yan Immortals heard this number, they all revealed an indescribable expression.","900 million, it had exceeded the previous record of 100 million for an Emperor-grade by a significant margin.","100 million Black Mountain Crystals were enough for a large sect to use for tens of thousands of years, if not longer.","This had gone beyond imagination.","At this moment, within the space where the visitors from Guhai City had arrived, a sense of restlessness had taken hold.","The young master who was supposed to win was suppressed by this price.","Guhai City, with its 13 Heavenly Regions, could muster at most 800 million Black Mountain Crystals. But now, the price of this Emperor-grade had far surpassed that, reaching a staggering 900 million.","Despite his anger, the young master could do nothing.","His chest heaved, his eyes betraying his disappointment.","Just then, the field of Yan power rippled, and a servant girl gracefully entered the space.","She curtsied slightly and softly said, “Lord Cui has a message: you can bid freely, no matter how high the price goes. In the end, this pill belongs to Guhai City.”","The young master of Guhai City trembled all over, his expression changing from fury to relief.","Beside him, an elder Yan Immortal bowed and said, “In that case, we are truly grateful to Lord Cui for his kind consideration. Guhai City’s 13 Heavenly Regions express our deepest gratitude.”","The servant girl nodded and departed.","The young master felt the weight lift from his shoulders and gazed at the central hall once more, his expression returning to one of confidence.","“1 billion!”","The hall, once silent, erupted into a cacophony. They were all stunned.","A 1 billion bid shattered the record of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House, which had stood for 20,000 years. And this was not the end.","Just when all the Ascendant practitioners believed the final price would be 1 billion, the space that had been silent for so long announced another bid.","“1.1 billion.”","The Yan Immortals could not hide their expressions anymore. 1.1 billion Black Mountain Crystals was beyond their imagination.","“1.2 billion!”","A clear and decisive bid once again shook the thoughts of the Immortals.","“Young Master, we can’t go any higher. The maximum price our sect can bear is 1.2 billion. We can’t continue to bid.”","In the third-floor space, a shadow spoke in a hushed tone, growing anxious in his words.","Standing confidently in a golden and blue embroidered robe, a young nobleman slowly closed his eyes.","“1.2 billion, 1.2 billion...That’s 1.2 billion.”","“Can they really produce so many Black Mountain Crystals?”","The shadow whispered, “Master, let’s temporarily yield the Emperor-grade pill to them this time. We can come back in 500 years, and then we’ll only need half the price to get one.”","“But I’m not willing...” the young man sighed deeply.","In the center of the hall, Qing Ling, without leaving a trace, let out a sigh of relief. The final bid of twelve billion came from Ancient Sea City.","This meant that her goal had been achieved.","“In that case, the final Canglian Pill will be awarded to the 13 Heavenly Regions of Guhai City...”","Before the sentence could be completed, ripples suddenly spread through the third floor.","Then, the barrier dissipated, and over a dozen Yan Immortals from the Shangjun Sect descended from the sky, arriving at the center of the hall.","Seeing this, Qing Ling’s heart tightened. She hastily put away the Sandalwood Black Box and took a few steps back, vigilantly watching the newcomers.","Immediately after, the dozen or so Yan Immortals of Guhai City also stepped into the air and stood opposite the Shangjun Sect.","As their eyes met, the young master of Guhai City spoke coldly, “What, couldn’t agree on the bid, so you want to use force?”","The young nobleman from the Shangjun Sect smiled faintly, “No, no, you’ve misunderstood me. I’m here just to verify something.”","He then turned to Qing Ling, “Miss Qing Ling, I would like to verify something.”","“Of course,” Qing Ling nodded, though she was somewhat puzzled.","“What I want to verify is whether Guhai City can really produce 1.2 billion Black Mountain Crystals. If not, then what should be done?”","As soon as these words were spoken, the hall erupted in noise again.","The elders of Ancient Sea City all had changed expressions and grew nervous.","This time at the auction, they had brought only 800 million Black Mountain Crystals, far from the required 1.2 billion.","Now, facing such a threat, they had no solution at all.","Guhai City’s young master’s face was cold, as if he was trying his best to suppress the anger in his heart.","Seeing this change, the young master of the Shangjun Sect smiled secretly. “Oh, you can’t produce it? Then what’s the plan?”","Then, he turned to look at Qing Ling. “Miss Qing Ling, what should we do if we can’t come up with a corresponding bid?”","Qing Ling’s expression changed. She understood the seriousness of the situation but did not dare to speak out recklessly. “Umm...”","In the next moment, a voice, full of confidence and arrogance, resounded, silencing the entire bustling hall.","“How can it be impossible to produce the corresponding bid? You, kid from Guhai City, continue.”","All the Immortals looked up and saw a figure in black and gold attire descending from the sky. He waved his hand, and a storage pouch fell from the sky.","The young master of Guhai City’s face lit up as he caught the pouch.","Seeing the appearance of this figure, all the Yan Immortals exclaimed.","Seeing this figure’s appearance, all the Immortals let out a collective exclamation. They all knew that this fellow, dressed in black and gold attire with a surly expression, was Cui Jing, the third-in-command of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House.","His sudden appearance added a new layer of complexity to the situation.","All the Yan Immortals from the Shangjun Sect slowly retreated a step, and the young nobleman’s eyes narrowed, his expression growing more subtle."]},{"number":5049,"title":"Chapter 5049 The Master Behind the Scenes","paragraphs":["5049 The Master Behind the Scenes","For nearly 20,000 years, rumors about Cui Jing, the third-in-command of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House, had overshadowed all others.","There was a simple reason for this: he was known for his insatiable thirst for killing and his love of battle.","Over the course of 20,000 years, the Eternal Wushuang Auction House had long risen to become a presence above the Heavenly Regions. Even the foundation of some Super Heavenly Regions could not compare.","This was because what supported the Eternal Wushuang Auction House was the heritage of an Emperor, the heritage of Emperor Liu Ya.","One Emperor-grade pill was enough to mobilize an entire Super Heavenly Region.","As the third-in-command of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House, Cui Jing had proven his bloodlust and love for battle in a bloody that occurred 10,000 years ago.","Facing several Super Heavenly Regions and the attacks of dozens of Yan Immortals, he fought until the very end, enduring until reinforcements arrived.","Even before his injuries had fully healed, he rode alone through the night to reinforce, single-handedly annihilating two Super Heavenly Regions.","Over a dozen Yan Immortals, countless top cultivators, and living beings all perished in the void with no chance of escape.","He severed the heads of the two lords of the Heavenly Regions and brought them back to the Eternal Wushuang Auction House together with their immortal sources. They were auctioned off at a starting bid of one Sky Crystal.","It was from that battle that nearly 100 Heavenly Regions learned of Cui Jing’s name.","Now, he stood at the center of the Heavenly Hall, his black and gold robe fluttering. He looked at the representatives of the Shangjun Sect with a smile that didn’t quite reach his eyes.","All the Yan Immortals looked at Cui Jing and unconsciously felt a chill on their necks. The auction of human heads from 10,000 years ago was still vivid in their memories.","“Y-Young Master, let’s go quickly...”","The elder Yan Immortal was extremely nervous and anxious, not knowing how deep the roots of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House ran. Hence, stepping back was the most crucial thing to do.","However, the Young Master of the Shangjun Sect was still in a confrontational state, his eyes ice-cold.","Cui Jing could not be bothered to warn him. He turned around and said, “Give the pouch to Qing Ling and let her count it.”","The Young Master of Guhai City reacted and nodded, handing the pouch to Qing Ling.","Qing Ling took it, opened the pouch, and examined it for a moment. Then she bowed slightly and said, “Sir, there are exactly 12 billion Black Mountain Crystals in the pouch, accurate without error.”","Cui Jing nodded and prepared to leave.","But then, a chilly voice rang out, “The Eternal Wushuang Auction House is certainly generous.”","“What I’d like to ask is whether the buyer of this pill is truly Guhai City, or is it actually the Eternal Wushuang Auction House?”","The entire Heavenly Hall fell silent, all the Yan Immortals and the lords of the Heavenly Region stared at this scene.","Anyone with functioning eyes could see that only an enormous entity like the Eternal Wushuang Auction House could afford 12 billion Black Mountain Crystals.","Even though Guhai City was a superpower that spanned 13 Heavenly Regions, it was absolutely impossible for it to have 12 billion Black Mountain Crystals.","The result was self-evident.","Moreover, there was another layer of meaning behind Cui Jing giving 12 billion Black Mountain Crystals in public.","Cui Jing represented the Eternal Wushuang Auction House.","His willingness to give away 12 billion Black Mountain Crystals in public was a way of repaying the favor from 10,000 years ago, when Guhai City had extended a helpnig hand to the Eternal Wushuang Auction House.","This was also a signal to all the Transcendent Immortals present and the lords of the Heavenly Regions: as long as you helped Eternal Wushuang Auction House, they would naturally repay you tenfold or a hundredfold.","Therefore, this was a display of generosity without any pretense.","However, when the Young Master of the Shangjun Sect said it, it didn’t seem so appealing.","Cui Jing stopped and a strange smile appeared on his cold face. He turned around and said in a low voice, “The buyer of the pill is obviously Guhai City. Didn’t you see all that?”","When the Young Master of Shangjun Sect heard this, he smiled slightly. “I see. But isn’t the Black Mountain Crystals used to purchase the pill provided by Eternal Wushuang Auction House?”","“If it was provided by Eternal Wushuang Auction House, then what’s the point of putting this pill up for auction?”","As soon as he said this, a commotion broke out in the Heavenly Palace.","All the elder Yan Immortals of Guhai City had solemn expressions, ready to fight at any moment.","Cui Jing smiled, “This pill was indeed acquired by Guhai City, but the Black Mountain Crystals were sent to the auction house by the elders of Guhai City in advance.”","“What, you don’t believe me?”","The noise gradually died down, but tension remained.","“How can we believe it?” The Young Master of Shangjun Sect smiled.","At this moment, Cui Jing burst into laughter. “Why should I make you believe me? I didn’t say it to make you believe; I said it to inform you. Whether you believe it or not doesn’t matter!”","The eyes of the Shangjun Sect’s Young Master instantly became clear and cold.","“Young Master, let’s go!” the elder whispered. “This is Eternal Wushuang Auction House. We shouldn’t get into a dispute here.”","The cold light in his eyes disappeared. The Young Master of the Shangjun Sect suddenly smiled. “It seems that Eternal Wushuang Auction House is not such a clean place either, full of impurities and filth.”","As soon as these words were spoken, all the Yan Immortals looked shocked. The Shangjun Sect was going to confront Eternal Wushuang Auction House!","Cui Jing’s expression turned cold, but he still suppressed the anger in his heart and looked at him. “What’s your name?”","All the elders of the Shangjun Sect were shocked. The oldest of them cupped his hands in a trembling voice. “Lord Cui, our Young Master is still young and full of vigor. If he offended you in any way, please–”","Before he could finish his sentence, Young Master Shangjun Sect stopped him and said in a serious tone, “I am the son of the Sect Master of Shangjun Sect, Qin Tuo.”","“Qin Tuo, that’s a good name.” Cui Jing suddenly clapped his hands and laughed. “But do you think it’s better for you to say that with your own mouth or have it carved on your tombstone?”","When the Young Master named Qin Tuo heard this, his eyes narrowed and he involuntarily took a step back.","Cui Jing smiled disdainfully and prepared to leave.","Qin Tuo, who realized that he had lost his composure, instantly felt embarrassed. He said angrily, “Who do you think you are, a mere auction house! How dare you go against the Shangjun Sect?!”","At this point, the entire place erupted in shock. More than half of the Yan Immortals looked at Qin Tuo with a meaningful look.","Shangjun Sect was the top Super Heavenly Region in the entire Great Si Region. It was true that it could sweep over half of the ordinary Heavenly Regions.","But this time, they had kicked a hornet’s nest. They had challenged a terrifying force that had wiped out more than ten Super Heavenly Regions 10,000 years ago. the consequences were not something they could resist.","Cui Jing stopped, his black and gold robe fluttering despite the lack of wind.","In the next moment, he suddenly turned around and, with unimaginable speed, kicked Qin Tuo in the chest.","Boom!","Qin Tuo was sent flying a hundred feet and crashed heavily into the jade wall.","The Heavenly Palace was deathly silent, all the Yan Immortals were astonished.","None of the Yan Immortals had expected Cui Jing to kick the son of Shangjun Sect so unreservedly and without any restraint."]},{"number":5050,"title":"Chapter 5050 Slaughter in the Void","paragraphs":["5050 Slaughter in the Void","This kick was equivalent to kicking the face of the entire Shangjun Sect. Moreover, it was in front of so many Heavenly Region lords. It was impossible to clean up the mess.","But the one delivering this kick was Cui Jing. His bloodthirsty and combative nature made all the Immortal cultivators present, even the lords of Heavenly Regions, hesitate to step forward.","The elders of the Shangjun Sect, finally realizing the situation, glared at Cui Jing in anger, but they didn’t dare to voice their grievances. Instead, they flew over to stand before Qin Tuo.","“Young Master!”","At this moment, Qin Tuo, in stark contrast to his previous indifference, was consumed by humiliation and rage. His peak-level Immortal power erupted, instantly sweeping through the entire Heavenly Hall.","The elders of the Shangjun Sect were equally resolute, each releasing their own Yan power, ready to fight at a moment’s notice to defend their Young Master’s honor.","All the elders of Guhai City were also on the verge of unleashing their attack, releasing their Yan power.","With his black hair dancing wildly, Qin Tuo was already on the verge of a furious outburst.","Cui Jing, still wearing a sardonic smile, appeared as if he was witnessing something absurd.","In the next moment, an even more powerful and shocking energy suddenly descended from the Heavenly Hall like a torrential river.","This Yan power was extremely terrifying, and the moment it descended, every Yan Immortal felt threatened. Those with weaker cultivation even found it difficult to control their own Yan power.","Some of the lords of the Heavenly Regions realized the situation and their expressions expressions changed slightly. They were anxious, as if they were being targeted.","But when the Yan Immortal hidden in the shadows finally revealed himself, all the lords of the Heavenly Regions secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","Chen Qing.","The person who released the Yan power to suppress the Heavenly Palace was Chen Qing.","He was the second-in-command of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House. He was originally a Yan Immortal, but in that bloody battle 10,000 years ago, he comprehended his own Immortal Style and killed several Super Heavenly Region lords, making him famous.","There were rumors that he was only a step away from the Grand Yan Immortal realm, and there were even rumors that he was already a Grand Yan Immortal.","At this moment, the moment he appeared, all the elders of Shangjun Sect were ashen and did not dare to confront them anymore.","Guhai City, also considered a Super Heavenly Region, watching closely from the sidelines. If a real battle were to erupt, there was no chance of victory for the Shangjun Sect!","“A bunch of clowns, are you looking down on the Eternal Wushuang?”","Chen Qing’s voice was filled with uncontrollable anger.","He descended from the sky, his True Sword already drawn from its sheath, carrying countless strands of Sword Intent. The Sword Intents hovered directly above the heads of every elder of the Shangjun Sect without the slightest hesitation.","As long as Chen Qing willed it, he could severly injure them.","Qin Tuo stepped back, recovering from his anger. He was acutely aware that in this situation, the Shangjun Sect had no chance of winning.","Chen Qing and Cui Jing, however, stood still, looking at them with seemingly mocking smiles.","At this moment, a Yan Immortal stepped forward and stood in front of Qin Tuo. He cupped his hands and said seriously, “Lord Chen, Lord Cui, there’s no need to be so stubborn. The Shangjun Sect is also one of the top sects in the Great Si Region. Perhaps, in the future, we may meet again.”","“What a joke. Are you trying to threaten us with your power?” Chen Qing took a step forward, his face dark and cold. “Let alone one Shangjun Sect, even ten of them can’t make any impact here!”","“You...”","That elder Yan Immortal was at a loss for words. His face alternating between red and green, almost on the verge of spitting blood out of anger.","On the other hand, Qin Tuo, who had been in a state of anger earlier, calmed down. He gave Chen Qing and Cui Jing a deep look and then led the elders away.","Chen Qing did not obstruct their departure too much and allowed them to leave.","After that, the Young Master of Guhai City led a group of Yan Immortal elders to bow, their posture was humble and respectful.","Guhai City had no advantage whatsoever against Shangjun Sect, and they could not even protect the Emperor-grade pills.","However, with the intervention of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House, not only did they save face, but they also obtained an Emperor-grade pill, which was the best outcome.","Watching this scene, all the Immortals in the Heavenly Palace and the lords of the Heavenly Regions revealed meaningful expressions.","Chen Qing smiled, “No need to be polite. What we promised to your Guhai City, no one can take away. What is yours is yours.”","Qing Ling let out a sigh of relief, silently lamenting the many hardships and difficulties faced by the Eternal Wushuang Auction House.","In an unseen place, within the highest level of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House’s space, a slender but awe-inspiring young Yan Immortal slowly closed his eyes.","He seemed extremely tired, unwilling to open his eyes even for a moment, as if he hadn’t had a good night’s sleep in a long time.","...","The once-in-500-year auction has drawn to a close, and the lords of various Heavenly Regions and the Yan Immortals, have successively withdrawn.","Although it has ended, the true undercurrents are about to begin.","Within the Eternal Wushuang Auction House, the treasures acquired will be protected, but once they leave, they will no longer enjoy any safeguard.","In the past 20,000 years, the theft of celestial treasures has continued to unfold. Although the chances are slim, it still occurs. After all, the treasures within the Eternal Wushuang Auction House are enough to drive Yan Xian mad.","At this moment, the group from Guhai City, bearing Emperor-grade pills, has changed their appearances and left the Eternal Wushuang Auction House, heading towards the boundless void.","They aim to reach Guhai City as quickly as possible because delays can lead to unforeseen circumstances, and no one knows how many Yan Immortals are lurking in the shadows.","At the same time, they have also prepared for the worst. The Emperor-grade pills are carried by the Young Master. If they encounter an irresistible attack, they will swallow the pills directly.","A group of more than ten Yan Immortals, like meteors, move extremely swiftly, crossing through the large and small Heavenly Regions, concealing their figures.","But as they continue forward, in the depths of the dim void, all the elders of Guhai City feel a slight change in expression, as if they have sensed a great crisis.","“Not good, Young Master, I’m afraid we’re going to meet with misfortune.”","The Young Master of Guhai City felt his heart sink.","The next moment, seemingly to confirm the thoughts of all the Yan Immortal elders, the previously star-studded void suddenly took on a dark red hue.","It was like crimson lava, cracking the void and forming countless terrifying patterns, collapsing down.","All the Yan Immortal elders of Guhai City turned to look.","They saw a terrifying figure with blood-red Yan power flowing all over, emerging from the rift in the void.","With each step he took, the void trembled, and even the void astral winds were crushed to pieces.","“Qin, Qin Tuo?!”","...","The sky was clear, and the sun hung high.","Two figures with powerful Immortal auras coursing through their bodies moved swiftly through the clouds, as if they were on a matter of utmost importance.","Feng Shan, who was as imposing as a mountain, still bobbed his head, as if it could fall asleep again at any moment.","Beside him was Wei Liujia, draped in a flowing black cloak, his expression filled with anxiety.","Due to his extreme anxiety, between the index and middle fingers of his right hand, he even held a sparkling star."]},{"number":5051,"title":"Chapter 5051 Reunion","paragraphs":["5051 Reunion","Stellar Chess.","Using the stars as chess pieces, and thoughts as the chessboard, deducing the existence of all things.","At this moment, Wei Liujia had already deduced an outcome that seemed utterly impossible.","What he needed to do now was to witness the truth!","“Liu Jia, have you gone mad? Big Brother might not return for another 100,000 years. Didn’t the Young Emperor clearly say that Big Brother won’t come back?”","Feng Shan scratched his head, muttering, as if he was unwilling to believe it. After all, after the passage of 20,000 years, they had all been forced to accept reality.","Unexpectedly, after hearing these words, Wei Liujia, who rarely lost his temper, cursed for the first time, “Don’t listen to his nonsense! Do you believe me or him?!”","“I, I definitely believe you,” Feng Shan scratched his head again, “But are you really sure?”","“We’ll know as soon as we see,” Wei Liujia said in a firm voice, “I have a premonition that Big Brother will be in Little Lonely Heaven!”","Feng Shan’s body trembled and his figure instantly shot out 10,000 feet. “Then what are we waiting for? Let’s go, hurry!”","“...”","It had been nearly 20,000 years since Jian Wushuang had left quietly, and Little Lonely Heaven had been sealed for almost the same amount of time.","As the Heavenly Official of the Second Prince, Zhao Ting had also left quietly thousands of years after Jian Wushuang disappeared.","Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, Cui Jing, Wei Liujia, and Feng Shan did not leave. Even though their instincts told them that Jian Wushuang would not return, they still waited.","Wei Liujia had established the Star Observation Pavilion, deducing day and night, with Feng Shan following closely by his side.","Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, Cui Jing, and the others had turned the Eternal Wushuang Auction House into a massive institution.","Everything was changing, except for Little Lonely Heaven’s grass and trees that were sealed, waiting for that one figure to return.","Standing outside the unchanging Little Lonely Heaven, Wei Liujia stopped in his tracks, took a deep breath, and then waved his hand to dispel the circulating seals.","Familiar scenes entered his eyes, triggering endless thoughts.","Every blade of grass and tree swayed as they had thousands of years ago.","In the next moment, the two of them dashed towards the center of Little Lonely Heaven.","It was Jian Wushuang’s Heavenly Palace.","The Heavenly Palace was grand, filled with Immortal energy, and the Dao flowed naturally. Nothing had changed.","As his feet landed on the ground, Wei Liujia and Feng Shan once again stood in the central square of the Heavenly Palace after more than 10,000 years.","As Wei Liu Jia gazed at the Heavenly Palace shrouded in mist, he felt an inexplicably strong intuition. He raised his right hand, examining the star in his palm, then strode into the palace.","The long-sealed heavenly gates had opened once more, and everything remained as it was. Wei Liujia stood outside the palace gate, feeling a bit hesitant.","Feng Shan cleared his throat but also froze in place, unsure whether to advance or retreat.","“Liujia, did you say the boss has returned?”","“It seems I was mistaken,” he replied, his eyes filled with disappointment.","Inside the Heavenly Palace, the atmosphere was solemn, and the order flowed, but that lone Yan Immortal remained absent.","“Feng Shan, let’s go,” Wei Liujia turned around, preparing to leave.","Feng Shan did not say much either; they had already prepared to accept an outcome that might never come to fruition.","The next moment, a disturbance in the order, and a familiar voice quietly echoed.","“Liujia, Feng Shan, you’re here.”","Both of them trembled, halted in their steps, and locked eyes. Then, they turned to look.","A young man in plain white clothing, though his complexion appeared weary, had an extremely captivating pair of azure eyes. He slowly walked out from the depths of the palace, wearing a smile.","“Boss...”","“Big Brother Jian...”","Upon their reunion, all reservations disappeared. Feng Shan rushed forward like a charging bull toward Jian Wu Shuang.","Wei Liujia did not hold back either, and with a flash, he followed closely behind.","Jian Wushuang felt like he was about to pass out due to the long and tight embrace.","“Stop, stop, I can’t breathe...”","The hug lasted for quite some time until Wei Liujia realized something was amiss and pushed Feng Shan away to prevent Jian Wu Shuang from fainting.","“Big Brother Jian, are you injured?” Wei Liujia stared at Jian Wu Shuang, his keen senses detecting a change.","Jian Wushuang coughed lightly several times and smiled wryly, “This is a long story. It’s not the right time to explain now. I’ll tell you all about it later.”","Wei Liujia nodded. He vaguely knew that Jian Wushuang had left because he went to a dangerous place to look for Di Qing. The injuries that he had suffered were probably related to the dangerous place.","However, none of this was important. The important thing was that Jian Wushuang had returned in one piece. This was more exciting than any news.","Feng Shan was excited beyond measure. “Boss, wait here. I’ll call Chen Qing and the others over.”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand. “No need to make a big fuss. It’s not a significant event that requires a celebration. You all have your own matters to attend to.”","Wei Liujia wanted to say something, but at that moment, another figure emerged from the depths of the celestial palace.","As their eyes met, the air grew heavy.","Dressed in plain attire and holding a jade bowl, the Young Emperor stood frozen in place, his eyes slightly trembling.","He had never imagined this scenario. Besides Jian Wu Shuang, there were two more Yan Immortals here?","For a moment, he did not know how to react, standing there with the jade bowl in his hand.","Wei Liujia and Feng Shan regained their composure and exchanged meaningful glances with Jian Wushuang.","Then, Wei Liujia teased, “Perhaps, we’ve come at an inopportune time.”","Jian Wushuang, puzzled, shook his head. “No, you’ve arrived at the perfect time.”","At that very moment, outside the Heavenly Palace, the sound of a fierce wind cutting through the air could be heard.","And then, three powerful figures, each exuding a strong aura of immortality, appeared.","They were Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and Cui Jing.","For nearly 20,000 years, they had experienced the changes of the mortal world, but for Immortals, it was but a fleeting dream.","Their eyes met, and they all smiled knowingly.","“Long time no see,” Jian Wu Shuang waved and smiled.","“It’s good that you’re back, Brother Jian,” Chen Qing stepped forward, extending a respectful salute.","Chun Qiu and Cui Jing also stepped forward and cupped their hands.","“There’s no need to be so formal. How did you know that I was back?”J ian Wushuang asked with a smile.","“We have telepathy.” Chun Qiu smiled and pointed at his heart.","Cui Jing also smiled and said, “It’s good that you’re back, Brother Jian. Now we don’t have to worry about where you are.”","After close to 20,000 years, they gathered once again and all of them laughed.","Only the Young Emperor, who was holding the jade bowl, had a gloomy expression. He didn’t know whether to leave or not.","A moment later, he placed the jade bowl on the table beside him and turned around to enter the depths of the Heavenly Palace.","Seeing the familiar faces, Jian Wushuang was in a good mood. “Your cultivations have improved. In some time, you should be able to step into the Grand Yan Immortal realm, right?”","Hearing this, they all looked at Chen Qing.","Chen Qing was the person who had been immersed in the Yan Immortal Realm for the longest time. He was also the first Yan Immortal expert to master the Immortal Style other than Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":5052,"title":"Chapter 5052 The Night Will Come","paragraphs":["5052 The Night Will Come","Jian Wushuang was only a hair’s breadth away from becoming a Sword Immortal.","Seeing that everyone was looking at him, Chen Qing scratched his head and smiled foolishly. “About 10,000 years ago, I’ve already comprehended my own Immortal Style. However, I’m afraid there’s still a gap before reaching the Grand Yan Immortal realm.”","“I’m afraid this gap might trouble me for quite some time.”","Jian Wushuang said, “Even those Emperor-grade pills can’t assist you in breaking through?”","Chen Qing replied, “I’ve tried it several times, but the results are mostly minimal. Although the Emperor-grade pill’s medicinal effect is powerful and is sufficient to break through that restraint, it’s as if there’s some kind of obstruction that prevents me from breaking through. It’s very strange.”","Jian Wushuang remained silent, lost in thought.","Even though he had long ago comprehended the Immortal Style, due to his own body, he was unable to sense the cultivation realm that led to the Grand Yan Immortal.","At the same time, he also thought that there were very few Grand Yan Immortals in the Great SI Region, which was indeed suspicious.","“Could it be that the path upwards has been sealed off?”","Then, Jian Wushuang looked at Chun Qiu and the others.","Quickly, he got his answer. Besides Chen Qing, Chun Qiu had also mastered his own Immortal Style.","Feng Shan had already comprehended the Immortal Style, and although Cui Jing and Wei Liujia had not yet, it was only a matter of time.","This was already a force that could not be underestimated. Even some of the Super Heavenly Regions in the Great Si Region would have difficulty contending with them.","Jian Wushuang sighed softly. After tens of thousands of years of development, they had all grown. Although they were still a distance away from the Grand Yan Immortal realm, they were already strong enough to establish themselves in the Great Si Region.","Cui Jing smiled when he saw that the atmosphere was a little gloomy. “Let’s not talk about this anymore. Big Brother Jian, you’ve just returned. We, brothers, should celebrate your return first.”","Chen Qing and the others broke into an uproar.","“Brother Jian, I’ve been saving some fine wine for this day. We won’t leave until we’re drunk!”","“Yes, yes, we haven’t seen each other for nearly 20,000 years. Let’s get drunk today!!”","“I won’t go home until I’m drunk!”","...","Several towering figures, like sacred mountains, had surrounded Jian Wushuang and were almost lifting him off the ground.","Jian Wushuang wore a contented smile on his face. After all, it had been a considerable amount of time since they had last met.","However, at this moment, a somewhat cold voice emanated from deep within the Heavenly Palace, “No drinking, but everything else is allowed.”","“...”","Jian Wushuang shrugged his shoulders, indicating that he was still recovering from a serious illness.","Chen Qing and the others looked at each other and grinned. Then, they grabbed him and flew toward Wei Liujia’s Star Observation Pavilion.","Star Observation Pavilion.","After Jian Wushuang disappeared, Wei Liujia started to build a mysterious celestial pavilion.","Rather than calling it a pavilion, it was more appropriate to call it a small Heavenly Region that could accommodate all things.","The Star Observation Pavilion contained a myriad of things. It was created by Wei Liujia with great care, and it was situated right next to the Little Lonely Heaven, resembling a halo.","With the enhancement of Chen Qing and the others’ powers, ordinary external forces couldn’t forcibly enter. It was an extremely secretive place.","Right now, within the Star Observation Pavilion, six Yan Immortals were gathered.","“Come, come, come. This wine is my most prized collection. Normally, I wouldn’t bring it out, but now is the perfect occasion.”","On the eaves of the Star Observation Pavilion, the six Yan Immortals casually sat, gazing into the distance at the distant rivers and waters.","Chen Qing wore a meaningful smile on his face, then took out pots of exquisite wine from his waist.","Although the wine pots were small, he could feel that it was definitely not less than ten thousand catties each.","Jian Wushuang had no doubts and lifted his head to take a sip of the wine, and then his expression became strange.","Even after nearly 20,000 years, he recognized the taste of the wine immediately. It tasted exactly the same as the mouth-chewed wine he had encountered during the amusing incident in a mortal realm on their way to the Northern Heaven Celestial Prefecture with Chen Qing and Chun Qiu for the first time.","The so-called mouth-chewed wine involved using a beautiful woman’s mouth to chew the grains and create wine yeast, which would then ferment to produce a unique and sweet wine.","If Jian Wushuang hadn’t known the secret behind it, the wine in his hand would indeed be considered a fine wine, on par with Immortal wines.","However, knowing the peculiarity of it, he did not dare to take a second sip.","At the same time, what left Jian Wushuang both amused and puzzled was the fact that after nearly 20,000 years, the mortal realm’s vast territories had likely witnessed countless cycles of life and death. Yet, Chen Qing still had a considerable stash of mouth-chewed wine hidden away.","While Cui Jing and the others were drinking, Jian Wushuang made an excuse that his injuries hadn’t fully recovered and he couldn’t drink, so he dodged to the side.","Standing on the eaves of the Star Observation Pavilion and gazing at the distant rivers and mountains, he felt an immense sense of contentment.","This secluded corner of the world, apart from lacking the aura of life, was otherwise perfect for meditation and cultivation.","Jian Wushuang had even decided to meditate here for a period of time.","The clouds rolled and the sun shone brightly.","However, at this moment, Jian Wushuang’s gaze turned sharp.","His eyes suddenly turned towards the sun in the sky, hidden behind the clouds.","The sunlight was radiant, emitting a gentle hue.","But at the edge of the sun, there was an extremely faint reddish tint, peculiar in nature.","The light red color was not Yan power. It carried a mesmerizing, mind-controlling power, although extremely subtle. Nevertheless, Jian Wushuang was quick to sense it.","He pondered for a moment, then waved his hand to signal Chen Qing and the others who were still drinking.","“Did any of you notice something unusual?”","Following Jian Wushuang’s pointing finger, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and the rest all turned their gaze toward the sun in the sky.","Soon, their expressions grew strange.","Tens of thousands of years of battles and traversing bloody seas had made them far more sensitive to impending danger than ordinary Yan Immortals.","Chen Qing was the first to regain his senses. He looked at Wei Liujia and said, “Liujia, this is your territory. You wouldn’t be targeted by someone, right?”","Wei Liujia wore a bewildered expression. “It can’t be. Except for coming to aid the Eternal Wushuang Auction House in the last 20,000 years, I haven’t left this place.”","“Then what could this phenomenon be?” Feng Shan scratched his chin in puzzlement.","Wei Liujia knew that this matter was not simple. He hurriedly stood on the roof of the Star Observation Pavilion and began to deduce with the Stellar Chessboard.","The chess pieces fell one after another, and the entire chessboard shook uneasily.","And Wei Liu Jia’s complexion grew even graver.","In the sky, the sun had already been enshrouded by a reddish hue, like a spider’s web of blood veins.","“Not good, it’s the Eternal Wushuang!” Wei Liu Jia suddenly raised his head, his face contorted with worry.","“Motherf*cker, there are still people who dare to lay their eyes on Eternal Wushuang Auction House?” Chen Qing erupted, his anger reaching its peak.","“Let’s go!” Chun Qiu shouted and prepared to help.","“Wait,” Jian Wushuang called them back, smiling faintly. “I’ll accompnay you to take a look.”"]},{"number":5053,"title":"Chapter 5053 Blood","paragraphs":["5053 Blood","The void shattered and the stars retreated.","Everything was silent.","Six figures shot through the void like meteors, speeding forward.","The leaders were Chen Qing and Chun Qiu.","“Damned thing, what exactly is this?!” Chen Qing cursed with a dark expression.","The further they advanced, the more fragmented the void became, as if they had experienced an unprecedented battle.","As far as his eyes could see, everything was shattered. Moreover, at the edge of the void crack, there was a suppressed and cold aura flowing.","The aura was dark red, like a river of blood.","“If I catch you, I’ll skin you alive and bury you under the Heavenly Palace as a cornerstone!” Cui Jing said fiercely, killing intent overflowing from the depths of his eyes.","“I hope Eternal Wushuang can hold on for a while longer.” Chun Qiu was a little worried.","In the next moment, a weak fluctuation swept over from the depths of the void.","Chen Qing stretched out his hand and pressed down, directly suppressing the weak fluctuation and dragging it over.","“T-This is Gu Ting from Guhai City?!”","Chen Qing was utterly shocked when he saw the figure that resembled a blood gourd in his hand.","“Gu Ting? How did he end up like this!” Cui Jing rushed forward. When he saw that it was indeed Gu Ting, he was equally shocked.","“It looks like he was ambushed.” Chun Qiu frowned.","Wei Liujia pondered. “Could it be Shangjun Sect?”","“Whether it’s a major sect or a minor one, watch how I crush them into powder!” Feng Shan roared thunderously with clenched fists.","At this moment, Gu Ting, the Young Master of Guhai City, who was being held by Chen Qing, gradually regained consciousness from his fainting.","Upon seeing Chen Qing and the others, he had a look of relief, as if narrowly escaped death. Then, his eyes dimmed, and he said, “Lord Chen, the Emperor-grade pill has been taken from me, and all the elders of Guhai City have fallen.”","Chen Qing’s heart sank, and he hastily asked, “Who did this? What happened to the Eternal Wushuang Auction House?!”","“I-It’s Shangjun Sect, Qin Tuo!” Gu Ting gritted his teeth with resentment. “He’s already on his way here!”","Chen Qing was furious, and his power surged. “This guy is asking for death!”","Meanwhile, Chun Qiu remained calm throughout, gazing at Gu Ting indifferently. “Did you lead him here?”","Gu Ting trembled all over, and a hint of shock flickered in his eyes. Finally, he said, “Lord Chun, we were ambushed by Shangjun Sect on the way, and there was no way to turn back. Our only chance of survival was to escape to the Eternal Wushuang Auction House. I’m the only one left–”","Chun Qiu interrupted him with a wave of his hand and said, “You’ll have to explain this to Guhai City in the future.”","“For now, our priority is to eliminate Qin Tuo.”","Eternal Wushuang Auction House.","At this moment, the sun in the sky had already set, replaced by a massive blood moon.","The void shattered, and several Heavenly Regions had been destroyed.","The Eternal Wushuang Auction House, established based on a Heavenly Region, was now on the verge of destruction.","Dark and bloody rivers tore through the earth, surging and engulfing everything in their path.","The Heavenly Region shattered, and at its center, the colossal structure known as the Eternal Wushuang Auction House was surrounded by the dark and bloody river.","Led by Qing Ling, nearly ten Yan Immortals stationed here were struggling desperately.","Qing Ling had only recently ascended to the rank of Yan Immortal, and her cultivation realm was not yet stable. She found it extremely difficult to withstand such a terrifying impact.","However, she did not take a single step back. Instead, she released her Yan power to resist.","What was even more terrifying was that Qing Ling did not know who the enemy was, because this phenomenon had appeared almost instantaneously, and everything had fallen into a passive state.","The dark and bloody river surged, transforming into colossal blood dragons that charged toward the Heavenly Palace of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House.","“Damn it, what are these things, and who would strike at a time like this?!” Qing Ling gritted her teeth, her anger reaching its peak.","Beside her, a middle-aged transcendent immortal also gritted his teeth as he resisted, “Fairy Qing Ling, you should leave first and quickly bring Lord Chun and the others here. We’ll hold the line here!”","“It’s impossible. If I leave, we won’t be able to hold on here,” Qing Ling firmly shook her head.","“But if we continue like this, we won’t be able to hold out,” the middle-aged Yan Immortal could not help but say. The edge of his sword had already lost its sharpness due to the dark bloodstains, rendering it powerless.","“Even so, we can’t retreat!” Qing Ling said calmly. Thousands of azure ribbons burst forth from her palms, forming an extremely sturdy barrier that enveloped the entire Heavenly Palace of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House.","Roar!","An earth-shattering explosion tore through the chaos and darkness.","An endless river of blood gushed out from the depths of the earth’s core and continuously condensed into a hundred million-feet-long flood serpent.","Thick blood dripped from the gaps of every scale.","A pair of blood-red pupils shone like the blood-red sun.","It was simply too huge. Even the Eternal Wushuang Heavenly Palace seemed a little tiny in front of it.","Order was broken, the Heavenly Region was destroyed. Everything was in chaos.","At this moment, the unparalleled Heavenly Palace was like a lonely boat that was struggling to hold on and could capsize at any time.","And of the close to ten Yan Immortals that were originally stationed here, three had already perished.","Facing the flood dragon formed by the dark blood river, all the Yan Immortals were ashen.","As long as it attacked, the Heavenly Palace would definitely be destroyed.","They probably couldn’t resist either.","The middle-aged Yan Immortal gritted his teeth and looked at Qing Ling, intending to send her out.","But in the next moment, the chaotic sky suddenly trembled, followed by a thunderous explosion.","All the Yan Immortas’ gazes converged on the sky.","There, a figure like a divine mountain, as heavy as the afterglow of a setting sun, slammed down onto the giant head of the Blood River Serpent.","Boom!!!","A burst of incomparable blood radiance erupted, and an unparalleled explosion resounded.","The Blood River Serpent roared in madness; its entire head was almost pierced, and even one vertical-slit snake eye shattered.","The massive body crashed heavily into the blood river.","“Quick, into the hall!” Qing Ling shouted, and the few remaining Yan Immortals all flew into the hall at lightning speed, then tightly closed the gates.","The blood river howled, and the dimension collapsed.","The Blood River Serpent, with its head pierced, fell heavily into the blood river, churning up a sea of blood that covered the sky.","“I was wondering what it was, but it turned out to be just a piece of trash!”","Feng Shan’s body shook, and he shook off the blood on his shoulder. He spat in disdain.","But in that moment of distraction, Chen Qing’s urgent voice suddenly rang out, “Feng Shan, retreat quickly!”","“Hmm?” Feng Shan was puzzled and was about to speak when he suddenly realized that the blood river beneath him was once again forming into a huge serpent.","It opened its blood-drenched, sky-swallowing mouth and spewed an endless river of blood towards Feng Shan.","Because all of this happened too quickly, by the time Chen Qing and the others arrived, Feng Shan had already been engulfed.","As far as the eye could see, even the Heavenly Hall of the Eternal Wushuang Auction House couldn’t avoid being submerged in the blood river."]},{"number":5054,"title":"Chapter 5054 Strange Change","paragraphs":["5054 Strange Change","Chen Qing stamped his foot, his five fingers spread out, and in an instant, tens of thousands of brilliant rays burst forth.","These rays were like the sharpest arrows, tearing through the void, and rushing violently towards the Blood River Serpent.","Splatter– splatter.","Endless blood mist exploded as the Blood River Serpent opened its enormous mouth and roared.","And with this roar, Feng Shan, the mountain-like figure, escaped in a sorry state from the giant mouth.","“Damn, that was close!”","Feng Shan’s face turned pale, full of taboo, and he muttered, “What is this thing?”","Chen Qing and the others also arrived. They looked at the blood river below them and had a bad feeling.","Cui Jing held a mysterious staff and licked his lips. “Isn’t it a bit... inappropriate not to have Sword Jian here?”","“No matter, watch how I dismantle this place!” Feng Shan rubbed his hands together and roared as he charged down.","Chen Qing and Cui Jing also activated their powers and descended together.","Chun Qiu, on the other hand, looked at Gu Ting, who just woke up “This blood river...”","“This Blood River is the incarnation of Qin Tuo!” Gu Ting confirmed without hesitation. “Earlier, he transformed into the Blood River and devoured all the elders of my Guhai City.”","Wei Liujia stroked his chin, “That shouldn’t be the case. From their previous performance, the Shangjun Sect seemed quite righteous. The current blood river seems inconsistent with their behavior.”","Chun Qiu glanced at him and then said calmly, “Often, the more righteous they appear on the surface, the more sinister they are behind the scenes. Don’t be deceived by appearances.”","“That makes sense. So, what do we do next...”","“We must protect Eternal Wushuang with all our might, and, also, eliminate the root cause.”","Boom! Boom! Boom!","With the combined full-force attack of Chen Qing, Cui Jing, Chun Qiu, and Wei Liujia, the Blood Sea Serpent, which stretched for billions of feet, was directly shattered, its divine thoughts extinguished, and it miserably fell into the surging sea of blood.","The sea of blood receded, revealing the still-standing Eternal Wushuang Heavenly Palace.","But this situation only lasted for a moment, and an endless sea of blood once again surged.","This time, it was even more frenzied.","Countless serpents churned out of the sea of blood, attacking the Heavenly Palace.","At the same time, ripples appeared on the surface of the blood sea, and a dark red figure emerged from it.","His Immortal body was surrounded by an unimaginable amount of blood aura, as if he was covered in a layer of blood armor. Although this figure had changed greatly, one could still recognize him at a glance. He was the Young Master of Shangjun Sect, Qin Tuo.","At this moment, he was completely different from the one who had bid at the auction house.","Bloodthirsty, sinister, filled with some unknown prohibition, it was terrifying to the extreme.","He emerged from the sea of blood and approached Chen Qing and the others.","They all sensed the anomaly behind them and then saw this scene.","“Qin Tuo? How did you turn into this ghostly appearance?” Cui Jing frowned, clearly more disgusted with Qin Tuo.","“Something’s not right, be careful, everyone,” Chen Qing said in a low voice, then released a probing burst of Yan power towards Qin Tuo.","The violent burst of Yan power stabbed directly at Qin Tuo, who had no way to evade.","But then, he quietly raised his palm and a blood mirror suddenly appeared in front of him, completely absorbing Chen Qing’s Yan power.","Then, the blood mirror trembled and astonishingly reflected Chen Qing’s previous Yan power attack, with its power multiplied!","Chen Qing’s brow furrowed deeply, and he drew his true sword from his waist to cut off those Yan power bursts.","“This guy is indeed suspicious. Be cautious, everyone,” he said.","“Hey, junior from the Shangjun Sect, do you really intend to go against the Eternal Wushuang?” Cui Jing coldly shouted.","Qin Tuo, who was already enveloped by the sea of blood, revealed a sly smile at the corner of his mouth. “What does Eternal Wushuang Heavenly Palace amount to? Dare to speak to me like this?”","“Well, then, today, I’ll just exterminate all of you.”","As soon as Qin Tuo said this, an endless sea of blood surged, crashing toward Chen Qing and the others.","“Humph, petty tricks,” Feng Shan shouted, and then his celestial body suddenly doubled in size, covered in a crimson aura, like a true divine mountain. He thundered against the sea of blood.","Rumble...","Feng Shan’s figure only existed for a moment, and it was actually swallowed up and absorbed by the surging sea of blood.","Chen Qing’s expression changed slightly, and without thinking, he shouted, “Retreat, there’s something wrong here.”","“We can’t retreat, the Eternal Wushuang Heavenly Palace is just behind us!” Chun Qiu said in a deep voice. “Feng Shan is also in danger; we mustn’t retreat!”","“Then let’s open a path of blood!” Cui Jing held his black staff and rushed forward without any hesitation.","The sea of blood surged and roared as it surrounded them.","With Chen Qing as the leader, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, and Wei Liujia all charged towards the blood sea.","The full-powered attack of the four Yan Immortals tore open a crack almost instantly.","But what awaited them was not Qin Tuo, but a world that seemed soaked in blood, everything in sight bathed in crimson.","“Where is this place?” Cui Jing said, puzzled.","“I’m afraid we’ve fallen into Qin Tuo’s trap,” Chun Qiu frowned.","Wei Liujia’s eyes lit up. “Feng Shan is ahead!”","Following his pointing finger, they saw that the mountain-like Feng Shan was now lying in the bloody mess, its fate uncertain.","Wei Liujia did not say anything more, he went straight to assist.","“Liujia, don’t go!” Chun Qiu shouted urgently, but it was a moment too late.","A sudden change occurred. Feng Shan, which had been lying in the bloody mess with an unknown fate, suddenly disappeared.","In its place, thin bloodlines, as thick as fingers, shot out from the ground and rapidly attached to Wei Liujia’s Immortal body.","In an instant, they pulled him directly into the river of blood, and he disappeared completely.","Because all of this happened in an instant, when they tried to rush to his aid, it was already too late.","Chen Qing stepped forward, angrily shouting, “You damn b*stard, hand them over, or we’ll go to the Shangjun Sect and kill all of you, none of you will survive!”","A soft laugh, with a hint of mockery, echoed in this blood-red world without warning.","“Truly noisy. Today, none of you will survive, that’s for sure.”","Qin Tuo, wrapped in the river of blood, quietly appeared, like a blood-red sun, hanging high in the sky, surrounded by Blood Qi.","Endless beams of Blood Qi descended, rapidly devouring all their Immortal powers.","He raised both arms, and blood-red diamond-shaped mirrors appeared all around him.","In each mirror, there were reflections of Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and Cui Jing, their figures and faces distorted to the extreme.","Chun Qiu’s expression changed slightly. Then, he seemed to realize something and hurriedly looked at his Immortal body.","His Immortal body was already covered in a faint layer of blood mist, and as time passed, it gradually solidified.","The same situation occurred on Chen Qing and Cui Jing.","Chun Qiu’s expression became solemn. “Have you felt it? The Yan power within us is dissipating.”","Chen Qing and Cui Jing nodded simultaneously, then they all looked towards Qin Tuo in the void."]},{"number":5055,"title":"Chapter 5055 Blood Mirror World","paragraphs":["5055 Blood Mirror World","Without a doubt, the changes in their Immortal bodies were all caused by Qin Tuo.","The binding became heavier and almost solidified.","“Damn it, could it be because of those mirrors?” Cui Jing was already panting slightly.","With the rapid loss of the Yan power, the blood mist that surrounded their Immortal bodies became more and more solid. It was as if they were wearing blood armor. If they waited any longer, there would be consequences.","At this moment, there were already no less than 100,000 blood-colored prismatic mirrors surrounding Qin Tuo.","Each mirror reflected the faces of Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and Cui Jing. The blood flowing inside made their faces look strange.","“Playing tricks.” Chen Qing’s expression was ice-cold. After which, he waved his arm, and the True Sword in his hand shot out.","In an instant, the sword light rose and swept across the sky.","Nearly 10,000 pure Sword Intents slashed toward Qin Tuo and the blood mirrors around him.","This sword strike was infused with Chen Qing’s Immortal Style. it was an incredibly powerful strike, one that even fellow Yan Immortal cultivators would have to avoid.","But Qin Tuo did not dodge; he remained suspended in the air like a blood-red sun. Then, he raised his arms, and the 100,000 mirrors advanced like a tide, one after the other, suppressing Chen Qing’s Immortal Style sword technique.","100,000 mirrors aimed to disperse the impact.","However, these were still not enough for the Immortal Style.","In almost an instant, tens of thousands of the mirrors were shattered.","It was like a blood rain falling from the sky, the mirrors shattered and scattered across the firmament.","Chen Qing’s Immortal Style was too domineering; 100,000 blood mirrors couldn’t stop it, they were all shattered and disappeared.","Then, all the Sword Intent continued unabated, piercing towards Qin Tuo.","As long as this celestial technique hit its mark, Chen Qing was entirely confident in obliterating him.","But then, a strange scene unfolded!","As the endless Sword Intent pierced towards Qin Tuo, it was directly devoured and absorbed.","For a brief moment of silence, Qin Tuo smirked, suddenly shaking his arms and erupting with all the devoured Sword Intent.","Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and Cui Jing were all shocked and quickly released their Yan power to resist.","Boom, boom, boom...","Each sword intent was far stronger than before, to the point where Chen Qing and the others were almost unable to withstand it.","The world-shrouding blood-red sword radiance eventually dissipated, and Chen Qing withdrew his heavily damaged Yan power barrier, leaping forward to confront Qin Tuo.","Chun Qiu and Cui Jing moved one after another, releasing their own Yan power to surround them.","“You overestimate yourself!”","Qin Tuo smirked and, in the next moment, his body directly refracted tens of thousands of strands of blood light, boldly colliding with Chen Qing.","Boom!","A deafening sound reverberated, causing the entire blood-red world to tremble.","Blood light surged, spilling into the void.","The combined full-strength attack of the three Yan Immortal cultivators was intercepted by Qin Tuo himself, and he didn’t even take a step back.","This was truly astonishing.","Chen Qing frowned slightly. He realized that the situation was far from simple.","The changes caused by all this had long exceeded his imagination. Qin Tuo was definitely more terrifying than he had imagined.","Immediately after, Qin Tuo let out a low chuckle and his fists struck Chen Qing heavily.","Chen Qing used his palms to deflect the force, but he was shocked to find that his own Yan power, when it touched Qin Tuo, was like sinking into a swamp and was rapidly swallowed.","In an instant, a barrage of punches, each one struck heavily on Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and Cui Jing’s Immortal bodies.","Splish-splash!!","They were sent flying and crashed heavily into the river of blood.","However, this was just the beginning.","Above the void, Qin Tuo was almost mad. His clothing was torn to shreds, leaving his chest bare. Countless blood-colored Yan power surged out and transformed into serpents that rushed into the river of blood.","The blood river churned up waves of blood that almost enveloped the entire blood-red world.","Blood mist filled the sky, and Qin Tuo’s face was gloomy. His eyes were like two blood mirrors, emitting a mysterious and eerie power.","This blood-red world, situated between illusion and reality, was created by Qin Tuo himself. Even those who had mastered immortal techniques, only one step away from becoming Grand Yan Immortals, couldn’t escape from it.","The only way in this world was death.","Here, he was the supreme master of everything.","“Argh...”","Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and Cui Jing all surfaced from the blood river simultaneously, but they could not break free. Blood Serpents coiled around their Immortal bodies, dragging them madly into the river of blood.","“Damn thing, who is this guy? Why is my Yan power being suppressed so heavily by him?!”","Cui Jing struggled to catch his breath.","Chen Qing and Chun Qiu were both struggling, barely able to protect themselves.","This blood river, and even the entire blood-red world, was too bizarre. Their Yan power was rapidly diminishing, and they couldn’t even replenish it.","Their arms were tightly entwined, to the point where they couldn’t even consume the Emperor-grade pills they carried with them.","Chen Qing looked at Qin Tuo in the void, then he shouted, and in an instant, an extreme surge of Yan power flowed through his body.","“Control Heaven—”","Like the collapse of a great sun, an extremely pure Yan power swept through the vast expanse.","The Blood Serpents coiled around Chen Qing were instantly reduced to powder. He broke free from their bindings, then grabbed Chun Qiu and Cui Jing, pulling them out of the blood sea.","This was Chen Qing’s Immortal Style, his most powerful attack.","Under this attack, the entire Blood Mirror World trembled, and countless cracks covered every corner.","It was like a real mirror, about to shatter.","But this situation only existed for an instant and was quickly repaired.","Qin Tuo, with a sinister smile, charged directly at Chen Qing.","Blood radiance burst forth, sweeping across the vast expanse, then descending.","Chen Qing, wrapped in the supremely pure Yan power, pushed Chunqiu and Cui Jing far away and confronted Qin Tuo alone.","Boom—","At that moment, it was as if a thousand stars were being annihilated.","Chen Qing’s Immortal Style ‘Control Heaven’ had too much power, almost instantly swallowing up Qin Tuo.","The entire bloody world was on the verge of collapse.","“Chen Qing!” Chun Qiu and Cui Jing shouted. They wanted to help, but they were repelled by the huge energy.","This terrifying fluctuation did not last long, only for a few dozen breaths.","As the energy finally dissipated, they could see Chen Qing’s retreating figure.","Cui Jing reacted quickly and hurriedly released his Yan power to support Chen Qing, who was flying backward.","Divine blood splattered, and his Immortal body was covered in wounds. His eyes were closed, and he was clearly unconscious.","“Qin Tuo is dead?”","Looking at the bloody mist in the bloody void, Chun Qiu realized that things were not that simple.","As if to confirm his thoughts, the sticky blood mist gathered again in the void, and quickly, limbs started to grow out of the blood mist.","Qin Tuo was not injured at all. In fact, the Blood Qi around his body became stronger and stronger.","Chun Qiu and Cui Jing stepped back slowly and looked at him solemnly.","This blood-colored world was too strange, causing the situation to completely deviate from its original scope.","If they were not careful, they might not be able to escape today.","The danger this time was far more violent and unpredictable than any other time in the past 20,000 years.","And the one who caused this was just a Yan Immortal."]},{"number":5056,"title":"Chapter 5056 Sword Against Mirror","paragraphs":["5056 Sword Against Mirror","This was a huge crisis!","Chen Qing, Fengshan, and Wei Liujia have all faced disasters, leaving only Chunqiu and Cui Jing struggling.","“Take care of Chen Qing; I’ll take the fight.” After leaving this sentence, Cui Jing resolutely rushed into the void.","Facing Qin Tuo, he raised his eight-foot mysterious staff diagonally and charged without the slightest hesitation.","As he brought down the staff, the virtual image of tens of thousands of feet descended like a black dragon, shaking the heavens and the earth.","Qin Tuo retreated, raised his right hand, and suddenly clenched it into a fist.","In an instant, countless threads of blood-red brilliance surged from behind him, sweeping toward Cui Jing like a deluge.","Buzz...","The blood-red and profound black clashed, and the virtual image of the staff shattered rapidly, but the blood-red brilliance did not diminish; it crazily twisted toward Cui Jing.","In just an instant, Cui Jing’s figure was engulfed in the blood-red torrent.","“Cui Jing!” Chun Qiu’s heart was filled with anxiety; he almost fell into the blood river while clutching Chen Qing.","The entire chaotic sky was almost covered by the blood-red flood, and it was difficult for Cui Jing to escape.","Qin Tuo stood with his hands behind his back, slowly approaching the spot where Cui Jing had stood before.","The next moment, a change occurred!","The chaotic blood river was torn apart without any warning.","As the blood river tore, a force as heavy as a mountain suddenly struck!","Because everything happened too quickly, even Qin Tuo couldn’t react.","Boom!","Unparalleled violence and a murderous aura erupted.","Under this strike, Qin Tuo’s entire right arm, along with his shoulder, was smashed into a cloud of blood mist.","Then, like a demonic god, Cui Jing walked out of the blood-red torrent. He was covered in blood, with the mysterious staff slung diagonally over his shoulder.","Facing the retreating Qin Tuo, he spat out a mouthful of blood and said fiercely, “As fellow Immortals, do you even deserve the qualifications to be so arrogant? Today, even if I have to shatter my own cultivation, I will extract your Immortal Bone!”","Qin Tuo’s shattered arm quickly regenerated. Furious, he released almost all his power. An endless blood-red torrent behind him formed a sky-covering diamond-shaped mirror.","The mirror reflected the endless blood river.","“Bah, he’s just playing tricks!” Cui Jing spat out another mouthful of blood and said with a ferocious expression.","This mirror was simply too vast, it was like a barrier connecting to a Super Heavenly Region plane.","Cui Jing stood before the mirror, feeling a chill like the depths of the ocean.","Inside the massive mirror, the river of blood surged, and then a vertical pupil appeared, exuding a mesmerizing power.","“Cui Jing, get back!” Chun Qiu sensed that something was wrong and urgently warned, but it was already too late.","Cui Jing stood still as if his soul had been sucked out, his eyes devoid of expression. Then he leaped into the mirror, swallowed by the river of blood.","Chun Qiu’s face turned pale. They had come as a group of five, and now only he remained. This situation was truly dire.","Feng Shan, Wei Liujia, and Cui Jing’s whereabouts were unknown, and Chen Qing had fallen unconscious. In this eerie crimson world, he was the only one left with the strength to fight.","He waved his hand, using his energy to suspend Chen Qing in mid-air, and stood in front of Qin Tuo.","“Hand them over, or you won’t be able to bear the consequences.”","Qin Tuo, tainted by the blood aura, smirked coldly. “You bunch of ragtag fighters have no strength left to fight, and you still think you can talk your way out?”","“Oh really? Are you so sure we have no strength left?” Chunqiu replied with a smile that wasn’t a smile.","Qin Tuo did not respond, but Chun Qiu’s question filled him with disgust.","Just as he was about to strike, the entire crimson world suddenly trembled.","The tremors were so violent that they instantly caused the earth to collapse and the blood river to reverse its flow.","Qin Tuo was taken aback, and even his cold demeanor wavered.","The shaking of the entire blood-red world was due to an external force, an unmistakable force.","Chun Qiu first tensed up, then a trace of joy appeared on his face. He felt a familiar, overwhelming power.","The once-dark sky began to shatter, countless rifts twisted and engulfed almost the entire sky.","In the next moment, starting from the center of the rifts, the entire sky collapsed and shattered, and the blood river reversed its flow.","A pure and supreme Yan power descended, pressing down on the blood river, keeping it at bay.","With the arrival of this figure, all the Blood Qi scattered and could not approach within a hundred miles of him.","Dressed in white, his clothes fluttering in the wind, long black hair billowing, his gaze carried an unparalleled majesty as he looked at Qin Tuo.","“Hngg...!”","He suddenly felt a powerful mental assault, almost causing him to collapse.","Qin Tuo grunted, stepped back several paces, and blood oozed from the corner of his mouth.","The newcomer was too terrifying. Just a single confrontation had brought them to this point. He was no ordinary Yan Immortal.","He looked at the figure in white, wearing clothes like a white jade gown, and a strange sense of familiarity washed over him.","“Brother Jian!” Chun Qiu shouted, “Cui Jing and the others have been taken to an unknown place by him.”","The newcomer was none other than Jian Wushuang. Earlier, when he was about to come with them, he had been forcibly held back by the Young Emperor, who had made him take some medicine before they left.","But the current situation was far more serious than he had imagined.","After hearing Chun Qiu’s words, Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows and looked at Qin Tuo, who resembled a blood gourd. For some reason, he felt a strange sense of familiarity with him.","However, he was certain that he had never seen Qin Tuo before.","“Hey, bring them all back, and I won’t pursue this,” Jian Wushuang said calmly, with an unquestionable demeanor, as if he were informing rather than negotiating.","Qin Tuo was taken aback, then annoyed. “You say bring them back, and they’ll be brought back? You must be delusional!”","Jian Wushuang was too lazy to waste his breath and flicked his finger.","In an instant, an extremely pure Sword Intent rose up and slashed forward.","This was an unstoppable sword aura; even if Qin Tuo realized it, he could only choose to resist it head-on.","“Splatter...”","Divine blood splattered as the Sword Intent almost cut Qin Tuo in half.","He grunted, and his eyes filled with murderous intent as he seemed to be willing to shatter his Immortal body, releasing an endless surge of Blood Qi.","The Blood Qi transformed, forming a million blood-colored mirrors, closing in on Jian Wushuang from every direction.","Watching this scene, Chun Qiu was greatly alarmed. “Brother Jian, get out of the way!!!”","However, Jian Wushuang did not dodge or evade. Instead, he looked with interest at the million blood-colored mirrors closing in like a vast sea.","Qin Tuo revealed a cruel smile; he was confident that no immortal could escape his grasp.","But in the next moment, a tremendous change occurred.","Under the encirclement of a million blood-colored mirrors, a pillar of deep blue light shot into the sky, dispersing the blood fog directly.","At the same time, a majestic figure appeared, casting a rainbow-colored halo over heaven and earth.","The figure opened its eyes, exuding an indescribable supreme majesty that swallowed everything!","The entire Blood Mirror World couldn’t withstand this energy and quickly collapsed.","The million mirrors quickly turned into dust, dissipating like the tide.","Qin Tuo was greatly alarmed and hastily retreated, but it was already too late"]},{"number":5057,"title":"Chapter 5057 Directly Entering Shangjun Sect","paragraphs":["5057 Directly Entering Shangjun Sect","Under the pressure of Wushuang Image Form, nothing impure could exist.","The million mirrors were instantly emptied, and the entire Blood Mirror World collapsed into nothingness.","Qin Tuo was not spared either. His Immortal body was shattered by Wushuang’s Image Form and turned into powder.","After all, he was only a Yan Immortal. Even if he was only one step away from Grand Yan Immortal, he was still a Yan Immortal. How could he withstand Jian Wushuang’s full-powered attack?","Everything turned into ashes, including the blood river that surrounded the Eternal Wushuang Heavenly Palace.","Qing Ling and the others opened the palace doors, still nervously scanning for any signs of danger.","Chun Qiu, carrying Chen Qing on his back, looked at the figure that had remained calm and composed throughout the entire battle. In his eyes, there was a hint of uncontrollable excitement.","Such a difficult battle, yet Jian Wushuang effortlessly resolved it with a casual gesture. This clearly indicated that in the nearly 20,000 years since his return from the Endless Sea, he had reached an unimaginable level of power.","At this moment, Chun Qiu’s heart was filled with excitement and joy.","But his joy didn’t last long because Qin Tuo, whose Immortal body had been destroyed by Jian Wushuang, unexpectedly reformed.","“Brother Jian, be careful!” Chun Qiu shouted loudly.","Qin Tuo let out a low chuckle and struck a palm towards Jian Wushuang’s back.","Terrifying Blood Qi rushed forward, piercing through without any hindrance, heading straight for Jian Wushuang.","It was like a stone thrown into a lake, creating layers of ripples.","His figure disappeared like smoke, incredibly elusive.","Qin Tuo was taken aback, realizing the danger. When he attempted to retreat, he found it was too late.","Cold sweat dripped from his temples as Qin Tuo keenly felt a finger pressing against his neck.","A moment later, a faint sound cut through the air. He felt a dizzying sensation in his head, and then his head and body separated.","Jian Wushuang swung his hand, severing Qin Tuo’s head. Holding it by the hair, he stepped toward the Eternal Wushuang Heavenly Palace.","“Lord, Lord Jian?!”","Qing Ling cried out in shock. She immediately realized that she had lost her composure and hurriedly lowered her head.","Jian Wushuang nodded with a smile and threw Qin Tuo’s head in the middle of the square.","“Release them and I will spare your life.”","Qin Tuo, who only had his head left, smiled slyly. “Do you think I’ll spit out what I’ve eaten?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. “Do you want to die?”","“Of course I want to die, but no one can put me in...”","Before he could finish his sentence, Jian Wushuang raised his foot and crushed Qin Tuo’s head.","Chun Qiu was shocked. “Brother Jian, if we kill him, I’m afraid that Feng Shan and the others...”","“This isn’t his true self, it’s just a shell.” Jian Wushuang said, “Feng Shan and the others should have been taken away by his true self a long time ago.”","Chun Qiu understood what he meant.","“Go to Little Lonely Heaven and call that Yan Immortal from Guhai City over, he should know the way.”","...","In the vast void, four figures that were like suns and stars were moving forward rapidly. They had already transcended the laws of order and the restraints of the Heavenly Dao. They were all Yan Immortals.","The leader was Jian Wushuang, who was dressed in white. Beside him were Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, who had just woken up, and Gu Ting, the Young Master of Guhai City.","“Motherf*cker, this time, when I go to their lair, I’ll first destroy their entire family! None of them can escape,” Chen Qing said angrily. Clearly, he was still bearing a grudge from before.","Chun Qiu also agreed with him. Since they had taken this opportunity to find the Shangjun Sect, there was no better way than to wipe them out once and for all.","However, Gu Ting appeared much more nervous. He had narrowly escaped from Qin Tuo’s clutches and was well aware of Qin Tuo’s formidable power.","Therefore, when he saw that only three Yan Immortals from the Eternal Wushuang Auction House had been sent, he couldn’t help but find it somewhat absurd.","One must know that the Shangjun Sect was one of the top super forces in the entire Great Si Region. It was an existence that even Guhai City feared. The number of Yan Immortals in their sect alone would likely exceed 50.","Furthermore, it was rumored that the Shangjun Sect’s Sect Master was already a Quasi-Grand Yan Immortal. Yet, Eternal Wushuang Auction House had only dispatched three Yan Immortals.","In the eyes of Gu Ting, this was almost equivalent to seeking death.","His injuries had just stabilized, and if he were to directly confront the Shangjun Sect, there would be almost no chance of survival.","For the sake of his own fate, Gu Ting finally said, “Seniors, if we go straight to the Shangjun Sect, won’t we be too weak? How about I go and consult with our Patriarch to request reinforcements?”","Jian Wushuang smiled. “No need.”","Then, Chen Qing waved his hand broadly, “Absolutely not necessary. Even with just us, even if we add your forces from Guhai City, it wouldn’t be an easy task to annihilate the Shangjun Sect.”","“But now, it’s different. As long as Brother Jian is here, even if there were ten Shangjun Sects, it wouldn’t be enough to kill him.”","Gu Ting furrowed his brows, uncertain about how to respond. As the second-in-command of the Eternal Wushuang, Chen Qing’s words clearly carried weight, especially with the presence of the leader, Chun Qiu, which further increased their credibility.","However, he still couldn’t believe it. After all, only a Grand Yan Immortal had the power to destroy an entire Super Heavenly Region. Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and that mysterious man clearly hadn’t reached the level of a Grand Yan Immortal.","This was undoubtedly a gamble of life.","Gu Ting gritted his teeth, momentarily unsure of what to do.","Seemingly aware of his concerns, Jian Wushuang, who was walking with his hands behind his back, spoke calmly, “You only need to lead us to the location of the Shangjun Sect. You won’t need to visit them personally; just guide us there directly.”","Gu Ting was startled and then lowered his head in embarrassment.","The Great Si Region established by Zhen Wuyang was almost infinite in size, gathering more than ten former Emperors’ territories. The vastness of this area was unimaginable.","However, after the battle of the Emperors in the Ancient Era, almost half of the countless Heavenly Region planes in the realm had been destroyed.","Even after countless years and the universe’s reincarnation, it had yet to fully recover.","However, despite this, some Heavenly Regions had received the blessings of the new Heavenly Court and had risen to become Super Heavenly Regions.","And the Shangjun Sect was naturally one of them.","Under Gu Ting’s guidance, the Heavenly Region where the Shangjun Sect was located soon appeared in Jian Wushuang’s sight.","A massive gate was erected in the void, magnificent and ethereal, with Immortal clouds billowing and auspicious cranes singing. From a distance, it exuded the aura of a super sect.","The word ‘Shangjun’ was embedded on the gates, clearly marking it as the location of the Shangjun Sect.","Jian Wushuang remained calm as ever, walking with his hands behind his back.","Chen Qing and Cui Jing followed closely behind, their eyes filled with unconcealed killing intent.","Gu Ting opened his mouth, but he didn’t say anything. His heart was in turmoil, torn between whether to leave or stay.","After a moment, he clenched his teeth and made a decision. Without looking back, he followed Jian Wushuang, heading straight for the Shangjun Sect!"]},{"number":5058,"title":"Chapter 5058 Gathering of the Elders","paragraphs":["5058 Gathering of the Elders","Immortal clouds curled up and auspicious signs rang out. This was an auspicious land.","Standing in the void was the heavenly gate, the gateway of the Shangjun Sect. At this moment, several top cultivators were guarding it.","The Immortal aura circulated. Behind the heavenly gate was a huge Immortal Array.","“Stop. Yan Immortal, which faction are you from? Our sect is not open to the public, please move.”","A cool breeze swept across and a top cultivator guarding the heavenly gate extended his hand to block Jian Wushuang’s path.","Without waiting for Jian Wushuang to speak, Chen Qing slapped several top cultivators and sent them flying thousands of feet away, opening the door of Shangjun Sect.","Then, Jian Wushuang slowly entered the heavenly gate.","Behind the gate was not the Heavenly Region of the Shangjun Sect. Instead, it was a huge and chaotic Immortal Array Formation.","“They’re using strange tricks, a sure sign they’re up to no good,” Chen Qing said in a deep voice and directly waved his hand to blast out a beam of Yan power.","However, when the Yan power strip collided with the Immortal Formation, it was easily absorbed and couldn’t be shattered.","“I’m afraid we can’t barge in here. The Immortal Array creates a barrier,” Chun Qiu said thoughtfully.","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang raised his hand and easily tore the barrier on the Immortal Array Formation.","“...”","“...”","“Let’s go.” He gestured and then stepped into the Immortal Array.","When he went to Prince Jiu’s Great Mi Heaven, Jian Wushuang felt the marvel of the Teleportation Immortal Array. It was not bad and could instantly go to any place within the Immortal Array Formation’s path.","The origin of the Teleportation Immortal Array had long been unknown, but it had completely flourished in the era of Zhen Wuyang.","In order to destroy Heavenly Court, large-scale deployment of Yan Immortals was extremely important, and Zhen Wuyang used the Teleportation Immortal Formation to successfully destroy Heavenly Court after Heavenly Court.","It was also because of this that even after countless years, there were still Immortal Array Formations that remained in some Super Heavenly Regions.","With a thought, they stood on a land shrouded in Immortal clouds.","“Is this Shangjun Sect? Why does it not look like a place for hiding impurities?” Chen Qing stroked his chin and looked at the ancient pavilion.","At this moment, Gu Ting was extremely nervous. “Um, this should be the location of the Shangjun Sect. I also passed by here with the clan elders billions of years ago and never visited this place.”","“For now, let’s not worry about it. Let’s go in and see!” Chen Qing said in a low voice.","At this point, Jian Wushuang spoke, “Let’s not act hastily. If the Shangjun Sect is indeed a righteous sect, we’ll spare them this time. If not, we can always take action later.”","Chun Qiu, Chen Qing, and Gu Ting nodded simultaneously.","Immortal clouds curled up and the mountain was majestic. Countless green Immortal trees were growing vigorously. Ancient buildings were like dragons, quietly hibernating in the mountain range.","At this moment, it was still early morning, and some disciples had already begun their morning breathing exercises. They were diligently cultivating in their respective Dao Arenas.","Jian Wushuang walked with his hands behind his back, paying no attention to the disciples of the Shangjun Sect.","His goal was very clear: he headed straight for the main hall of the Shangjun Sect.","Soon, the disciples of Shangjun Sect found the uninvited guests and began to gather in the direction of the hall.","The main hall of the Shangjun Sect was located at the very center of the vast Heavenly Region plane, occupying the most abundant source of Yan power.","In just a few dozen breaths of time, Jian Wushuang stepped onto the main hall’s square.","The square was grand, and the main hall was magnificent, exuding an awe-inspiring presence.","In the center of the square, there was a massive sundial, with each direction corresponding to a constellation.","Chen Qing directly leaped onto the sundial platform and shouted, “Old rascal inside the hall, come out!!”","As if the water had suddenly boiled, the main hall opened, and more than ten old men in black robes walked out, all with an imposing presence.","With just one glance, Jian Wushuang knew that these old men were all Yan Immortals.","A long-bearded old man in the lead had an unfriendly expression on his face. “Where did you come from? How dare you stand on the sundial? Don’t you know how to write the word ‘death’?”","Chen Qing sneered and said disdainfully, “What? Do you want to teach me?”","The long-bearded old man was furious. He slammed his ancient staff into the ground, instantly sending a pure surge of Yan power forward.","Chen Qing raised his hand and effortlessly shattered the oncoming Yan power.","“Don’t embarrass yourself by using some random technique. Don’t force me to go on a killing spree!” Chen Qing shouted angrily, “Hand over Qin Tuo, or every single one of you will die!”","A thunderous atmosphere filled the air, and all the elders and disciples took a step back, their faces tense.","The long-bearded old man spoke again, taking a step forward, “Junior, the Shangjun Sect is not a place for your arrogance. You can still leave now to avoid serious consequences.”","“Of course, we can leave, but first, return my three brothers,” Chun Qiu stepped forward and said.","The long-bearded old man’s eyebrows trembled slightly. He obviously knew something, but he still said, “The elders and disciples of the Shangjun Sect have not stepped out of the sect for millions of years. Naturally, we don’t know the whereabouts of the brothers you mentioned. I think there must be some misunderstanding.”","“Old thief, dare you still speak nonsense with your eyes open?” Chen Qing, filled with anger, laughed mockingly and struck out with a palm towards all the elders.","The elders quickly reacted and used their powers to resist.","Chen Qing had already comprehended his own Immortal Style and was only a step away from the Grand Yan Immortal realm. He was a Quasi-Grand Yan Immortal. With his full force attack, it was enough to make ordinary Yan Immortals unable to withstand it.","The 15 elders struggled with all their might to resist Chen Qing’s attack.","The elder with a long white beard at the forefront almost couldn’t maintain his stance, and his vital energy and blood surged within his Immortal body.","Chen Qing coldly shouted, “Anyone who doesn’t want to die, step aside. Today, I’m here to seek justice. If you insist on not backing down, don’t blame me for annihilating the sect!”","As soon as he said that, all the Shangjun Sect disciples were in an uproar and quickly retreated.","The elder with the long white beard had a changeable expression and eventually looked towards another elder, giving a subtle signal.","Then, the two elders quickly entered the hall.","“I believe there must be some misunderstanding in this matter. Please stay for a moment,” the elder with the long white beard said in a deep voice after taking a deep breath.","Chen Qing did not speak any further and turned to look at the calmly composed Sword Peerless.","In front of the grand hall, in the center of the square, a brief silence fell.","After a few breaths, Jian Wushuang moved forward slowly.","Gu Ting’s eyebrows twitched. For some reason, every time he saw Jian Wushuang, he could not help but feel nervous. It was as if he was gazing into an unfathomable abyss, impossible to fathom.","At the same time, there was a hidden sense of anticipation in Gu Ting’s heart. What kind of existence was Jian Wushuang, who could make both the leader and the second-in-command of the Eternal Wushuang willingly follow him?","Soon, he witnessed an almost unimaginable scene.","Jian Wushuang was alone in front of more than ten elders of Shangjun Sect. With a casual wave of his hand, he sent them flying.","...","More than a dozen senior elders of the Shangjun Sect, who had immersed themselves in the cultivation of Immortality for countless years, were all sent flying, smashing the doors of the hall heavily and rolling into the interior of the grand hall."]},{"number":5059,"title":"Chapter 5059 Breaking the Sect With a Single Sword Strike","paragraphs":["5059 Breaking the Sect With a Single Sword Strike","The grand hall, built with warm jade, had a simple and dignified facade, but now it was riddled with more than a dozen holes, looking both ridiculous and absurd.","More than a dozen senior elders of the sect had been beaten and were rolling on the ground like gourds. They hadn’t even had the chance to release their Yan power, and they lay in the hall like toppled old dogs, utterly silent.","Silence, a deafening silence.","Nearly 1,000 disciples who had come to the front of the Shangjun Grand Hall witnessed this scene, completely dumbfounded.","Their elders, who were highly respected and had unfathomable strength, had actually been beaten into rolling gourds?","Gu Ting was flabbergasted. He even tried hard to blink his eyes, trying to see if it was an illusion.","This was simply unimaginable. Just a single slap had sent more than ten Yan Immortals flying. Looking at it, even a Quasi-Grand Yan Immortal probably couldn’t achieve such a feat!","But now, this scene had actually happened.","“Brat, you’re courting death!”","A thunderous shout echoed out, led by the old man with long beard. 13 Shangjun Sect elders charged out of the Grand Hall, launching an attack on Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, time seemed to stand still, and the perceptions of every cultivator and Yan Immortal present appeared to slow down.","Only Jian Wushuang remained unaffected, his movements unchanged as he ascended the steps step by step.","Looking at the elders surrounding him from all directions, he appeared indifferent.","However, he raised his hand casually and made a simple gesture.","Sword Intent Spread!","Pfft—","A distinct tearing sound reached the ears of every cultivator present.","Then, all 13 elders groaned simultaneously and were once again sent flying backward.","As they fell, their colorful divine blood splattered the jade steps, forming a bloody path.","13 elders, 13 Yan Immortals , all had their right arms disabled in that moment.","The divine blood flowed from their severed arms, staining the jade steps red.","In their eyes, only fear remained as they clutched their severed arms and retreated incessantly.","Jian Wushuang, dressed in his pearly white robes, remained untainted by a single drop of blood. He walked slowly, ascending the steps.","“I’ll give you one last chance. Will you die here in obscurity, or will your Sect Master come out?” Jian Wushuang spoke calmly, without a hint of emotion.","The elderly man with a long beard, who led the group, pale-faced and holding his severed arm, said, “Junior, do you realize you are opposing our entire Shangjun Sect?”","He raised an eyebrow and replied, “So what?”","“Chen Qing, sword!”","“He’s it is!” On the square, Chen Qing laughed loudly, pulled out the True Sword from his waist, and threw it at Jian Wushuang.","Clang–","The True Sword broke through the clouds and landed in his hand.","Seemingly seeing through his intentions, the long-bearded old man’s heart trembled and he cried out involuntarily, “No!”","But it was already too late.","Jian Wushuang guided the sword with his hand, unleashing the most dazzling force.","At this moment, it was as if a thousand suns shattered, and the fringe-like power flowed and blossomed.","All cultivators, including the immortal practitioners, couldn’t even look directly at it.","With a single slash, the grand hall that had stood for countless ages in this realm shattered with a resounding crash.","The intricate beams and painted rafters turned into ruins, pavilions and towers crumbled into powder.","The rotating order of the heavens and the Dao collapsed and ceased to exist.","One sword strike destroyed the sect!","The fringe-like power scattered, and all disciples of the Shangjun Sect opened their eyes, their faces turning pale.","The pavilions and towers had turned into level ground, and nothing remained.","Chen Qing was exhilarated, punching the air with his fist. After exchanging a glance with Chun Qiu, he leaped towards Jian Wushuang.","Gu Ting was completely shocked. His chest heaved up and down violently.","This scene was too shocking. The foundation of the Shangjun Sect had been reduced to dust by a single sword strike.","He had a strong intuition that the Supreme Sect was in grave danger today.","In front of the shattered hall, Jian Wushuang returned the sword to Chen Qing without even glancing at the elders of the Shangjun Sect, who were already mentally defeated. He walked straight into the ruins.","His goal was to find Cui Jing, Wei Liujia, and Feng Shan, and no one could stop him.","Soon, Jian Wushuang stopped walking.","Because a slender and stooped figure blocked his path.","“You cannot proceed any further,” the thin, stooped figure said, their voice raspy yet resolute.","“Sure. Return those three Immortal practitioners you shouldn’t have touched, and I won’t pursue this further,” Jian Wushuang said decisively.","Unexpectedly, the hunchbacked figure shook his head. “It’s impossible now. The Shangjun Heavenly Palace has been damaged by you, enough to offset the lives of those three Yan Immortals.”","Jian Wushuang smirked coldly, “It seems that you don’t intend to hand them over?”","“Please leave now, or else the consequences are beyond what you can bear,” the hunched figure continued.","“Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, attack,” Jian Wushuang shouted coldly.","Chen Qing and Chun Qiu responded without any hesitation, moving directly forward.","And that mysterious hunched figure, who seemed to come out of nowhere, also sprang into action. His movements were incredibly agile, like a ghost, as he confronted them head-on.","Fists clashed with palms, and terrifying Yan power surged like a torrent, directly sweeping everything away.","Buzz!","Like an ancient thunderclap, it reverberated through the heavens, powerful enough to clear the skies.","Under the assault of Chen Qing and Chun Qiu, the hunched figure unexpectedly withstood their attacks without retreating a step.","Then, he shook his arms, sending Chen Qing and Chun Qiu flying dozens of yards away.","“You’re asking for death!” Chen Qing shouted, launching a powerful punch that tore through the air, causing the heavens to change color.","Chun Qiu also joined the battle, a short sword with intricate purple patterns emerging from his sleeve, thrusting fiercely forward.","These were the full-powered strikes of two peak Yan Immortals.","The hunched figure remained in place, unflinching, choosing to endure their attacks.","Boom, boom...","In an instant, the ruins and debris turned to dust, and all the disciples of the Shangjun Sect who were present retreated thousands of yards, scattered in all directions.","The hunched figure staggered back ten yards, a short sword deeply embedded in his chest, with blood gushing out and staining the ground.","“Let’s go.” Jian Wushuang sternly commanded and was about to move forward.","“You... can’t go!” The hunchbacked figure opened his arms in an attempt to stop him.","Jian Wushuang ignored him, extending his hand to release a stream of Yan power to bind him, then proceeded toward the depths of the ruins.","The entire Shangjun Sect hall and even the plane itself were thoroughly disrupted, resembling a doomsday scene.","Jian Wushuang destroyed the Shangjun Sect’s main hall with one sword strike. He did not kill them all. Instead, he followed the faint aura and walked deeper into the main hall.","“Do you have to do this?” A low, almost seductive voice resonated from the wreckage, carrying a captivating aura.","Jian Wushuang halted his steps, looking impassively ahead.","After a few breaths, the entire space began to tremble, and then strands of misty gray spiritual energy appeared, converging into a figure in a black robe.","This black-robed figure was tall and extremely skinny, with a strange, skull-like face.","“I have no intention of destroying your Shangjun Sect; I’ve come to retrieve my friends,” Jian Wushuang said. “Release them, and I will leave.”","A strong wind suddenly rose from the ruins, making everything even more bizarre."]},{"number":5060,"title":"Chapter 5060 The True Eye Appears","paragraphs":["5060 The True Eye Appears","The black-robed figure remained silent, fixing a steady gaze upon Sword Unparalleled.","“Are you here to stop my son from ascending to the position of Grand Yan Immortal?”","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank when he heard that. He had a bad feeling.","“Tell me, where are they? If he didn’t say it, the Shangjun Sect would definitely die a tragic death!”","The figure in the black robe was none other than Qin Zun, the Sect Master of the Shangjun Sect, and Qin Tuo was his son.","Faced with Jian Wushuang’s interrogation, he paid no heed and anger began to show in his eyes.","“All elders and disciples of Shangjun Sect, listen up. Hurry to the Heavenly Pavilion and kill the enemies!”","Jian Wushuang’s face turned cold. “Do you want all the disciples to die with you?”","“You guys deserve to die!” Qin Zun said angrily, “You’re just a puny little Yan Immortal. I can kill you with a flip of my hand!”","Jian Wushuang felt disgusted and raised his hand to slap him.","Unmatched Yan Power surged instantaneously, carrying an overwhelming force.","Qin Zun reacted quickly, raising both arms to meet the attack, and his Yan Power rose to shatter Jian Wushuang’s assault.","As the Sect Master of Shangjun Sect, he had already comprehended his own Immortal Style several years ago, and was only a step away from becoming a Grand Yan Immortal.","Faced with Jian Wushuang, who was only at the Yan Immortal realm, he naturally didn’t take him seriously.","However, in the following moments, Qin Zun realized how absurd his thoughts had been.","Unusually, Jian Wushuang rushed forward with a faint bloodlust in his eyes.","His speed was so astonishing that when Qin Zun finally reacted, a heavy punch struck his chest.","A crisp sound of bones breaking echoed as his chest caved in, and then his entire body was sent flying a hundred yards, crashing into ruins.","Jian Wushuang moved like a ghost, and by the time Qin Zun landed, he had already arrived in front of him, delivering another powerful punch.","The distinct sound of bones breaking resonated once more.","Even though Qin Zun was a quasi-Grand Yan Immortal with an incredibly robust Immortal body, he was still no match for Jian Wushuang.","Dust flew everywhere, and intense shockwaves rippled.","None of the Shangjun Sect’s elders and disciples dared to take a step forward after hearing Qin Zun’s order.","Blood Qi swirled around like a sea of blood.","This was Jian Wushuang’s Slaughter Dao, and only his Slaughter Dao could produce such pure Blood Qi.","In the span of ten breaths, a total of 10,000 punches, each one landing squarely on Qin Zun’s Immortal body.","When Jian Wushuang finally stopped, Qin Zun was on the brink of death.","His immortal bones were shattered, and there was no hope of recovery in the short term.","Slowly exhaling a heavy breath, he lifted his hand and tossed Qin Zun, who was like a dead dog, far away, then fixed his gaze on the ground beneath his feet.","With the Slaughter Dao infused in him, Jian Wushuang’s sensitivity to Blood Qi had reached an unprecedented level, and he sensed the unrest in the ground beneath him.","This was the very center of the Upper Equivalence Sect’s main hall, where the Yan power and Blood Qi were most concentrated, and it was highly likely that Qin Tuo’s hiding place was here.","With this in mind, Jian Wushuang no longer hesitated. He turned his right hand, and an invisible sword materialized.","Then, he forcefully thrust the Invisible Sword into the ground.","The next moment, the entire Immortal mountain trembled, and an indescribable wave erupted.","All the elders and disciples of the Shangjun Sect were once again pushed back a hundred feet, and even Chen Qing and Chun Qiu could not stand their ground and were forced back a hundred feet as well.","The Immortal clouds dispersed, and the towering Immortal mountain was riddled with cracks, and pure golden intent flowed within the fissures.","Then the Immortal mountain shattered, turning into heavy rocks that fell into the mountain stream.","As the Immortal mountain disintegrated, a mass of Blood Qi, like a scorching sun, rose from it.","The Blood Qi were chaotic, emitting a strange color, with an indescribably dark black at its core that even Jian Wushuang couldn’t see through.","However, the aura emitted by this Blood Qi seemed to have crossed that threshold.","As the Blood Qi rose, the entire Heavenly Region was dyed red.","Jian Wushuang frowned as he felt the inexplicable familiarity again.","The Blood Qi gradually dissipated. In the center of the chaos was a figure.","He was none other than Qin Tuo, whose head had been severed earlier.","At this moment, his entire body was covered in dark red patterns, and in the void behind him, there was a tightly closed eye wheel suspended in the air.","The aura emitted by Qin Tuo far exceeded that of an Immortal, truly reaching the realm of a Grand Yan Immortal.","Although the difference between a Yan Immortal and a Grand Yan Immortal was only a thin line, it was an unimaginable chasm that 99 percent of Yan Immortals could not cross. Only less than 1 percent of Yan Immortals could ascend to the position of a Grand Yan Immortal.","The difficulty of this was simply indescribable.","Jian Wushuang frowned. At this moment, he did not care if Qin Tuo was a Grand Yan Immortal or not. What he was most worried about was the whereabouts of Cui Jing and the others.","“This is the power of intent that only Grand Yan Immortals can control? How wonderful.” Qin Tuo smiled wickedly and looked forward.","Their eyes met, and Qin Tuo made the first move!","He casually flicked his hand, and the chains of the Great Dao formed by his power of extension directly entwined around Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s Sword Intent soared into the sky.","Facing the countless chains of the Great Dao, a million Sword Intents converged into one line, boldly confronting them.","Clang!","The heavens and the earth trembled, and at this moment, the chains of the Great Dao were shattered, but the million Sword Intents continued their momentum, directly attacking Qin Tuo.","Crimson Blood Qi surged and collided head-on.","Moreover, at this moment, the enormous eye wheel suspended in the void behind Qin Tuo slowly opened.","T","he vertical pupils were ice-cold, devoid of any emotion, only exuding a beguiling, captivating intent.","With the opening of this eye wheel, everything quietly changed.","Anyone who made eye contact with it, including Yan Immortals, would be directly ensnared.","At this moment, all the disciples and even the elders of the Shangjun Sect were ensnared, and they began to madly fight each other.","Gu Ting was greatly alarmed, and he almost succumbed as well. However, Chen Qing slapped him back to reality, holding his face in shock as he watched this scene.","“Don’t look at that eye. I can save you once, but I can’t guarantee a second time,” Chen Qing warned him before falling silent.","After jointly constructing a barrier, Chun Qiu looked worriedly at Jian Wushuang’s back. This bewitching power was too strange, and a slight lapse in judgment could lead to becoming ensnared.","If Jian Wushuang were to be ensnared, things would become completely uncontrollable.","Facing the eye wheel with its bewitching power, Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow. As a master of perfect Divine Sense, he naturally sensed the bewitching power emanating from the eye wheel, primarily designed to erode one’s Divine Sense.","For ordinary Yan Immortals, a slight mistake might lead to being ensnared.","“Have you had enough of your bewitching?” Jian Wushuang frowned, then raised his hand and slapped it toward Qin Tuo.","This palm, containing boundless Sword Intent, was like a hurricane. It effortlessly severed the chains of the Great Dao and descended upon Qin Tuo’s Immortal body and the enormous eye wheel behind him.","Qin Tuo hadn’t expected that Jian Wushuang would not be affected by the bewitching power. He also hadn’t expected such a rapid counterattack.","So much so that he did not even have time to react and had to forcibly withstand this powerful and heavy blow"]},{"number":5061,"title":"Chapter 5061 Killing","paragraphs":["5061 Killing","The sky cracked open, revealing deep chasms and exposing the turbulent void, where the gales of energy roared.","Meanwhile, Qin Tuo was like a kite with a broken string, hurtling backward for thousands of yards, shattering several divine peaks and Immortal mountains before coming to a halt.","The sword intent filled the sky, all pointing directly at Qin Tuo.","In the void, the eye wheel was like a totem, watching over everything.","“You’re courting death!” Qin Tuo roared as he walked out of the shattered Immortal mountain.","He waved his arms, releasing waves of formidable Yan power that wrapped around Jian Wushuang.","“How noisy.” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. He reached out and crushed all the Yan power that was coming at him.","Then, he leaped towards Qin Tuo.","A heavy punch thundered forth, and the fist’s energy ruptured the air, instantly dispelling all the blood mist.","It was a punch infused with the essence of Slaughter Dao, enough to make even a Grand Yan Immortal struggle to withstand it.","However, Qin Tuo stubbornly resisted, his chest collapsing and breaking apart, and his Yan power cascading like tassels into the void.","He couldn’t believe it—a mere Yan Immortal could actually inflict such serious injuries on him.","One had to know that between a Grand Yan Immortal and a Yan Immortal, there was a chasm that could not be crossed, let alone cause harm to a Grand Yan Immortal.","Yet, it was happening before his eyes.","Divine blood spurted, the Immortal body shattered, but after just a few dozen breaths, everything healed.","In Qin Tuo’s eyes, only madness remained.","He had been suppressed by Jian Wushuang all along, even when he reached the realm of Grand Yan Immortal. This had driven him almost insane.","Boundless crimson blood mist condensed into chains that fell from the void, piercing through every inch of the earth and the divine mountains.","The elders and disciples of the Shangjun Sect, who had already lost their way, didn’t even attempt to evade. They stared blankly at the void, then were pierced by the descending chains, turning into dust.","Jian Wushuang frowned, the Invisible Sword forming once more. He slashed at the void, severing each chain.","“Motherf*cker, is this b*stard crazy? Why won’t he even let his own sect’s disciples off?”","Within the barrier, Chen Qing was struggling to resist.","“It must be that eye causing trouble; we need to find a way to remove it,” said Chun Qiu in a deep voice, his gaze fixed on the eye wheel hovering in the void.","“I’ll think of a way,” Chen Qing gritted his teeth. With a thought, the True Sword hanging from his waist unsheathed and carried a million Sword Intents towards the eye wheel in the void.","The dark red eye wheel was enormous, almost splitting the sky in half. Its pupils were chaotic and mesmerizing, emitting an enchanting aura from the center of the vertical pupil.","A million Sword Intents condensed into a massive real sword, piercing towards the eerie eye wheel.","In the next moment, a bizarre scene unfolded.","The million Sword Intents penetrated the eye wheel without any resistance, but that was it. Like a drop in the ocean, it did not trigger any detonation, and the eye wheel remained unharmed.","“Not good, it seems there’s big trouble...” Chen Qing’s lips quivered, as if he foresaw something terrible.","Next, seemingly to confirm his thoughts, the eye wheel in the void suddenly trembled. Then a massive True Sword tainted with dark red blood mist shot out, retracing its path and heading straight for Chen Qing, cutting through Chunq Qu’s barrier.","“Run!” Chen Qing exclaimed in panic, fleeing with Chun Qiu.","Boom!!!","The huge sword slashed down, shattering the earth. Thousands of Immortal mountains collapsed in that moment.","All the elders and disciples of the Shangjun Sect who had arrived were ultimately buried, leaving no trace behind.","Witnessing this scene, Jian Wushuang turned to Qin Tuo. “You want to fight to the death?”","“So what? The ultimate outcome will be your demise!” Qin Tuo replied coldly.","“In that case, as you wish.”","With those words, an Invisible Sword in his hand slashed towards Qin Tuo.","The void collapsed, and endless Sword Intents surged.","Qin Tuo roared as the meridians on his Immortal body coiled, causing his figure to grow several times larger.","Following that, a colossal dark red Image Form appeared behind him.","The Image Form was so massive, earth-shattering, and shrouded in mist that it was nearly impossible to make out its true form, only its hazy outline.","Moreover, chains extended from the void, entangling the dark red dharma image, restricting its movements.","With the appearance of the Image Form, his aura skyrocketed to an unprecedented level, even making Jian Wushuang feel threatened.","“I am already a Grand Yan Immortal, what are you?” Qin Tuo roared, his five fingers spreading as billions of blood radiance suddenly shot out.","Facing the overwhelming blood radiance, Jian Wushuang calmly advanced with hands behind his back, his gaze indifferent.","A faint golden aura had quietly enveloped him, easily deflecting the needle-like swords of blood radiance.","Qin Tuo was shocked. Although he had already reached the Grand Yam Immortal realm, Jian Wushuang’s calmness and determination still made his heart palpitate.","Therefore, he made a decisive move, and the dark red Image Form behind him that was bound by the chains was revived.","The Image Form raised its arm, and its colossal hand, capable of obscuring the sky, descended upon Jian Wushuang.","The void trembled, seemingly unable to withstand such power, on the brink of collapse at any moment.","Boom, rumble...","A deafening roar echoed through the vast expanse, where crimson and dark red collided, and the shockwave that erupted swept away the void, causing the entire Heavenly Region to falter and fracture.","The hand of the dark red Image Form shattered upon impact, and a dazzling figure, like a blazing star, appeared before Qin Tuo in an instant.","Everything happened too quickly. When he finally reacted, Jian Wushuang stood before him.","“So, what if you’re a Grand Yan Immortal?”","Following this indifferent voice, a chilling sword pierced through his Immortal body.","Qin Tuo felt an indescribable pain coursing through every fiber of his being. He instinctively glanced at his chest.","In the center of his heart, an Invisible Sword was embedded, and divine blood gushed forth.","With the power of the Yan Immortal, cutting through the body of a Grand Yan Immortal was an unimaginable scene.","Qin Tuo wanted to retaliate but found that he couldn’t even move a finger. His Yan power seemed to have found an outlet and was pouring out uncontrollably from his shattered heart.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang remained cold and composed, as if slaying a Grand Yan Immortal was the simplest task for him.","“I’ll spare your life if you tell me the whereabouts of those three Yan Immortals,” he said indifferently, his voice leaving no room for doubt.","The overwhelming sense of annihilation filled Qin Tuo with terror. He opened his mouth, “They, they are all...”","Before he could finish the sentence, his expression suddenly changed, contorting into a sinister grin. “You want to know where they are? Then go join them!”","Jian Wushuang realized the danger but it was already too late.","A Grand Yan Immortal’s power at the moment of life and death far exceeded imagination. Qin Tuo directly embraced him and shot into the void.","There, a gigantic eye wheel hung in the air, a massive dark red eye wheel radiating an enchanting and mesmerizing aura, reaching the pinnacle of eerie."]},{"number":5062,"title":"Chapter 5062 Two Jian Wushuang","paragraphs":["5062 Two Jian Wushuang","It was as if he had crashed into water, creating layers of ripples.","Qin Tuo pushed Jian Wushuang and disappeared into the huge eye wheel.","Buzz...","The eye wheel was perfectly round, releasing billions of dark red lights.","Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and Gu Ting were unable to move an inch under the blood light. They could only bitterly resist.","“Motherf*cker, even if I die today, I’m going in!” Chen Qing roared hoarsely as he endured the bloody glow.","With their Immortal Styles, they managed to withstand the immense pressure for a moment. Then, Chen Qing and Chun Qiu did not hesitate and jumped into the eye wheel.","Gu Ting shivered, and a complicated expression appeared on his face. A moment later, he gritted his teeth and said, “Wait for me! I’m coming too!”","...","“Could this be the inner world of that eye wheel?”","An echoing voice filled the air, ethereal and profound.","Looking around, it was a strange and mysterious world made entirely of crystal-clear mirrors.","At this moment, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and Gu Ting stood in the world formed by the mirrors, their gazes solemn.","“Where do you think Brother Jian is?” Chun Qiu said worriedly.","“Don’t worry, that fellow won’t be able to do anything to Brother Jian for the time being.” Chen Qing consoled him. “But right now, we need to figure out where we are.”","At this moment, Gu Ting, who had been silent for a long time, spoke up, his voice trembling slightly. “Have you noticed anything different behind us?”","Chen Qing and Chun Qiu did not understand his meaning and instinctively turned to look behind them.","What they saw was three figures emerging from the mirror world behind them.","After recognizing the faces of those three figures, even the more composed Chun Qiu could not help but curse, “What the hell, how could it be us?!”","The three figures emerging from the mirror world were identical to Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and Gu Ting, down to the smallest detail, even their walking posture was indistinguishable.","It was precisely because of this that Chun Qiu became instantly alert.","“There’s something strange here. I’m afraid these guys are all copies. Be careful,” Chun Qiu warned in a low voice.","In the next moment, the three figures from the mirror world moved like phantoms and instantly charged toward them.","“Everyone, be careful!” Chen Qing shouted angrily, then spread his fingers, releasing a powerful Yan power defensive barrier.","But on the other side, Chen Qing, who was the leader, also moved. He also raised his arm and blasted out a violent and violent Yan power.","The six figures started to fight.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang, who had been dragged into the Eye Wheel World by Qin Tuo, also encountered this crisis.","Qin Tuo disappeared into who knows where, replaced by a figure who shared the same height and appearance as Jian Wushuang.","He frowned, taking a step back and assuming a defensive posture.","The ‘Jian Wushuang’ opposite him had calm eyebrows and eyes. With a flip of his hand, an Invisible Sword, emitting a faint golden aura, appeared.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. He did not expect that the image could condense an Invisible Sword.","The invisible sword was his Sword Dao incarnation, and if the illusion could create it, it meant it had also mastered the Wushuang Sword Dao.","Before they even began fighting, the hidden cards were revealed, which made things extremely tricky for Jian Wushuang.","As expected, when the representation of the Wushuang Sword Dao, the crimson-gold Sword Intent, surged. The ‘Jian Wushuang’ illusion released its Sword Intent.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, first stance.","Star.","The sword slashed down, splitting the sky and splitting the earth. A natural chasm was cut open in the void, and the mirror under his feet shattered instantly but recovered at an even faster rate.","Jian Wushuang had never imagined that one day he would experience the taste of his own Sword Dao.","Countless Crimson Gold columns that reached the heavens burst apart, and an endless sword intent swept forth.","At that moment, he also made his move.","It was also the first move of the Wushuang Sword Dao’s first move.","A more grandiose and unrestrained sword intent surged, obscuring the sky and enveloping everything in a brilliant display of Sword Intent!","The two collided, and the great supreme fluctuation directly swept through the sky!","Boom!!!","The mirror world began to crumble and shatter, tearing apart a natural chasm.","The Sword Intents canceled each other out and were destroyed.","When the dust cleared, they looked at each other.","Jian Wushuang did not expect that the image could replicate the Wushuang Sword Dao without any reduction in power.","This made the situation even more challenging. If they continued to fight, they might get stuck in a stalemate.","With this in mind, Jian Wushuang decided to leave directly.","However, the projection seemed to know what he was planning and immediately released the second move of the Wushuang Sword Dao: River.","As the second move of the Wushuang Sword Dao, the River Sword Intent was extremely powerful, second only to the Lake Sword Intent.","Billions of strands of Sword Intent converged into a majestic Heavenly River, descending from the void.","This Heavenly River was so vast that it blocked the entire void, and its terrifying Sword Intent made everything tremble.","This was the pinnacle of swordsmanship!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed as he felt the danger.","In the next moment, he also took action. The golden Sword Intent surged around him, quickly converging into a Heavenly River, rushing forward suddenly.","Two Heavenly Rivers, two River Sword Intentions, clashed completely.","This was the supreme Sword Intent, capable of easily tearing apart any Heavenly Region, even a Grand Yan Immortal would be unable to withstand it.","The bizarre world within the mirror could not repair itself as quickly as it was being destroyed.","In just an instant, the entire world crumbled.","As the fragments scattered, the River Sword Intent dissipated, and the ‘Jian Wushuang’ image retreated a hundred yards!","Jian Wushuang also suffered considerably, his vital energy and blood surging dangerously, narrowly avoiding severe injuries.","The pressure of the Wushuang Sword Dao was almost unbearable even for him.","The image was obviously in worse shape, with divine blood spilling from its wounds.","“Courting death,” Jian Wushuang said coldly.","However, the image seemed to fully recover in a short time, its gaze turning icy as it looked at him.","Then, a brilliant golden light quietly rose from the image’s body, quickly ascending into the sky and transforming into countless strands of flowing golden tassels.","Jian Wushuang’s gaze suddenly focused, and his steady heart began to beat faster.","It was actually the strongest move in his Sword Principle. The image intended to unleash the Lake Sword Intent!","The Lake Sword Intent was a sword strike that surpassed imagination.","It was a sword strike beyond imagination, unstoppable and incomparable, a move that could only be endured.","Once the Lake Sword Intent appeared again, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Back then, Jian Wushuang had used the Lake Sword Intent to kill the Immortal Lord of the Nine Heavens Chang Duoling by himself. That guy was already a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","Killing a Three Revolutions with one sword strike was unimaginable.","No matter how strong Jian Wushuang was, he was still a Yan Immortal. Facing the Lake-style Sword Intent, he had no confidence in enduring it.","The brilliant golden radiance had turned into countless tassels, constructing the Heavenly Gate.","The ‘Jian Wushuang’ image was enveloped by the golden radiance, its face darkening and a cold smile appearing at the corner of its mouth.","But then, in the next moment, its expression changed dramatically, filled with disbelief."]},{"number":5063,"title":"Chapter 5063 Prism Mirror True Eyes","paragraphs":["5063 Prism Mirror True Eyes","The Heavenly Gate, which represented the Lake-style Sword Intent, was still being constructed.","However, the image’s expression contorted, looking terrified, as if encountering something uncontrollable.","His attire, originally pale white, suddenly shattered, revealing a well-proportioned Immortal body.","Then, his Immortal body suddenly expanded several times to the extreme.","Cracks spread on his Immortal body, and divine blood began to spill out.","Jian Wushuang retreated. He sensed that something was wrong and frowned.","“Could it be that he can’t withstand the power of the Lake-style Sword Intent?”","As if to confirm his thoughts, the image began to scream in pain.","Dark red blood light started to drill out of his Immortal body and dissipated.","After ten breaths, the image shattered under Jian Wushuang’s gaze.","As the strongest sword technique of the Wushuang Sword Dao, the image vanished with the wind, not even completely forming the Heavenly Gate.","“...Wow, he actually killed himself.”","Sword Wu Shuang pondered for a moment but quickly became vigilant again. This mirrored world was far more intricate than he had imagined, and he had to be cautious.","Qin Tuo was definitely not dead but concealed somewhere here. What he needed to do now was to flush him out.","After the confrontation with the River Sword Intent, the mirrored world had completely disintegrated but was now slowly recovering.","Looking around, it was all emptiness and silence.","Sword Wu Shuang tried calling out the names of Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and the others, but there was no response.","Stepping on the mirrored surface reflecting his shadow, he walked forward slowly.","Everything was eerily silent to the extreme, with only the shadows keeping him company.","After walking a thousand steps, Jian Wushuang halted his steps and suddenly spoke, “Have you had enough?”","In the next moment, he stomped his foot, shattering the mirror surface, and a dark red blood aura rose into the air.","Qin Tuo’s face turned cold, and he stared fiercely at Jiang Wushuang in mid-air.","Sword Unrivaled could not be bothered with idle talk. A constellation of seven stars appeared between his eyebrows, and he summoned an Immortal Style with a wave of his hand.","Little Mountain River.","A divine mountain suddenly rose from the ground, forming a cage to imprison Qin Tuo, while the galaxy turned into chains that directly entwined around him.","Then, heavenly fire descended, consuming everything.","This was the first time Jian Wushuang had used an Immortal Style since emerging from the Endless Sea. He was growing, and so were his techniques, far surpassing what they had been before.","Qin Tuo was imprisoned deep in the mountains and bound by the celestial river. He was unable to extricate himself.","Jian Wushuang walked slowly to his side, extinguishing the burning heavenly fire with a wave of his hand, looking at him calmly.","“Where are they exactly?”","Qin Tuo gritted his teeth, the terror of life and death forcing him to finally yield.","Seeing him hesitate, Jian Wushuang did not press further but instead flicked his finger, sending a pure strand of Sword Intent into his Immortal body.","“Ahhh!”","Qin Tuo screamed in agony as the strand of sword intent crazily traversed his meridians, shattering them completely with each pass, a pain so unbearable that even a Grand Yan Immortal couldn’t endure it.","Jian Wushuang did not speak but continued to force more strands of Sword Intent into his Immortal body.","Divine blood spewed, and Qin Tuo could not hold on any longer. “They, they are all inside!”","When he heard this, he raised his brows slightly. After which, he looked at the world formed by the prism mirrors and pondered whether Qin Tuo’s words were true or false.","After a moment, Sword Unrivaled spread his five fingers and released his Yan power, smashing the mirror surface beneath his feet.","Boom! Boom!","The earth shattered rapidly, and dark red blood auras gushed out from the cracks.","“If I had destroyed this place without finding them, you would have met a fate worse than death,” Jian Wushuang said coldly, then fully released his Yan power, shattering the void!","The extremely violent Yan power exploded, causing even Qin Tuo to tremble.","The entire mirror world was on the verge of shattering. However, in the next moment, a huge dark red eye wheel appeared in the void.","With a captivating and intimidating aura, it stared directly at Jian Wushuang.","Disgust rose in his heart. A million Sword Intent suddenly appeared behind him and swept toward the eye wheel.","This time, the eye did not swallow or absorb the Sword Intent; it allowed the Sword Intent to slaughter it until it turned into powder.","Seeing this, Qin Tuo was astonished and could not believe his eyes.","As the eye disintegrated, the world that was rapidly repairing itself ceased its restoration, entering a state of final collapse.","Qin Tuo’s aura also rapidly withered.","The independent world in this eye wheel completely collapsed, and they returned to the real Heavenly Region plane.","Above the ruins of the Shawngjun Sect, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and Gu Ting were all pleasantly surprised. “They, they’ve come back?”","Immediately afterward, another bull-like figure fell from the sky and crashed into the ruins.","With two more ‘plop’ sounds, two figures stacked on top of each other landed on the back of the bull-like figure.","“C-Cui Jing, and Liujia?” Chen Qing was first shocked, then overjoyed. “Good heavens, they’re all back!”","Chun Qiu hurried forward and pulled them up from the ruins. After checking that they were all sleeping soundly and were not seriously ill, he heaved a sigh of relief.","“What about Brother Jian?” Chen Qing turned his head and hurriedly looked around.","Gu Ting pointed forward and swallowed with difficulty.","Following his finger, Jian Wushuang stood in the ruins, holding Qin Tuo’s neck in one hand, looking calm.","Divine blood splattered, and he had almost become a man of blood, his life hanging by a thread.","“Release my son...”","A feeble voice rang out as Qin Zun, the Sect Master of the Shangjun Sect, stumbled out of the ruins, rushing toward Jian Wushuang.","But soon, his path was blocked, and a slender short sword pierced through his Immortal Source.","Chun Qiu retrieved the short sword, and Qin Zun fell, collapsing into rubble.","Jian Wushuang did not pay attention to what was happening on the other side; all his focus was on Qin Tuo.","Then, Qin Tuo smiled, “I never expected this. I ascended to the Grand Yan Immortal, only to fall in the hands of a Yan Immortal in the end. Truly ironic.”","After uttering these words, he fell directly, his Immortal body shattering into pieces.","Jian Wushuang was surprised to find that Qin Tuo had no Immortal Source!","Or perhaps, his Immortal Source had shrunk to a certain extent, nearly disappearing, nothing like the Immortal Source a Grand Yan Immortal should possess!","Before Jian Wushuang could investigate further, a transparent crystal, as clear as a mirror, hovered in the air and rotated slowly after Qin Tuo’s Immortal body shattered.","Jian Wushuang immediately thought of the previous crystal world and the eye wheel that possessed the power to beguile.","“Could there be a connection between them?”","He did not understand and reached out to receive the crystal.","Under the sunlight, Jian Wushuang’s face was reflected on each of the six sides of the crystal.","For some reason, after seeing this rhombus crystal, the vague sense of familiarity in his heart suddenly became stronger.","However, Jian Wushuang was almost certain that he had never seen this crystal before.","“No way. Could this crystal be the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor that carries Master’s information?”"]},{"number":5064,"title":"Chapter 5064 The Arrival of Uncle Yu","paragraphs":["5064 The Arrival of Uncle Yu","However, he quickly rejected this idea. The form of the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor was very simple. It used some unknown bone piece as a carrier to engrave unknown words.","Moreover, judging from the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor in his hand, each one of them had existed for too long and was barren.","Jian Wushuang guessed that these bone armors had existed for a long time, probably longer than the Ancient Era.","It was also because of the fact that the form of the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor was too simple that he was certain that the crystal in his hand could not be a carrier of words.","“But what’s with this inexplicable sense of familiarity?” Jian Wushuang frowned and kept rubbing the six-sided crystal.","It was not until this moment that he discovered that when viewed from a certain angle, there was actually a vertical pupil in the center of the six-sided crystal!","The vertical pupil was incredibly vivid, as if it contained life, and when Jian Wushuang looked at it, it seemed to make eye contact with him!","Almost at the same time as their eye contact, he felt a rapidly encroaching and enticing power that he couldn’t resist, quickly eroding his Divine Sense.","Jian Wushuang was shocked. He used Perfected Divine Sense to cancel out the bewitching power.","At this moment, Cui Jing’s anxious voice sounded.","“Big Brother Jian, are you alright?”","He raised his head and saw Cui Jing, Feng Shan, and the others surrounding him. They were all looking at him anxiously.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. “I’m fine. It’s good that you’re all here.”","“You gave us a scare, Boss. You’ve been standing here for two or three hours. We thought you were about to have a breakthrough,” Feng Shan said casually. “It wasn’t until we saw your pale face that we realized something was wrong.”","“Two, two or three hours?” Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled, clearly understanding the significance of this.","What had been completed in an instant had somehow passed two or three hours in the blink of an eye. There was only one possibility.","When he locked eyes with the Vertical Pupil within the Ling Crystal, he had inadvertently been drawn into an illusion. However, because his Divine Sense had already reached a perfected state, the vertical pupil could not further entice him.","Jian Wushuang let out a sigh of relief. He had a vague understanding of the Prism Crystal True Eye in his palm.","It was impossible for Qin Tuo or even the Shangjun Sect to have such a thing. It was too treacherous.","For some reason, Jian Wushuang felt a strong sense of familiarity.","But other than that, he knew nothing else.","After hesitating for a moment, Jian Wushuang put the Prism Crystal True Eye into his bosom.","“It’s really unexpected that the entire sect would self-destruct into extinction,” Chen Qing sighed. “Well, at least we don’t have to do the dirty work ourselves.”","With one last glance at the now-ruined Heavenly Region plane, Jian Wushuang and Chen Qing turned away.","As one of the top super forces in the Great Si region, Shangjun Sect’s sphere of influence already included nearly 15 Heavenly Regions, and the disciples they cultivated were spread all over the Heavenly Regions.","However, after this battle, the core of the sect was reduced to ruins, and the Sect Master and Elders were all dead.","The Shangjun Sect had declined from then on.","Cui Jing, Feng Shan, Wei Liujia, and the others were safe and sound. They returned to the Six Heavens Realm.","To Jian Wushuang, this was just a small interlude after he woke up. There was no earth-shaking battle.","Only the Prism Crystal True Eye left him feeling uneasy.","After returning to Little Lonely Heaven, just as Jian Wushuang was about to carefully examine the Prism Crystal True Eyes, the Young Emperor arrived at Little Lonely Heaven.","“No... Brother Jian, prepare well. Uncle Yu has come from the Heavenly Court to see you.”","Walking into the hall and finding everyone gathered there, the Young Emperor straightened his clothing and spoke seriously.","The others exchanged glances and then looked at Jian Wushuang together.","Jian Wushuang was also slightly surprised. He did not know why Uncle Yu had come to find him.","After pondering for a moment, he nodded and stood up.","“Big brother, we’ll go with you,” Cui Jing stood up and said.","Jian Wushuang shook his head, “No need. I’ll be back soon. It’s not a big problem.”","“Let’s go, Uncle Yu has been waiting for a long time.” The Young Emperor raised his eyebrows and smiled.","Then, the two stepped into the air and disappeared.","“Big brother Jian, are you sure there won’t be any problems on this trip?” Cui Jing stood in front of the hall, expressing some concern.","“What could go wrong? Even if Emperor Zhen Wuyuang himself came, Brother Jian would handle it with ease,” Chen Qing said confidently. “Let’s continue our diligent practice and catch up to Brother Jian’s pace.”","Since entering the Great Solitude Sky, Jian Wushuang had been frowning as if he were reminiscing about something.","He found that his memory seemed to have some gaps, with a certain period of it being blurry, no matter how hard he tried to remember what had happened.","He only vaguely remembered that Uncle Yu was abnormally powerful. At the end of the Endless Sea, it was Uncle Yu who appeared and brought him out of the Endless Sea.","However, the memories after the Endless Sea became exceptionally fuzzy, and he couldn’t recall them no matter how hard he tried.","“Could some of these memories be related to Uncle Yu?” Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow, naturally associating his missing memories with Uncle Yu.","Perhaps he could see the worry in his heart, the Young Emperor smiled and comforted him, “Don’t worry too much. Uncle Yu is here this time to return something you left with him.”","“I hope so,” Jian Wushuang replied.","At the same time, he felt a little uneasy. After all, not only were the True Souls of the three Emperors stored in the Boyang Bottle, but more than half of his fortuitous encounters and trump cards were also inside.","Regardless of what was inside, if Uncle Yu or Zhen Wuyang discovered it, the consequences would be dire.","So, Jian Wushuang’s heart was still heavy.","When he entered the Heavenly Palace where the Young Emperor resided, a black-robed elder seemed to have been waiting there for a while. He smiled and said, “Young Friend, long time no see.”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands in return. “Greetings, Uncle Yu.”","“There’s no need to be so formal. Let’s sit down and have a chat.” Uncle Yu smiled and pulled him to his seat.","The Young Emperor sat down next to Uncle Yu and said with a smile, “What a rare guest, Uncle Yu. How could you bear to leave the Heavenly Court and come to my place?”","Uncle Yu chuckled, “Of course, there’s an important matter to discuss, or else I wouldn’t have the leisure to travel through the Heavenly Realms.”","“Get to the point, I want to hear if it benefits me,” he winked, showing some excitement.","Uncle Yu shook his head with a smile. “This time, you won’t get a share. I’m here mainly to return some things to my Young Friend, something he left with me.”","Saying that, Uncle Yu reached into his waist and placed a small jade bottle, green and white intertwined, on the table.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed, and his heartbeat quickened.","This green and white jade bottle was no ordinary item; it was the Boyang Bottle."]},{"number":5065,"title":"Chapter 5065 Opportunity to Transcend to the Grand Yan Immortal Cultivation Realm","paragraphs":["5065 Opportunity to Transcend to the Grand Yan Immortal Cultivation Realm","The Boyang Bottle, within which 3,000 worlds grand worlds could be hidden, was known as the ‘Infinite Bottle’.","It was the companion of Emperor Yang Jun.","Always worn by Jian Wu Shuang, all the opportunities and items he had acquired since arriving in the Great Yan Domain were hidden within the Boyang Bottle.","Now that he saw the Boyang Bottle again, Jian Wushuang tensed up.","The expression on the Young Emperor’s face also momentarily became unnatural, but he quickly smiled and said, “Uncle Yu, the journey from the Heavenly Court to the Six Heavens Realm is quite far, and you must be a bit tired. I’ve already prepared some fine wine...”","Uncle Yu waved his hand and looked at Jian Wushuang with a gentle gaze. “Young Friend, this item belongs to you.”","He nodded.","“That’s good. Now that it’s returned to its original owner, I can rest easy,” Uncle Yu said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands in thanks and quickly put away the Boyang Bottle.","He added, “Oh right, I haven’t opened this small bottle of yours. It’s always in its initial state.”","With just a cursory glance, Jian Wushuang knew that the Boyang Bottle had indeed never been opened, and the faint sealed aura still lingered.","He heaved a sigh of relief and then cupped his hands in relief.","Uncle Yu smiled and nodded. “Young friend, you don’t have to be so polite. This is what I should do. Take a look and see if there’s anything missing.”","Jian Wushuang did not even look at it. He tied the Boyang Bottle to his waist and said, “Uncle Yu jests. The fact that you have returned what I have lost is already my good fortune. If I were to investigate further, I would truly be a petty person.”","“Haha!” Uncle Yu laughed. “Interesting, how amusing.”","“Don’t be coy. Did you come all this way just to deliver a little bottle?” the Young Emperor asked as he shook his head. “Did you bring any treasures with you?”","“You, indeed, can’t hide anything from me,” Uncle Yu said helplessly. “Of course, I’ve brought treasures for you.”","“Quickly, show them to me!” the young Emperor said eagerly.","“This time’s treasure is extraordinary,” Uncle Yu appeared quite mysterious as he casually brushed his hand, and a palm-sized jade box landed on the desk.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes moved slightly and he roughly guessed what was in the jade box.","The Young Emperor impatiently opened the box, and the hall was immediately filled with brilliant light and a rainbow of colors.","The incredibly rich fragrance of medicine almost solidified, bringing a sense of refreshment and joy upon inhaling it.","Inside the jade box were two pills.","The pill was almost transparent, and the supreme fate energy contained within it was like a cloud that rose and spun.","With just one glance, Jian Wushuang knew that these two pills must be Zhen Wuyang’s painstaking work!","In fact, the value of these two pills was even higher than Emperor Liu Ya’s emperor-grade pills!","This was because he could feel that the fate energy contained in these two pills had long surpassed the power of the Yan Immortal realm and had reached a different level.","Who could condense the fate energy of a Grand Yan Immortal into a pill?","Only an Emperor.","When he opened the jade box and saw that it contained pills, the Young Emperor could not hide the disappointment in his eyes. “There, there’s nothing special about this.”","“...”","“...”","The only one who could disdain pills of this level was probably Young Emperor. Even an ordinary Yan Immortal, with even the most mediocre aptitude, would ascend to the rank of a Grand Yan Immortal within a year of consuming one of these pills. This was the terrifying level of these two pills.","Uncle Yu smiled. “Yan’er, you just have to try. Leave the rest to...”","Before he could finish his sentence, the Young Emperor raised his head and swallowed the two pills like he was eating beans.","“...”","“...”","“I ate it, but it didn’t seem to have any effect.” The Young Emperor rubbed his belly and raised his eyebrows at Uncle Yu.","Indeed, when the two pills were ingested, there was no awe-inspiring scene as expected, not even a hint of mystical change; it was as if they had disappeared without a trace.","“Who, who asked you to eat both of them...” The corner of Uncle Yu’s eyes twitched. “One of them was supposed to be for Young Friend Jian Wushuang.”","The Young Emperor’s eyes widened. “Ah?? Why didn’t you say so earlier? Do you want me to spit it out?”","Uncle Yu smiled bitterly. “You are always so impatient.”","He scratched his head. “You can’t blame me, Uncle Yu. You didn’t explain yourself.”","Then, Uncle Yu looked at Jian Wushuang apologetically, “Wushuang, it’s my fault. I’ll ask the Emperor for another one for you.”","Hearing that, Jian Wushuang shook his head hurriedly, “Uncle Yu, you don’t have to do that. I’ve never done anything good for the Heavenly Court, and receiving this pill would make me feel undeserving. I can’t bear it.”","“Besides, it’s the correct choice to let Young Emperor eat both pills. Please don’t make things awkward for me.”","Uncle Yu said with some difficulty, “But this pill was given by the Emperor to thank you for protecting the Young Emperor back then.”","“There’s really no need. The pill is too precious. I definitely can’t accept it.” Jian Wushuang shook his head firmly.","He understood the importance of these pills; they guaranteed the ascent of a Yan Immortal to a Grand Yan Immortal without fail, which was simply incredible.","Once he accepted this pill, it would be equivalent to accepting Heavenly Court’s favor. Moreover, this favor was too heavy, he would definitely not bear it.","From the looks of it, the two pills had been eaten by the Young Emperor. It was the best way to deal with it.","Uncle Yu wanted to say more, but the Young Emperor spoke up, “Alright, Uncle Yu, don’t be so conflicted. At most, you can just send another one over. The most important thing now is to return to the Heavenly Court as soon as possible.”","Upon hearing this, Uncle Yu could not help but smile and cry, “You brat, am I really that unwelcome here?”","After some more conversation, Uncle Yu left.","Only Jian Wushuang and the Young Emperor were left in the huge Heavenly Palace.","“He’s finally gone.” The Young Emperor heaved a sigh of relief and raised his eyebrows.","“What’s wrong?” Jian Wushuang didn’t understand.","What the Young Emperor did next made him widen his eyes.","He reached out and wiped his mouth. Two pills that contained supreme fate energy fell into his palm again.","“You... didn’t you eat them?” Jian Wushuang exclaimed in shock.","The Young Emperor smirked triumphantly, “Of course not. You should know my condition. These pills are useless for me. I could eat a thousand of them, and they wouldn’t have any effect.”","“So, I pretended to eat it and hid it in my mouth.”","With that, he handed the two pills directly to Jian Wushuang.","“Instead of letting them go to waste, I’d rather give them to you.”","Looking at the two pills in his hands, Jian Wushuang still resolutely gave them away.","Looking at the two pills brimming with fate energy in his hand, Jian Wushuang still insisted, “If you don’t take them, then you might as well throw these pills away. They are just useless junk to me.”","“But...” Jian Wushuang swallowed the words that were about to come out of his mouth and let out a sigh."]},{"number":5066,"title":"Chapter 5066 The Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor","paragraphs":["5066 The Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor","Actually, what he really wanted to say was that these two pills were supreme treasures for ordinary Yan Immortal cultivators, but they had little use for him.","At this point, Jian Wushuang could basically confirm that his upper limit was the Yan Immortal cultivation realm.","As for the Grand Yan Immortal realm, or even the realm of Imperial Emperor, they were almost out of his reach.","So, these two pills, which contained the fate energy of a Grand Yan Immortal, were something he could not really benefit from.","But he couldn’t say all of this out loud, so he could only hold the two pills with a bitter smile.","“I think I’ll soon meet a Grand Yan Immortal,” the Young Emperor said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly. “I’m afraid it won’t be that easy.”","The Young Emperor did not comment.","After Jian Wushuang left Big Lonely Heaven and returned to Little Lonely Heaven, Cui Jing and the others surrounded him.","“Brother Jian, what’s the situation? Is it from the Heavenly Court?”","“Did they give you some extraordinary treasure?”","Facing these questions, Jian Wushuang patiently answered them one by one, and of course, he also mentioned the matter of the two pills.","“No way, are there really pills like that?” Cui Jing was completely shocked.","Not only Cui Jing, but Chen Qing and the others were also shocked. Pills that could guarantee the promotion of Yan Immortal cultivators to Grand Yan Immortal actually existed!","Chen Qing muttered in astonishment, “My goodness, if these were placed in the Eternal Wushuang Auction House, I’m afraid the entire Great Si Region would compete for them.”","“No, this matter cannot be leaked. Only you all can know about it,” Swordless said with some seriousness.","With his reminder, Chen Qing and the others realized the seriousness of the situation.","If the news of this pill were to spread out, countless Heavenly Regions would be shocked. The Eternal Wushuang Auction House was just an auction house, and it could not withstand too many variables.","Therefore, this matter could not be spread.","Then, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and placed the two pills on the table.","“These are the two pills. I have no use for them.”","Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, Feng Shan, and Wei Liujia looked at each other and shook their heads in unison.","“Brother Jian, we don’t need these pills. It wouldn’t be a waste for you to use them,” Chen Qing said with a smile.","Chunqiu also nodded, “Brother Jian, what Brother Chen said is correct. Over these 20,000 years, just consuming Emperor-grade pills, we’ve had no less than several hundred of them. The medicinal effects have accumulated in our bodies, enough to support us in breaking through.”","“Indeed, these pills are better off with you, Brother Jian. I’m afraid I couldn’t handle the potency,” Cui Jing said, waving his hand.","Fengshan rubbed his palms together, “I’ve never taken pills, I believe in natural progression.”","“Same here,” Wei Liu Jia added with a smile.","“...”","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly; he knew what they were thinking.","“Brother Jian, try to break through again. Perhaps this is an opportunity,” Chen Qing earnestly suggested. “I look forward to seeing how far you’ll grow after becoming a Grand Yan Immortal.”","Chun Qiu smiled and said,” That’s right. Brother Jian, hurry and grow stronger. The Eternal Wushuang needs your protection.”","Jian Wushuang decisively shook his head, “At least in the short term, I won’t attempt to break through to the realm of the Grand Yan Immortal. I have more important things to do.”","“These two pills will be kept in the hall. Whoever first has the breakthrough opportunity must take one.”","“Remember, only by becoming stronger can you stand in this vast world.”","At this moment, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, Feng Shan, and Wei Liujia all nodded solemnly.","It was precisely because they weren’t strong enough yet that they had been led by Qin Tuo and narrowly escaped from irreparable harm.","Then, Cui Jing asked, “Big Brother Jian, you mentioned there’s something important to do. Are you leaving again?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and smiled, “Not leaving for now. I’ll rest and contemplate for a while.”","Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, and the others exchanged glances and then revealed mischievous smiles.","“In that case, let’s have a hearty celebration for ten days and ten nights!”","“Well, that doesn’t seem right. My injuries haven’t fully healed yet.”","...","A gentle breeze blew past, and the Heavenly Palace stood tall for eternity.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was lying on the roof of the Heavenly Palace, holding a jade bone plate in his left hand and staring at it in a daze.","It had been nearly 20,000 years since he had obtained the first Heaven-patterned Bone Armor.","And in these nearly 20,000 years, so much had happened that he didn’t even have time to search for the solution to the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor.","However, for now, everything had come to a temporary halt. Except for the fact that Di Qing was still missing, Jian Wushuang had had some time to search for and unlock the secrets of the Heaven-patterned Bone Armor.","At this moment, he held two pieces of Heaven-patterned Bone Armor related to his master, Xuan Yi, and knew that there was another piece in the possession of Lady Yin Ling.","There were three pieces of bone armor in total, but it wasn’t enough to reveal much useful information. Jian Wushuang guessed that there must be at least ten pieces of Heaven-patterned Bone Armor.","Collecting all of these bone armors was nothing short of a fantasy for him.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang decided to start by deciphering the inscriptions on the known bone armor in his possession.","The inscriptions on this bone armor were ancient and obscure, far beyond his ability to comprehend on his own.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang immediately thought of the brief conversation he had with the Young Emperor.","In the entire Great Si Region, those who could decipher difficult and obscure inscriptions were extremely rare, especially ones as ancient and enigmatic as these.","However, there were exceptions, and one such exception was Xu Tuo, the unparalleled divine craftsman of the Great Si Region, who resided in the Sancun Mountain. He had a passion for forging supreme treasures and delving into difficult and obscure inscriptions.","Jian Wushuang felt that he could ask the divine craftsman Xu Tuo for help.","He had already started to plan to rest for a while more before heading to Sancun Mountain.","Just as Jian Wushuang was lost in his thoughts, Cui Jing’s words brought him back to reality.","“Eh, Big Brother Jian, when did you get this bracelet on your wrist? Why haven’t I seen it before?”","When he heard this, he subconsciously looked at his wrist. Only then did he realize that there was a bracelet on his left wrist.","“How come I don’t recall having this bracelet before?” Jian Wushuang was also surprised. The bracelet on his wrist had a rustic appearance with depictions of mountain ranges and flowing water, exuding a majestic and powerful aura.","After pondering for a moment, he began trying to remove the bracelet from his wrist. However, he quickly realized that this bracelet was no ordinary item; it contained a captivating imprisoning power.","“Could it be from Prince Yan or Uncle Yu? Did they put it on me?” Jian Wushuang frowned and thought about it, but he quickly rejected all these thoughts.","Because there wasn’t a single Yan Immortal who could put a bracelet on his wrist without him knowing.","Yet, such a thing had undeniably occurred, and if it weren’t for Cui Jing’s reminder, Jian Wushuang might not have even noticed this change."]},{"number":5067,"title":"Chapter 5067 Preparing Before Leaving","paragraphs":["5067 Preparing Before Leaving","He had a strange intuition that this bracelet seemed to be imprisoning something.","But what exactly it imprisoned, he had no way of knowing.","“No way, Boss. You don’t know who put this bracelet on you?” Cui Jing was surprised. Then, he lowered his voice and said, “Do you think it’s the Young Emperor?”","Jian Wushuang did not say anything, but he had a rough idea.","He had left the Endless Sea, and it was Uncle Yu who had taken him out, and during this period, his memory was fragmented. He could hardly recall what had happened.","And this ancient-looking bracelet was very likely worn on him during the time he was unconscious.","As for who did this, Jian Wushuang had also made a rough judgment.","“But why would they put such a thing on me?” he frowned and then, as if realizing something, sat up and began to meditate on the spot.","His Yan power surged like a torrent, flowing endlessly through his meridians.","His Immortal Styles, Yan power, and sword principles were all intact, and even surpassed his previous abilities, reaching an astonishing level.","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and heaved a sigh of relief. The bracelet did not confine any of his abilities.","It was precisely because of this that he felt that it was extremely strange.","Since there was no restriction, what was the meaning of this bracelet?","After pondering for a moment, Jian Wushuang decided to put this matter aside for now and would ask the Young Emperor about it when he saw him.","For nearly 20,000 years, they rarely gathered together, and now they were all sitting or lying on the eaves of the Heavenly Palace, leisurely resting.","Jian Wushuang also rarely stopped his busy schedule and enjoyed a moment of peace.","Then, he took advantage of the fact that everyone, including Chunqiu, was present and announced his plan to leave.","Upon hearing this, Cui Jing quickly got up and eagerly said, “Boss, take me with you this time, take me along.”","“Step aside, it’s my turn this time.” Feng Shan, with his massive body, also squeezed over.","“Fair competition, fair competition,” Chen Qing insisted, not willing to fall behind.","Watching this noisy scene, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but smile and then said seriously, “Everyone, calm down. This time when I go, I don’t know when I’ll be able to come back, so none of you can accompany me.”","“What you need to do now is to raise your strength as much as possible. Only then can you truly establish yourself in the Great Yan Domain.”","At this moment, Chen Qing and the others became serious and began to ponder.","Without exception, they pulled their thoughts to the distant future and the vast and unpredictable Great Yan Domain.","The Great Yan Domain was not only a mysterious and ultimate boundless universe for Jian Wushuang, but also for Chen Qing and the others.","None of them had stepped out of the Great Si Region.","The Great Si Region was too vast, countless Yan Immortals and even Grand Yan Immortals had yet to walk out.","However, such a Great Si Region was merely a drop in the ocean in the Great Yan Domain.","Even Chun Qiu, who was the son of an ancient Emperor in the past, could not imagine the vastness of the Great Yan Domain.","So, they pondered the words of Jian Wushuang and began to realize that beyond the Great Si Region was the true vista.","At this moment, Chun Qiu’s gaze became more determined, and he spoke, “Brother Jian, does that mean that as long as we reach the level of Grand Yan Immortal, we can continue to follow you and explore the even broader realms beyond the Heavenly Regions?”","Chen Qing, Cui Jing, and the others’ gazes became heated.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, “Going beyond the even broader and unpredictable world is indeed possible, but for now, your goal is to reach the level of Grand Yan Immortal.”","Great Transcendent Immortals were beings who stood at the pinnacle, second only to the Emperor. They could create heavenly principles with a breath, an existence beyond description.","But ascending to the rank of Grand Yan Immortal was unimaginable for Yan Immortals.","You see, in the vast and boundless Great Si Region, after the Emperor’s War in the Ancient Era, Grand Yan Immortals had become so rare that they could be counted on one hand.","There were even rumors that the path to ascension had been sealed, no longer attainable.","But when they saw Qin Tuo, the son of the Shangjun Sect Master, ascend to the rank of Grand Yan Immortal, they realized that the path upward was not sealed; it had just become more challenging.","Now, Jian Wushuang wanted them to ascend to the Grand Yan Immortal cultivation realm as soon as possible, which indirectly confirmed this point.","Only through further cultivation and reaching that height could they truly stand at the peak.","At this moment, besides Jian Wushuang, Chen Qing, Chun Qiu, Cui Jing, Feng Shan, and Wei Liujia all nodded heavily. They had already set their hearts on the goal of advancing towards the Grand Yan Immortal.","Jian Wushuang’s words not only inspired them but also motivated himself to strive for greater heights.","As they continued their journey, new mysteries from the distant past began to surface.","His teacher Xuan Yi, Old Master, and not forgetting the Devourers organization and the Devouring Emperor... These people dominated the Void Universe and almost suppressed Void God. Who were they? Did they leave any footprints in this vast Great Yan Domain?","All of these were like layers of fog that shrouded Jian Wushuang’s mind.","What he needed to do now was to dispel this fog and unveil the truth.","So, he couldn’t afford to wait any longer and had to seize the only clue he had, the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor.","After spending several decades drinking on the eaves of the Heavenly Palace, Jian Wushuang left alone, without allowing any other Yan Immortals to follow him, as if he had never appeared.","As he departed, he went to find the Young Emperor once again. After learning the approximate location of Sancun Mountain, where the divine craftsman Xu Tuo resided, he finally set out.","He could not wait any longer for news about the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor. So, resolutely, he set off.","Jian Wushuang did not waver in the face of the vast and unknown Heavenly Regions.","Even though the Great Si Regioin was boundless, it was divided into seven parts, which corresponded to the Seven Princes under Emperor Zhen Wuyang.","The location of Sancun Mountain was mysterious and unpredictable.","Sancun Mountain did not belong to any of the heaven domains in the Great Si Domain. It was ethereal and impossible to find.","While countless Yan Immortals had tried to find it, seeking the divine craftsman, they had all returned empty-handed.","It was rumored that Sancun Mountain was the most prized work of divine craftsman Xu Tuo. It was built with supreme power and even a Grand Yan Immortal could not detect it, let alone find it.","The Yan Emperor could only give a rough location and was not very clear either.","Yet, the approximate location of the Sancun Mountain happened to be in a troublesome place—Great Mi Heaven.","Great Mi Heaven was the Heavenly Region of the Second Prince, Prince Jiu. It was also controlled by Prince Jiu, who had the deepest grudge against Jian Wushuang.","Although the three-inch mountain didn’t belong to Dami Heaven, it was adjacent to Dami Heaven.","Despite all this, Jian Wushuang still set off on his journey and headed toward the boundless and unpredictable expanse."]},{"number":5068,"title":"Chapter 5068 Concealed Kill","paragraphs":["5068 Concealed Kill","Because of his previous experience, he no longer lost himself in the void.","The void was vast, but the Yan Immortal travelers were exceedingly rare. Occasionally, a Yan Immortal would appear, casting a doubtful glance at Jian Wushuang, and then vanish into the void.","Relying on his own speed, it would take him a considerable amount of time to reach the Great Mi Heaven. However, if he used the Immortal Array Formation left behind from the Ancient Era, it would greatly shorten the journey.","But perhaps due to a less-than-favorable impression of the Immortal Array, Jian Wushuang stubbornly chose to travel alone.","The Heavenly Regions stretched out beneath him as he flew past with incredible speed.","Every Heavenly Region had countless living beings and cultivators who aspired for more than the mundane. These Heavenly Regions were just a drop in the ocean in the vast Great Si Region.","The Great Si Region was vast beyond imagination, immeasurable.","These emotions lingered in Jian Wushuang’s Divine Sense for a moment before they were erased. He continued to move forward in silence.","Among those who could traverse countless domains of heaven, every one of them was a Yan Immortal.","However, not all Yan Immortals were virtuous. Often, there were Yan Immortals with formidable cultivation but no hope of ascending to the rank of Grand Yan Immortal, and they would ambush passing Yan Immortals in the void.","It was just like the Yan Immortals and Top Cultivators that Jian Wushuang had met during the voyage.","Although Jian Wushuang was still a Yan Immortal, his strength had reached a terrifying level. Even Qin Tuo, the son of the Shangjun Sect Master who had advanced to the Grand Yan Immortal, could be effortlessly slain by him.","So, he paid little attention to the dangers lurking in the void. He was confident that he could emerge unscathed even if facing a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","However, the less he cared, the more danger sought him out.","“Hey, traveler, hand over everything you have and I’ll spare your life.”","A somewhat coarse voice echoed, and then more than a dozen figures suddenly appeared from the void, blocking all of Jian Wushuang’s paths.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow slightly and came to a stop.","In the vast void, a lone Yan Immortal was the most vulnerable to being ambushed.","Among these 18 figures, there were actually seven Yan Immortals and the rest were all Top Cultivators with profound cultivation.","These individuals, who had already reached the pinnacle of their strength, were now engaged in such lowly activities, which made Jian Wushuang feel disgusted.","The leader among the 18 figures, a burly man, took a step forward and pointed his halberd at Jian Wushuang. His eyes were full of arrogance, as if he were looking at an item in a store","In his eyes, the young Yan Immortal in front of him had nothing special except for his ethereal temperament.","Jian Wushuang, with a calm and quiet expression, suddenly smiled faintly, “Of course, you’ve come for a reason, and I’ll give everything to you.”","The burly man was initially stunned by these words, but then he became overjoyed and was about to rush forward.","However, a skinny Yan Immortal suddenly stopped him and shook his head, “Don’t be reckless.”","“Third Brother, are you out of your mind? Is it necessary to act like this for a lone Yan Immortal?” The burly man shook off the thin Yan Immortal’s hand and excitedly approached Jian Wushuang.","The other Yan Immortals also gathered around at the same time.","“Don’t play tricks. Honestly hand over all your precious treasures, and I will let you go, or else...” The burly man suddenly released a burst of Yan power that seemed unstoppable.","Faced with such a group of top cultivators, Jian Wushuang felt even more disgusted. However, he did not show it.","Then, Jian Wushuang closed his palms and a dark green pill appeared in his palm.","Instantly, the area within a thousand miles was filled with an extremely strange medicinal fragrance.","Rainbow-colored lights gathered around Jian Wushuang, reaching an unprecedented richness.","This pill, appearing in the world, made all the Yan Immortal and Top Cultivators widen their eyes in disbelief.","This pill had surpassed their imaginations. Even though they had never seen it before, the aura emanating from the pill told them that it was a great opportunity.","All the Yan Immortals became enthusiastic and almost involuntarily rushed toward the pill.","But the next moment, a sudden change occurred!","A wisp of delicate Sword Intent, almost impossible to discern, floated up like a feather and spun in the air.","Time seemed to freeze for an instant, and before the frenzy in the eyes of the mad Yan Immortals and Top Cultivators had dissipated, they suddenly felt a chill in their necks and chests, and then they ceased to breathe.","That wisp of gentle Sword Intent took the lives of 6 Yan Immortals and 11 Top Cultivators within a breath.","If one looked carefully, they would see that their Immortal Sources and Life Sources had all been shattered and could not be reconstructed.","Their heads, which still had a fanatical look in their eyes, fell into the void and were then torn into pieces by the invisible gale.","Concealing his brilliance, Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow.","He paid no attention to the corpses of these deceased cultivators but instead gazed into the distance.","Over there, a skinny figure had already fled billions of miles away.","Long before Jian Wushuang took out the pill, the skinny Yan Immortal had fled without hesitation, putting a considerable distance between them.","“He’s quite the excellent scout,” Jian Wushuang muttered.","Although he said so, he had no intention of letting this small variable go unchecked.","Furthermore, the direction in which the skinny Yan Immortal fled was in the direction of Great Mi Heaven, so Jian Wushuang naturally gave chase.","At this moment, beads of cold sweat trickled from the skinny Yan Immortal’s temples; he had employed every trick in the book to escape.","He did not even dare to turn his head. He was so scared that his soul almost left his body.","If it wasn’t for his caution, he would have been dead by now.","Now, out of 18 figures, only he had escaped, and he could not help but secretly rejoice.","However, this relief did not last long. The skinny Yan Immortal instinctively looked back, and upon doing so, nearly lost all hope.","A youth with a calm countenance, who had effortlessly killed 6 Yan Immortals and 11 Top Cultivators with a wave of his hand, was charging towards him!","Despair surged within the skinny Yan Immortal, and he felt a chill creeping over his body as he trembled uncontrollably.","An indescribable aura of cold-bloodedness silently swept over him.","But this chilling intent did not emanate from Jian Wushuang.","It was frigid, icy, and domineering.","This murderous intent instantly spread for millions of miles.","Jian Wushuang halted his steps at the right moment, raising his eyebrows slightly.","This was not just murderous intent; it was also Sword Intent.","To cover such a vast distance in an instant was truly extraordinary.","“Do you have to kill them all? Can’t you be a bit more merciful?” A voice, as if descending from the heavens, floated up, carrying a touch of cold inquiry as it approached Jian Wushuang.","The voice took form, countless ice crystal Sword Intents descending, capable of obliterating the heavens.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang frowned slightly. He waved his hand and an endless breeze swept, reaching into the sky.","When the two collided, countless ice crystal Sword Intents disappeared without a trace in an instant.","The sweeping wind cleared the chaotic void, making it impossible for the hidden voice to escape."]},{"number":5069,"title":"Chapter 5069 A Man with a Passionate Heart","paragraphs":["5069 A Man with a Passionate Heart","The chaotic void wind dissipated, revealing a rather slender figure.","In their first encounter, the slender figure with the longsword found himself at a disadvantage, which greatly displeased him and left him somewhat incredulous.","However, he quickly concealed his emotions and turned his gaze towards the skinny Yan Immortal kneeling beside him, trembling like a sieve.","Then, he spoke, “Hey, why did he want to kill you?”","The skinny Yan Immortal shuddered, nearly collapsing in the void. He said in a trembling voice, “I-I don’t know, but he has a thirst for blood and killing. All of my companions fell to his hands. If I hadn’t run fast enough, I might have also met a gruesome fate.”","“A bloodthirsty killer for no apparent reason?” The slender figure clearly did not believe his one-sided account. He turned to Jian Wu Shuang and asked loudly, “Is what he’s saying true?”","Jian Wu Shuang responded indifferently, “True or not, what difference does it make?”","“Alright, it seems I’ve encountered yet another rule-breaker,” the slender figure said solemnly. “In that case, you’ll have to pay the price.”","As soon as he said that, an unprecedented Sword Intent erupted and swept up, causing the void to tremble.","Under this Sword Intent, the skinny Yan Immortal who was shaking like a leaf fainted.","Confronted with such a Sword Intent, Jian Wu Shuang’s gaze also became focused.","He sensed a kind of energy fluctuation that did not belong to a Yan Immortal!","This guy who did not show his abilities was actually a Grand Yan Immortal?!","It’s worth noting that after the battle of the Emperors, Grand Yan Immortals had become almost extinct in the entire Great Si Region.","However, Jian Wu Shuang had repeatedly encountered Grand Yan Immortals, and most of them were on opposing sides, which left him feeling quite helpless.","To Jian Wushuang, who had experienced the terrifying training of the Endless Sea, a Grand Yan Immortal was nothing. However, a Grand Yan Immortal with a deep understanding of Sword Principle was enough to give him a headache.","And judging solely from the Sword Intent he had unleashed, Jian Wu Shuang dared not underestimate him.","The slender figure rose with a drawn sword, igniting a magnificent Sword Intent, and descended directly.","Jian Wushuang did not want to engage in prolonged combat, so he unleashed the Wushuang Sword Dao directly.","Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, the first form.","A plain and unremarkable straight slash, as the initial move of the complete Wushuang Sword Dao, was rare in its focus on explosiveness.","The slender figure was greatly amazed, completely disregarding the Sword Intent surrounding him, and swiftly rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","Watching this bizarre scene, Jian Wushuang’s brow twitched. He obviously hadn’t expected that the guy would charge at him like a raging bull.","This undoubtedly disrupted his thoughts, but Jian Wushuang did not retreat. He adjusted his state instantly and took the initiative.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, the second form.","River.","The majestic Heavenly River, breaking through the void from every crack, then roaring as it converged.","Under this sword strike, even a Grand Yan Immortal would feel their own insignificance.","“What a powerful sword move!” the slender figure exclaimed without reservation. “In that case, I’ll show you my strongest move too!”","A colder aura suddenly swept over, centered on the slender figure, and tore through the void.","Then, countless Sword Intents gathered behind him, forming a blazing sun.","The blazing sun was radiant, containing nine crimson-golden rays, resembling a golden wheel, circulating behind him.","Facing the mighty and overwhelming River Sword Intent, the slender figure raised his sword suddenly.","Where the sword pointed, nothing could resist.","At that moment, the brilliant golden radiance burst forth from the sun behind him. The nine crimson-golden rays shot out like nine True Swords, unstoppable.","Where the sword pointed, even the Heavenly River composed of countless pure Sword Intents began to shatter!","Nine True Swords, turning into scorching suns, extinguishing all Sword Principle.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, feeling astonished.","This was the first time that, apart from Sword Immortals, another Sword Dao could contend with the Wushuang Swords Dao.","As the River-form sword intent shattered and dissipated, the nine sun-like True Swords also vanished into nothingness.","Jian Wushuang didn’t mind this and instead focused on the Grand Yan Immortal.","The slender figure appeared unusually excited. “Delightful! I never expected that a Grand Yan Immortal could not only engage me in a swordfight but also suppress me with just one move!”","Jian Wushuang looked at him and did not speak.","“Your Sword Principle—did you learn it from someone or develop it yourself?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him. “Are you done talking?”","The slender figure hesitated for a moment, but he did not get angry. Instead, he scratched his head and said, “Misunderstanding. It was all a misunderstanding.”","“Since it’s a misunderstanding, don’t block my way,” he said in a calm tone. “Also, the person you’re protecting is not a good individual, taking pleasure in ambushing lone Yan Immortals. It just so happened that he and his buddies encountered me, and I casually eliminated them.”","The slender figure was taken aback again, then his expression turned cold. “I had a feeling that this guy wasn’t a good character. It seems my instincts were right!”","With those words, he reached out and lifted the unconscious and skinny Yan Immortal, then without any hesitation, twisted its head off.","After casting another glance at the slender figure, Jian Wushuang turned and left.","There was still a considerable distance to the Great Mi Heaven, and he had no reason to waste any time.","After passing through thousands of Heavenly Regions alone, Jian Wushuang stopped and looked back.","He saw the slender figure holding the decapitated head of the skinny Yan Immortal following him.","“Why are you following me?” Jian Wushuang frowned, growing somewhat annoyed.","The slender figure smiled and said somewhat embarrassed, “There was a misunderstanding earlier, so I wanted to make it up to you.”","“Whether there was a misunderstanding or not, what if he was telling the truth, and I was lying?” Jian Wushuang said, “It’s all just one-sided claims. How can we determine the truth?”","“The sword! Sword Intent,” the slender figure suddenly asserted with determination. “Your Sword Intent won’t deceive me. To produce such pure Sword Intent as a Yan Immortal, if there were impurities in your state of mind, you would never have comprehended this level of swordsmanship.”","“Alright, let’s put this matter behind us. I’ll continue on my way, and you don’t need to follow me anymore,” Jian Wushuang said before turning and leaving.","Tossing the head in his hand into the void, the slender figure watched his departing silhouette. After careful consideration, he still decided to catch up.","“May I ask, Young Friend, where are you headed? How about we travel together?” he inquired.","“No.”","“...”"]},{"number":5070,"title":"Chapter 5070 Entering the Dust","paragraphs":["5070 Entering the Dust","In the vast emptiness, within the boundless universe, even for a Yan Immortal cultivator traversing through the void, there were still dangers to be found.","“Young one, I must admit that your swordsmanship is exceptionally remarkable. But with your current cultivation level, it would be wiser to proceed more cautiously,” the slender figure remarked.","He kept saying that he was a Grand Yan Immortal, all while getting closer to Jian Wushaung.","Finally, Sword Wushuang could no longer endure it. “Don’t you think that, for me, you are the greatest threat right now?”","“...Young Friend, you’ve got it all wrong. I would never be that kind of Yan Immortal!”","The slender figure replied with utmost sincerity.","“...”","He could sense that this individual was nothing more than a pure chatterbox, perhaps having gone years without speaking a word, which explained his incessant rambling.","He only shut his mouth in satisfaction when Jian Wushuang had restrained his hostility.","However, before long, he sighed, “In this vast empty void, to have a like-minded companion is truly fortunate. I can’t remember how long it’s been since I last spoke.”","“Have you always been like this?” Jian Wushuang suddenly inquired, “Interfering in matters across the Super Heavenly Regions? Buting into the business of random Heavenly Realms?”","“...Not entirely, it’s mostly because I enjoy meddling in ordinary affairs,” the slender figure said with a twitch of his lips.","Jian Wushuang shook his head in response and remained silent.","“What happened earlier was indeed my... I mean, my fault. Young Friend, please don’t take offense. In truth, I’m quite easy to get along with,” he continued, “For the sake of making amends, I’ve decided to protect you throughout this journey.”","“That’s hardly necessary,” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","The slender figure found himself at a loss for how to handle this uncooperative individual. However, he soon felt a sense of satisfaction and continued to follow Jian Wushuang from a distance.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, couldn’t be bothered with such matters and continued soaring into the depths of the void.","Jian Wushuang didn’t care about this and continued to dive into the depths of the void.","The void was vast, and there was still a considerable distance to cover before reaching the Great Mi Heaven.","As they continued their journey through the void, Jian Wushuang gradually let down his guard, allowing the slender figure to keep pace closely.","Jian Wushuang glanced at him but did not respond.","“These six words are, ‘enter the dust, transcend the world.’”","As these words were uttered, Jian Wushuang’s figure momentarily froze, then returned to a calm demeanor.","Indeed, someone who could contend with their own Sword Principle against the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent... How could they be an ordinary person?","The slender figure observed all of his reactions and couldn’t help but smile, saying, “So, Young Friend, shall I take you on a journey into the dust?”","This time, Jian Wu Shuang did not refuse, “Sure.”","“Then let us journey into the dust!”","The slender figure laughed heartily and took the lead.","And Jian Wu Shuang, who was originally prepared to go to the Great Mi Heaven, was successfully led astray.","To ‘enter the dust’ meant to enter the mortal world and experience the most subtle forms of life.","For Yan Immortals like Jian Wushuang, the mortal realm was considered impure, and their formidable Yan power could easily dissipate.","As a result, very few Immortals would set foot in the mortal world.","But the slender figure was an exception. He did not care about his own fortune or the dispersion of his Yan power; he entered the mortal world.","Without the supreme Dao of heaven and earth, and even in a realm so devoid of Yan power that it could not support the existence of cultivators, two figures in plain white robes walked slowly.","These two figures were Jian Wushuang and the slender figure.","The market was bustling and prosperous, filled with ordinary people who could not control or sense Yan power.","As Jian Wu Shuang and the slender figure walked through the market, even though they suppressed their Yan power, their extraordinary aura still attracted many curious gazes.","Among the bustling crowd, the slender figure appeared quite relaxed. He somehow produced two melons from who-knows-where, offered one to Jian Wushuang, and when it was politely declined, he simply began munching on it himself.","“After I reached the heights I aspired to, I stopped and entered one mortal world after another, experiencing the subtle essence of ‘entering the dust’.”","“All Yan Immortals abandon the mundane world like an old shoe, but I have a different feeling.”","“They, these mortals, have such short lifespans, at most a century is one cycle for them. I once sat on a high mountain in the mortal realm, watching them cycle through a thousand lifetimes. The loneliness of life and death touched me.”","“You might not believe it, but the fact that I can ascend to the Grand Yan Immortal realm has a lot to do with the mortal world.”","He threw melon husk on the ground and looked at Jian Wushuang.","“But I always feel that something is missing.”","Listening quietly to the thoughts of a Grand Yan Immortal, Jian Wushuang said, “That day may never come, or it may only exist in a single thought.”","“I actually hope that day will never come,” the slender figure chuckled.","“By the way, we’ve known each other for so long, and I haven’t asked for your name.”","“Jian Wushuang.”","“I am Nan Xuan.”","After exchanging their names, the two of them did not speak anymore and walked forward leisurely.","The market was bustling, to say the least.","Although there weren’t many pedestrians, their gazes were intense and sincere as they looked at the two of them.","But soon, the pedestrians in the market began to rush forward as if they were joining in on the fun.","“Let’s go, let’s go. Have you guys heard? There’s a magician from another kingdom. It’s said that his magic arts are extremely powerful, and he can conjure anything he wants. Let’s all go and take a look.”","Accompanied by the noisy voices, almost half of the pedestrians gathered in the front.","Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan were also carried forward by the crowd.","In the end, the pedestrians converged in the depths of the bustling market and stopped to watch in front of a stall covered with various masks.","In the center of this stall, a shabby old Daoist with white hair, wearing a Daoist robe, swayed left and right with a cheerful expression.","As his body swayed, the bells tied to his waist jingled.","“Welcome, dear spectators! This old Daoist has been waiting for you all here for quite some time.”","He said with a smile, then reached out and took a white monkey mask from the shelf, throwing it onto the table.","In an instant, the white monkey mask emitted a puff of smoke, and a long-armed, all-white monkey leaped out from it.","The crowd was in an uproar, all amazed by this sight.","The transformation of an inanimate object into a living creature was something unimaginable, but it was happening right before their eyes."]},{"number":5071,"title":"Chapter 5071 The Sloppy Old Daoist","paragraphs":["5071 The Sloppy Old Daoist","Even Nan Xuan, who was a Grand Yan Immortal, blinked in surprise at this moment.","Everyone sighed in amazement, except for the Jian Wushuang, whose eyes showed a hint of suspicion. He sensed a very familiar aura emanating from this old Daoist.","That familiar aura was extremely faint, but he sensed it immediately.","Jian Wushuang was puzzled. This mortal plane was nothing more than a low-level realm among the countless Heavenly Realms in the Great Si Region. How could there be an existence that made him feel familiar?","Moreover, this sloppy old Daoist had no trace of yan power fluctuations, which essentially ruled out the possibility of him being a cultivator.","Unable to figure it out, Jian Wushuang continued to observe.","Amidst the commotion of the crowd, the long-armed white monkey leaped from the table and began to bow and greet with an extremely cute appearance.","At this moment, the sloppy old Daoist in Daoist robes waved his hand and said, “Monkey, come back here and serve watermelon to the spectators.”","Ji, ji.","The white monkey responded and leaped back onto the old Taoist’s shoulder. It then extended its claws and began to fumble in the old Daoist’s arms.","It poised itself and swiftly dug a small pit on the ground, placing the melon seeds inside it.","“All things in nature grow according to certain rules, but these rules can be broken. Today, I will break these rules in front of all of you,” the scruffy old Daoist said, finishing his sentence and waving his hand over the spot where he buried the melon seeds.","In an instant, a mysterious scene unfolded. The soil loosened, and a lush green vine emerged from the ground, breaking through the earth’s surface.","It was a melon vine, and in just a few breaths, it grew from a seedling to sprawl across the ground, vibrant and green.","Then, the scruffy Taoist exhaled, and the small melons on the vine began to grow rapidly, quickly producing a ripe, dripping green watermelon.","As the crowd watched this spectacle, the atmosphere became even more charged, and everyone was captivated by this miraculous display.","In less than ten breaths, a single seed had transformed into a massive, impressive melon, a sight that left everyone in awe.","“This old Daoist is quite something; he even has me a bit perplexed,” the slender figure named Nan Xuan remarked, stroking his chin in contemplation.","Even Jian Wushuang, who had been initially skeptical, gradually calmed down.","The sloppy old man laughed loudly. “Since the fruits are ripe, it’s time to pick them.”","“Dear spectators, please take a look. This is not an ordinary melon but a mysterious golden melon,” the sloppy old Daoist said, using his hand as a knife to slice open the ripe, dripping green melon.","A strand of golden light burst from the crack in the melon. Then, countless strands of golden light emerged together, dazzling and blinding, making it impossible to look directly at them.","Everyone instinctively covered their eyes. When the light faded, a chorus of amazed gasps filled the air.","Inside the melon that had been cut in half, where the flesh should have been, an endless number of golden seeds were packed.","The sloppy old man was very pleased and reached out and took out a golden melon seed from the melon, holding it up to the sky.","“This is a gift from the heavens to me and to all of you. Each one of these golden seeds will be distributed to the spectators. There’s no need to rush.”","With these words, the crowd erupted in excitement. To receive a golden seed out of nowhere was enough to drive everyone into a frenzy.","Watching the restless crowd, the unkempt old Daoist quickly waved his hand and said, “Hold on, dear spectators. Due to the limited number of golden melon seeds, I have no choice but to set a threshold.”","“This threshold is that one golden melon seed requires one coin to purchase.”","The crowd fell silent, but quickly became agitated again. One coin could only buy three or five steamed buns, but being able to exchange it for one golden melon seed was a huge bargain.","“I’ll take ten! I’m buying ten!” a burly man exclaimed, tightly clutching ten coins and speaking excitedly.","“Let me finish first,” the sloppy old Daoist continued, “Each person can only buy one golden melon seed, and you must blow a breath onto the coin in your hand before you can use it to exchange for a golden melon seed.”","The same burly man from before impatiently blew on his coins and then handed them over.","The old Daoist smiled and accepted the coins, giving out the golden melon seeds in return.","This scene deeply stimulated everyone present.","Next, the entire scene descended into chaos as everyone rushed to exchange for golden melon seeds.","Only Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan remained calmly in their place.","“What do you think? Is this old Daoist a Yan Immortal who has come from another Heavenly Region?” Nan Xuan asked him.","Jian Wushuang’s deep gaze seemed to pierce through the crowd, focusing on the central figure. “It’s very likely, almost certain.”","In the next moment, he moved directly, emitting an unimaginable and strange aura that pushed the crowd aside like waves, creating a path.","Nan Xuan also knew that something was amiss and hurriedly followed up.","When they reached the center of the crowd, in front of the stall filled with masks, Nan Xuan’s brows were already tightly furrowed.","At this moment, the sloppy old Doaist was nowhere to be seen, only a long-armed white monkey that looked at them with a mocking expression.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes darkened as he reached out and slapped the white monkey.","“That old guy actually managed to escape?” Nan Xuan’s anger surged. As a true Grand Yan Immortal, not only did he fall for an illusion, but he also let the caster escape. It was undoubtedly humiliating.","“How could it be him? Shouldn’t he be in the Endless Sea? How could he possibly be here?” Jian Wushuang frowned, utterly baffled.","Nan Xuan said coldly, “Even if I have to dig three feet into the ground today, I will find him!”","Then, they both turned their gazes towards the distance.","Meanwhile, in the bustling market, a Daoist in tattered robes was running for his life. Due to his hasty steps, he looked rather comical.","“No, it’s impossible. I must be mistaken. How could it be him? In a place without the flow of Yan power, how could I possibly encounter him?!”","As he continued to flee, the sloppy old Daoist muttered to himself. It seemed he had recalled something terrifying, and his eyes frequently showed signs of fear.","The battle had been too terrifying, so much so that even though he had managed to escape by sheer luck, the mere thought of it filled him with immense dread.","“As long as I absorb some more fate energy, my injuries will recover. At that time, I can escape wherever I want and no one will be able to find me.”","As the sloppy old man thought of this, his pace quickened even further."]},{"number":5072,"title":"Chapter 5072 Birth","paragraphs":["5072 Birth","But soon, everything changed.","The buildings in the bustling city and the ground under their feet began to shake and tremble.","In an instant, the world spun.","The unkempt old Daoist only saw a blur before being kicked forcefully to the ground.","“Run, let’s see how far you can run!”","Nan Xuan shouted angrily, using his foot to press down firmly on the unkempt old Daoist.","“Alright, spare me, kind sir. I haven’t done anything against the heavens. Please, sir, take a closer look,” the sloppy old Daoist said as he struggled on the ground.","Just then, Jian Wushuang slowly approached him and crouched down.","The sloppy old Daoist, who had been planning to continue begging for mercy, shivered when he saw the newcomer’s face. He closed his eyes and actually passed out.","“Frightened to death?” Nan Xuan exclaimed in surprise.","Jian Wushuang spoke coldly, “If you pretend to be dead again, you’ll really be dead.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the sloppy old Daoist woke up. He did not even dare to look at him as he crazily knocked his head on the ground. “Please spare my life, please spare my life...”","Jian Wushuang said coldly, “Shut up, I don’t want to pursue the matter from before.”","The sloppy old Daoist immediately fell silent, not daring to move.","Now, Jian Wushuang had recognized that this old Daoist was Jiang Youxing, the one who had deceived him with overwhelming illusions in the Endless Sea and stolen his Chaos Origin Sealess Fruit. But he had no intention of pursuing the matter further; he only furrowed his brow and asked, “How did you escape from the Endless Sea? Tell me, are there any cracks in the Endless Sea to follow?”","Upon hearing this, Jiang Youxing trembled again and then said with a bitter expression, “My Lord, there are no cracks in the Endless Sea. The reason I was able to escape is that I abandoned all my fate energy, and I managed to escape while the Heavenly Gate was not completely closed.”","Jian Wushuang didn’t believe his words at all and reached out to sense his luck and fortune. After a thorough examination, he found that Jiang Youxing’s current situation matched his account exactly. Only then did he give up.","“Let’s go,” Jian Wushuang said as he stood up, his face showing signs of fatigue.","Nan Xuan was stunned. Then, he asked, “So, are we just going to let this go like this?”","He did not turn back. “Let him go. There’s no point in killing him.”","Although Nan Xuan was a little angry, he did not kill Jiang Youxing in the end. After giving the old Daoist a kick, he left.","Jiang Youxing slowly got up and sat on the ground, lost in thought for a long time. Finally, after one last glance at the receding figure of Jian Wushuang, he disappeared without a trace.","This journey into the mortal realm had been extremely turbulent, with the encounter of the biggest variable that disrupted everything.","Jian Wushuang no longer had the mood to continue traveling in the mortal world. After hastily appearing, he headed straight in the direction of the Great Mi Heaven.","“Young Friend, you seem to know that old Daoist from before?”","In the void, Nan Xuan asked.","“I know him. We’ve met once, and he stole something from me,” Jian Wushuang said without hiding anything.","He spoke angrily, “I knew that old guy wasn’t a good person, and it seems I was right.”","However, this revelation did not stir any emotions in Jian Wushuang, and he did not harbor any intent to kill Jiang Youxing when he saw him again.","More than anything, there was an indescribable and inexplicable sentiment regarding the Grand Yan Immortals imprisoned in the Endless Sea. It was this sentiment that led him to spare Jiang Youxing.","“Young Friend, what is your ultimate destination?” Nan Xuan inquired.","“The Great Mi Heaven.”","After the battle between the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, almost 70 percent of the entire Great Mi Heavenly Region had been destroyed.","Even though nearly 20,000 years had passed, it had not fully recovered.","The remnants of the shattered Heavenly Region plane were still visible, and everywhere his eyes could see, there was a desolate and bleak atmosphere.","“I remember visiting this place in the past. How did it become like this?” Nan Xuan was quite surprised. In his memory, the Great Mi Heaven was one of the top Heavenly Regions within the entire Great Si Region.","However, at present, it seemed that the Great Mi Heaven had suffered some severe damage and was slowly recovering.","He could not possibly imagine that the one who had transformed the Great Mi Heaven into its current state was none other than Jian Wushuang, who was standing beside him.","“Little Friend, what are you planning to do in Great Mi Heaven?” Nan Xuan continued to ask.","“I’m looking for someone.” Jian Wushuang said calmly and took out a map from his pocket.","This map had been drawn by the Young Emperor himself before Jian Wushuang’s departure. However, the map’s directions were quite vague, only indicating the general location of the Sancun Mountain. The exact coordinates remained a mystery.","“To the southwest, the 42nd Heavenly Region,” Jian Wushuang murmured softly, putting the map away, his mind made up.","In the vast expanse of the void, the approximate location of the Sancun Mountain was in the southwest. The farther southwest he went, the further away he would be from the Heavenly Region of Great Mi Heaven, reducing the risk of being pursued by the subordinates of Prince Jiu.","However, even though he thought so, things often turned out contrary to his wishes.","Just as Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan were about to turn southwest, a deep voice sounded without any warning.","“Stop right there, all of you!”","Seven figures, seven Yan Immortals in total, appeared from all directions and surrounded them.","The leader, a young Yan Immortal, looked at Jian Wushuang with a cold gaze and a hint of mockery on his lips. “Heavenly Official Jian of the Six Heavens Realm, what brings you to Great Mi Heaven?”","Jian Wushuang was slightly shocked. He did not expect an ordinary Yan Immortal to be able to call out his name accurately.","After thinking for a moment, he said, “I have no intention of causing trouble in Great Mi Heaven. We’ll leave now.”","With that, Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan turned to leave.","“How arrogant. Do you really think you can come and go in Great Mi Heaven as you please?” The young yan Immortal sneered and waved his arm. The other six Yan Immortals released their Yan power, trapping Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan.","“His Highness the Second Prince wants to see you. I hope you won’t be disrespectful.”","Before Jian Wushuang could respond, Nan Xuan chuckled, “Hasn’t your master ever taught you to read the situation?”","The young Transcendent Immortal furrowed his brow, clearly not paying much attention to Nan Xuan. “And who are you?”","“I am your grandfather!” Nan Xuan roared, and without warning, he unleashed a tremendous surge of power from his palm. With an unimaginable speed, it swept across the surroundings.","This was the pressure of a Grand Yan Immortal, there was no way a Yan Immortal could escape.","The leader, the young Yan Immortal, had barely reacted before his Immortal body was crushed to dust.","The other six Yan Immortals fared no better; they all disappeared without a trace.","In less than a breath’s time, seven Yan Immortals were nowhere to be seen.","“A bunch of insignificant pests, daring to obstruct me?” Nan Xuan’s tone was far from friendly, clearly irritated by the consecutive annoyances.","After dealing with the trouble, Jian Wushuang knew that he could not stay any longer, so he and Nan Xuan disappeared in the southwest direction."]},{"number":5073,"title":"Chapter 5073 Pre-Ambush","paragraphs":["5073 Pre-Ambush","Great Mi Heaven was vast and contained countless Heavenly Region planes.","In the initial battle, although the core sanctuary of the Great Mi Heaven had suffered heavy damage, the peripheral Heavenly Regions had not been greatly affected.","In the southwest, the farthest and coldest region within the entire Great Mi Heaven domain.","Even Yan Immortals rarely ventured here.","It was desolate, lacking in Yan power, and filled with the impurities from the Ancient Era.","Looking around, the Heavenly Regions planes were sparsely visible.","“Between the 42nd Heavenly Region...”","Jian Wushuang frowned and pondered as he continued to move forward in the void.","In this Great Mi Heaven, although the Heavenly Regions in the southwest were sparse, it would still take quite some time to search for the Sancun Mountain if they were to search them one by one.","Looking at the Heavenly Regions arrayed like stars, Nan Xuan spoke, “Young Friend, are you sure the Yan Immortal you’re looking for is here?”","Jian Wushuang nodded,” It is indeed here, but I’m afraid it will take some time to find the exact location.”","“We can’t stay here for long,” Nan Xuan added, “We just killed the Yan Immortal under the ruler of the Great Mi Heaven. They might have already sensed it. If we linger here, we’ll likely be discovered soon.”","Nan Xuan’s words were not without reason. Given Prince Jiu’s disposition, he would certainly not let this opportunity slip by.","So, Jian Wushuang found himself in a dilemma.","He did not know how many trump cards Prince Jiu had up his sleeves. If they clashed again, it would not be easy.","“Let’s retreat from Great Mi Heaven for now. We’ll make plans after some time,” Nan Xuan looked at him and said. “Or I can accompany you further into the journey.”","“You don’t need to do that,” Jian Wushuang replied, “My affairs shouldn’t involve you.”","Nan Xuan raised an eyebrow and smiled, “True friends are hard to find, and even harder to find are true friends with whom you can discuss Sword Principles and the Dao. I don’t want to see a friend in a difficult situation.”","“You’re a strange fellow,” Swordless shook his head, somewhat helpless.","However, at this moment, the void suddenly shook. Immediately after, the dead and cold void suddenly emitted a dense and surging energy.","“Speak of the devil, so soon?” Nan Xuan raised his eyebrows in surprise.","Relying on the perception of a Grand Yan Immortal, he realized that a majestic aura was converging from all directions.","Jian Wushuang frowned and had a bad feeling.","In the next moment, the once silent and frigid void was suddenly illuminated by pure Yan power. Figures, each capable of shaking the heavens and the earth, ascended from various Heavenly Region planes, converging together.","They were all Yan Immortals!","Close to 70 Yan Immortals appeared, they seemed to have been waiting for a long time, waiting for the right time to appear.","Each of the Evolving Immortals emitted extremely powerful Yan power, and they surrounded Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan with cold gazes.","“Are they lining up to die?” Nan Xuan sneered.","Between Yan Immortals and Grand Yan Immortals, there was an insurmountable gap that could not be compared. Faced with nearly 70 Yan Immortals, Nan Xuan alone could easily wipe them out.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow. After experiencing the Endless Sea, he had undergone a complete transformation and could easily withstand 70 Yan Immortals, or even 100 more, without any harm.","However, the current Prince Jiu did not know of his change, so he made a wrong judgment.","But no matter how mistaken the judgment was, Prince Jiu still attached great importance to it and had set up an ambush with 70 Yan Immortals.","If he hadn’t entered the Endless Sea, these 70 Yan Immortals would have been enough to severely damage Jian Wushuang, or even successfully besiege him.","But now, everything had undergone a dramatic change.","The 70 Yan Immortals did not charge in recklessly. Instead, they scattered strategically and connected with each other.","Moreover, their Yan powers began to condense, forming an Immortal Formation that resembled a cage that covered the sky.","“You want to use an Immortal Formation to trap me?” Nan Xuan sneered. His clothes fluttered and his unparalleled Yan power exploded.","The fate energy and Yan power of a Grand Yan Immortal were unquestionably displayed at this moment.","The faces of all the Yan Immortals were filled with shock. How could they have expected that a Grand Yan Immortal would appear among them?","Weren’t Grand Yan Immortals extinct?!","He did not even give these Yan Immortals time to think, Nan Xuan revealed his decisive side.","Rumble...","Unparalleled Yan power surged from Nan Xuan as the center, instantly tearing apart the Immortal Formation constructed by 70 Yan Immortals working together.","And at this moment, Jian Wushuang also moved, pure and dazzling divine patterns quietly flowing around him.","Boom!","The sky-covering Immortal Formation was finally torn apart, and the Yan power flowed and shattered.","The nearly 10 Yan Immortals facing them had not even reacted yet when Jian Wushuang directly shattered their Immortal bodies and erased their Immortal Sources.","None of the Yan Immortals could get close to him, and wherever his crimson-gold Yan power passed, even the void was torn into deep ravines.","In just one exchange, nearly 20 Yan Immortals died in Jian Wushuang’s hands.","Although Nan Xuan was a Grand Yan Immortal, he could not compare to Jian Wushuang in terms of speed.","This also surprised him.","How could a Yan Immortal have such power?","But soon, Nan Xuan understood. The fact that Jian Wushuang could stand up to him in a first encounter without falling behind was already unimaginable.","“Young Friend, truly amazing.”","Nan Xuan sighed, then charged once more.","70 Yan Immortals, even in the entire Grand Si Region, was a terrifying power. Even in ordinary Super Heavenly Regions, there was no such depth of power.","But now, these Yan Immortals were easily slaughtered.","Jian Wu Shuang hadn’t even summoned his Invisible Sword. With a wave of his hand, all the Yan Immortals were extinguished.","Emerging from the Endless Sea, his transformation had already surpassed the imagination of all Yan Immortals, including himself.","The Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body was like a container that was constantly broken and reshaping. When Jian Wushuang regained control of it, it had already reached a terrifying transformation.","He could effortlessly extinguish Grand Yan Immortals like Qin Tuo, who possessed strange powers. How could these Yan Immortals stop him?","In just a short moment of a hundred breaths, all 70 Yan Immortals were wiped out.","The void slightly tore apart, shattered Immortal bodies, and ownerless Immortal Sources floated in the void.","Jian Wu Shuang and Nan Xuan stood with their hands behind their backs, calmly observing this scene.","“Young Friend, are we leaving or not?” Nan Xuan turned to ask.","This time, Jian Wu Shuang did not hesitate at all. “Let’s go.”","Erasing 70 Yan Immortals was undoubtedly a major blow to Prince Jiu. If they did not leave now, he might take drastic measures.","Saying so, they left in an instant, flying a hundred thousand miles away.","But in the next moment, the vast void of the Great Mi Heaven began to tremble incessantly, and the stars and constellations started to shift.","An ancient and silent aura quietly emerged in the vast wilderness!"]},{"number":5074,"title":"Chapter 5074 Twenty Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals","paragraphs":["5074 Twenty Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals","Jian Wushuang’s brows furrowed slightly; this aura, it felt both unfamiliar and familiar at the same time.","He realized that there was no avoiding it anymore.","Accompanied by the tremors in the void, the once silent emptiness began to shift and change colors.","A mist, which seemed to appear out of nowhere, billowed up, obscuring everything.","“Again?” Nan Xuan said with solemnity.","The mist billowed, and a majestic aura filled the air.","“Do you truly believe you can act as you wish in Great Mi Heaven?” A voice, filled with unparalleled authority, resonated through the empty space like a tolling bell.","However, a figure that Jian Wushuang was all too familiar with suddenly appeared.","“Prince Jiu?”","“Jian Wushuang!”","In the nearly twenty thousand years since they had last met, Prince Jiu’s demeanor had undergone a drastic transformation.","Now, he exuded an intimidating presence, an intangible but palpable aura of supreme authority that filled the entire space. His ink-gold battle armor made him look like an emperor emerging from a sea of corpses.","Golden rays emanated from his True Eyes, captivating all who looked upon them.","And behind Prince Jiu, 20 figures clad in black robes stood in formation, as imposing as mountains and as terrifying as can be.","Deathly silence filled the air.","Their eyes met. Jian Wushuang looked calm, while Prince looked angry. Veins were popping out of his hand that was gripping the hilt of the sword at his waist.","He said angrily, “Jian Wushuang, you’ve humiliated me time and time again. Do you truly think you can escape punishment?”","A thunderous sound reverberated through the void.","Following that, Jian Wushuang said, “I have no intention of being your enemy. This time, I came to the Great Mi Heaven only to find a friend. It’s just that my journey didn’t go smoothly, and I had to remove some obstructive Yan Immortals along the way.”","“Do you realize that the Yan Immortals you removed were all under my command?”","Prince Jiu took a step forward, and his supreme authority bore down directly.","Nan Xuan’s expression changed slightly, and the Yan power within his body began to boil.","Only Jian Wushuang remained indifferent, completely disregarding his authority and aura. “I just said that I cleared some obstructive Yan Immortals, not because they were Great Mi Heaven’s Yan Immortals that I acted.”","The prince’s tightly furrowed brow eased slightly. “Even if it wasn’t intentional, I will never let go of the massacre of so many subordinate Yan Immortals!”","Jian Wushuang’s gaze sharpened, and a formidable divine pattern quietly surged around him. It was a plain but impossible-to-ignore pressure, rising from the bottom to counter Prince Jiu’s authority and displaying resistance.","Faced with this sudden and even more imposing pressure, Prince Jiu took half a step back, his expression uncertain.","There was unconcealed astonishment in his eyes. It had only been a few tens of thousands of years, but Jian Wushuang’s presence had surpassed what it used to be.","But soon, he regained his composure and said, “Jian Wushuang, old accounts and new accounts, we’ll settle them today!”","After his words, the prince swiftly drew the longsword hanging at his waist, and the sword’s tip, emitting a green light, pointed straight ahead.","In the next moment, the 20 figures in black robes behind him all moved, and the surging Yan power reached its peak.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang looked at Nan Xuan and said, “If you leave now, there’s still time.”","“Don’t joke, Young Friend. I won’t leave you behind in this dangerous place,” Nan Xuan frowned. “It’s too perilous here. Let’s go together.”","He said calmly, “I won’t leave. He won’t let me go.”","Nan Xuan was puzzled. “Just because of him, a young chap who isn’t even a Grand Yan Immortal?”","Jian Wushuang wanted to tell Nan Xuan that this young chap, who wasn’t even a Grand Yan Immortal, was the Emperor’s second son, the prince beneath the Emperor supreme’s seat, and his strength ran much deeper than what he showed.","But he ultimately remained silent and instead took a step forward, placing himself in front of Nan Xuan.","“Jian Wushuang, do you think you can withstand the entire Great Mi Heaven?” Prince Jiu’s voice trembled, and the 20 figures in black robes behind him moved in unison.","The extremely surging Yan power was almost tangible, and a unique aura descended.","20 black robes represented 20 Yan Immortals, but these Yan Immortals were no ordinary ones; they had mastered their own Immortal Styles.","Once they mastered an Immortal technique, it meant they had found their own path, the path to ascend.","Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals!","20 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals!","“I’m not trying to withstand the entire Great Mi Heaven, but the entire Great Mi Heaven is here to stop me!” Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows were as sharp as a sword, full of unyielding pride.","Pointing his long sword, Prince Jiu commanded, “Strike!”","Boom, boom, boom!","The clouds billowed, and the force erupted. Under the influence of the 20 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals, the void began to shatter.","They had all mastered their own Immortal Styles, far surpassing ordinary Yan Immortals, and even Jian Wushuang felt the gravity of the situation.","An Invisible Sword wrapped in bright golden divine patterns quietly appeared.","Facing the 20 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals, he directly released the Wushuang Sword Dao.","Wushaung Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, first move.","Star.","With this sword move, the void directly shattered, and thousands of starlight pillars ascended, devouring everything in sight like a raging dragon.","Nan Xuan, who had a long sword by his waist, also drew his sword without any hesitation.","A brilliant sun appeared behind him, and nine crimson-golden rays of sunshine followed the sword.","At that moment, the void was covered in the aura of crimson-gold.","The 20 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals were like moths to a flame as they were engulfed.","A deafening roar, capable of tearing apart the planes of entire Heavenly Regions, finally erupted in the southwest direction of the Great Mi Heaven.","The range of this shockwave was too vast, even Prince Jiu couldn’t ignore it.","He hurriedly waved his hand to bring down endless authority, using it to suppress the turmoil.","As the Master of the entire Great Mi Heaven, it was connected to Prince Jiu’s fate energy, so he could suppress the chaos very quickly.","At the same time, the shock and fear in his eyes only grew.","When had Jian Wushuang grown to such a level that he could single-handedly confront 20 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals?","One had to know that there were a total of 20 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals, enough to trample over any Super Heavenly Region!","But now, they seemed to be in dire straits?!","The resentment towards Jian Wushuang made Prince Jiu unable to endure any longer, and he directly shattered the void, slashing towards Jian Wushuang.","The void tore apart, and Lord Jiu, wearing ink-gold battle armor, broke through the brilliant golden radiance, his sword cutting through everything.","However, his long sword did not land on Jian Wushuang but was blocked by a slender and deep green True Sword.","“Hey, I say, let us leave, or else your Heavenly Region will be destroyed.” Nan Xuan held his swords with both hands, keeping Prince Jiu at bay, and said loudly.","“Get lost!” Prince Jiu almost went insane, raising his sword for a furious strike.","Stars burst forth, but Nan Xuan blocked them all.","“Ignorant!” He sneered, and with a shake of his deep green sword, he forced Prince Jiu back a hundred meters.","Blood surged within Prince Jiu, and he was so infuriated that he nearly spat out a mouthful of blood.","He could not understand why Jian Wushuang always had Grand Yan Immortals by his side."]},{"number":5075,"title":"Chapter 5075 The Reappearance of Changfu","paragraphs":["In the entire Great Si Region, where the Grand Yan Immortals were on the brink of extinction, why did they always appear by Jian Wushuang's side?","Prince Jiu, in his anger, actually calmed himself down. Facing Nan Xuan, who was a Grand Yan Immortal, he no longer clashed head-on but took a step back.","The magnificent meaning of crimson gold slowly dissipated, and the shattered void returned to silence.","Jian Wushuang stood still with his sword in his hand. In front of him, the 20 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals had disappeared without a trace, not even leaving behind a speck of dust.","In just a moment, 20 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals were directly erased.","This situation even exceeded his expectations.","But Jian Wushuang quickly realized that this was almost an inevitable outcome.","With the combined attack of Nan Xuan and himself, there was no possibility of survival for the 20 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals.","Looking at the devastated Heavenly Region planes and void, Jian Wushuang knew that he and Prince Jiu would fight to the death.","Ignoring the prince, Nan Xuan quickly arrived in front of him and said, \"Hurry, let's go.\"","But Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, \"You go first; I'll handle things here.\"","Nan Xuan urged anxiously, \"Why are you staying here? It's not wise at this time!\"","However, Jian Wushuang remained resolute in signaling him to leave first.","\"Then don't blame me,\" Nan Xuan said, preparing to take action.","\"Why bother?\" Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly and stopped him. \"If we don't leave now, we won't be able to escape.\"","Nan Xuan raised his voice, \"Even if we can't escape, who can harm me?\"","The next moment, a more ancient and profound aura awakened without any warning.","That aura transcended the constraints of the current heavenly laws, and the grand celestial laws of the universe began to collapse and shatter.","It was an aura from the Ancient Era!","Sensing the arrival of this aura, Nan Xuan swallowed the rest of his words.","His eyebrows twitched, and he muttered, \"Young friend, how much trouble have you truly stirred up...\"","Jian Wushuang remained silent, bitterness flashing in his eyes.","Only those terrifying beings from the Ancient Era could crush the Heavenly Dao solely with their aura.","And from that era, the terrifying presence would certainly not be less than Nine Revolutions.","The Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was an absolute pinnacle existence. Even though Jian Wushuang could slay a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal and even contend against a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, he was utterly powerless when facing a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","Not to mention, those who possessed such an ancient aura were all big shots!","A cruel smile appeared on Prince Jiu's face. A slender figure had appeared behind him.","Seeing the appearance of that figure, Jian Wushuang's eyes momentarily widened, his gaze filled with incredulity.","That figure left a deep impression on him, and even now, he had not forgotten.","From the Great Mi Heaven, the terrifying presence that destroyed one of Di Qing's True Life single-handedly, Changfu!","That was the presence that had ultimately perished.","But now, the reappearance of Changfu made Jian Wushuang feel as though he had plunged into an icy cave.","Prince Jiu slowly retreated.","Long Fu, dressed in mountain and water robe, nodded slightly and then walked forward at a leisurely pace.","Nan Xuan cleared his throat, his expression somewhat unnatural. As a Grand Yan Immortal, he naturally sensed the formidable aura emanating from Changfu.","He finally understood what Jian Wushuang meant. Even if he wanted to leave now, he couldn't.","They looked at each other from afar. Jian Wushuang did not take a step back when facing Changfu.","\"Long time no see.\" Changfu nodded slightly, giving a friendly gesture.","Although he was a little surprised, he still returned the greeting.","\"Di Qing... Is he well?\" Changfu asked again.","Jian Wushuang nodded, \"Not bad. His injuries have recovered well.\"","And so, the two of them began to discuss matters with each other.","This left Nan Xuan somewhat dumbfounded, and even Prince Jiu found it hard to keep a straight face.","He said in a deep voice, \"Elder Changfu, please eliminate all enemies!\"","As the command descended, silence returned to the void.","Jian Wushuang knew that he could not avoid it forever.","An Invisible Sword surrounded by divine glyphs appeared in his hand, the tip of the sword pointing straight at Changfu.","Nan Xuan was shocked. He even felt that this scene was extremely unreal.","A puny little Yan Immortal was actually pointing his sword at a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal?","\"It's my duty. Please don't blame me,\" Changfu said calmly. He raised his finger and then pointed downwards.","In an instant, the void shattered and the Heavenly Dao collapsed.","With just a finger, he broke through all the obstacles and landed on Jian Wushuang.","Splat!","Divine blood splattered, and his chest was completely shattered. He did not even make any effective resistance.","Nan Xuan turned pale with fright and hurriedly tried to help Jian Wushuang up. However, Changfu's attack landed on him again.","Pain, intense pain instantly spread throughout his limbs and bones. Nan Xuan felt his entire back completely shatter, and his Immortal Source was rapidly dissipating.","\"Damn it...\" Before he could finish his sentence, he fainted.","In just a brief moment, Jian Wushuang became a bloodied figure, utterly devoid of any resistance.","He clung to his unconscious, severely wounded body, struggling to breathe.","Upon witnessing this scene, though Prince?Jiu found it hard to believe, his ecstasy quickly dispelled his doubts.","With the long sword in hand, Prince Jiu decided to kill Jian Wushuang himself!","However, before he could move, Changfu opened his palm again.","Ancient and deathly aura emanated from his palm, causing the vast void to crumble and shatter.","Violent and surging astral winds erupted from the cracks, shredding everything in their path.","Finally, Jian Wushuang's figure was engulfed and consumed by the astral winds of the void, disappearing without a trace.","Prince Jiu exclaimed in shock, \"Where's Jian Wushuang?!\"","Changfu nodded and said, \"He has been torn apart within the chaotic void turbulence.\"","\"No, it can't be! Is he really dead?\" Prince Jiu couldn't believe it.","Had this Yan Immortal who he considered his greatest enemy really died so abruptly?","Prince Jiu sought reassurance, \"Elder Changfu, is he truly dead, with no possibility of resurrection?\"","Changfu nodded, \"Your Highness, there is absolutely no possibility. No Yan Immortal can escape my grasp.\"","Satisfied with the confirmation, Gongzi Jiu nodded and regained his composure, seemingly unaffected by feelings of joy.","\"Very well, let's return for now and make further plans later.\"","After a brief pause at the scene, the forms of Prince Jiu and Changfu eventually vanished into the void.","Once again, all was silent.","In this battle, more than ten of the Heavenly Region Planes were shattered, and the void was riddled with holes.","As far as the eye could see, it was all filled with raging astral winds of chaos.","Yet within this tumultuous and chaotic astral wind, a pair of eyes with a faint golden glint quietly opened.","\"Back then, Di Qing spared my life, and that's why I survived. Now, it's time to repay that favor.\""]},{"number":5076,"title":"Chapter 5076 Accidental Encounter","paragraphs":["The sound of Chang Fu's voice echoed in his mind, repeating incessantly for a long time.","In the midst of the empty void and the gale of the void, the once shattered Immortal body of Jian Wushuang was visibly restoring itself at a remarkable speed.","In just a few dozen breaths, it had fully recovered.","And in his arms, Nan Xuan, who had been lying motionless, opened his eyes at this moment and exclaimed, \"Could it be? You're really not dead?\"","Jian Wushuang nodded calmly. Long before he made his move, Changfu had secretly informed him during their conversation that he should feign death to avoid the entanglement of Prince JIu.","This was also the reason why Jian Wushuang 'died' so easily.","\"It's terrifying. How can there be such beings in the Great Domain?\" Nan Xuan, who had come back to life, said with lingering fear.","This was his first time being in such close contact with a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","After ascending to the Grand Yan Immortal realm, each transformation was like a deep abyss, and the pressure brought upon Nan Xuan by the Nine Revolutions was something he fundamentally could not resist.","That was also the reason why Nan Xuan was so astonished.","Because Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals could only exist in that Ancient Era.","In the end, the War of Emperors came to an end, and the Immortals were annihilated.","\"There are some things that cannot be explained in a few words. What we can do now is to leave.\"","Jian Wushuang said calmly. He stood up slowly in the chaotic and violent void gales.","Nan Xuan also got up and looked at his retreating figure with a pensive expression.","The void gales could cause some harm to Yan Immortals, but for a Grand Yan Immortal, it was like a mere itch.","In order to avoid the detection of his own Yan Power, Jian Wushuang signaled Nan Xuan to suppress his Yan power. They then disappeared into the turbulent flow along with the raging void gales.","\"Young Friend, do you think we'll be swept to some unknown place by this gale?\"","\"I'm not too sure. Since the astral winds are in Great Mi Heaven, it should stay within this range.\"","\"Then wouldn't we be dragged into this for quite a long time?\"","\"Perhaps.\"","...","Due to the severe fragmentation of the void, the gust of wind became even more violent, showing no signs of following any rules.","Huge vortexes rotated in the shattered void, and stars faded away.","These void gusts could cause considerable damage to lower-level Yan Immortals, but their harm to the Grand Yan Immortals was almost negligible.","However, due to the previous battle, Nan Xuan suffered some injuries from Changfu's finger attack.","Although he did not fall,?he could not release his Yan power to protect himself, so he quickly fainted again.","As for Jian Wushuang, the void winds could not break his defense at all. Despite his Immortal body not having Yan power, the gales did not affect him at all.","Thus, he held Nan Xuan with one arm and shuttled through the violent void winds like a fish swimming in water.","Since Sword Wushuang didn't have much knowledge about the Great Mi Heaven, he had no choice but to move blindly, allowing the gusts of the void to carry them anywhere.","Under such a battle, the peripheral Heavenly Regions of the Great Mi Heaven fell into chaos, with the void shattered, and all the Heavenly Regions were in turmoil.","Floating within the gusty vortexes, it was unknown how much time had passed before Jian Wushuang felt the gusts of the void tearing at his Immortal body gradually dissipate, and the force supporting his floatation disappeared.","It was like falling into boundless darkness, everything turning dim.","But this unknown dimness lasted for less than ten breaths of time before suddenly clearing up.","Sword Wushuang quietly opened his eyes.","Faint flowing clouds reflected in his eyes, along with a unique crimson color that was characteristic of the morning glow.","This was a peculiar Heavenly Region Plane!","...","\"Senior Brother, look up there, something's in the sky!\"","\"No, something's wrong with the sky, it's changing!\"","\"Run, I think the sky is collapsing...\"","Amidst the clamor, the chaotic sounds of people splashing in the water echoed continuously.","About 40 to 50 bare-chested men carrying baskets on their backs were running along the shore.","Clearly, they had all noticed the strange changes in the sky and were hurrying to escape.","At this moment, the youngest and most inexperienced disciple cried out in panic, \"Senior Brother, w-what about our sword blanks...\"","The burly man leading the group turned back and urgently replied, \"Run, it's too late for that now, we can't worry about it at a time like this, let's go back and see our Master!\"","Hearing this, the young disciple gritted his teeth and bent down to pick up four or five sword blanks before quickly catching up with the group.","They ran frantically along the riverbank, all the men watching the sky with deep concern.","At this moment, the sky above them had already developed numerous fine cracks, and crimson fiery clouds covered the entire sky.","Moreover, in the center, a violent whirlpool began to surge as if it could shatter at any moment.","In the next moment, the raging whirlpool seemed to have reached its breaking point and began to collapse.","A crimson pillar of light, ten thousand feet in size, suddenly pierced through the sky, illuminating the entire earth.","As far as the eye could see, everything was filled with a hazy golden light.","All the men running halted in their tracks, unable to believe what they were witnessing.","They realized that although the sky had broken, the destructive force that seemed unstoppable had not harmed anything.","Furthermore, these rays of light existed for only an instant, then retreated like tides, disappearing without a trace.","\"Is this... is this a dream?\" the muscular man at the front exclaimed in disbelief.","But soon he realized that it was not a dream but a reality.","Because although the sky had been repaired, the cracks that had not yet disappeared were still visible.","At this moment, the young disciple holding the sword blanks whispered in astonishment, \"Master, look at the water!\"","Following his outstretched finger, everyone turned their gaze towards the surface of the water.","There, hovering above the vast expanse of water, was a figure.","A figure dressed in simple attire, with a faint golden radiance flowing around him, exuding an indescribable aura of power.","And in his arms, he cradled a figure in black, silently suspended above the water.","The leader of the muscular men's pupils contracted as he saw the powerful figure approaching them.","In the face of such a formidable presence, not to mention confrontation, they could barely stand steady.","All the muscular men's faces turned pale, and they kept retreating.","Splash!","Due to nervousness, the young disciple carrying the sword blanks slipped and fell into the water along with his cargo.","In the next moment, thousands of threads of faint golden radiance quietly emerged from the water, lifting the young disciple out of the water along with the sword blanks.","\"Junior Brother!\" the muscular man exclaimed in shock, attempting to reach out and rescue him, but they found an invisible barrier separating them.","And so, thousands of radiance threads carried the young disciple towards the center of the river.","\"Young Friend, pardon the intrusion. What place is this?\"","\"This... is where my master resides, called the Sancun Mountain...\"","\"Sancun Mountain?\""]},{"number":5077,"title":"Chapter 5077 Sword and Mountain","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang felt his heart surging with emotions he hadn't experienced in a long time, an indescribable excitement resurfacing once more.","Even though that glimmer of hope had seemed elusive and intangible, it had materialized in a way that felt predestined by the heavens.","The Sancun Mountain, a place so elusive and difficult to find, had been stumbled upon almost by accident.","For a moment, Jian Wushuang was unsure of how to react.","As for the young disciple lying in the lush grass, though he appeared somewhat nervous, curiosity and admiration overwhelmed him.","The appearance of Jian Wushuang breaking through the sky left a profound impression on him, an overwhelming power etched into his memory, never to be forgotten.","Collecting his thoughts, Jian Wushuang spoke, \"Is this the secluded place of the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo?\"","\"Ah, Xu Tuo?\" the young disciple paused, \"Who is he?\"","Before he could respond, a burly man who had been standing by the shore stepped forward and asked, \"Visitor, what business do you have with my master?\"","Jian Wushuang secretly breathed a sigh of relief and replied, \"I came here to seek guidance from the Divine Craftsman on some questions that have troubled me for days.\"","The burly man furrowed his brow, \"My master doesn't meet visitors easily. Even if you come, there's no guarantee you'll get to see him.\"","\"I still wish to see him; otherwise, I won't have peace of mind,\" Jian Wushuang said, bowing respectfully and placing Nan Xuan aside.","At this moment, a slender man discreetly tugged on the burly man's sleeve and whispered, \"Senior Brother, we shouldn't bring him there. It's been so long since Master last had a visitor. If we take him now, Master might become angry with us...\"","\"Didn't you see that Junior Brother is in his hands? If we don't let him go now, disaster will befall us!\" the muscular man said.","The slender man sighed and said no more.","Afterward, he bowed and said, \"If the visitor insists, we will guide him. However, can we release my Junior Brother first?\"","Jian Wushuang was taken aback, realizing his earlier mistake. He quickly sent the young disciple back to the shore.","Unexpectedly, as soon as he landed, a burly man raised his hand and delivered two blows to his head.","The young disciple felt wronged and said, \"Senior Brother, why are you hitting me...\"","\"If I don't teach you a lesson, how will you remember anything?!\" the burly man said angrily.","Then he turned around and bowed, \"In that case, please follow us, Guest.\"","Jian Wushuang nodded and picked up the still unconscious Nan Xuan, following closely behind.","With that, nearly fifty burly men with bare chests and carrying backpacks walked along the water's edge, heading towards the mountains.","The youngest and most inexperienced disciple walked at the rear of the group, clutching a sword blank in one hand and touching his head with the other, muttering softly, \"So my master's name is Xu Tuo...\"","Like an ink painting, the ink-covered mountains stretched into the distance, with green being the dominant color.","Jian Wushuang carried the still unconscious Nan Xuan and walked at the forefront of the group, alongside the burly man.","They walked in silence, but during this time, Jian Wushuang observed all the details.","These accompanying men had extremely strong arms, and most of them had burn marks on their forearms, as well as shiny iron shavings on their pant legs, indicating years of ironworking.","At the same time, these men addressed the master craftsman Xu Tuo as their master, which was enough evidence that they were at the Three-Inch Mountain.","\"Guest, may I know your name?\" the burly man finally spoke.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly. \"My surname is Jian, and Wushuang is my name.\"","\"L-Lord Jian,\" he suddenly hesitated, \"My master has a peculiar temper and has never appeared publicly. It's likely not an easy task to seek an audience with him.\"","\"Are there any obstacles?\" Jian Wushuang asked.","The burly man nodded, \"Master has a peculiar temper and has never appeared publicly, so in order to maintain his peace and quiet, he has set up three trials. Only by passing all three trials can one have a chance to see him.\"","\"Very well, I'll proceed,\" he said, his gaze calm, showing no sign of hesitation.","Jian Wushuang's decisiveness and composure surprised the burly man. By the time he realized it, Jian Wushuang was already on his way alone.","The group of men remained in place, staring intently at his departing figure.","The lean man crossed his arms, a playful expression on his face. \"Do you think he can truly pass all three trials?\"","One of the men spoke up, \"If he can pierce a hole in the sky, what can possibly stop him?\"","At this point, a solemn-looking man interjected, \"Even if one could pierce the sky, it doesn't necessarily mean they can overcome our master's three trials.\"","\"Don't forget, no cultivator has ever seen our master's true face.\"","\"But he doesn't look like an ordinary cultivator.\"","\"Even if he's formidable, can he be a Yan Immortal? Remember, even Yan Immortals can be restrained when they arrive at Sancun Mountain.\"","The burly man waved his hand, \"Enough, stop arguing. Our immediate concern is to meet our master and let him decide.\"","\"Then let's hurry; I have a bad feeling about this.\"","As their footsteps grew fainter, the group of men disappeared from the scene, not entering the mountain.","...","This was a mountain. To be precise, it was a Sword Mountain!","Every hundred steps, there stood a sword, or what could only be described as sword-like shapes, slanting into the ground, enduring countless millennia.","An indescribable sense of solemnity and desolation pervaded the area.","Stepping into this vast and heavy Sword Mountain, Jian Wushuang became cautious.","If there were indeed mountain trials, this Sword Mountain was undoubtedly the first one. To have a chance to meet the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo, he had to be extremely careful.","Looking out, just the foot of the mountain alone had no less than 100,000 sword blanks.","However, all these sword blanks were made of ordinary iron and had no resonance with the one who wielded them, not even a hint of sentience.","Walking through this place, amidst the grand sword formations, made Jian Wushuang contemplative.","He speculated on who might have crafted these mindless sword blanks and why they had been abandoned halfway.","Just then, Nan Xuan woke up from his slumber, stretched lazily, and looked weary. \"Young friend, where exactly are we?\"","Jian Wushuang sighed and proceeded to explain the unexpected turn of events to him.","Listening intently, Nan Xuan exclaimed, \"Could it be? Such a stroke of luck?\"","\"Regardless of whether it is correct or not, we have to try.\"","After uttering these final words, Jian Wushuang continued to advance.","\"Young friend, wait for me.\"","Two figures moved forward with unwavering steps, paying no heed to the gusts of sword wind sweeping toward them.","Soon, Jian Wushuang discovered the clues within this Sword Mountain.","The sword blanks that covered the entire mountain foot gradually became sparse as they ascended."]},{"number":5078,"title":"Chapter 5078 Sword Tomb","paragraphs":["The mindless sword blanks gradually disappeared, vanishing completely when they reached the halfway point.","In their place, pristine True Swords emerged. Time seemed to have left no mark on these sword blades.","They gleamed as if freshly forged, exuding a rich aura that coalesced into a thin mist.","These True Swords were now more than adequate for ordinary cultivators.","However, in the eyes of Jian Wushuang, they lacked something crucial—resonant sentience.","Only when True Swords possessed sentience could they resonate with their wielders.","Unfortunately, he felt no sentience emanating from any of these True Swords.","At that moment, Nan Xuan suddenly spoke up, \"Young Friend, be alert. I sense a significant energy fluctuation at the mountaintop.\"","Jian Wushuang nodded, feeling the same disturbance from the mountaintop.","There were even more True Swords on the mountainside than at its base, numbering no less than 200,000 by a rough estimate.","Yet, out of these 200,000 True Swords, not one had gained sentience.","Though he was quite puzzled by this, Jian Wushuang still strolled towards the mountaintop.","As the first trial of the three, he did not believe it would be this easy.","As expected, at the next moment, the mountaintop trembled violently. Then, a curtain of countless True Swords descended from the heavens.","Boom!!!","The mountain was shaking. Nan Xuan raised his eyebrows and prepared to attack.","However, Jian Wushuang acted first.","He took a step forward, swung his right arm, and thousands of sword light beams burst forth instantly!","The collision between the two forces sent shockwaves throughout the Sword Mountain, reducing all the True Swords within a thousand miles to dust.","The sword curtain also shattered, dispersing in all directions.","A huge crisis was resolved just like that.","But Jian Wushuang did not pause for even a moment. He leaped straight to the mountaintop!","Nan Xuan followed closely, quickly catching up.","Upon reaching the mountaintop, a unique atmosphere, distinct from that of the mountain's base and slopes, spread out, causing even the clouds to turn a dark red hue.","It was an ancient desolate aura, vast and breathless, a solitude that seemed to transcend the concept of time itself, affecting even Yan Immortals.","As they gazed into the distance, upon the dark-brown, ravaged mountaintops, they saw fragmented longswords, some embedded at odd angles, some buried beneath the earth, all carrying an unspeakable sense of desolation.","Each sword, though broken, retained its sharpness, untouched by the ravages of time.","It appeared as if this place had borne witness to a ferocious battle, the swordsmen long gone, leaving behind a land soaked in divine blood.","\"There is only sadness left here.\" Nan Xuan muttered. Then, he scooped up a handful of soil from the ground under his feet.","The soil was blood-red, as if repeatedly soaked.","\"This is not Sword Mountain; it is a Sword Tomb,\" said Jian Wushuang, eyeing all the shattered longswords.","Despite enduring countless ages and suffering fractures, these longswords retained their sentience.","Jian Wushuang could even sense a faint resonance among them.","At that moment, an ancient voice, seemingly from nowhere, resounded.","\"Well said. This is indeed a Sword Tomb, my final resting place.\"","Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan became alert at the same time. They even released their Yan power simultaneously.","\"Do not worry; I mean you no harm. I simply wish to talk,\" the voice continued.","With the voice's descent, all the broken longswords emitted a soft hum.","Then, a figure in a black robe appeared atop the mountain peak, descending slowly.","With each step he took, the shattered longswords moved in rhythm, as if welcoming an old friend they hadn't seen in ages.","Jian Wushuang's heart was on edge. He could distinctly feel the dreadfulness emanating from the figure in the black robe, an ancient aura.","\"I have been asleep for a very long time, and I haven't spoken in ages,\" he said.","In a matter of moments, the figure in the black robe stood before Jian Wushuang and lowered the hood that covered his face.","The hood revealed a face that, though aged, bore a resolute countenance, much like a sword, captivating and piercing.","Jian Wushuang remained silent, looking at the elderly figure before him. He strangely felt a sense of familiarity.","As for Nan Xuan, he was rendered speechless. Despite being a Grand Yan Immortal, the aura emanating from the elderly figure easily overwhelmed him.","Hence, neither of them dared to make any rash moves.","Observing their cautious expressions, the elderly figure in the black robe smiled warmly, \"Do not be afraid. I am just a broken Sword Spirit, and I harbor no ill intentions towards you.\"","\"A Sword Spirit?\" Jian Wushuang's heart trembled, looking at the elderly figure in disbelief.","A True Sword with a spirit could only lead to a deeper level of mastery.","Long before encountering this black-robed elder, Jian Wushuang had speculated about his identity, but the one thing he hadn't anticipated was the Sword Spirit.","To grow to such an extent, what a terrifying existence the Sword Spirit must be!","It was an unimaginable existence, even more bewildering than a Sword Immortal.","To be born as a tool, to transform into a soul, and ultimately become a Sword Spirit, continuously ascending to the pinnacle. And now, this elder was the pinnacle of the Sword Spirit.","At this moment, the black-robed elder chuckled again, \"I almost forgot to mention, even before I went into slumber, I was already a Peak Grand Yan Immortal.\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","Peak Grand Yan Immortals, surpassing Nine Revolutions, the closest one could get to Emperor-level cultivation. Even in that Ancient Era, Peak Grand Yan Immortals were exceedingly rare.","And this black-robed elder was not just a Sword Spirit but also a Peak Grand Yan Immortal?!","This completely exceeded Jian Wushuang's imagination.","If a Sword Spirit could reach the pinnacle of the Grand Yan Immortal, what level of existence would its master be?","Nan Xuan was completely speechless. Everything that had happened during his time by Jian Wushuang's side, the encounters with Yan Immortals, and even the legendary Grand Yan Immortals, had all far surpassed his imagination.","What he had once been proud of seemed almost insignificant now...","Jian Wushuang gulped. He had never thought that there would be such a terrifying existence in Sancun Mountain.","The black-robed elder paid no heed to the astonishment in his eyes and continued, \"Young one, as the stars revolve and the years pass, I must ask, where is this place where I slumber located?\"","Despite the shock he felt, Jian Wushuang, an individual who had experienced countless battles, quickly composed himself and replied, \"This place belongs to the Great Si Region.\"","\"The Great Si? Excellent, excellent,\" the black-robed elder revealed a highly satisfied expression. \"Then, let me ask one more question: Who is the Emperor of this Great Si Region?\"","\"The Emperor of the Great Si Region... Is Zhen Wuyang.\"","As Jian Wushuang spoke, a realization dawned in his eyes."]},{"number":5079,"title":"Chapter 5079 Yu","paragraphs":["A peak Grand Yan Immortal asking such a grand question in itself was significant.","Jian Wushuang had already guessed the identity of the owner of this Sword Spirit.","Upon learning this news, the old man in the black robe's complexion returned to warmth, and he nodded, saying, \"It's in accordance with the Emperor's will.\"","Following that, his gaze shifted between Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan, ultimately settling on Jian Wushuang.","\"Young Friend, have you ever met Emperor Zhen Wuyang?\"","With these words, the old man in the black robe initially shook his head, self-deprecatingly chuckling, \"I must be getting senile to ask such a question.\"","\"I have,\" Jian Wushuang replied calmly, his expression unchanged.","The old man in the black robe's eyes immediately widened in disbelief. \"You really met him? How is that even possible?\"","...","It was no wonder the old man in the black robe reacted this way. As the Emperor of the entire vast and boundless Great Si Region, Emperor Zhen Wuyang was already an unparalleled existence.","The very foundation of the Heavenly Court was situated in the Heavenly Realm, and even the Heavenly Realm alone was beyond the reach and gaze of ordinary Yan Immortals, let alone seeing the true face of Emperor Zhen Wuyang!","So, the old man in the black robe was naturally astonished at Jian Wushuang's words.","To avoid any complications arising from their conversation, Jian Wushuang added, \"During a grand Heavenly Court banquet, I once observed from a distance.\"","The old man in the black robe suddenly realized, \"Ah, I see now, I see.\"","Although there were loopholes in Jian Wushuang's explanation, it sufficed to deflect further questions. Jian Wushuang couldn't help but breathe a sigh of relief; he could sense that the old man meant no harm and was merely reminiscing about the past.","At this point, the old man in the black robe spoke again, \"Since the young one has seen Emperor Zhen Wuyang, have you also encountered another figure by his side?\"","\"Who?\"","\"A Ye Immortal who followed Emperor Zhen Wuyang, named Yu Chang.\"","Upon hearing this name, Jian Wushuang's spiritual consciousness quivered. He was far more familiar with this name than with Emperor Zhen Wuyang.","His first narrow escape, his second narrow escape, and their brief encounter in the Heavenly Court had left a deep impression on him.","Jian Wushuang nodded, \"I have seen him too.\"","The black-robed elder rarely revealed a hint of joy, \"How is he doing? Has he made any progress?\"","\"Everything is fine, there are no major issues.\"","\"Very well, then I can rest easy.\" He nodded, a satisfied smile in his eyes, \"Since all the news has been obtained, I have no reason to keep you here any longer.\"","Jian Wushuang felt a sense of relief. If the black-robed elder did not object, it meant that he had passed the first test.","With a wave of his hand as he spoke, in an instant, all scenes retreated like a tide.","\"My obsession is over, and now I will truly go to sleep. Thank you, Young Friend,\" the black-robed elder said with a smile as he bowed.","Jian Wushuang was taken aback, suddenly realizing where that heavy sense of twilight had come from.","This black-robed elder was inevitably heading towards his demise!","As if confirming his suspicions, the black-robed elder said at last, \"I am about to wither away, and I have nothing of value left. If you don't mind, you can take this as a memento.\"","With those words, a thumb-sized object was thrown towards Jian Wushuang.","He reached out and caught it, and saw a dark blue diamond-shaped crystal in his hand, radiating unparalleled power.","In the center of this small crystal, there was a character: Yu.","\"Young Friend, take care.\"","After saying these last words, the black-robed elder's figure turned into a long wind and dissipated into nothingness.","A dark blue brilliance, like a swimming fish or a graceful swallow, moved gracefully in the air and finally returned to the crystal in Jian Wushuang's hand.","Jian Wushuang looked at the crystal in his hand, lost in thought. A Peak Grand Yan Immortal from the distant Ancient Era, the Sword Spirit, had just disappeared like this.","He left almost no trace, and there was no earth-shattering scene.","It was a sigh-inducing departure.","Adjusting his thoughts, Jian Wushuang then looked at Nan Xuan. \"Let's go, why are you still standing here?\"","Coming back to his senses, Nan Xuan looked at him and smiled bitterly, \"The more I get to know you, the less I understand you, young friend.\"","\"If you can't understand, save it for later. The most important thing now is to leave this place,\" Jian Wushuang said as he casually tucked the crystal into his bosom.","Nan Xuan nodded and followed him down the mountain.","Standing at the top of the mountain, Jian Wushuang looked back one last time at the spot where the black-robed elder had stood before finally leaving.","The entire Sword Mountain or Sword Tomb seemed to have lost its vitality, with all the True Swords and sword blanks vanishing, turning into a green mountain.","After leaving Sword Mountain, the path ahead was no longer a rugged mountain trail but had transformed into a wide road paved with blue stones.","The road was so wide that it extended into the depths of the distant clouds.","\"The second trial?\"","Jian Wushuang was puzzled, but he still stepped forward.","As he stepped onto the blue stone road, a strange sensation suddenly arose.","An intensely scorching aura erupted from the surrounding wilderness, burning everything. Even Jian Wushuang's Immortal body felt the peculiar heat.","But this extreme heat quickly faded, replaced by an intense cold.","The rapid shift between hot and cold made it extremely uncomfortable.","\"What's going on? Why is it so peculiar?\" Nan Xuan frowned and then reached out to manipulate the air.","He was actually altering the rules of this world with just a casual gesture!","If it were said that Yan Immortals stood above the Heavenly Dao, then Grand Yan Immortals not only stood above the Heavenly Dao but could also casually modify the rules of the Heavenly Dao!","And for Nan Xuan, as a Grand Yan Immortal, modifying the Heavenly Dao of this world was as simple as can be.","Soon, he completed the modification, turning the bizarre weather into a cloudless sky spanning thousands of miles.","Jian Wushuang could only shake his head in amusement. Modifying the Heavenly Dao on such a scale just for clear weather was probably something only Nan Xuan could do.","\"All right, the damn weather's back to normal. Let's hurry on our way,\" he said, raising an eyebrow, looking quite pleased with himself.","Jian?Wushuang nodded and took the lead.","They had passed the first trial of Sword Mountain without any disturbances, but the second trial would likely be much more challenging.","He couldn't be sure if the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo would increase the difficulty, so he decided to give it his all.","Inside Sword Mountain lay a terrifying ancient power. Sword Wushuang didn't believe that the upcoming challenges would be easy.","This broad road paved with blue stones was very likely the second trial.","Only by traversing this wide road would they have a chance to meet the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo.","Although Sword Wushuang wasn't certain whether they could uncover the secrets of the Heaven Script Bone Armor once they met Xu Tuo, he pressed on without hesitation.","Even though the information was vague and elusive, he continued to seek answers.","At this moment, Nan Xuan suddenly spoke, \"Young Friend, do you think there might be a Yan Immortal guarding this road?\""]},{"number":5080,"title":"Chapter 5080 The Immortal Guarding the Pass","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang's mouth twitched slightly, just as he was about to speak when he was interrupted by a gusty wind.","\"Force?\"","Both of them became alert simultaneously, their sharp gazes fixed on the swirling clouds on both sides of the road.","\"Who dares to cause disturbance here?\" a voice, ethereal yet steady, echoed, followed by the clear cry of a crane from within the clouds.","An ethereal but extremely calm voice resounded, followed by a clear crane cry from the clouds.","Then, the clouds parted, and a ten-li wide Scarlet Crowned White Crane soared out, with a white-robed old man sitting cross-legged on its back.","\"Quite the entrance,\" muttered Nan Xuan under his breath, preparing for a fight.","The white-robed old man gracefully descended and landed on the green stone road, while the ten-li wide crane transformed into a young boy upon touching the ground.","One old, one young, one tall, one short – two Yan Immortals now stood in their way, blocking their path.","However, this was just the beginning.","Several figures broke through the clouds and descended onto the road, blocking the way.","There were five figures in total, five Yan Immortals, and with the white-robed elder as the center, they walked towards Jian Wushuang.","\"Who dares to cause disturbance here?\"","Nan Xuan was about to take action but was stopped by Jian Wushuang.","He then said, \"We have no intention of disturbing you. We've come here only to see the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo and seek comprehension.\"","\"Comprehension? I suggest you leave. The Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo does not entertain visitors,\" the white-robed old man said forcefully, his voice carrying a tone of suppression.","Jian Wushuang remained unfazed and continued, \"Please inform him that we only seek comprehension, and once that is achieved, we will leave immediately.\"","\"Can't you understand words, or do you want me to expel you myself?\" a burly man with round ears and a round face angrily said.","\"You're asking for it!\" Nan Xuan shouted coldly, unleashing a palm strike through the air.","In the next moment, the burly man with round ears and a round face let out a sudden, unconscious groan as his massive figure was sent flying without warning.","Two streams of blood traced an arc in the air before landing on the white robe of the white-robed old man.","Because everything happened too quickly, the remaining Yan Immortals did not react in time, and the burly man with round ears and a round face lay unconscious on the ground.","Without bothering to wipe off the blood on his white robe, the old man with long beard and eyebrows shouted at the top of his lungs, \"Attack!\"","\"Be cautious and make sure to knock them out; otherwise, it'll be troublesome later,\" Jian Wushuang quickly advised, fearing that Nan Xuan might go too far and kill someone.","\"Don't worry, I'll treat them well.\" Nan Xuan replied with a faint smile. His figure instantly disappeared from his spot.","Subsequently, the battle only lasted for ten breaths, and after those ten breaths, the storm settled.","Nan Xuan returned to Jian Wushuang's side and let out a sigh, \"That was annoying.\"","Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly. Before him, the Yan Immortals who had appeared so dignified and ethereal moments ago were now all tied up together and unconscious.","The unconscious Yan Immortals had never expected that their opponent would be a Grand Yan Immortal.","It was a near-absolute domination; as long as Nanyuan willed it, a mere flick of his finger could easily crush them.","As the group of gate-guarding cultivators, known as Guardian Immortals fell unconscious, the vast road leading to the clouds finally opened completely.","Jian Wushuang sighed in silence, then continued to move forward.","Even though there were hundreds, if not thousands, of Yan Immortals ahead, dealing with them was only a matter of time for him now.","Having once reached higher realms, how could he possibly return to square one?","Moreover, this time, he had a true Grand Yan Immortal accompanying him. Failure was not an option.","Two of the three trials had been completed, and only the final one remained!","At the end of the expansive road lay undulating mountain peaks, with endless clouds rolling and billowing.","At the summit of these rolling mountains, a suspension bridge spanned millions of miles, suspended precariously in the midst of the clouds—a breathtaking sight.","\"This is truly a grand spectacle just to meet someone!\"","Nan Xuan stood before the suspension bridge, feeling sentimental. \"In this setting, it almost seems like a man pursuing a woman in the mortal world.\"","Jian Wushuang gave a faint smile. \"There's much to reflect upon.\"","Nan Xuan smiled too. \"Indeed, there is. After all, I've spent countless lifetimes in the mortal world, watching them build towering structures only to see them crumble. It naturally evokes many emotions.\"","\"Their lives are short, and they can't even compare to the time it takes for us to take a single breath. However, they still live diligently. It's truly worth admiring.\"","Jian Wushuang listened quietly to his reflections, his eyes showing a hint of tenderness.","From the smallest beginnings, one can still glimpse the grand Dao.","Just like that, a Dao discussion began on the peak of the clouds.","The clouds and mist are ethereal, gathering and dispersing.","After an unknown amount of time, when the suspension bridge beneath their feet disappeared and was replaced by solid ground, Jian Wushuang finally realized that they had completed the last part of the journey without any disturbances.","\"The third trial, could it be that we've passed it as well?\" He still found it somewhat unbelievable.","At this moment, a clear voice rang out, \"No, of course not. With me here, passing it won't be so easy!\"","With the utterance of this voice, the mist quickly dissipated, revealing towering pavilions and terraces that surpassed one another, stretching gloriously into the sky.","In contrast to Jian Wushuang, there stood a young man with a bare chest, his muscular arms holding a long sword with an expressionless demeanor.","He was an Immortal of the Yan clan, cold and aloof.","He looked at Jian Wushuang and said directly, \"I want to fight you!\"","Nan Xuan smiled, \"This kid really underestimates himself.\"","Jian Wushuang paid little attention to this, nodding and saying, \"Alright, but before we start, let me ask you first: does the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo reside here?\"","\"Let's fight first!\" the young man shouted and slashed down with his sword.","Nan Xuan retreated, leaving a space for this battle.","Faced with the descending sword, Jian Wushuang did not release his Invisible Sword but instead raised both hands and met it head-on.","As the sword came down, shattering the clouds for hundreds of feet, he simply sidestepped it.","The young man was a Yan Immortal, and his control over the long sword was precise, advancing step by step, relentlessly pressing Jian Wushuang.","Countless sword radiance burst forth from the sword, like a sky-covering brilliance descending.","However, Jian Wushuang only waved his arm and shattered the sword light.","Following that, he leaped forward, appearing directly in front of the young man and quietly gripping the sword with his index and middle fingers.","Ding!","With a crisp sound, the snow-white long sword broke into several pieces, leaving only the hilt.","Finger-snapping the sword in two, Jian Wushuang's face turned serious. He bent his finger and released a surge of Yan power, sending the young man flying.","The clouds shattered, and he tumbled through the air, finally crashing in front of a building.","\"Huff, huff... Huff...\"","He rolled over and panted heavily, \"I don't believe it, let's go again!\""]},{"number":5081,"title":"Chapter 5081 Meeting the Divine Craftsman","paragraphs":["The young Yan Immortal quickly stood up and drew out a long sword from somewhere, slashing at Jian Wushuang.","This time, Jian Wushuang moved even faster.","Almost at the instant the young man moved, he attacked.","Using his palm as a blade, Jian Wushuang aimed for his head and, with unimaginable speed, snatched away his long sword.","The young man, thrown backward, barely managed to stop himself, his eyes filled with anger and humiliation.","Jian Wushuang, who had taken the long sword, didn't rush to attack but instead examined the sword in his hand. \"Did you forge this yourself?\"","\"None of your business!\" The young man suddenly blushed, as if he had been touched in a sore spot, and reached out to reclaim the long sword.","However, Jian Wushuang was one step ahead of him. He shook his arm hard and the long sword in his hand shattered into pieces, leaving only the hilt.","The longsword shattered, and the sword body shattered into pieces, falling like snowflakes.","\"You've gone too far!\" The young man was furious and drew another long sword, thrusting it at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang barely dodged and remarked, \"The sword is too brittle, lacking in spirit. The only commendable thing is that all impurities have been thoroughly refined out. You put a lot of effort into forging it.\"","The young man froze for a moment but then continued the fight.","Jian Wushuang seemed to be quite interested in disarming his opponent, and in a matter of moments, he took away another sword.","\"This sword is not bad. It is much better than the previous two sword blanks, but it is still a sword blank.\"","\"You dare to be so insolent!\"","...","\"This sword isn't bad, but it's still just a raw sword blank. Come again!\"","And so, what was originally a confrontation turned into a comical brawl.","The young man acted like a sword repository, constantly drawing long swords to thrust at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was like an old master. He stood in the clouds and directly grabbed the long swords to comment on them before shattering them one by one.","In the end, the young man simply handed the sword to him and waited for his comment.","Watching this scene, Nan Xuan couldn't help but be dumbfounded. \"Can it be done like this?\"","In the end, the young man couldn't hold back and asked, \"Who are you exactly, and why do you understand the sword so well?\"","Jian Wushuang didn't answer him but said, \"Alright, all questions are answered. Now it's time for you to answer mine.\"","\"No,\" the young man flatly refused. \"I won't tell you that my master lives here.\"","\"Hmm?\"","...","The air froze, his lips twitched slightly, apparently realizing that he had just blurted out his master's location.","Jian Wushuang stifled a laugh; it seemed this guy's brain was not functioning properly.","The next moment, an irritable voice rang out, \"Enough, you foolish disciple, even forging swords has turned your brain to mush!\"","Jian Wushuang's gaze instantly sharpened as he looked towards the clouds ahead.","The clouds fluctuated, with speckled sparks flying within, like a massive furnace, and the cloud smoke began to turn crimson.","Upon hearing this reprimand, the young man hurriedly kneeled, his face flushed, \"Master, forgive me, your disciple is dull and couldn't fulfill your instructions.\"","The clouds seemed to be boiling, like a toppling furnace, causing the entire sky to begin to boil.","Seeing this scene, Jian Wushuang's breathing became rapid. The closer he was to the truth, the more nervous he became.","As the sky turned crimson and boiled, a slightly stout figure slowly approached from afar, from the edge of the sky.","Sensing the fluctuation in the air above, Nan Xuan's face changed, and he quickly moved to Jian Wushuang's side, whispering, \"Be careful, the newcomer is a Grand Yan Immortal whose strength surpasses mine.\"","He nodded. How could someone as famous and mysterious as Xu Tuo, the Divine Craftsman, not be a Grand Yan Immortal?","Moreover, Jian Wushuang speculated that Xu Tuo was likely one of those who had existed since the Ancient Era.","Approaching on a stream of fiery red clouds was an older man with a somewhat reddish-black complexion and a slightly stout figure.","He stared with a pair of bull-like eyes and stood with his hands behind his back, exuding an imposing aura.","Seeing this, the young man shivered in fear and lowered his head even further.","Jian Wushuang took half a step back and nodded slightly.","The short, stout old man with a dark and ruddy complexion arrived in mid-air, standing before him. He stared directly at Jian Wushuang, assessing him from head to toe.","After a while, he spoke coldly, \"You're the one shamelessly claiming to guide my disciple?\"","Jian Wushuang replied with a firm tone, \"Guidance might be an overstatement; I just didn't want to waste such a promising talent.\"","\"A promising talent?\" The stout old man suddenly sneered, \"My disciple is renowned for his stupidity, even among all my disciples. Where do you see promise in him?\"","The young man kneeling on the ground heard his master's harsh judgment and turned pale. His entire being seemed to tremble, as if he could collapse at any moment. The impact of these words was far more devastating than having his sword taken from him.","The impact of these words was far more terrifying than when his sword was taken away.","Despair grew.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang spoke again, \"Forging a sword is the same as forging one's heart. The hardships involved in this process are beyond what ordinary cultivators can endure.\"","\"In the realm of the heavens, there are countless swordsmiths, but who deserves to be called a true master, who can forge the ultimate treasure? In truth, it was already destined from the very beginning.\"","The stout old man scoffed at this, saying, \"Nonsense. Who dares to claim that destiny is set?\"","Jian Wushuang smiled and asked, \"May I ask, Senior, are you the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo?\"","\"Yes,\" the stout old man admitted, \"but what does that have to do with your talk of destiny?\"","Once he was sure of this, Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief and continued, \"Then may I ask how many disciples does the Divine Craftsman have?\"","\"You're testing my patience, Junior,\" the stout old man frowned, clearly displeased.","Jian Wushuang smiled slightly, \"I don't dare, but I can assert that no matter how many disciples the Divine Craftsman has, there will be only two who can ultimately reach your level.\"","The stout old man, who had been frowning, suddenly froze and a trace of unconcealed shock flashed in his eyes. But soon, he regained his composure and dismissed it, saying, \"Humph, pure nonsense. You don't even know how many disciples I have, yet you dare to make such a claim?\"","\"It doesn't matter how many there are. There will only be two,\" Jian Wushuang said mysteriously, \"Senior, are you willing to make a bet? I know who the two are.\"","\"A bet? I'm not afraid to make a bet. I'm only afraid of your wild claims!\" The stout old man sneered, \"Fine, let's make a bet.\"","\"Senior, if I guess who the two are correctly, please agree to a condition.\"","\"Of course, if you guess correctly, I'll agree to any condition, even if it's ten conditions,\" the stout old man agreed.","Jian Wushuang nodded, raised his palm, and pointed at the young man who was still kneeling in the clouds. He said with determination, \"That's the first one!\"","A strong wind suddenly rose, and the young man, whose spirits had been sinking, trembled with renewed hope!"]},{"number":5082,"title":"Chapter 5082 Destined by the Heavenly Dao","paragraphs":["He couldn't believe it. He had only met this young Yan Immortal who had shattered nearly a hundred of his long swords a few hours ago, and now he was saying that he could one day rival his master. It was truly beyond imagination.","Seeing Jian Wushuang so confident, even the short and chubby old man felt shocked, but quickly scoffed, \"This is utterly absurd, pure nonsense!\"","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, \"Whether it's nonsense or not, only you know.\"","\"Tell me the reason,\" the short and chubby old man stared at him intently, looking quite serious.","Jian Wushuang nodded and continued, \"The reason is simple. His swordsmithing technique is not advanced, you could even say it's at a beginner's level. This shows his lack of skill.\"","\"However, he compensates for it with diligence. In just the previous battle, he displayed nearly a hundred swords, and each one surpassed the last. If I'm not mistaken, the number of swords he has crafted must exceed ten thousand.\"","The young man kneeling in the clouds suddenly raised his head, looking at Jian Wushuang with disbelief, as if a hidden secret had been uncovered.","The short and fat old man shook his head and said, \"Hard work can make up for one's ineptitude. This is a ridiculous saying. Since ancient times, how many cultivators have ever reached the end?\"","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, \"Diligence can indeed compensate for lack of skill, but that's just the initial condition. What's more important is whether his master will spare no effort in teaching him.\"","\"Hmph!\" The old man waved his sleeve, \"You're just using strong words. Now, tell me who the other disciple is?\"","Nan Xuan watched nervously from the side, feeling lost in the clouds. He had come to this realm with Jian Wushuang, but why hadn't he noticed anything while Jian Wushuang was talking so confidently?","Jian Wushuang said, \"The youngest and most spirited disciple with the sharpest eyes is the second one.\"","With these words, the short and chubby old man could no longer hide his astonishment, and a terrifying surge of Yan power directly enveloped the entire sky.","\"Who exactly are you? How do you know so much?\"","Nan Xuan was facing a great enemy, and he also released his terrifying Yan power.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang remained calm, unaffected by the short and chubby old man's pressure. \"I came here this time just to seek advice from Senior Divine Craftsman on a certain matter, nothing else.\"","\"As for why I knew so much, you need to calm down first before I can explain it all.\"","In an instant, the opposing tension between them dissipated. The short and stout old man regained his previous composure, albeit without the contempt in his eyes. He said, \"Please go on.\"","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, \"I have been searching for the Senior Divine Craftsman for some time now. Eventually, by pure chance, I entered this realm. What's even more coincidental is that I encountered a group of the Senior's disciples at that time, nearly 50 of them.\"","\"Due to a celestial anomaly, those disciples panicked and fled. They even casually discarded the sword blanks by the shore. However, one of the disciples fell into the water because he held onto the sword blanks with unwavering determination.\"","\"I rescued him, and we had a brief conversation. I saw an indescribable determination in his eyes and talent far beyond his peers.\"","\"These two disciples are my choice.\"","After saying the last sentence, Jian Wushuang nodded and looked at the short and stout old man.","Silence prevailed for a while, and the world remained still.","The short and stout old man's gaze was as sharp as a sword, continuously scrutinizing him. After a long while, he hoarsely spoke, \"Are you one of Prince Jiu's subordinates?\"","\"No, I belong to no faction. I'm just a wanderer in this world,\" Jian Wushuang replied decisively, without hesitation.","Seemingly satisfied with his answer, the short and stout old man smiled secretly. \"You're quite an interesting Junior.\"","\"Enough talk. Follow me.\"","After the short and stout old man finished speaking, he turned and walked towards the depths of the clouds, and his voice echoed.","\"Don't kneel there, foolish disciple. Forge another thousand swords for me and place them on Sword Mountain after you're done.\"","The young man heard this and replied earnestly, \"Yes, Master.\"","Jian Wushuang shook his head with a smile and followed the short and stout old man, with Nan Xuan trailing behind.","Shortly after, the young man also caught up with them, and he respectfully said, \"I'm not good with words, but I still want to thank you sincerely.\"","Jian Wushuang waved his hand with a smile and said, \"No need to thank me. Just pester your master more in the future and learn as much as you can.\"","\"I will,\" he replied with unwavering determination and fiery determination in his eyes.","After going through the last trial, Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo showed up on his own initiative, which saved Jian Wushuang a lot of trouble and also gave him a preliminary understanding of Xu Tuo.","The Sancun Mountain Heavenly Region was much larger and more abundant in spiritual energy than many other Heavenly Regions, making it extremely suitable for cultivation.","However, Jian Wushuang speculated that there were likely not more than a hundred cultivators residing in the entire Sancun Mountain Heavenly Region, and it could even be fewer.","Despite the scarcity of cultivators, the sky was filled with countless pavilions and buildings, and navigating among them allowed one to easily appreciate their intricacies.","The short and stout old man walked with his hands behind his back, proceeding neither quickly nor slowly.","Jian Wushuang followed closely behind him and did not speak.","After nearly half an hour of weaving through the clouds, they finally arrived at a magnificent and vast Dao Arena.","The Dao Arena was square-shaped, with its edges spanning a hundred thousand miles, constructed from pitch-black rocks and enveloped in a peculiar aura.","If one were to judge the Dao Arena alone, it might not have been overly impressive. However, what astonished Jian Wushuang was the enormous cauldrons placed in the Dao Arena.","There were a total of ten colossal cauldrons, each one reaching the pinnacle of size, resembling towering mountains resting upon the Dao Arena.","Within these cauldrons, a boiling, black-red magma churned and roared, with endless sparks flying out, creating an extremely shocking spectacle.","Simultaneously, the power manifestations in the sky transformed into ten raging vortexes, all pouring into the massive cauldrons, causing an earth-shattering commotion.","It was easy to imagine that once the magma within these cauldrons spilled over, it would result in an unimaginable catastrophe.","This place was the treasure Dao Arena created by the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo!","The short and stout old man halted his steps and looked at Jian Wushuang, saying, \"You are the only outsiders besides my disciples who have come here.\"","\"It is an honor,\" Jian Wushuang nodded.","The short and stout old man was very pleased and nodded in response, \"Respectful juniors, you possess a fraction of the demeanor I had in my younger days.\"","Next, under his guidance, Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan entered this grand and expansive treasure Dao Arena.","Layers of dark blue power fluctuations resembled a vast barrier, protecting this part of the Dao Arena.","As they took a step into it, an indescribable pressure instantly washed over them.","Caught off guard, even Nan Xuan, who was a Grand Yan Immortal, couldn't help but grunt.","The pressure here far exceeded that of any Heavenly Region, and it was even several times more intense than the void. It was likely that any Yan Immortal who dared to step foot here would suffer irreparable damage in an instant."]},{"number":5083,"title":"Chapter 5083 Decipher the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor","paragraphs":["Even Jian Wushuang could feel the layers of shackles on his body, making it difficult for him to breathe.","The short, chubby old man seemed accustomed to this sensation and explained, \"The heavy pressure here is intentional on my part, meant to refine the impurities within every raw material.\"","Upon hearing this, Nan Xuan muttered under his breath, \"No wonder he's so short, he hasn't even spared himself.\"","\"...\" The short, chubby old man paid no attention to Nan Xuan's comment and turned to Jian Wushuang. \"Junior, how do you feel?\"","\"I'm fine, no major issues,\" he quickly adjusted his state and nodded.","The old man then looked at him with interest and said, \"You don't seem as simple as just a Yan Immortal, both in your performance and your level of careful thinking.\"","Jian Wushuang smiled and asked, \"What do you think I am, then?\"","\"I don't know, but I can sense that you're not as simple as you appear, and more importantly, I sense loneliness within you.\"","Loneliness? Perhaps,\" Jian Wushuang replied.","The short, chubby old man waved his hand. \"Well, enough chatter. What is your purpose in coming to me this time? Do you want me to craft a supreme treasure for you or trade something?\"","\"Neither. I simply seek your guidance,\" Jian Wushuang said and took out a palm-sized object from the Bowl of Yang Vessel.","It was a Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor, pure and luminous, engraved with intricate ancient patterns.","Due to the immersion in Emperor's Radiance and Yan power from the Boyang Bottle, the entire Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor had a faint white glow.","His eyes widened as he eagerly took the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor from Jian Wushuang's hand and examined it closely.","Jian Wushuang dared not even breathe, keeping his focus and anxiety at their peak.","As of now, within the Great Yan Domain, the only thing connected to information about his master, Xuan Yi, was this Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor.","If no one could successfully comprehend it, it would mean the complete loss of Xuan Yi's information.","For Jian Wushuang, this was an unacceptable reality.","For millions of years, only Master Xuan Yi had been closely related to his growth. He was unwilling to let go of Xuan Yi's information at this critical juncture.","Therefore, at this moment, his heart was moved.","Master Xuan Yi, who was he?","Was the ultimate Great Yan Domain related to him?","How far had he gone?","Everything was a mystery!","As time passed, watching the short and chubby old man furrow his brows, Jian Wushuang became increasingly anxious.","Finally, he tentatively asked, \"Senior Divine Craftsman, can you decipher it?\"","The old man, named Xu Tuo, suddenly raised his head and stared at him intently. \"Where did you obtain this thing?\" he asked.","Jian Wushuang bowed respectfully, \"The process of obtaining it was extremely convoluted and difficult to explain at the moment. However, the inscriptions on it are of utmost importance to me, so I request your assistance.\"","After a moment of silence, Xu Tuo spoke, \"This thing is extremely ancient, and the contents hidden within it are likely beyond the comprehension of any Yan Immortal expert.\"","\"It can't be. Senior, you must have a way,\" Jian Wushuang pleaded urgently.","\"I have perused countless texts from various domains, and I am familiar with ancient scripts from different eras, but the inscriptions on this bone armor are like nothing I have ever seen,\" Xu Tuo said solemnly. \"This bone armor is ancient to an unimaginable degree.\"","Jian Wushuang took a step back, feeling as though he had been struck by lightning.","If even Xu Tuo, who had examined countless texts, couldn't identify it, then who in the entire Great Si Region or Great Yan Domain could?","At this moment, Xu Tuo suddenly said, \"However, I can attempt to decipher it.\"","Jian Wushuang was taken aback, then he bowed respectfully. \"I am grateful for your willingness, Senior!\"","Xu Tuo looked at him with a meaningful expression before clutching the bone armor with the inscriptions and swiftly walked toward the center of the Dao Arena.","As he moved, the scenery within the Dao Arena changed, and the ground trembled. Soon, a grand hall appeared, situated in the center of the Dao Arena.","Xu Tuo rushed into the hall, followed closely by Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan.","The hall was vast, resembling a library, with countless books suspended in the air, seemingly endless.","The number of books in this hall was probably not inferior to the Heavenly Dao Library in Zhen Wuyang's Heavenly Palace.","Xu Tuo hurriedly entered the hall and, with a casual wave of his hand, hundreds or even thousands of ancient books, whose ages were incalculable, fell onto the desks.","He then began comparing the inscriptions on the bone armor with the ancient books.","Jian Wushuang didn't idle either; he began to search through the ancient books as well.","Looking at the tense atmosphere, Nan Xuan did not dare to stay idle. He also started to rummage through the ancient books.","The disorderly arrangement of the ancient books in the hall made even Jian Wushuang, who had transcended the rules of the Heavenly Dao, feel a headache.","Once they reached the level of Yan Immortal, they could instantly comprehend various non-interconnected scripts from different Heavenly Region Planes using the power of the Heavenly Dao. Therefore, mastering ancient scripts and languages within an instant was not a difficult task for them.","However, this Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor proved to be a challenge. Even Xu Tuo, who was currently examining it, couldn't make heads or tails of it.","The hall was deathly silent, leaving only the sound of pages turning rapidly.","Xu Tuo's expression was solemn as he constantly rubbed the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor, but he had no clue.","Jian Wushuang kept looking for any ancient book, desperate for a clue.","\"It's impossible. How could there be such ancient scripts? What place do these scripts belong to?\" Xu Tuo's expression grew even more serious, and his eyes reddened.","Just then, Nan Xuan's voice suddenly sounded, \"The patterns in this book seem to somewhat match those on the bone armor.\"","Jian Wushuang's body shook, and he quickly looked at the ancient book in Nan Xuan's hands.","But Xu Tuo was quicker; he directly snatched the ancient book from Nan Xuan's hands and hurried back to the desk.","\"It's this one!\"","Taking a deep breath, Xu Tuo said in a deep voice.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang could not control himself and rushed forward.","The ancient book that Nan Xuan had dug out only had a few dozen pages. The words were strange and filled with an aura of vicissitudes.","Xu Tuo knelt in front of the document and read it word by word.","\"Name... Yi, Xuan?\"","\"Resided... in the... East Capital.\"","With Xu Tuo's explanation, the extremely mysterious Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor showed its first appearance to Jian Wushuang.","The words were not coherent at all, but they were like a life-saving straw, allowing Jian Wushuang to get closer to Xuan Yi for the first time!","Why do I have such a familiar feeling?\"","\"Resided in the East Capital... Why do I feel such familiarity with this?\" Xu Tuo murmured while still trying to decipher. However, he soon encountered a bottleneck, and sweat dripped from his temples.","\"Why can't I read these words anymore?\""]},{"number":5084,"title":"Chapter 5084 A Strange Arrival","paragraphs":["His words made Jian Wushuang's mental state fall to the bottom again.","\"There is a Great Restriction on these characters, rendering them completely unreadable,\" he said, lifting his head and speaking in a deep voice.","Jian Wushuang fell silent, as he had already sensed that anything related to Xuan Yi was under a powerful restriction.","This was something that could be seen even in the Divine Power Universe.","Yet, he couldn't help but ask, \"Is there really no way, Senior Divine Craftsman?\"","\"I'll keep trying,\" Xu Tuo took a deep breath and continued to examine the documents on his desk.","Nan Xuan asked, \"What is this thing exactly, and why is it so difficult to decipher? Even a Grand Yan Immortal can't do it?\"","\"I'm afraid there's really no way to unlock it,\" Jian Wushuang said with a touch of bitterness in his eyes. He could sense that the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor was imprisoned by some force, and the characters were sealed beyond Xu Tuo's ability to unlock.","But at that moment, Xu Tuo suddenly spoke again, \"Resided in the Eastern Capital, passed through... Ji Shangyang?!\"","In that moment, Jian Wushuang's mind exploded like a thousand-pound thunderbolt.","\"Resided in the Eastern Capital, passed through Ji Shangyang!\"","These eight words were both unfamiliar and extremely familiar.","Past scenes began to reappear.","The Soul Travel experience he had in the Eternal Wushuang Auction House came flooding back.","The figure in the black robe hurrying along the road had spoken the exact words, \"I passed through Ji Shangyang from the Eastern Capital!\"","Everything seemed like fragmented pieces gradually coming together.","\"Resided in Eastern Capital, passed through Ji Shangyang.\" What did these eight words mean? And why could the figure in the black robe, who was in a hurry, say words that matched these eight perfectly?","Everything was shrouded in mist but couldn't be unraveled.","Xu Tuo's face turned somewhat pale, and disbelief flashed in his eyes. It was as if he had realized something and tried to get up and move away from the documents.","But the moment he stood up, the originally lustrous Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor suddenly turned completely black, like charcoal.","The once radiant white glow had turned into a dark purple, reaching a level of eerie strangeness.","In the next moment, a violent vortex erupted to the extreme, centered around the Heavenly Rune Bone Armor.","Nan Xuan was the first to react, without any hesitation, he directly pushed Jian Wushuang several dozen yards away.","As for Xu Tuo, being the closest, he was directly engulfed by the dark purple vortex.","\"Senior?!\" Jian Wushuang shouted anxiously, disregarding the violent vortex. He immediately released his invisible sword and slashed at it.","Clang!","The clash of metal resounded, creating a gap in the vortex, but it did not suffer greater damage and instead displayed a menacing presence, covering the sky.","\"Young Friend, run quickly. The old man has his own destiny. Let's not worry about him for now,\" Nan Xuan shouted loudly, then picked up Jian Wushuang and ran without hesitation.","As they stepped out of the hall, the violently raging vortex tore the hall apart. The entire Dao Arena was shrouded in a layer of dark purple haze.","The entire Dao Arena was trembling, and the ten enormous cauldrons were also shaking, with some molten lava even splashing.","\"Damn it, where did this storm come from? It can even reduce Yan power?\"","Nan Xuan said with a frown as he put Jian Wushuang down.","Jian Wushuang had a very bad premonition in his heart. This aura was irresistible, as if it had traversed endless time and space, and it was the Great Restriction. Anyone who dared to peek into its secrets would face the most terrifying consequences.","At this moment, the vast and majestic Daoi Arena was completely covered by the dark purple vortex, and the Yan power was depleted.","Being within it was even more oppressive.","Jian Wushuang reached out and grabbed at the air, then opened his palm to look. It was filled with wispy threads of haze.","The violent vortex gradually dissipated, turning into a sky full of black mist.","\"Divine Craftsman, I'm afraid there's danger,\" he muttered to himself, and an Invisible Sword appeared in his hand.","As soon as the Invisible Sword appeared, the majestic and brilliant scarlet-gold divine pattern became the only bright light in the entire sky.","The overwhelming violent vortex finally dispersed, but Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan both became serious at this moment.","Because they saw a withered figure standing on the ruins of the original hall.","That withered figure was wearing an extremely oversized black robe that completely concealed their figure. The only thing exposed was a raised palm, holding up the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo.","Divine blood seeped out from the corner of his mouth. It was obvious that he had been severely injured earlier.","All of this happened too quickly. In less than ten breaths, it had become like this.","And to render a Grand Yan Immortal powerless in such a short time, what terrifying entity could this mysterious figure be?","The dark purple haze flowed slowly, and Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan had already brought their Yan power to its peak, ready to respond at any moment.","\"Ugh—\"","With his neck clamped by a hand, Xu Tuo emitted a painful groan. \"Who... who are you?\"","Due to the oversized black robe, it was impossible to discern any features or facial expression of this figure. The only thing that could be felt was an irresistible pressure.","\"Speak, who are you?\" Xu Tuo struggled to speak.","But what he got was another hand that pierced through his chest.","Divine blood splattered, and his Immortal body was directly torn apart!","Xu Tuo's eyes widened, and his Yan power began to rapidly dissipate from his body.","Then, as if discarding trash, the black robe was casually thrown aside.","The next moment, without waiting for any further action, a scarlet-gold divine pattern descended like a sudden burst of clouds, tearing a rift in the heavens and then heavily striking the black robe.","Whizzz—","The void was split open, an Invisible Sword spanning thousands of feet, cleaving through the heavens and earth, tearing the black robe into fragments without any hindrance.","\"Young Friend Jian, impressive!\" Nan Xuan loudly exclaimed, seeming quite relieved.","But before his words had even finished, Jian Wushuang's figure in the void was suddenly thrown backward, as if enduring an irresistible blow, retreating tens of thousands of feet!","Nan Xuan was greatly alarmed, instantly arriving in the void, reaching out to catch Jian Wushuang.","\"Hurry up and leave!\"","Jian Wushuang, his chest collapsed, shouted in astonishment, simultaneously forcefully pushing Nan Xuan away.","The heavens once again rippled, and the previously disappeared black robe unexpectedly reappeared.","He raised his palm, quietly pressing it against Jian Wushuang's chest.","Remble!","An unimaginable aura fluctuation shook the heavens and the earth, tearing open a rift in the sky that spanned billions of zhang in an instant.","Even Jian Wushuang, who possessed the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, could not withstand this strike at all. His immortal body instantly shattered.","Then, his shattered figure, like a kite with a broken string, floated down and fell into a giant cauldron filled with molten lava.","\"Wushuang!\"","Nan Xuan exclaimed in shock, unable to believe the scene that had just unfolded before his eyes.","In just a short hundred breaths of time, there had been one death and one injury!"]},{"number":5085,"title":"Chapter 5085 Black Robe! Black Robe!","paragraphs":["As a Divine Craftsman, Xu Tuo died on the spot!","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang, in the brief moment of their clash, was blasted into the molten lava of the enormous cauldron!","It was too terrifying, too gruesome.","Rumble...","The giant cauldron began to deform, its bottom suddenly shattered. The cataclysmic lava, akin to a rampaging dragon out of control, gushed out from the cauldron!","The heavens and the earth changed color, and even the Heavenly Dao of the Sancun Mountain shattered directly.","Clouds dissipated, and a dark purple haze churned frenziedly.","Everything was filled with an apocalyptic atmosphere.","The black-red doomsday lava instantly devoured nearly half of the Dao Arena and began to burn.","The entire sky turned chaotic and crimson.","Nan Xuan's anxiety reached its peak. If he did not rescue Jian Wushuang from the molten cauldron in time, the outcome would undoubtedly be dire.","This was a situation he absolutely did not want to witness.","Therefore, the moment Jian Wushuang fell into the giant cauldron, Nan Xuan rushed toward him.","But in the next moment, what awaited him was an impenetrable barrier.","The dark purple mist surged wildly and formed a thick barrier, blocking Nan Xuan's path.","\"Get out of my way!\" he snarled, directly unleashing the supreme Yan Power unique to the Grand Yan Immortals.","However, what happened next was beyond Nan Xuan's expectations.","The unparalleled Yan power, which could override the Heavenly Dao and modify them, rapidly dissipated upon touching the barrier.","At the same time, a massive black robe, like the embodiment of darkness itself, hovered in front of Nan Xuan beyond the barrier.","His eyes narrowed, and almost at an unimaginable speed, he drew the long sword hanging from his waist and thrust it toward the black-robed figure beyond the barrier!","The barrier shattered in response, but the long sword came to a halt in front of the black-robed figure, unable to advance any further.","Tip of the sword against fingertip!","The black-robed figure slowly extended a finger, pressing it against the tip of Nan Xuan's sword.","Nan Xuan was astonished, attempting to retract the sword, but he realized he could no longer control it.","\"Clang, clang, clang!\"","A crisp sound of metal shattering rang out. His personal long sword, a blade capable of challenging even Jian Wushuang, unexpectedly shattered in this moment!","Shattered inch by inch!","With a single finger, the black-robed figure shattered the long sword. Then, with undiminished force, a dark purple beam shot forth.","Nan Xuan could no longer dodge and could only watch as the dark purple beam of light pierced towards him.","His Immortal body, which was stronger than the Heavenly Dao, was easily shattered at this moment.","His entire right arm was instantly shattered, and even his entire right shoulder was penetrated by that terrifying force.","Divine blood scattered, and South Xuan had no strength left for another battle, plummeting into the molten lava below.","In the span of ten breaths, another Grand Yan Immortal met near-instantaneous obliteration, and the black-robed figure had used only a single finger from start to finish.","The dark purple mist obscured the sky, and the endless molten lava pouring from the giant cauldron had already devoured the entire Dao Arena, burning through the clouds.","Nan Xuan fell into the molten lava like a kite with a broken string.","The black-robed figure, however, seemed unwilling to let him go and began moving closer.","But at that moment, as the rolling molten lava surged, a crack suddenly appeared, and the previously deceased Divine Craftsman, Xu Tuo, miraculously came back to life!","Although he was short and stout, he moved with incredible agility and quickly rescued Nan Xuan.","Then, he swiftly shoved a pill into Nan Xuan's mouth. \"Kid, wake up for me!\"","Nan Xuan coughed up a mouthful of divine blood, his vitality greatly diminished, clearly heavily wounded.","\"I... am not dead yet?\"","\"Dying is simple, but staying alive is not so easy. Buck up!\" Xu Tuo growled in a low voice.","He then supported Nan Xuan and prepared to escape.","However, everything had already undergone a profound change, and even a Grand Yan Immortal had no power to reverse the situation!","The black-robed figure that had appeared from seemingly nowhere effortlessly struck down Xu Tuo with one palm, and with a single finger, defeated Nan Xuan. Its true power was far more terrifying than what had been revealed.","A cold sweat dripped from Xu Tuo's temple. Previously, he had managed to escape disaster by feigning death, but this did not prove that he could resist the black-robed figure. Instead, it made him realize that the black-robed figure was too terrifying and overwhelmingly powerful.","Strength this formidable made no sense; it was the embodiment of endless despair.","Next, as if to confirm Xu Tuo's thoughts, the sky suddenly collapsed and folded, an irresistible force like chains compressing from all directions.","Xu Tuo and Nan Xuan simultaneously groaned and then stiffened in place, unable to make any further moves.","The black-robed figure appeared before them once more, slowly raising its withered and massive hand toward the front.","A pure and dense dark purple aura gathered in its palm, filled with a destructive aura.","Xu Tuo's eyes widened; he could foresee that once this aura struck, even a Grand Yan Immortal would have no chance of survival.","But there was simply no escape.","The dark purple aura, brimming with the essence of destruction, roared forth, directly engulfing Xu Tuo.","In the next moment, an almost earth-shattering explosion resounded.","The giant cauldron shattered with a thunderous crash, and black-red magma scattered in all directions, scorching the heavens.","And amidst it all, a beam of light, like a shooting star, tore through the mist and shot towards the black-robed figure.","And among them, a beam of light that looked like a meteor suddenly tore through the mist and shot toward the black-robed figure.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Xu Tuo felt his eyes obscured by a crimson hue, and he and Nan Xuan were both forcefully pushed back by the tremendous force.","The collision of the dark purple aura and the crimson beam resulted in the most intense detonation.","Just this single explosion had brought the entire Dao Arena to the brink of destruction.","Six of the ten giant cauldrons in the Dao Arena shattered in a row.","The black-red molten lava inside the cauldrons was no longer restrained, falling to the earth like colossal dragons.","At that moment, countless divine herbs and Immortal trees, as well as the vitality of countless living beings, were devoured by the molten lava.","The earth turned into a purgatory, becoming a vessel for the accumulating lava, and mountains, rivers, and lakes all turned to ashes.","\"A great battle is happening!\"","The previously Guardian Immortals, witnessing this unimaginable scene, all rushed toward the direction of the Dao Arena without hesitation.","At the same time, disciples of the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo also sprang into action.","The destruction of the world continued.","Due to the sudden detonation, both Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo and Nan Xuan were able to catch their breath.","At the same time, Xu Tuo exclaimed in disbelief, \"It can't be, how could it be that kid?!\"","Nan Xuan, barely recovering his composure, saw the scene in the distance and couldn't help but smile bitterly.","In the far distance, facing the figure in the black robe was Jian Wushuang, dressed in the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens.","His Immortal body, previously heavily wounded, had fully recovered. His robe had been torn to shreds by the surging lava, revealing the deep blue Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens underneath.","Radiant divine patterns flowed all over his body, and the boundless power of the Great Dao once again radiated from him.","The Dao of Protection, the Wushuang Sword Dao, the Dao of Slaughter—these three Great Dao had merged within him, making Jian Wushuang reach an unprecedented level of terror.","Fierce winds raged, making the figure's black robe rustle.","And once again, he moved!"]},{"number":5086,"title":"Chapter 5086 Great Supreme","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang emerged from his black robe with a bony, skeletal hand, as if holding the very chains of fate itself, commencing a deadly strangulation.","The heavens above crumbled and folded in upon themselves, just as they had when dealing with Xu Tuo, exerting immense pressure.","The invisible and intangible power was like a shackle that instantly strangled Jian Wushuang.","\"Break!\" He shouted sternly.","The Selfless True Shadow merged with him directly. This towering Selfless True Shadow, exceeding tens of millions of feet in height, shattered the intangible binding force to pieces!","While breaking through the assault of the black-robed figure, Jian Wushuang moved.","With a divine technique that bent the earth and moved mountains, he silently appeared behind the black-robed figure.","Then, a sword, unseen but adorned with magnificent divine patterns, penetrated his chest without any hindrance.","The black robe shattered, and countless streams of crimson and golden light burst forth from his chest, illuminating the dark-purple sky.","\"Is this how he dies? Who is this kid, anyway?\" Xu Tuo lost his voice, his eyes filled with disbelief.","In his eyes, Jian Wushuang was nothing more than a Yan Immortal, yet he had just single-handedly obliterated the black-robed figure, which was utterly inconceivable.","But things were far from being so simple!","Just as Jian Wushuang completely shattered the black robe, a voluminous black robe silently appeared behind him.","Jian Wushuang had already sensed it, but he had no time to react and could only brace himself.","A bone-chilling coldness, as if carrying the solitude of eternity, unleashed itself freely.","His complexion changed drastically in an instant, and his entire Immortal body, along with the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, was covered and devoured by countless strands of cold radiance.","His divine soul seemed frozen and imprisoned.","Then, the black-robed figure's vast hand reached out once again, pressing against Jian Wushuang.","Ding-ding! Ding!","The sound of clashing golden iron reverberated through the air, and at that moment, the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens seemed unable to withstand it, as fine cracks began to appear.","This was the first time the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens had shown cracks.","With the appearance of these cracks, Jian Wushuang's Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body began to shatter.","He clenched his teeth, his eyes bloodshot, and the path of slaughter completely took over the Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body at that moment!","Guided by divine blood, the Immortal body burned, releasing the Dao of Slaughter completely.","The Selfless True Shadow's phantom once again enhanced, and a crimson blood radiance covered the sky.","The wildly raging blood aura even managed to counteract the extremely eerie coldness at that moment.","The blood radiance soared, forming a violent vortex.","Jian Wushuang forcibly reversed the dire situation, like a god of slaughter charging fiercely.","An unsurpassed strength that had long surpassed the realm of Yan immortals was fully displayed at that moment.","With a punch, the sky collapsed instantly, and the Heavenly Dao belonging to Sancun Mountain finally shattered.","The figure in the black robe retreated, dodging Jian Wushuang's killing move.","However, he had already descended into madness, determined to utterly destroy the black-robed figure, no matter the cost.","Immortal Style, Little Mountain River!","The towering mountain peak of the divine mountain descended from the sky and suppressed the black-robed figure.","Simultaneously, a river of pure Yan power materialized and swept towards its target.","Heavenly fire and thunder rained down in this moment of destruction.","It was a scene of calamity. The sky tore asunder, and the earth cracked into horrifying chasms. Chaos and uncontrollable violence became the predominant themes.","Jian Wushuang did not stop there. An Invisible Sword condensed from scarlet light landed in his hand.","Wushuang Sword Dao, Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, first move, second move.","Star, River!","The twin sword moves of Star and River struck out together, consumed by a bloodlust beyond control.","The heavens were torn apart, and the earth cracked open, forming terrifying rifts spanning millions of miles.","Chaos and unbridled violence became the dominant themes.","The Sword River, composed of innumerable crimson sword energies, cascaded from the sky like a blood-red waterfall, devouring everything in its path.","Simultaneously, thousands of blood-red columns of light erupted and then burst forth, shrouding everything in a crimson hue.","The black-robed figure was annihilated and disappeared within it. Standing in the far distance, the nearly crumbling Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo and the astonished Nan Xuan watched this scene in awe.","After a long while, Xu Tuo struggled to speak, \"Are you sure this Junior is really just a Yan Immortal?\"","Nan Xuan shook his head. His Immortal body had recovered within a short time, though it still bore hidden injuries, but it had regained about 60 or 70 percent of its strength.","\"I don't know if he's a Yan Immortal or not, but I do know that if we don't take this opportunity to eliminate that terrifying fellow, none of us will survive,\" Nan Xuan declared.","Xu Tuo reluctantly nodded, his expression grave. \"My Sancun Mountain has been reduced to this... It's truly lamentable.\"","Boom...","A thunderous explosion continued, and more than half of the vast Sancun Mountain Heavenly Region had been destroyed.","Without the support of Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo, it would have likely crumbled into dust long ago.","At present, the Sancun Mountain domain barely held together.","The destructive power of the Wushuang Sword Dao, enhanced by the Dao of Slaughter, had reached an unprecedented level.","Even a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal would undoubtedly be severely injured within this Sword Principle.","Releasing all the power of these two Sword Intents, Jian Wushuang hovered in the void, his chest heaving violently. He did not relax his vigilance because he could sense that the oppressive presence had only disappeared for a moment under the onslaught of the Wushuang Sword Dao.","As the Sword Intent finally dissipated, beneath the exposed void of the sky, the nightmare-like black robe reappeared!","At this moment, even Jian Wushuang, whose consciousness had been invaded by the Dao of Slaughter, revealed a hint of bitterness in his eyes.","Could it be that, under such a frenzied assault, he couldn't even harm this intruder?!","Where did this black-robed figure come from, and what terrifying level had they reached?","A single palm extinguished the Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal Xu Tuo, a single finger left Nan Xuan with no resistance, and a single effortless confrontation with Jian Wushuang.","Such ease could perhaps only be achieved by a Peak Grand Yan Immortal?!","Jian Wushuang was shocked. It seemed that only a peak Grand Yan Immortal could explain how terrifying the black-robed figure was.","Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo and Nan Xuan had already arrived by his side to fight against the figure together.","\"Could he really be a Peak Grand Yan Immortal? But how could there be such an eccentric Peak Grand Yan Immortal hidden in the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor?!\" Jian Wushuang pondered silently.","If this black-robed figure truly was a Peak Grand Yan Immortal, then even if they all perished today, it seemed unlikely they could inflict any harm upon him.","The black-robed figure was a supreme existence, totally Insurmountable!","With this realization, Jian Wushuang turned to Xu Tuo. \"Senior, this matter has nothing to do with you. Please leave now, and I will stay behind to resist.\"","Upon hearing this, Xu Tuo snorted disdainfully. \"Junior, you underestimate this old man too much. Today, I will not retreat a single step. You should consider when it's appropriate for you to scram.\"","\"I'm not leaving either. If we don't settle this score today, I won't have a peaceful day and night!\" Nan Xuan declared coldly, his gaze locked onto the black-robed figure.","Jian Wushuang's eyes turned bitter upon hearing their responses. The black-robed figure's strength had long surpassed the range they could handle.","If they stubbornly stayed, none of them had any chance of surviving!","This was the overwhelming pressure imposed by the black-robed figure!"]},{"number":5087,"title":"Chapter 5087 Chaos","paragraphs":["In the midst of Jian Wushuang's contemplation on how to persuade them to leave, the figure in the black robe moved once again.","He appeared like an emotionless vessel, determined to erase all opposition!","A massive palm extended from beneath the black robe, and with just a distant grasp, it possessed the Power of Restriction, strong enough to shatter billions of stars. It descending upon them directly.","The boundless Power of Restriction shattered all heavenly laws, cultivations, and suppressed figures like Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, they attacked at the same time.","A crimson golden radiance burst forth from behind Nan Xuan, resembling a blazing sun, fiercely opposing the threat.","A dark-red Yan power light wheel quietly circulated around the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo. This light wheel represented the symbol of the supreme Dao unique to the Six Revolutions Yan Immortal.","The towering figure of the Selfless True Shadow, stretching over countless miles, manifested around Jian Wushuang. It glared at the black-robed figure with its True Eyes, radiating boundless Yan power.","Three distinctly different yet overwhelmingly formidable forces of the Great Dao, capable of annihilating any Heavenly Region Plane, soared into the heavens!","There were no detonating sound waves that obliterated billions of stars, no words to describe the devastation that unfolded.","Only silence, emptiness!","With the point of impact as the epicenter, the entire Sancun Mountain Heavenly Region's sky, along with endless voids, turned into a realm of silent emptiness!","Blankness, blankness, nothing but blankness!","The weakest among them, Nan Xuan, coughed up divine blood directly, and his two arms shattered inch by inch!","The Power of Restriction unleashed by the black-robed figure was simply too terrifying, turning almost everything in its path into eternal silence and emptiness.","Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo was also on the verge of collapse, and the Yan power light wheel circulating around him showed signs of extinguishing.","Thanks to the support of the Selfless True Shadow, Jian Wushuang's condition remained relatively stable.","He quickly knocked three Emperor-grade pills out of his Boyang Bottle and forcefully stuffed them into the mouths of Xu Tuo and Nan Xuan.","Xu Tuo had initially hesitated, but upon instantly recovering to his peak state, his eyes nearly popped out of their sockets.","Nan Xuan's injuries were also completely healed in a matter of moments.","Jian Wushuang and the rest, who had been pushed to their limits by the Power of Restriction, began to resist once more.","\"Master!\"","At this moment, abrupt calls rang out, and then, on the last remaining ground of the Sancun Mountain, figures ascended into the air, approaching the void.","Xu Tuo's figure trembled, and then he saw dozens of disciples rushing towards him, yelling in despair, \"Get away, all of you! Don't come any closer!!\"","But it was already too late. The black-robed figure slightly tilted his head and then raised his palm, unleashing a violent, dark-purple radiance!","Once struck, all the disciples would undoubtedly meet their end!","Xu Tuo had already despaired; even if he were to take action, it was simply too late.","But in the next moment, Jian Wushuang quietly disappeared.","By the time he reappeared, it was in front of nearly 50 disciples.","\"You all must retreat quickly; this is not a place for you.\"","After uttering this last sentence, the ferocious dark purple aura erupted completely!","Jian Wushuang opened his arms and forcibly withstood all the eruptions on his back.","This special power that even Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo, who was a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, could not resist, was released on his back.","In an instant, divine blood gushed out of his mouth and nose, and his Immortal body began to tear apart on a large scale.","\"Hurry up and leave!\"","At this moment, the few Guardian Immortals from before appeared. They hurriedly used their Yan power to pull all the disciples down to the continent.","But Jian Wushuang could no longer hold on, and at his back, the Nine Heavens Robe quietly shattered.","Endless dark purple aura pierced through his back, erupting completely within his Immortal body.","\"Young Friend!\"","Seeing this scene completely, Xu Tuo and Nan Xuan simultaneously shouted in astonishment. In their frantic state, both of them coughed up a mouthful of divine blood.","Like a rain of blood, colorful divine blood showered the empty space.","A shattered figure silently fell from the void.","Xu Tuo and Nan Xuan also could no longer hold on, and the imprisoning power that covered the sky shattered, descending upon them.","Nan Xuan fell unconscious, like a lone goose descending to the earth.","Xu Tuo, too, finally fell heavily, throwing himself towards the land already covered in black and red lava.","The lava roared and rolled, turning the land into a purgatory.","Several Guardian Immortals and a group of terrified disciples now stood at the summit of the highest divine mountain, unsure of what to do.","On the back of a giant white crane, Jian Wushuang, his figure mangled and almost unrecognizable, breathed faintly.","Xu Tuo and Nan Xuan were also leaning against the white crane, their fates uncertain.","Xu Tuo and Nan Xuan also leaned against the side of the white crane, their fates uncertain.","The sky had completely shattered, and the boundless void had become eternal emptiness, with only a single continent of Sancun Mountain still remaining.","This was a dire situation, an extreme point of despair, where everything teetered on the brink of destruction.","Snap—","A figure clad in a wide black robe landed, and with every breath, the aura emanating from him turned any approaching lava into nothingness.","After such a bloody battle, he had not suffered any injuries.","Standing atop the divine mountain, the black-robed figure walked slowly.","The white crane let out a clear cry, as if sensing a terrifying presence that filled it with fear.","All the disciples took slow steps backward, their eyes filled with nothing but terror.","The terrifying battle from before was still vivid in their memories, and now, even their masters had been defeated. How could they possibly resist?","Facing this unstoppable adversary, a total of five guardian immortals stepped forward at this moment, resolutely blocking all the disciples.","Without saying a word, the round-faced Yan Immortal from earlier charged towards the black-robed figure.","However, he did not even have time to release his Yan power before he was torn into pieces by a strand of dark purple aura.","Then the second and third Guardian Immortals also charged at the black-robed figure without any hesitation.","However, their fates were equally tragic.","The black-robed figure could casually kill a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, how could they contend against him?","In the end, all the disciples had nowhere to retreat.","The black-robed figure slowly raised his palm, and in his withered yet broad hand, the aura of destruction once again condensed.","However, in the next moment, an unrestrained and nearly hysterical roar echoed from the void.","\"Jian Wushuang, you have repeatedly destroyed my Great Mi Heaven. Today, I will make sure you beg for death!\"","The booming voice reverberated through the endless void.","The previously eternal void, now on the verge of destruction, was suddenly filled with nearly 100 figures!","Each figure was mysterious and immensely powerful, their Yan power flowing steadily.","And at the forefront of nearly 100 figures stood a young man clad in dark golden armor, exuding a proud and decisive aura.","He was Emperor Zhen Wuyang's second son, the Master of the entire Great Mi Heaven, Prince Jiu.","Standing beside him was an old man dressed in simple mountain and water robe, with an indescribable sense of grandeur flowing around him.","This old man was a powerhouse who had walked out of the Ancient Era to the present day.","A Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, Changfu."]},{"number":5088,"title":"Chapter 5088 The Supreme Battle (1)","paragraphs":["Under the nearly irresistible suppression of the black robe, with the Sancun Mountain Heavenly Region at its center, almost countless trillions of miles of void directly turned into eternal nothingness.","A few million trillion miles was just an approximate estimate; the real situation was far more astonishing.","Nearly ten thousand Heavenly Regions shattered into pieces in this bloody battle, and endless beings quietly disappeared.","You should know that even though the southwest direction is the most desolate area in the Great Mi Heavenly Region, it still harbors endless treasures and beings.","But now, everything has turned into chaotic nothingness.","Eternal, silent nothingness—its meaning is that it has permanently become nothingness. The Heavenly Dao will never give birth again, and rules will no longer emerge.","Only an enduring void remains.","This kind of eternal, silent nothingness, even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal could not cause such destruction.","But it happened now.","This almost made the Master of the Great Mi Heavenly Region, Prince Jiu, spew out blood.","Only a few tens of thousands of years had passed since the last time the Great Mi Heavenly was severely damaged. Now, this second major blow had almost turned the southwest direction of the Great Mi Heavenly Region into a complete ruin.","How could this not make him furious?","Furthermore, he sensed the most familiar aura in this destruction.","That familiar aura belonged to Jian Wushuang.","So, Prince Jiu was completely enraged and led all his forces to come for vengeance.","...","Facing the only surviving continent, Prince Jiu was absolutely certain that this was the work of Jian Wushuang.","\"Jian Wushuang, today I will make sure you suffer and beg for death!\"","The raging surge of Yan power filled the entire silent void once more, throwing everything into chaos again.","And the black-robed figure, which had originally planned to erase all the disciples, withdrew its hand upon sensing the arrival of a powerful presence and slowly turned around.","In the next moment, a long sword, like flowing light, pierced down with earth-shattering force!","As the black-robed figure turned around, the long sword had already pierced directly through his chest.","Clang!","The long sword trembled and burst forth with immeasurable momentum.","\"Hmph, stop pretending, and die, Jian Wushuang!\" Prince Jiu sneered coldly. He believed that this one strike would leave no possibility of survival for Jian Wushuang!","Because this sword was a gift from Zhen Wuyang, and it would grow with its owner, making it extremely special.","The long sword pierced into the black-robed figure's chest, and thousands of dark golden lights bloomed from his back. Even a Grand Yan Immortal would be severely injured.","But in the following moments, the actions of the figure in the black robe caused a drastic change in Prince Jiu's complexion.","He extended his large palm and pulled out the long sword from his chest, examining it for a moment.","Seemingly contemplating something, he suddenly shook his arm holding the sword!","The sword, a gift from Zhen Wuyang, shattered in response!","The longsword wailed and shattered into nearly a hundred fragments, scattering into the void.","The fragments, like giant stars, carried unimaginable force as they shot toward Prince Jiu and others!","Prince Jiu's expression changed drastically, and he subconsciously took half a step back.","Changfu took a thousand steps forward. Facing this situation, he waved his hand and cast a barrier.","Ding! Ding ding!!!","The fragments struck the barrier and instantly covered it in cracks, despite being a barrier crafted by a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal. It seemed unable to resist.","Changfu's expression changed slightly, and his eyes revealed a look of disbelief.","\"He's not Jian Wushuang.\"","Prince Jiu recovered from his shock. He opened his mouth but did not say anything. Apparently, he realized that the black-robed figure wasn't Jian Wushuang.","In his knowledge, no matter how powerful Jian Wushuang was, it was impossible for him to cause such a degree of destruction.","Frowning, he asked, \"Then who is he?\"","Changfu shook his head, looking at the almost crumbling barrier in front of him and said slowly, \"The one responsible for this destruction is not Jian Wushuang; it's him.\"","\"Him? Can he be that terrifying?\" Prince Jiu's gaze turned serious. Whoever could inflict such damage on the entire southwestern region of the Great Mi Heaven was beyond imagination, and perhaps even Changfu could not achieve this level of destruction.","213 fragments of longswords were pinned to the barrier, and then the barrier shattered with a deafening crash.","This was their first clash.","Changfu knew that he was already at a disadvantage.","Looking at each other from afar, he frowned.","The figure in the black robe moved towards the void at this moment.","With his departure, the last remaining land in the Sancun Mountain Heavenly Region split in two instantly.","Facing the extremely eerie figure in the black robe, Chang Fu immediately rushed forward.","Gongzi Jiu then commanded nearly 100 black-robed figures behind him.","Although these black-robed figures were all Grand Yan Immortals, they had mastered their own Immortal Styles, making them Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals.","These were Prince Jiu's last reserves.","Under Prince Jiu's command, nearly 30 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals surrounded the black-robed figure, swiftly closing in on him.","Changfu's heart sank as he said, \"Everyone, retreat! Do not advance any further!\"","But it was too late; nearly thirty quasi-Grand Yan Immortals had already released their own Immortal Styles, attacking the black-robed figure!","At this moment, the eternal void trembled slightly.","Immortal Styles that could obscure the heavens descended like 30 supreme chains, completely binding the black-robed figure.","Seeing this scene, Prince Jiu breathed a sigh of relief and said, \"Elder Changfu, please make a move!\"","Changfu nodded without hesitation.","He was like a divine mountain that had existed since the Ancient Era and exuded an awe-inspiring momentum.","With a wave of his hand, an aura beyond the heavenly realm descended, like tens of thousands of divine mountains coming down.","Boom, boom, boom!","At this moment, even the void of eternal annihilation trembled, and tens of thousands of immortal mountains seemed to suppress everything. All the Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals present were chilled to the bone.","Another explosion occurred as the black-robed figure, bound by the Immortal Styles, was annihilated once again.","The shockwave capable of easily shattering the Heavenly Region dissipated instantly and lingered for a long time.","\"Is it over?\" Prince Jiu's eyes sparkled with excitement.","But Changfu slightly shook his head, \"I'm afraid it's not that simple.\"","Seemingly to confirm his thoughts, in the center of the boundless annihilation explosion, the figure in the black robe appeared once again.","His body was intact, not a single tear in his oversized black robe!","This scene left all the Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals stunned!","He had resisted Changfu's attack head-on and had not suffered the slightest damage. Who exactly was this terrifying individual?","As all the Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals were still in shock, the black-robed figure moved.","He did not break free from the Immortal Style chains surrounding him; instead, he subtly vibrated his body.","A total of 30 thick, dark purple beams shot out from his black robe, carrying an eerie glow, and latched onto the chains of the Immortal Styles."]},{"number":5089,"title":"Chapter 5089 The Supreme Battle (2)","paragraphs":["In this situation, it happened in an instant, so fast that all the Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals couldn't react before they were entangled by the extremely strange dark purple beams of light.","\"Ah!\"","30 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals simultaneously cried out in agony. The unimaginable Power of Restriction not only imprisoned their Divine Souls but also voraciously consumed their Yan power.","In less than ten breaths' time, all 30 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals directly turned into dry bones!","Because everything happened so quickly, it wasn't until they all turned into bones that Prince Jiu finally reacted and exclaimed, \"How is this possible?\"","30 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals turning into bones in just ten breaths' time was something Prince Jiu couldn't accept.","Changfu's expression also grew solemn. Those who could instantly absorb the Yan power and fate energy of Grand Yan Immortals were all great evildoers and supremely powerful beings.","The black-robed figure before them was undoubtedly one of these supremely powerful beings.","After absorbing the Yan power and fate energy of the 30 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals in an instant, the black-robed figure leaped into the void!","His target was Changfu!","Confronted by the overwhelming purple radiance, Changfu took a step forward and then raised his palm.","Instantly, boundless fate energy converged into a beam and shot towards the black-robed figure.","Fwooom!","The beam of fate energy, which had condensed, penetrated the black-robed figure's chest without any hindrance.","However, this only caused his figure to pause for a moment before he continued charging towards Changfu without losing momentum.","Changfu resolutely met the attack. With a wave of his hand, a supreme mountain of fate energy condensed and smashed towards the black-robed figure.","Eternal silence and void began to tremble.","Faced with this towering mountain of fate energy, the black-robed figure clenched his right palm into a fist and struck it heavily.","The mountain instantly shattered, and a massive dark purple fist energy continued to blast towards Changfu.","His expression tightened, and he chose to directly resist this punch.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The fist energy erupted, and ink-black mountain and water patterns rippled around Changfu's body, canceling out the terrifying punch.","Even Prince Jiu, who was protected behind Changfu, could feel the formidable power of this punch, causing his expression to change.","Changfu took half a step back before completely nullifying the punch.","The black-robed figure had already arrived in front of him, emitting bone-chilling coldness.","He raised his right palm high, silently gathering a dark purple radiance, and then struck towards Changfu.","This dark purple radiance was extremely pure and terrifying. It could annihilate Yan power, and a single punch had killed the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo.","Faced with a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, the black-robed figure unleashed this technique once again.","This was a battle of peak power, an ultimate battle.","As a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal who had emerged from the Ancient Era, he was already proud and standing at the pinnacle among cultivators.","Their every move had the potential to shatter the Dao and overthrow the heavens.","And once they engaged in such a battle, it would be an unimaginable catastrophe. Even the most outstanding geniuses would be unable to participate in this level of combat.","In that moment, the eternal void of silence and annihilation trembled once again.","This unparalleled battle sent shivers down the spines of all Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals present. They felt that even staying here was a disaster in itself.","The intensity of this battle far surpassed the previous clash with Di Qing.","Confronted with the dark purple brilliance capable of devouring fate energy and Yan power, Changfu exerted all his might.","Immortal mountains were hurled towards the figure in black robes, bringing with them the order of the Heavenly Dao.","The full force of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal's strike caused even the eternal void of silence and annihilation to tremble incessantly.","When the two collided, their shockwaves could instantly annihilate any Heavenly Region Plane.","Caught off guard, Prince Jiu and over 60 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals were sent flying billions of feet away.","At this moment, the Sancun Mountain Heavenly Region, which had been split into two and resembled a lone boat, seemed as though it could crumble at any moment under this impact.","The shockwave that could even destroy the order of the Heavenly Dao swept over layer by layer, making the remaining disciples of Sancun Mountain extremely frightened.","There were only two Guardian Immortals left after the black-robed figure killed them.","Facing these shockwaves, they were utterly defenseless and could only endure, knowing they could be annihilated at any moment.","At this moment, the figure lying on the broad and warm back of a white crane suddenly moved his fingers.","The white crane sensed it, turned its head, and let out a clear cry.","\"He's awake! He's awake! This lord has awakened!\" the youngest and most innocent disciple exclaimed with excitement.","All the disciples hurriedly gathered around the white crane, anxiously waiting.","\"I can't believe it. With such severe injuries, even a Grand Yan Immortal is unlikely to wake up,\" said a thin man with concern.","The other disciples fell silent.","Indeed, the three figures lying on the back of the white crane had all suffered varying degrees of injuries, but Jian Wushuang, who had single-handedly blocked the full force attack of the figure in black robes, had the most terrifying injuries of all.","His entire chest was pierced through, his limbs were shattered, and his divine blood had completely stained his Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens a deep red.","With such an injury, it was almost impossible for even an Immortal Source to remain, so how could he possibly come back to life?","At this moment, the young man who had initially fought with Jian Wushuang slowly got up and approached him. He placed his palm on Jian Wushuang's shattered chest.","A pale blue Yan power flowed like gentle clouds into the wounds.","The other disciples exchanged glances and all contributed their own meager strength.","They all felt a sense of gratitude towards Jian Wushuang. Without him, nearly 50 disciples would not have survived.","Drop by drop, strand by strand, the Yan power flowed into Jian Wushuang's Immortal body, slowly but steadily repairing it.","The young man said firmly, \"We don't know when he will wake up, but he must wake up!\"","As time passed, on the back of the white crane, Jian Wushuang quietly opened his eyes.","...","Boom!!!","The eternal void of silence and annihilation trembled, and the order of the heavenly path continued to crumble.","The scope of this unparalleled battle had reached unimaginable proportions.","Beyond the previous levels of destruction, the vast Great Mi Heaven itself was in a state of constant turmoil.","As the order of the Heavenly Dao collapsed, countless Heavenly Regions were affected and turned to dust.","And all of this was a result of this unparalleled battle.","The divine blood that carried the shackles of fate energy floated in the eternal void of silence and annihilation, unchanging for eternity.","And this divine blood was actually spilled by Changfu!","The Heavenly Dao seemed to be wailing in sorrow, and the ink-blue mountains and rivers of the common garb were soaked in divine blood.","His Immortal body was on the verge of exhaustion.","Facing the black-robed figure, Chang Fu revealed a sorrowful expression.","Every single full-powered attack was unable to cause any serious damage to the black-robed figure. On the contrary, the figure could easily cause irreparable damage to him.","Such a deep sense of powerlessness made him feel as if he had fallen into a bottomless abyss.","Facing Black Robe, Changfu made his final decision.","He turned around and looked at Prince Jiu, who was billions of miles away. Prince Jiu's face was now pale and unbelieving."]},{"number":5090,"title":"Chapter 5090 Resurrection After Annihilation","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang, once steady and confident from the beginning, had transformed into an indescribable sense of desolation. He felt a surreal sensation about everything that had transpired.","But everything had become unalterable.","Changfu, who had already aged considerably, seemed like an unparalleled mountain in this moment, bearing an unimaginable momentum as he faced the figure in a black robe.","He had become like the very essence of Changfu Mountain, suppressing all oncoming adversaries.","Centered around Changfu, a deep and resounding sound of annihilation rang out.","He restrained the figure in the black robe with his hand, his eyes now burning with fierce determination.","\"You are not a Yan Immortal, nor do you belong here.\"","Leaving behind these last words, Changfu ignited completely, and the foundation of the Yan Immortal, belonging to the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, was utterly annihilated.","The black-robed figure struggled to break free but was utterly powerless.","This was the final thought of the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, capable of causing the demise of even those of the same level.","The detonation of the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal's Immortal Source was terrifying beyond words. Even the residual shockwaves were enough to easily obliterate Grand Yan Immortals, let alone the entire Heavenly Region Plane.","Yet, all the Heavenly Region Planes in the southwest direction of the vast and boundless Great Mi Heaven had already been annihilated, leaving only an eternal emptiness.","Even so, the entire Great Mi Heaven, in its vastness, fell into chaos.","The unimaginable detonation devoured everything in its path.","Countless miles away from the battlefield, Prince Jiu felt an irresistible pressure surging toward him.","His throat tightened, and he was thrown backward once again.","However, miraculously, even on the edge of this destruction, the Sancun Mountain, with only a small portion of its surface remaining, survived unscathed, without any damage.","The complete detonation of the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal continued for an exceedingly long time.","Eternal silence and nothingness became the predominant theme.","\"Cough, cough... Is it all over?\"","His dark golden armor shattered, and Prince Jiu, in a rather dire state, stood up from the brink of destruction, bitterness in his eyes.","Of the more than 60 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals who had followed him, only over 50 remained. Nearly 20 of them had been reduced to ashes in the detonation.","\"Your Highness, let us retreat and seek assistance from the Emperor in the Heavenly Court,\" a Quasi-Grand Yan Immortal advised in a hushed tone.","\"I want to see who dares to retreat!\" Prince Jiu coldly shouted, his expression dark. \"Until this matter is thoroughly investigated, no one can leave!\"","\"Yes,\" all the Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals nodded in agreement, not daring to speak further.","Then, Prince Jiu and his group of Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals rushed toward the center of the detonation.","In the very heart of the detonation, everything seemed to have entered a state of chaos.","Hovering drops of divine blood and tattered clothing fragments all indicated that a fierce and brutal battle had once erupted here.","\"Are they all gone?\"","As he gazed at the scene before him, Prince Jiu was lost in thought. \"Changfu... Is he it really gone?\"","Changfu had disappeared without a trace, and the black robe had also vanished completely.","This unparalleled battle seemed to have come to an end.","But at this moment, the keen-eyed Quasi-Grand Yan Immortal behind Prince Jiu noticed something unusual. Wisps of mist-like threads were slowly moving and converging.","\"Your Highness, it seems like something's amiss,\" said the same Quasi-Grand Yan Immortal as before. He felt a palpable sense of unease resurging.","It was still the Quasi-Grand Yan Immortal from before. He felt a palpitating power recovering.","Prince Jiu furrowed his brow tightly and was about to speak when he noticed that at the very center of the explosion, layers of black radiance were gathering!","The black radiance gathered, and a terrifying imprisoning force was once again descending!","Prince Jiu's eyes widened to the maximum; it was an extremely frightening aura!","The black robe! Black robe!","The black robe that had perished alongside Changfu, who sacrificed his Immortal Source, had unexpectedly resurrected.","He was like an undying nightmare, reappearing once more.","Dark purple radiance surged around him, reaching an eerie extreme.","\"Retreat!\"","Without any hesitation, Prince Jiu frantically retreated. \"Retreat quickly!\"","But it was already too late. The revived Yan Immortal, with a single palm, obliterated 20 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortal!","Everything happened too quickly, leaving no time for any reaction.","Nearly 1,000 slender, dark purple beams of light extended from beneath the black robe, forming an all-encompassing net that covered the heavens and the earth.","Then, more than 30 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals were unable to escape in time, imprisoned and bound, and their Yan power was drained to the last drop!","Prince Jiu was horrified, his spirit on the verge of shattering, and he desperately tried to escape.","As a result, out of the over 60 Quasi-Grand Yan Immortals who had followed him, only 13 remained!","And this number was still decreasing.","Because the dark purple light was devouring the fate energy too quickly, it was devouring all the Yan Immortals.","11.","10.","7...","3!","Prince Jiu frantically tried to escape but despairingly realized the dense web closing in on him.","Once entangled and devoured, there would be no turning back!","\"Damn it, what is this thing?\" He gritted his teeth, but there was nothing he could do.","As the last Quasi-Grand Yan Immortal was devoured, Prince Jiu found himself in dire straits.","The web, composed of dark purple thread-like beams, covered the sky, entrapping him completely.","Though he was a Quasi-Grand Yan Immortal, Prince Jiu knew all too well that there was no way out.","However, in this life-or-death moment, a familiar Yan power aura suddenly appeared.","Prince Jiu felt a tug at his waist, and then, at an unimaginable speed, he escaped the encircling web.","\"Jian, Jian Wushuang?!\"","In his shock and relief, he shouted without thinking.","Jian Wushuang glanced back at Prince Jiu, then carried him toward the remaining Sancun Mountain Heavenly Region.","With a 'thud', Jian Wushuang placed him directly on the summit of the divine mountain.","This dwindling Heavenly Region Plane was on the verge of collapse, and the remaining disciples were filled with despair.","The Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo and Nan Xuan had already awakened, recovering 70 to 80 percent thanks to the Emperor-grade pill. However, they were still no match for Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang had returned to his peak state. If it weren't for some minor damage to his Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, no one would have guessed that he had experienced a life-or-death crisis before.","\"That guy is coming this way,\" the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo rasped.","Nan Xuan held his chest and frowned, saying, \"He just won't give up.\"","Jian Wushuang glanced at the approaching figure in a black robe and then said calmly, \"Senior, take them and leave. I'll handle this. I will buy you enough time.\"","Xu Tuo was momentarily stunned and then shook his head. \"How can I retreat?\"","\"If we don't retreat, we'll all die in vain. I hope you understand that everything started because of me, and I should bear the consequences.\"","Leaving behind these final words, Jian Wushuang did not hesitate for a moment. He leaped forward to confront the black-robed figure.","\"Um, the young man is right. Staying here means dying in vain. Let's go,\" Nan Xuan urged, then slowly got up.","\"I'll go with the young man to buy you some time. You should leave as soon as possible,\" Xu Tuo said with a heavy heart, watching Jian Wushuang's retreating figure before finally sighing in silence."]},{"number":5091,"title":"Chapter 5091 Strike While the Opponent Was Vulnerable","paragraphs":["In the face of the overwhelming dark purple brilliance that blotted out the sky, Nan Xuan leaped into action, soaring towards Jian Wushuang.","His Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens, though already somewhat tattered, still emitted a brilliant azure light, untarnished and immaculate.","At the back of his robe, a fist-sized crack had formed, perfectly matching the sword scar on his chest.","\"Little Friend, let me help you.\" Nan Xuan leaped over with a smile on his face.","Jian Wushuang was taken aback; he hadn't expected Nan Xuan to arrive. \"Why have you come? Didn't I ask you all to leave quickly?\"","Nan Xuan smiled, \"Leaving would be too boring. I also want to see what kind of entity this fellow truly is!\"","Jian Wushuang knew Nan Xuan's unyielding character; he couldn't be dissuaded. He could only remain silent.","After enduring a brutal battle of unparalleled proportions, the entire southwestern region of the Great Mi Heaven had been completely annihilated.","As far as the eye could see, everything had turned into eternal nothingness.","The aura emanating from the shattered foundation of Changfu's Immortal Source had not yet dissipated, but the black-robed figure had already revived.","He was a true nightmare, remaining unscathed through his appearance, the battles with the Yan Immortals, and even the life-and-death struggle with the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals. It exceeded all imagination.","Perhaps, this black-robed figure was an Emperor-to-be?!","This thought was quickly dismissed by Jian Wushuang. In the Boundless Sea, he had encountered two Emperors-to-be.","One was Emperor-to-be Hei Yun who had devoured the Grand Yan Immortal's fate energy.","The other was Yu Yao, who sacrificed thousands of Grand Yan Immortals to ultimately become an Emperor-to-be.","They were terrifying beings who could not be underestimated, capable of overwhelming everything with a wave of their hands. In a certain sense, Emperor-to-be were on par with Emperors.","Jian Wushuang had experienced the terror of the Emperor-to-be in the Endless Sea, where their overwhelming aura was beyond imagination.","Although the current black-robed figure was nearly Immortal, impervious even to the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, Jian Wushuang could still sense a gap between him and an Emperor-to-be.","This gap was crystal clear.","For a moment, he thought of the Peak Grand Yan Immortals.","Surpassing the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, they represented the ultimate realm of the Grand Yan Immortal realm.","Only Peak Grand Yan Immortals could explain why Changfu had sacrificed himself and still could not harm the black-robed figure.","However, even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal was far from an opponent Jian Wushuang could contend with, let alone a Peak Grand Yan Immortal.","So, at this moment, he stood here, essentially offering himself up for death.","Even if he had Three Daos and his Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body, which had become more refined, he couldn't withstand a Peak Grand Yan Immortal.","As a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, Nan Xuan was also offering himself up for death, incapable of inflicting any significant damage on the black-robed figure.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang was puzzled. Why did the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor contain such a terrifying entity within it?","Could it be that the black-robed figure was guarding or imprisoning the hidden content within?","This puzzled him and made the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor even more enigmatic.","Facing these two figures, the black-robed figure slowed down, and the face beneath the large hood seemed to be contemplating something.","Jian Wushuang quickly took out two Emperor-grade pills and handed them to Nan Xuan. Jian Wushuang also immediately consumed several Emperor-grade pills.","This was to unleash the most terrifying power within a short period.","He did not hope to defeat the figure in black robes; he only wanted to buy time for the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo and his disciples to escape.","\"Damn old man, I'll settle the score for the previous sword today!\"","Nan Xuan said with a deep voice, and behind him, another giant sun that covered the heavens and the earth was formed!","The golden radiance was dazzling and unbearable to look at.","The aura of a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal surged at this moment.","Nan Xuan held a sword hilt that had just taken shape, which he had casually pulled out from Sword Mountain earlier.","Endless crimson-golden brilliance shone behind him, the giant sun radiant, containing nine crimson-golden rays, like a genuine golden wheel, flowing slowly behind him.","This was Nan Xuan's most powerful strike, filled with an unstoppable determination.","At this moment, the golden wheel sun burst with a dazzling golden radiance, illuminating the boundless void.","A total of nine crimson-golden rays, using the sword hilt as a medium, erupted violently, transforming into nine hundred thousand-foot True Sword Shadows, slashing towards the black-robed figure!","Jian Wushuang also made his move, wielding the Invisible Sword with brilliant divine patterns, easily severing the newly formed heavenly order and pressing down.","The black-robed figure stood still in place and did not attempt to dodge as before, instead choosing to face it head-on.","Endless annihilation and void tremors, the violent sound waves shattered once again.","Because the power was too swift and fierce, the sword hilt in Nan Xuan's hand couldn't withstand it and shattered into nothingness.","But his ultimate strike still landed on the black-robed figure's body.","Boom!","A wave of golden radiance erupted, and at that moment, it actually cleanly severed his left shoulder!","Following closely, Jian Wushuang also almost effortlessly severed the figure's right arm.","Dark purple misty threads spewed from the black robe.","This scene shocked Nan Xuan; he never thought he could sever one of the black robe's arms!","You should know that the black-robed figure was a terrifying existence that could erase a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal with a wave of his hand.","Jian Wushuang was also stunned; he could feel that he had indeed severed both arms.","The originally nearly indestructible figure, at this moment, had its arms cut off and did not immediately regenerate but released dark purple misty threads.","Jian Wushuang quickly realized the situation, gave Nan Xuan a quick glance, and then released his Sword Dao.","Wushaung Sword Dao, the Star River Lake Sea Sword Intent, second move.","River.","Jian Wushuang thrust the Invisible Sword stabbed into the figure's chest with all his might. The majestic celestial river, with Jian Wushuang as the origin and the Invisible Sword as the medium, swept toward the figure.","This strike was delivered with full force, with every ounce of his strength poured into it.","At the same time, Nan Xuan unleashed his supreme Yan power, slamming it into the face of the cloaked figure.","Both of them understood the principle of seizing the opportunity to strike while the opponent was vulnerable, so they exerted every ounce of their strength.","Boom!","In an immeasurable explosion, the already fragmented body of the black-robed figure was completely reduced to powder, shattering the void itself!","An unparalleled detonation spread across trillions of miles, causing the Sancun Mountain Heaven continent, which were already as fragile as a leaf in a boat, to teeter on the brink of collapse at any moment.","Standing at the edge of the shattered continent, Prince Jiu slowly lowered his arm that had been raised in front of him. His face was pale, and his eyes were filled with disbelief.","Because he saw that figure, that mere Yan Immortal, accomplish something that was fundamentally impossible.","An existence that couldn't be destroyed even by Changfu was now reduced to dust by Jian Wushuang's blade.","Indescribable emotions swirled in his eyes."]},{"number":5092,"title":"Chapter 5092 Sword Spirit","paragraphs":["Yan Immortal... Is this guy really just a Yan Immortal?","\"Jian Wushuang, what kind of being are you?\" Prince Jiu's eyes were filled with bitterness.","From the beginning, it seemed like he had never regarded Jian Wushuang as anything special.","It was only during the Heavenly Court feast, during the first Immortal Peach seizing competition, that Jian Wushuang had almost effortlessly claimed the final Immortal Peach, thereby entering the gaze of all the imperial princes.","And from that day until now, barely 20,000 years had passed, and he had grown into an existence even Prince Jiu could not ignore.","\"Jian Wushuang, oh Jian Wushuang, if you were one of us princes, how wonderful it would be,\" Prince Jiu muttered absentmindedly. \"I could offer you everything that Prince Yan can't, including the bloodline of an Emperor.\"","Just then, a timid voice sounded behind him, \"My Lord, would you like to leave with us?\"","Young Master Jiu snapped back to reality, glanced at the young and inexperienced disciple who had spoken, gently shook his head, and then continued to observe everything happening in the void.","The young disciple did not dare to linger and hastily ran to join the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo.","\"We don't need to leave either; it seems the danger has been resolved,\" Xu Tuo said slowly, watching the now calm void and letting out a sigh of relief.","...","\"D-did we really resolve it?\"","Amidst the eternal void of silence, Nan Xuan's chest heaved violently as he gasped for air, seemingly unable to believe that they had dealt with the black-robed figure.","Jian Wushuang's condition wasn't much better. The sudden loss of strength had nearly caused him to fall.","The figure had fallen without any apparent resistance, leaving Jian Wushuang feeling incredulous.","He could not believe that the black-robed figure had simply perished like this.","\"Could it be that he will resurrect like before?\"","He seemed to have a realization and instinctively looked towards the spot where the figure had fallen. It was then that he noticed the faint, dark purple mist-like substance starting to gather once more.","Jian Wushuang was greatly alarmed and immediately unleashed a powerful aura in an attempt to completely destroy the mist. To his surprise, it had no effect whatsoever.","\"What's going on?\" Nan Xuan also noticed something amiss and took several steps back, hastily releasing his formidable Yan power to attack.","But the ethereal, dark purple mist seemed to possess the ability to devour and erode their powers, completely unaffected by their attacks.","With the formation of a vortex, the embryonic form of a body once again appeared!","That body was none other than the black-robed figure that had been struck down!","\"How is this possible? How can this guy be indestructible?\" South Xuan exclaimed in disbelief, then went madly attacking the body.","This time, the reformed black-robed figure did not seem as sluggish as before. Facing Jian Wushuang and Nan Xuan, he slowly raised his palm.","The large palm suddenly spread open with five fingers, and an unimaginable dark purple beam of light burst forth.","Everything happened so quickly that Nan Xuan could not dodge it at all. He could only watch helplessly as his immortal body was pierced through.","But in the next moment, Jian Wushuang suddenly stood in front of Nan Xuan.","Buzz!!!","A tremendous burst of energy, capable of destroying any celestial realm, erupted directly in front of Jian Wushuang's chest.","The Nine Heaven Robes radiated a brilliant light, but the dark purple beam of light happened to hit the only crack in the Mystic Garb of the Nine Heavens.","Jian Wushuang felt his chest shatter in an instant, and that strange energy directly shattered his Immortal body, causing divine blood to gush out.","A dark purple beam of light, tens of millions of zhang long, pierced through his chest and appeared in the eternal void of nothingness.","\"Ah!\"","All the disciples were shocked and shouted in disbelief. Xu Tuo's figure trembled, unable to believe what he was seeing.","The black-robed figure that was supposed to have perished reappeared, and unleashed a destructive aura, almost instantly putting Jian Wushuang in a life-and-death situation.","Prince Jiu was also completely shocked, his face filled with disbelief.","The situation that had almost been decided had suddenly reversed.","The black-robed figure, like an undying nightmare, appeared once again!","Divine blood splattered into the void, and Jian Wushuang's Immortal body completely shattered, falling into Nan Xuan's arms.","\"Hurry...\" he exerted his last bit of strength to speak to Nan Xuan.","Nan Xuan nodded vigorously, then carried Jian Wushuang and fled without hesitation.","This time, the black-robed figure was no longer sluggish as before; he sensed their escape and immediately pursued them.","Boom!","The dark purple beam of light exploded in the void of nothingness. Nan Xuan narrowly avoided it but had no strength to fight back.","He held Jian Wushuang tightly, unable to escape the pursuit of the black-robed figure.","Facing Nan Xuan's frantic escape, the black-robed figure raised his palm again, and countless dark purple rays of light converged, forming a vast net that covered the entire void of nothingness.","Almost the entire void of nothingness was covered, and Nan Xuan had no way to escape!","Prince Jiu furrowed his brow tightly; he had been pursued in a similar situation before, and if it weren't for Jian Wushuang's help, he would have perished long ago.","Now, without outside assistance, there was no way for Nan Xuan and Jian Wushuang to escape!","He was hesitating, as if he was having some sort of internal struggle.","In the end, he did not lend a helping hand but turned his head to the other side.","Faced with the approaching all-encompassing net, Nan Xuan, though unwilling, had no way to turn the tide.","But in the next moment, a sudden change occurred!","Centered around the Sancun Mountain, a vast and pitch-black barrier suddenly appeared, blocking Nan Xuan's figure within it.","The incoming net of destruction followed closely behind but shattered violently upon impact with the barrier.","Nan Xuan was greatly surprised, but he did not have time to think as he directly carried Jian Wushuang to the summit of the Sancun Mountain.","The disciples hurriedly lifted Jian Wushuang and placed him on the broad back of a white crane.","\"Young Friend will be fine. Hurry, leave this place. I will hold them off,\" Nan Xuan said, trembling, and then stuffed the last Emperor-grade pill into Jian Wushuang's mouth.","Seeing this scene, Prince Jiu's expression changed repeatedly. He understood that if they did not leave now, they wouldn't be able to escape later.","Outside the pitch-black barrier, the black-robed figure was attacking frantically.","Under his relentless assault, the barrier was already covered in cracks.","Seeing this, Prince Jiu prepared to leave at once.","Almost at the same time, a voice filled with supreme anger resounded.","\"Truly detestable, causing me to be unsettled even in death! I can't even rest properly!\"","The Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo was stunned for a moment, then his eyes widened to the extreme, as if he had witnessed something utterly impossible.","The entire Immortal mountain began to tremble violently, as if the supreme law of heaven and earth was being born.","Then, a pure sword resonance moved the heavens and the earth, gripping the hearts of all who heard it.","Centered around the pitch-black barrier, an unimaginably enormous phantom descended.","He wore a black robe, his True Eyes brimming with anger, as if he were a sword that could cut through eternity.","He stood above the Nine Revolutions Grand Immortal, at the peak of the Grand Yan Immortal cultivation realm.","At the same time, he was also a Sword Spirit."]},{"number":5093,"title":"Chapter 5093 Crushing","paragraphs":["Weapons had souls, and swords had spirits. Only then could they reach a deeper level.","The only Sword Spirit that could grow into a Peak Grand Yan Immortal was the one who was sleeping in the Sword Tomb on Sancun Mountain.","Yu.","He, who was originally inexorably headed for decline, unexpectedly reappeared at this moment, and with boundless momentum, he directly crushed the figure in the black robe.","The mysterious black barrier shattered, and the black-robed elder, who was also a Sword Spirit, waved his hand heavily toward the figure in black.","In an instant, it was like the destruction of mountains and seas, with everything shattered.","The supreme palm attack actually smashed the black-robed figure into pieces.","...","Even Changfu, who was an extremely strong Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, could not obliterate the black-robed figure. This was despite him sacrificing his Immortal Source. However, at this moment, the black robe was smashed into pieces with a single slap.","This scene left all the disciples of the Sancun Mountain, including Jian Wushuang who had just awakened, and Prince Jiu, wide-eyed in disbelief.","Crushing, annihilating in seconds!","The seemingly indestructible nightmare in the black robe had been directly shattered into pieces, leaving Jian Wushuang unable to believe his eyes.","But the event had indeed happened; the black-robed figure had once again turned to dust.","\"Humph!\"","The immense, unimaginable figure coldly snorted, then stood with hands behind his back, turning and walking towards the divine Sancun Mountain.","With each step, the colossal figure shrank until it reached the front of the Sancun Mountain, where it had returned to its normal form.","Nan Xuan was so shocked that he couldn't speak, looking at him stutteringly, \"You, you're not supposed to exist anymore, right?\"","When this statement was made, all the disciples, including Prince Jiu, had their expressions change. They dared not even breathe loudly, for they knew that this was an unparalleled supreme being capable of slapping to death even the most formidable black-robed figure with a single strike. Being told like this, it was inevitable that the man would feel ashamed and angry.","However, the terrifying scene they had imagined did not materialize. Instead, the black-robed old man appeared somewhat annoyed. \"I originally wanted to die directly, but I couldn't bear the outside world's disturbance. That's why I came back to life and struck down that guy!\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","That's it?","Nan Xuan's mouth twitched. \"Thank, thank goodness you woke up, or else we would be finished.\"","\"Just this little bug has turned this place upside down?\" The black-robed old man looked regretful and slightly helpless. \"Has the Great Si Region really weakened to such an extent now?\"","\"...\"","None of the disciples dared to speak. Jian Wushuang, who had just revived from near death, smiled wryly at the words.","Let alone them, even Changfu, who had also emerged from the Ancient Era, ended up with a tragic fate.","After venting his complaints, the black-robed old man finally noticed Jian Wushuang, who was covered in blood, and quickly walked towards him.","\"Young Friend, what happened to you?\"","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly upon hearing this. \"I've made a fool of myself in front of Senior. I couldn't hold my ground.\"","The black-robed old man stared at him with narrowed eyes. \"You are a Yan Immortal, and although you couldn't hold your ground, you still pressed forward. You have the aura of my generation's demeanor. How could these concealed and tailless rats not dare to step forward?\"","He finished speaking and directly turned his gaze towards Xu Tuo, Nan Xuan, and Prince Jiu.","Prince Jiu unconsciously took a few steps back and remained silent. The aura emitted by the black-robed old man was too overwhelming, causing those who sensed it to go completely silent.","At the same time, Prince Jiu felt a very familiar aura emanating from the black-robed old man. However, he did not act recklessly but chose to remain silent.","Nan Xuan quickly explained, \"Don't look at me. I fought alongside Young Friend from start to finish.\"","The black-robed old man snorted angrily and then turned to Xu Tuo. \"Kid, come and explain to me why only the young man suffered such heavy injuries? What kind of nonsense are you up to?\"","\"...\" Xu Tuo was at a loss for words and then sighed.","\"Lord Yu, you must know that even if you tied us all together earlier, it wouldn't have harmed that person in the black-robed figure in the slightest.\"","\"Just a little while ago, a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal lost his life here.\"","The black-robed old man was greatly astonished, \"A Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, how is that possible?\"","Jian Wushuang spoke, her voice clear and cold, \"Senior, it is indeed true. The Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal who fell here was named Changfu.\"","The black-robed old man seemed somewhat incredulous, \"Changfu, that naive little fellow?\"","\"...\"","\"...\"","All the Yan Immortals had twitching corners of their mouths. How strong must one's qualifications and foundation be to dare to call a supremely powerful figure from the Ancient Era a 'naive little fellow'? Moreover, it seemed that the black-robed old man had known Changfu for a very long time.","\"It's a pity for this honest and straightforward little fellow. He survived the great calamity, only to meet his end in this nameless place.\"","The black-robed old man seemed somewhat melancholic, stirring up a sense of sorrow.","The starry river revolved, ever-changing.","Yan Immortals, from the moment they attained enlightenment and ascended to the Dao, there was no possibility of a good ending.","Even Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, and even Peak Grand Yan Immortals, rarely had good endings.","They had already transcended the Heavenly Dao, and they could even casually modify any aspect of the Heavenly Dao. Fate, for them, was already endless.","Endless fate was like a prison, causing all Yan Immortals to sink into it.","For those who couldn't be constrained by the Qi of the Heavenly Dao, wasn't that also a prison of their own making?","The black-robed man said slowly, \"Well, the little fellow is gone now, and I've avenged him. I can rest in peace.\"","\"Since there's nothing left to do here, I'll continue on my way to death.\"","\"...\"","Jian Wushuang and the others couldn't help but twitch their lips again.","This black-robed old man, whose essence was a Sword Spirit, always seemed to be so independent and carefree in his actions.","He appeared, killed the black-robed figure, and then prepared to seek death again.","\"The little fellow is gone forever,\" the black-robed old man looked at Jian Wushuang and said with a smile.","\"Senior, take care,\" Jian Wushuang bowed respectfully.","Just then, Prince Jiu, who had been silent for a long time, suddenly spoke, \"Senior, it seems like we've met before.\"","The black-robed old man turned around and looked at Jiuyan with some confusion. \"Who are you?\"","Prince Jiu smiled faintly and then clasped his hands, \"I... am the son of Zhen Wuyang.\"","\"Son of Zhen Wuyang?!\" The black-robed old man's face suddenly became extremely excited. \"The starry river changes, and many years have passed. Young man, you've grown so big already?\"","\"I even held you in my arms back in the day.\"","\"Wait a minute? Are you Yan'er?!\"","Prince Jiu's triumphant expression froze on his face as he realized that the black-robed old man seemed to have mistaken him for someone else.","Seeing his expression, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile.","With a forced grin, Jiuyan said, \"Senior, I'm not Prince Yan, I'm the Second Prince Jiu!\"","This time, it was the black-robed old man who felt embarrassed. He stood still on the spot, squinting his eyes, \"Oh my, I've become confused, I've become confused. I mistook you for the First Prince. Please don't take offense, Second Prince.\"","Prince Jiu's lips twitched, and he could only signal that it was no big deal."]},{"number":5094,"title":"Chapter 5094 Indestructible","paragraphs":["However, the black-robed old man continued to ask, \"But I must ask the Second Prince, how is the current situation of the First Prince?\"","Prince Jiu's face was quickly turning into a dark cloud, his mouth twitching incessantly as he spoke through gritted teeth, \"Fine, he's doing fine.\"","The black-robed elder burst into laughter upon hearing this, \"Very good, very good indeed. Since the First Prince is unharmed, I can leave with peace of mind.\"","\"No, Senior, you cannot leave,\" he hurriedly spoke, \"Changfu was once the Senior Elder appointed by my father, the Emperor. Now, he has sacrificed himself to protect me, and I have no other Senior Elders by my side.\"","\"So, I implore you, Senior, to become my Senior Elder.\"","After Prince Jiu finished speaking, he earnestly looked at the black-robed elder.","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes slightly, realizing that after all this talking and circling around, Prince Jiu intended for the black-robed elder to replace Changfu as his Senior Elder.","It had to be said that Prince Jiu indeed possessed a certain level of cunning and charisma, able to gain recognition even in a highly passive situation.","It was likely that the black-robed elder would eventually become his Senior Elder.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang couldn't help but feel a sense of unease. If the black-robed elder joined Prince Jiu's camp, the power struggle among the Emperor's sons would become even more frightening.","He couldn't forget that the Prince Alliance led by Prince Jiu had almost succeeded in erasing the Young Emperor from existence.","Just as Jian Wushuang began to have doubts, the black-robed elder spoke calmly, \"Second Prince, I'm sorry, but I cannot comply with your request. Ever since the ancient catastrophe, I have been on an irreversible path towards decline. The fact that I can still exist today is unimaginable. Therefore, I cannot stay by your side.\"","Prince Jiu was momentarily taken aback, clearly not realizing that the black-robed elder would refuse so decisively. He quickly cupped his hands and bowed, \"Please, Senior, you must agree.\"","A Prince paying his respects was an unimaginable act in the Great Si Region. Moreover, the black-robed elder had countless ties to Emperor Zhen Wuyang, so refusing was almost unacceptable.","However, this courtesy was not allowed to continue as the black-robed elder directly waved his hand, causing Prince Jiu to straighten his posture.","Then, he spoke sternly, \"A Prince should possess the dignity of a Prince. In the Heavenly Court, aside from the Emperor, there is no need for anyone else to show reverence.\"","\"I am truly beyond redemption and can no longer assist you, Second Prince. Please do not hold it against me.\"","Prince Jiu wanted to say something more, but the black-robed elder did not give him a chance to speak.","He turned and walked toward Jian Wushuang, speaking with a voice that only they could hear, \"Young Friend, if you see Yu Chang again, tell him that his old friend has passed away, and he should not dwell on it.\"","\"And also, let him find another sword when he has the chance. Going without a sword is ultimately not feasible.\"","Jian Wushuang's eyes lit up when he heard this.","It was only at this moment that he realized that he and Prince Jiu had both made a mistake.","That is, the black-robed elder had never been the right-hand man of Emperor Zhen Wuyang.","He had never been.","And at this moment, Jian Wushuang also realized that Yu Chang used a sword as well, but his ink-blue longsword was condensed from fate energy, much like Jian Wushuang's Invisible Sword.","The reason Jian Wushuang used an Invisible Sword was that his Tarot Divine Sword had been destroyed, and he currently had no sword to carry his Wushuang Sword Dao.","Likewise, Yu Chang used an Invisible Sword because his longsword had been destroyed.","Yu Chang was a true Peak Grand Yan Immortal and even had a Sword Spirit. He had indeed wielded an unparalleled sword, free from all constraints.","The only one worthy of this sword, apart from Zhen Wuyang, was none other than Yu Chang.","In the vast Great Si Region, a domain with dual Emperors!","This was a hidden secret, known perhaps only to the elders who had survived from the era of the Ancient War, apart from Jian Wushuang.","Yu Chang was also an Emperor, which sounded incredibly unbelievable, but it was indeed a fact.","As a Peak Grand Yan Immortal, the black-robed elder had the right to be called the Sword Emperor!","And only Yu Chang had the right to be his master.","This was evident from the black-robed elder referring to himself as Yu and gifting Jian Wushuang a dark blue ink crystal inscribed with Yu's name.","After saying these words, the black-robed elder smiled warmly and tapped his wrist.","Jian Wushuang understood immediately and subconsciously looked at his own wrist, where he wore a rugged and majestic Canghai Bracelet.","\"The bracelet... could it be related to Uncle Yu?\" He momentarily felt confused.","The memories from the time when he traveled from the Endless Sea to the Heavenly Court were fragmented and shattered, and Jian Wushuang could not recall any memory clues, so he had no way of knowing the origin of the Canghai Bracelet.","\"Alright, the matter is settled. I will continue waiting for my death,\" the black-robed elder laughed heartily and prepared to leave.","However, at this moment, Jian Wushuang's expression changed, and he looked at the elder with a bitter smile. \"I'm afraid, Senior, you can't leave yet. That guy has appeared again.\"","Upon hearing this, the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo and Nan Xuan both had their expressions change dramatically and almost simultaneously exclaimed, \"How is that possible?\"","Three times, truly perishing three times, yet each time coming back to life again, this had already exceeded imagination and was something that should be impossible.","Even Jian Wushuang himself felt deeply powerless in the face of the black-robed figure who emerged from the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor.","\"Could he really be indestructible?\"","The concept of being indestructible was too terrifying; it was almost impossible to exist.","Even Jian Wushuang's Undying and Imperishable Immortal Body could not revive so quickly as the black-robed figure had done.","But the black-robed figure had achieved it, surviving and resurrecting even in the hands of a Peak Grand Yan Immortal.","The black-robed elder had obviously not anticipated this situation, and his brow furrowed slightly.","\"You all wait here; I will go and completely suppress him before returning.\"","With that, he soared toward the empty void of nothingness.","Buzz!!!","An unparalleled wave of sound shook the surroundings, causing even the void of nothingness to tremble.","The power of a Peak Grand Yan Immortal was fully on display at this moment.","The black-robed figure continued to resurrect at the same spot as before, and a vast dark purple radiance surged from under his oversized black robe, shrouding everything.","\"Seeking death!\"","The black-robed elder snorted in anger, and his thunderous voice echoed throughout the Nine Heavens and Ten Earths.","Then, a heaven-enveloping giant palm descended towards the black-robed figure.","This moment made even the Heavenly Dao tremble.","The black-robed figure seemed to sense something and looked up at the empty void.","Finally, he was no longer indifferent and reached out to confront the attack.","A massive dark purple beam of light seemed capable of splitting the void into two, crashing fiercely into the void.","The palm, formed from the order of the Heavenly Dao and the ancient Dao of eternity, descended heavily.","When the two collided, an immeasurable force erupted, causing a terrifying explosion that shook the Nine Heavens and Ten Earths.","At the peak of the Sancun Mountain, Jian Wushuang's eyes narrowed as he witnessed this scene.","Without any hesitation, he released his own Yan power, enveloping the entire mountain within a protective barrier."]},{"number":5095,"title":"Chapter 5095 Guardian of the Secret Text","paragraphs":["In this realm, all disciples watched Jian Wushuang with intense anticipation.","Unbeknownst to them, they had already placed all their hopes on this young Yan Immortal.","As they watched Jian Wushuang stabilize the barrier with his Yan power, Prince Jiu's gaze grew cold and resentful.","He cold not understand why the most powerful individuals were all friendly with Jian Wushuang.","If it were just Yan Immortal, it would be one thing, but even Six and Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals seemed to flock to him.","\"Damn it, how did this guy manage to do it?!\" Prince Jiu was consumed by jealousy.","\"Jian Wushuang, don't get too cocky. One day, I'll crush you beneath my feet!\"","...","This time, the all-encompassing palm that descended from the black-robed elder failed to have the same effect. With shattered light and shattered shadows, the palm was directly dispersed.","A strange, dark-purple radiance aggressively consumed the Yan Immortal power and even defied the heavens, withstanding the black-robed elder's attack.","\"Hmm?\"","As the sky-breaking palm shattered into countless streams of light in the void, the black-robed elder looked puzzled. The previously weakened black-robed figure now seemed even more formidable.","Their first confrontation hadn't inflicted any significant damage on the black-robed figure, causing the elder to grow wary.","The black-robed elder, who had experienced countless battles since the Ancient Era, now sensed something entirely different about the black-robed figure.","He could not sense any flow of Yan Immortal power from the black-robed figure, not even the slightest ripple of it.","This left the black-robed elder extremely perplexed.","Yan power was the fundamental force of the entire Great Si Region, even the ultimate force of the Grand Yan Immortal Realm. No cultivator, not even Emperors, could escape the influence of Yan power, let alone Yan Immortals.","But now, this black-robed figure appeared to have completely and utterly avoided using Yan power. The strange dark-purple radiance he emitted was unique and fundamentally distinct from Yan Immortal power.","For a moment, the black-robed elder entertained many thoughts, but he quickly pushed them aside.","There was only value in contemplating when one was in danger of losing their life, and there was no danger in death.","The void trembled, and the order of the heavens shattered once more.","The black-robed elder moved through the air, extending his right palm with finger-like blades, striking toward the black-robed figure.","The seemingly indestructible black-robed figure appeared even more agile than before. Faced with the supremely powerful black-robed elder, he somehow managed to avoid the full force of the attack.","The fierce battle raged on!","At the same time, Jian Wushuang, who stood atop the divine mountain, gazed intently at the figure in the black-robed figure.","He could sense that the black-robed figure was adapting to the surroundings and growing even stronger than before.","\"Could it be that without touching the source, each death makes one stronger?\"","Jian Wushuang pondered out loud, all the while harboring concerns for the old man in the black-robed figure.","The old man's constant mention of 'seeking death' may very well have indicated that the condition of his Immortal body had truly reached its last stand. In this situation, even if the black-robed elder was a Peak Grand Yan Immortal, he might find himself at a disadvantage.","A more intense battle erupted within the eternal void, becoming a relentless clash.","The black-robed elder, who had been a Peak Grand Yan Immortal since ancient times, possessed an unfathomable foundation. He could casually conjure thousands of Chains of Heavenly Dao with a mere wave of his hand.","Countless Chains of Heavenly Dao, resembling ancient colossal dragons, emerged from the void and entwined around the black-robed figure.","There were simply too many of these Chains of Heavenly Dao for him to avoid, and in an instant, he found himself ensnared by them.","Buzz!!!","A resounding roar echoed through the ancient heavens, and in that moment, each chain of celestial order trembled, giving rise to intricate ink-blue patterns.","At this moment, with the black-robed figure at its center, 999 Chains of Heavenly Dao simultaneously erupted with unparalleled force!","The destiny contained within each chain of celestial order was equivalent to the black-robed elder's full-powered strike.","999 Chains of Heavenly Dao meant 999 full-powered strikes!","Even the eternal void of endless annihilation was perturbed by this.","The unparalleled fate energy of a Peak Grand Yan Immortal erupted completely, and the black-robed figure, bound and unable to escape, began to shatter under the crushing force of this fate energy.","It was quite evident that the body beneath the black-robed figure couldn't withstand the relentless lashings of the heavenly order chains, rapidly developing fine cracks.","At this moment, the old man in the black-robed figure arrived in front of the black-robed figure.","His expression grew solemn, as if he had sensed something. He spoke directly, \"You don't belong to the Great Si Region; who are you really, and what is your origin? A remnant of the ancient Heavenly Court?\"","The black-robed figure remained silent, and it seemed that their body under the wide black-robed figure was on the verge of breaking apart at any moment.","The old man in the black-robed figure narrowed his eyes; he could not even see the face beneath the hood, not even when it was himself attempting to do so. Throughout, this figure remained enigmatic to the extreme.","\"Who are you, really?\" the old man repeated.","This time, the black-robed figure slowly raised their head to gaze at him.","Even at such close proximity, their face beneath the hood remained hidden. All that could be seen was layer upon layer of dark purple mist, which was rather peculiar.","Finally, the black-robed figure, who emerged from the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor and whose identity was shrouded in mystery, spoke.","Their hoarse voice seemed to have traversed countless ages and eras.","\"One who gazes upon the Secret Text shall perish!\"","The black-robed elder furrowed his brow. \"What Secret Text? Speak!\"","\"One who gazes upon the Secret Text shall perish!\"","The phrase was repeated once more, and the figure suddenly raised their head, locking eyes with the old man in the black-robed figure.","Two jet-black rays shot out from beneath the hood like elongated swords.","Caught off guard, the old man momentarily lost focus as they stared back. In that very moment, a sword-like purple radiance burst forth from beneath the black-robed figure and pierced the old man's chest.","In an instant, the 999 Heavenly Dao Chains shattered, and the fate energy vanished rapidly.","\"Senior!\"","Jian Wushuang shouted, without any hesitation, as he lunged toward the old man in the black-robed figure.","Even the chest of a Peak Grand Yan Immortal like the old man was shattered by the purple radiance.","\"You seek death!\"","The Invisible Sword, enveloped in blazing golden divine patterns, had already materialized, and Jian Wushuang, with his feet suspended in the void, hurled the Invisible Sword towards the black-robed figure.","At this moment, even the overwhelming dark purple mist retreated.","Boom!","The incandescent, burning Invisible Sword also pierced through the black-robed figure's chest, and the purest form of the Wushuang Sword Dao erupted within.","The already heavily cracked black-robed figure couldn't withstand such an impact, and it shattered into fragments.","Jian Wushuang did not look at where the black-robed figure had fallen. He raised his hand and caught the falling old man.","\"Senior, are you alright?\"","The black-robed elder's face turned pale, and the supreme fate energy quickly dissipated from his shattered chest.","In a hoarse voice, he said, \"The situation seems a bit dire. My chest is hurting quite badly now...\""]},{"number":5096,"title":"Chapter 5096 People From the Heavenly Court","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang, although anxious, quickly regained his composure.","He fixed his gaze on the dark-robed elder's shattered chest, where an indelible dark purple radiance was slowly flowing.","With a thought, Jian Wushuang swiftly retrieved two Emperor-grade pills. He placed one in the mouth of the dark-robed elder and crushed the other, scattering it over the wound.","Upon ingestion, the dark-robed elder's eyes widened abruptly. The effects of the Emperor-grade pill were so potent that words couldn't describe them. Even a Peak Grand Yan Immortal would be completely restored by it.","As the pill entered his mouth and the formidable medicinal effects coursed through him, the dark-robed elder quickly closed his eyes and began to adjust his breathing.","Jian Wushuang did not waste any time either. He reached out and drew away the mist and dust covering the wound.","Nan Xuan and Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo and the others also hurried over, collectively releasing their energy to protect the dark-robed elder.","Time passed slowly, and his injuries gradually stabilized.","Finally, the dark-robed elder slowly opened his eyes, his gaze shining as he looked at Jian Wushuang.","Then, in a voice that only the two of them could hear, he exclaimed excitedly, \"Impressive, kid! Where did you get these pills, and why do they taste just like the ones I secretly ate all those years ago?\"","\"???\" Jian Wushuang was left baffled. He hadn't expected the first thing the old man would say upon waking up to be about this.","Following that, the dark-robed elder displayed a proud expression. \"Kid, it seems you've managed to find that old guy's stash.\"","\"...\"","His mouth twitched. \"Senior, it looks like you're not hurting anymore.\"","Then, the dark-robed elder finally assumed a serious tone. \"Well, I'm not feeling any pain anymore, but that guy has pushed me one step closer to a dead end.\"","Jian Wushuang knew that every word he uttered was true, and he was inexorably heading towards his demise. His fate energy was exceptionally powerful, but it was also fractured, unable to coalesce, and could only be released.","Furthermore, this battle pushed the black-robed elder towards a dead end.","\"Well, since the matter here is concluded, this old man will continue waiting for death.\"","The black-robed elder uttered his usual mantra, completely dismissing thoughts of life and death.","However, just as his words fell, his expression suddenly changed, and his gaze turned towards the distant void.","\"Not good, those guys have also come!\"","Jian Wushuang instantly became alert, but before he could speak, the black-robed elder urgently shouted, \"Kid, what about the crystal I gave you earlier? Hurry up, escape, and let me hide inside.\"","...","Jian Wushuang followed the instructions and took out the ink-blue crystal from the Boyang Bottle. The black-robed elder directly plunged into it, disappearing.","With vigilance mixed with curiosity, Jian Wushuang wondered who the newcomers were that made the black-robed elder so cautious.","In the next moment, from the depths of the endless void, a vast and supreme aura of destiny emerged, covering the heavens.","These destinies were not just one, but dozens of them.","\"Is there no end to this?!\" Nan Xuan was almost exhausted.","Jian Wushuang squinted, sensing the majestic destinies approaching, devoid of terrifying intentions.","He pondered silently, \"Could it be envoys from the Heavenly Court?\"","As if to confirm his guess, ten figures with glowing halos, carrying supreme destinies, appeared in mid-air.","\"Indeed, they are envoys from the Heavenly Court.\"","Jian Wushuang frowned, quickly realizing that the apocalyptic aura emitted by the Great Mi Heavenly had alarmed the Heavenly Court, prompting them to send their elders to investigate.","In an instant, ten majestic figures arrived, exuding an imposing presence.","Accompanying their arrival, the indescribable order of the heavenly path was rebuilt, and the once-chaotic void began to stabilize into eternal silence.","\"Be careful, these newcomers are Elders from the Heavenly Court,\" the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo whispered, his gaze heavy.","\"So, these are the Elders of the Heavenly Court,\" Nan Xuan murmured thoughtfully.","Prince Jiu, on the other hand, breathed a sigh of relief. As the son of the Emperor, there was no one closer to the Heavenly Court's Elders than him.","Leading the ten divine figures was one with an angry expression, a pure face without a beard, and a chilling aura.","He took a step forward, his gaze slowly sweeping over Jian Wushuang and the others. After pausing briefly on Jian Wushuang and Prince Jiu, he withdrew his gaze.","\"Who is responsible for this place?\" the man with angry eyes asked in a cold tone, and an unimaginable pressure followed suit.","A Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal!","Jian Wushuang quickly realized that these Elders who had survived since the Ancient Era were at least at the Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal realm, and it was even highly likely that some of them were at the pinnacle of the Grand Yan Immortal realm.","In the face of these formidable beings, resistance seemed utterly futile.","At this moment, everyone fell silent.","The reasons behind this massive destruction were too complex, and the instigator, the figure in the black robe, had completely disappeared, making it impossible to ascertain the truth.","Furthermore, the Heavenly Court was not a benevolent entity, and causing such destruction in the Great Mi Heaven would likely result in the Heavenly Court's interference.","This was Jian Wushuang's concern, which is why he had no intention of speaking up.","Nan Xuan, on the other hand, shook his head and looked around as if he were completely unaware of the situation.","The Divine Craftsman, Xu Tuo, clenched his teeth and remained silent. He understood that causing such terrible damage to the Heavenly Region would result in exile to desolate lands for eternity if the Heavenly Court discovered his involvement.","At this moment, Prince Jiu, who had remained silent until now, took a step forward and began, \"Immortal Lord Zhen Yao, I...\"","He did not finish his sentence as the enraged Immortal Lord Zhen Yao interrupted him with a cold, dismissive tone, \"Your Highness, did I give you permission to speak?\"","Prince Jiu fell silent, his face alternating between shades of red and blue. His anger flashed briefly in his eyes and then returned to its original state.","The gaze of Immortal Lord Zhen Yao continued to sweep the area, eventually stopping on Jian Wushuang, who maintained a calm demeanor.","\"Jian Wushuang, you, explain what's going on here.\"","Jian Wushuang's figure stiffened slightly, feeling somewhat helpless.","He wasn't entirely sure why this Immortal Lord Zhen Yao knew his name, but he could vaguely speculate on some connections.","After a moment of contemplation, he began, \"Originally, my companions and I came here for training and to pay a visit to the esteemed Divine Craftsman. However, an unexpected and significant change occurred.\"","\"Suddenly, a malevolent creature arrived here and began wreaking havoc. It quickly laid waste to this place. In order to prevent the Great Mi Heaven from being destroyed, Divine Craftsman and I joined forces to resist this creature.\"","\"However, that creature was too ferocious, and we were no match for it. Just as we were about to be defeated and on the brink of destruction, that creature suddenly fled from this place. Shortly thereafter, all of you arrived.\"","\"Now, in hindsight, I believe that creature fled abruptly due to its fear of the immense fate energy of all the Immortal Lords present, causing it to hastily escape.\"","As he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","In his explanation, he managed to convey the situation accurately while also subtly flattering the Heavenly Court's Elders, earning a nod of approval from Nan Xuan in the process."]},{"number":5097,"title":"Chapter 5097 Take Them All Away","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang did not dwell on it too much; he only wanted to deal with the current situation and then make a quick exit.","This black-robed figure incident was closely related to him, and if the Heavenly Court were to investigate the situation here, his prospects would undoubtedly be bleak.","If Prince Ji brought up certain details, it would undoubtedly put him in an even more precarious position.","What Jian Wushuang needed to do now was to downplay his own presence.","\"Hmph, what a load of nonsense!\" Prince Ji glanced at him disdainfully, seemingly quite displeased.","As for Immortal Lord Zhen Yao, after hearing Jian Wushuang's words, a meaningful look appeared in his eyes.","Then, he spoke with a solemn tone, \"To have caused this level of destruction here, it's likely even a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal couldn't achieve such a feat. I'm very curious, how did you guys manage it?\"","\"Could that creature be beyond the realm of a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal?\"","With just one brief question, he directly hit the crux of the matter.","In reality, the black-robed figure far exceeded the level of a Six Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal and could even dominate a Nine Revolutions. However, if it were mentioned that the black-robed figure was beyond the Nine Revolutions, it would surely alert everyone to the complexity of the situation.","Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment and then replied, \"There's a possibility, but his appearance was so sudden, and his departure was hasty. We couldn't even sense his true aura.\"","Immortal Lord Zhen Yao continued, \"If that's the case, then that creature must have come for some kind of supreme treasure. Which one of you possesses such a treasure?\"","He smiled faintly, \"Don't forget, this is the Heavenly Region of the Divine Craftsman, and the number of supreme treasures contained here is beyond imagination.\"","Immortal Lord Zhen Yao revealed a deep and meaningful expression, \"Oh, is that so? Then let me ask you again, how did you manage to survive under that creature's hand until now?\"","Jian Wushuang replied directly, \"That creature had no interest in prolonged battles. It seemed to be searching for something, which is why it caused such destruction in the Heavenly Region. That's why all of us were able to survive until you, esteemed Immortal Lords, arrived.\"","In a conversation where not a drop of information leaked, nothing of importance was revealed.","This made Immortal Lord Zhen Yao furrow his brow slightly. The situation here couldn't possibly be so simple, or else the Heavenly Court wouldn't have been shaken, and even the Emperor had been alerted.","This time, the Emperor had sent them to Great Mi Heaven to thoroughly investigate the cause of the matter and throw the instigators into the Endless Sea to consider the matter closed.","But now, everything seemed to be concealed, without any leads.","\"Jian Wushuang!\" Immortal Lord Zhen Yao said with a touch of anger, \"Do you realize the consequences of concealing information?\"","Jian Wushuang knew that he was getting angry and could only raise his hands helplessly, saying, \"Immortal Lord, the situation has indeed developed this way. If you don't believe me, I can't do anything about it.\"","Immortal Lord Zhen Yao stepped forward, \"Are you not afraid of being thrown into the Endless Sea?\"","\"Is that even a possibility?\" he muttered to himself, then continued, \"Although the situation is somewhat convoluted, this is the general course of events. If Xianjun doesn't believe it, you can investigate it yourself.\"","The atmosphere was tense, and all ten elders cast scrutinizing glances at Jian Wushuang, trying to find a breakthrough.","In the end, it was Immortal Lord Zhen Yao who spoke first. He looked at Prince Jiu and asked, \"Your Highness, is what Jian Wushuang said true?\"","Jian Wushuang's heart shook but quickly calmed down.","Prince Jiu, on the other hand, kept frowning, seemingly hesitating. Finally, he looked at Immortal Lord Zhen Yao and said, \"Immortal Lord Zhen Yao, it is indeed true.\"","\"Indeed true? Your Highness, are you starting to conceal the truth as well?\" Immortal Lord Zhen Yao glared, then raised his hand, and nearly a hundred Chains of Heavenly Dao shot out, binding both Prince Jiu and Jian Wushuang directly.","Prince Jiu was first taken aback, then lowered his head to look at the Chains of Heavenly Dao bound to his waist and shouted angrily, \"Immortal Lord Zhen Yao, how dare you?!\"","\"This is the Emperor's command, and anyone must carry it out, including the Emperor's son!\" he said sternly, clearly unafraid of the Prince.","\"I, the Emperor's son, will comply!\" Prince Jiu said with great indignation.","It was apparent that Immortal Lord Zhen Yao did not care about his feelings; instead, he tightened the Chains of the Heavenly Dao even further.","Everyone present, including the disciples of the Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo, got the treatment of being bound by the Chains of Heavenly Dao.","Especially Jian Wushuang, he was practically wrapped up like a dumpling, with only his head exposed.","\"Binding me is one thing, but isn't this a bit excessive...\" he remarked.","\"Special circumstances warrant special treatment,\" Immortal Lord Zhen Yao said with a casual glance.","At this moment, Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo spoke up, \"Gentlemen and Immortal Lords, where are you taking us?\"","\"We're taking you all to the Heavenly Court, to be dealt with by the Emperor.\"","\"T-the Heavenly Court?!\" All the disciples were in shock, exchanging puzzled glances.","For them, the Heavenly Court, which was the central hub of the entire Great Si Region, was an unimaginable and untouchable existence. They weren't even considered Top Cultivators.","Now, the fact that they were going to ascend to the Heavenly Court left all the disciples unsure whether to be excited or fearful.","Nan Xuan felt like crying without tears. The Heavenly Court was like a prison for someone like him, a free-spirited, solitary transcendent cultivator. This journey would likely bring more harm than good.","Over 60 figures, bound by the Chains of Heavenly Dao Order, were about to be sent to the Heavenly Court.","However, at this moment, Immortal Lord Zhen Yao abruptly halted and his intimidating gaze converged.","The other nine Elders also focused their attention.","In the eternal and empty void, a gust of dust-filled wind swirled.","Thin strands of dark purple mist appeared out of nowhere, condensing once again!","At this moment, Jian Wushuang's gaze became completely serious.","If it could be said that resurrection was a far-fetched notion, the black-robed figure had already been resurrected three times, and now it was happening again.","This was an unimaginable phenomenon, further proof that he was an undying and indestructible being. Even a Peak Grand Yan Immortal Lord couldn't completely obliterate him!","Jian Wushuang was horrified. What kind of existence was this black-robed figure emerging from the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor? Was his sole purpose truly to protect the secrets within the bone armor?","But what exactly did the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor contain that made the black-robed figure willing to exterminate anyone who glimpsed its secrets?","As the dark purple mist condensed, the nightmarish figure of the black robe reappeared.","Not only Jian Wushuang, but also Nan Xuan and Divine Craftsman Xu Tuo, felt a bone-chilling coldness deep in their hearts.","Endless resurrections, all at their peak, an individual who couldn't be completely extinguished even by a Peak Grand Yan Immortal—","could such a being truly exist?","At this moment, all ten Immortal Lord Elders sensed the presence of the black-robed figure, and their expressions turned serious.","Then, Immortal Lord Zhen Yao turned his gaze to Jian Wushuang, who was bound by the Chains of Heavenly Dao like a dumpling. \"Jian Wushuang, take a look. Is this the evil entity you mentioned?\""]},{"number":5098,"title":"Chapter 5098 Gathering in the Heavenly Court","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang nodded eagerly, \"Please, Immortal Lord, act swiftly to eliminate this evil creature. It's truly too terrifying and otherworldly. To prevent any future troubles, let's take action right away.\"","\"Eliminate it? I cannot kill it. I must capture it alive and hand it over to the Emperor for judgment,\" Immortal Lord Zhen Yao decided firmly, then turned his gaze back to the figure in the black robe.","\"You're confused, utterly confused,\" Jian Wushuang shook his head to signal his disagreement, but he could not attract the attention of the Elders.","Facing the figure in the black robe, the ten Ancient Elders who had emerged from the Heavenly Court each released their unique auras.","These ten Elders from the Ancient Era were all Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortals, and their boundless fate energy directly formed an unparalleled aura within the void of nothingness!","Such fate energy had surpassed comprehension, and even the Grand Yan immortals were like dust in the face of this unparalleled fate energy.","\"Emperor's fate energy?\" Jian Wushuang was slightly stunned as he looked at the overwhelming aura. It didn't take him long to realize this.","The reason this unparalleled fate energy was so terrifying was because it contained the Emperor's fate energy.","The Emperor's fate energy was an unparalleled existence, flowing invisibly throughout all things, and only the Emperor could control it.","As Immortal Lords who had followed the Emperor since the Ancient Era, although these Elder Immortal Lords couldn't control the Emperor's fate energy, they had been naturally nurtured by it due to their constant proximity to the Emperor.","After countless years, the fate energy of these Elder immortal lords had naturally absorbed some traces of the Emperor's fate energy.","Under this unparalleled fate energy, all the Immortals trembled.","A fate energy that could challenge the Heavenly Dao was being born, transforming into tendrils that coiled around the figure in the black robe.","It could be foreseen that once the battle began, it would be even more brutal and terrifying.","Jian Wushuang swallowed hard, subconsciously adjusting his position. If a battle broke out, he was bound tightly like a zongzi and had no chance of escaping.","\"Foul creature, surrender!\" Immortal Lord Zhen Yao proclaimed loudly, shaking the heavens and the earth.","Under the boundless and unparalleled fate energy, the figure in the black robe slowly revived, as if he had quickly adapted to this suppression.","Afterward, from beneath the spacious hood, two dark purple rays suddenly burst forth!","\"Seeking death!\" Immortal Lord Zhen Yao erupted in anger and directly waved his hand to suppress.","A void tremor accompanied his action, and the other nine Elder Immortal Lords also joined in, striking simultaneously.","Ten colossal palm strikes, each containing unparalleled intent, descended.","enigmatic and solitary, made no attempt to flee.","He slowly raised his head, and then with his arms raised as if supporting the heavens, he chose to confront them head-on.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","At that moment, even the boundless void quaked to an indescribable degree. Jian Wushuang and the others were sent flying by the shockwaves, retreating tens of thousands of zhang.","The boundless and supreme aura of destiny momentarily dimmed, and the tendrils formed from the fate energy shattered.","\"Hmm?\"","All the Elder Immortal Lords voiced their doubts, and after exchanging glances, they fixed their gazes on the black-robed figure.","Beneath the boundless fate energy, the ten colossal palm prints, filled with unparalleled intent, did not descend but were instead caught head-on by the black robe.","There were faint golden strands of destiny swirling within the ten colossal palms, and they cracked open, revealing wisps of misty dark purple radiance.","Immortal Lord Zhen Yao's gaze turned solemn. He looked at the other nine Elder Immortal Lords and then repeatedly formed hand seals before fiercely striking out at the figure in the black robe.","The nine Elder Immortal Lords did not hesitate either; they too formed hand seals and struck.","The previously heavily cracked ten colossal palm prints, as if receiving some kind of blessing, instantly repaired their cracks and emitted dazzling golden brilliance.","Under the pressure of the ten colossal palms, the black-robed figure's arms, raised as if to support the heavens, could not bear the weight and shattered instantly. His body was crushed as well.","Facing these ten immense palm strikes, the figure in the black robe, Immortal Lord Zhen Yao spoke in a deep voice, \"Everyone, ease up. We want him alive.\"","The nine Elder Immortal Lords simultaneously eased their efforts and stood with their hands behind their backs.","Then, Zhen Yao leaped into the very center of the boundless aura of fate energy.","With his arms shattered, the black-robed figure knelt on the ground, enduring the terrifying pressure brought by the aura of destiny.","He furrowed his brow and said, \"Who are you? Why are you intent on destroying the Great Mi Heaven?\"","The black-robed figure remained silent, only slowly lifting his head, two cold rays shooting out from under the spacious hood.","Immortal Lord Zhen Yao felt a slight shock in his heart; with his cultivation level, he could not discern the face beneath the black robe.","\"One who gazes upon the Secret Text shall perish.\"","It was the same sentence again, repeated by the black-robed figure, and then he fell into silence.","\"Who dares to pry into the Secret Text?\" Zhen Yao continued to inquire, but no matter how he asked, the figure in the black-robed figure remained silent.","Subconsciously, he turned and looked towards Jian Wushuang, who was tens of millions of feet away.","Jian Wushuang struggled to break free from the Chains of the Heavenly Dao Order that bound him. When he felt the gaze upon him, he quickly composed himself and continued to meditate, focusing on his breathing and inner thoughts.","'It must be this kid who caused trouble!' Zhen Yao pondered inwardly, then set aside these questions for the moment.","As he watched the black-robed figure that could even contend with ten Elder Immortal Lords, Zhen Yao showed no signs of arrogance. He raised his arm, and boundless fate energy began to gather into chains.","There were a total of ten chains, each one formed from the fate energy of an Elder Immortal Lord, collectively binding the black-robed figure.","Then, Immortal Lord Zhen Yao took out a small cauldron from his waist and directly absorbed the black-robed figure into it.","After completing all of this, the void returned to its ultimate state of silence and nothingness.","After glancing back at Jian Wushuang, Immortal Lord Zhen Yao turned his gaze forward.","\"Back to the Heavenly Court.\"","...","Immortal clouds enveloped the area, and the essence of life flowed and ascended.","The purest essence of life, so pure that it had turned into a liquid, converged into a torrential waterfall flowing in the sky canyon of the Immortal mountain.","Cycling endlessly, it was an unparalleled Celestial Realm that could not be described or directly observed!","Hidden amidst the ethereal clouds and mist, the SkySide Cloud Platform had not been visited by a Yan Immortal for millions of years, making it one of the more secluded places in the Heavenly Court.","At this moment, on the SkySide Cloud Platform, surrounded by the Chains of the Heavenly Dao, Jian Wushuang, who was tied up like a dumpling, said helplessly, \"What are you guys talking about? I have no idea what you're saying.\"","\"Are you really clueless?\" Immortal Lord Zhen Yao squatted in front of him, speaking with a smirk.","Jian Wushuang firmly replied, \"I really don't know anything. Even if you throw me into the Endless Sea, I still won't know what happened. Asking me again won't yield any results.\"","\"Kid, even at this point, you won't speak up? Do you really want the Emperor to personally intervene?\" an Elder Immortal with black eyebrows and white beard couldn't help but persuade, \"Come clean as soon as possible. You must understand that destroying the Heavenly Realm to that extent will have unimaginable consequences.\"","Jian Wushuang hurriedly said, \"Don't talk nonsense. I didn't destroy the Great Mi Heaven. You all saw who did it; you can confront that guy.\"","\"You!!\" The Elder Immortal with black eyebrows and white beard was momentarily at a loss for words, his anger almost rendering him speechless."]},{"number":5099,"title":"Chapter 5099 What’s His Origin?","paragraphs":["Watching Jian Wushuang, who was stubbornly uncooperative, even the Immortal Lord Zhen Yao found himself quite frustrated.","He couldn't be persuaded with gentle words, and using force wasn't an option either. To uncover the secrets he sought, it seemed he'd have to dig deeper into the other Yan Immortals.","With this in mind, Immortal Lord Zhen Yao turned his gaze towards the divine craftsman Xu Tuo and said, \"Old Friend, you must know something, don't you?\"","Xu Tuo did not hesitate for a moment and shook his head, saying, \"Everything happened too quickly. Even if I wanted to know something, I wouldn't have had the chance.\"","Immortal Lord Zhen Yao made a tempting offer, \"Speak up, and I'll ask the Emperor to give you another Heavenly Region that's even more perfect than the Sancun Mountain.\"","Xu Tuo shook his head again and fell silent.","\"You old coot, I'll see how long you can hold out!\" Immortal Lord Zhen Yao grew impatient and frustrated.","Nan Xuan quickly distanced himself, saying, \"Don't look at me, I know nothing. I'm just a passing Yan Immortal; this has nothing to do with me.\"","Immortal Lord Zhen Yao rose in anger and decided not to press any further.","Then, a golden light suddenly passed through the clouds surrounding the Skyside Cloud Platform, filling the air with a breathtaking aura.","The various Immortal Lords Elders immediately changed their expressions, looking solemnly towards the outside of the Skyside Cloud Platform.","Pure golden rays pierced through layers of clouds and projected onto the vast Dao Arena within the Skyside Cloud Platform.","Following that, two majestic figures descended from the clouds and landed on the platform.","Upon seeing these two figures, Jian Wushuang couldn't help but be speechless.","The divine craftsman Xu Tuo's mind shook, and he closed his eyes, refusing to watch any further.","Prince Jiu was both astonished and delighted.","Nan Xuan, although he had never been to the Heavenly Court, could sense the aura and fluctuations in the air. His eyes were filled with disbelief.","As for the disciples of the Sancun Mountain, they had long since fainted, missing the opportunity to catch a glimpse of the Emperor's true appearance.","The arrival was none other than the supreme being of the entire Heavenly Court, Zhen Wuyang, along with Yu Chang.","\"Greetings, Your Majesty,\" led by Immortal Lord Zhen Yao, the ten Immortal Lord Elders paid their respects.","Zhen Wuyang waved his hand and then slowly scanned over Jian Wushuang and the others, a faint smile playing at the corner of his mouth.","\"How is the situation in the Great Mi Heaven?\" he inquired.","Immortal Lord Zhen Yao nodded slightly. \"Your Majesty, the situation is not too favorable. One-sixth of the Heavenly Realm has been turned into nothingness.\"","Zhen Wuyang's expression hardened. \"One-sixth of the Heavenly Realm turned into nothingness?\"","\"Indeed, that's the truth.\"","\"Is it their doing?\"","\"At the moment, we don't know,\" Immortal Lord Zhen Yao replied, looking somewhat embarrassed. \"However, the ones responsible for the destruction of the Heavenly Realm have been identified.\"","At this, Zhen Wuyang looked once again at Jian Wushuang, his voice deep and dignified. \"Jian Wushuang, why do we find your presence in the Great Mitian? Shouldn't you be in the Six Heavens Realm?\"","Jian Wushuang's lips trembled slightly, and then he replied, \"Um, I just needed some time to clear my mind.\"","\"Clear your mind? Why didn't you go with Yan'er, then?\" Zhen Wuyang furrowed his brow slightly.","\"...\"","Immortal Lord Zhen Yao hastily interjected, \"Your Majesty, the Young Emperor is the Crown Prince and shouldn't move around freely.\"","Only then did Zhen Wuyang realize the impropriety of his words. After a slight cough, he turned to Immortal Lord Zhen Yao. \"Since the culprit behind the Heavenly Realms' destruction has been found, release them on the spot.\"","Immortal Lord Zhen Yao nodded and immediately took a small cauldron from his waist, tossing it into the air.","In an instant, a brilliant radiance emanated from the cauldron, and chains of great aura and fortune extended out, followed by a figure in a black robe descending to the ground.","With the appearance of the black-robed figure, the tranquil and peaceful Heavenly Court suddenly exuded a dangerous aura.","At that moment, both Zhen Wuyang and Yu Chang focused their gaze.","The kingly fate energy and aura of the Emperor directly suppressed the black-robed figure. Bound by the chains of great fate energy, and further suppressed by the Emperor's fate energy, the black-robed figure, which had originally been formidable enough to contend with Peak Grand Yan Immortals, disintegrated rapidly.","Zhen Wuyang concentrated and waved his hand, lowering the layers of Emperor's fate energy, shattering the chains on the black-robed figure.","Without any restraint, the black-robed figure rose to its feet, and an indescribable eerie aura instantly erupted.","However, Zhen Wuyang merely moved his palm slightly, shattering that aura.","The entire SkySide Cloud Platform surged with winds and dark clouds appeared.","Zhen Wuyang's expression turned solemn as he stared intently at the black-robed figure.","After a while, he spoke in a calm tone, \"Where do you come from, and why do you want to destroy our Great Si Region?\"","The black-robed figure raised its head, and a muffled and desolate voice emanated from beneath the hood, \"One who gazes upon the Secret Text shall perish!\"","Zhen Wuyang frowned, \"Did you come from the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm?\"","At this moment, Yuchang, who had remained silent until now, shook his head slightly, \"It's unlikely that this person is from the Heaven-Reaching Buddhist Realm. They are very cautious and rarely intrude into our Great Si Region.\"","\"Indeed, they also don't have any hair,\" Zhen Wuyang added with a hint of mockery before becoming solemn again. \"But why can't I discern their cultivation level? Could it be that they are not a Yan Immortal?\"","\"One who gazes upon the Secret Text shall perish!\" the black-robed figure repeated.","\"Those who pry into the Secret Text?\" Zhen Wuyang looked directly at Jian Wushuang and then waved his hand, bringing him closer.","\"What are these Secret Text, and did you come to the Great Mi Heaven Heavenly Region to find them?\"","Jian Wushuang was speechless for a moment. Then, the chains of fate energy binding him were wiped away, and he stood before Zhen Wuyang and Yu Chang.","\"Well, I'm not entirely sure myself. I haven't figured out anything yet.\"","\"Did you go to the Great Mi Heaven Heavenly Region to find Xu Tuo and search for some Secret Text?\" Zhen Wuyang hit the nail on the head.","With things having come this far, Jian Wushuang did not want to conceal too much. \"Yes, that's correct.\"","\"Being able to destroy one-sixth of the Heavenly Region in the Great Mi Heaven is probably beyond your capabilities,\" Zhen Wuyang stared at him intently, \"Was it a battle between you?\"","Jian Wushuang shook his head, \"With my strength, I could barely defend myself.\"","\"Then who was it that fought against him?\"","\"Changfu.\"","\"Changfu?\"","\"Yes, he held off the black-robed figure at the cost of his own life.\"","Zhen Wuyang furrowed his brows; this was bad news for him.","Changfu was a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal who had emerged from the Ancient Era and had followed him for countless ages, enduring numerous bloody battles. He had ultimately established the Great Si Region and was a venerable veteran of the Heavenly Court.","But now, his Senior Elder Changfu had silently passed away.","Taking a deep breath, Zhen Wuyang turned to Jian Wushuang and asked, \"So, where did this black-robed fellow come from?\"","Regarding the origin of the figure, apart from Jian Wushuang, not even Nan Xuan or the skilled craftsman Xu Tuo could guess.","As long as he did not reveal it, no Yan Immortal would know where the black-robed figure had come from.","However, Jian Wushuang now faintly realized that the Heavenly Script Bone Armor was not as simple as he had imagined.","In a sense, it had already surpassed his control.","So far, Jian Wushuang was convinced that the secret messages hidden in the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor were related to Xuan Yi.","But everything remained unresolved, still shrouded in mystery, and extremely dangerous.","What was the true identity of the black-robed figure within the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor?"]},{"number":5100,"title":"Chapter 5100 You Don’t Belong to This Era","paragraphs":["Hidden within the mysterious celestial bone armor, which had concealed Xuan Yi's ultimate secret, why did such a terrifying existence exist?","Moreover, even Emperor Zhen Wuyang could not detect the realm of the black-robed figure.","In what form did he truly exist within the bone armor, and for how many ages had he existed?","Everything seemed to come to the surface, yet everything also entangled even more, like a tangled mess of threads that one couldn't even begin to unravel.","Jian Wushuang remained silent for a moment and then said, \"He emerged from a piece of bone armor.\"","\"Bone armor? What bone armor?\" Zhen Wuyang's gaze turned serious.","\"A piece of bone armor that contained hidden inscriptions, very mystical, but it has now been destroyed,\" he said, \"and this black-robed person emerged from that bone armor.\"","To have a black-robed figure emerge from a piece of bone armor with strength comparable to a Peak Grand Yan Immortal was beyond belief.","You see, even a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, which was close to the Emperor's Dao, perceived the Emperor's fate energy. Not to mention the Peak Grand Yan Immortals.","Peak Grand Yan Immortals were already at the pinnacle of existence. They had found and immersed themselves in their Dao for countless ages, nearly equivalent to an Emperor-to-be's existence.","So, who could seal such a Peak Grand Yan Immortal within a small piece of bone armor?","Or perhaps, was it voluntary on his part to be sealed within it?","After hearing Jian Wushuang's account, Zhen Wuyang's expression changed several times, but he ultimately returned to calmness.","\"In other words, you hold such a piece of bone armor and seek a Great Yan Immortal who can decipher the inscriptions on it within the Great Mi Heaven?\"","Jian Wushuang nodded, \"That's correct, but I didn't expect there would be such an entity within that bone armor.\"","Zhen Wuyang was furious, \"Nonsense! If there is something even more terrifying within that bone armor, what will you do? Do you intend to destroy my Great Si Region?\"","\"...\"","\"I'll settle the score with you later!\" Zhen Wuyang left these words behind and turned his gaze to the black robe.","Then, the chains formed by Emperor's fate energy directly restrained the black-robed figure's limbs, suspending him in the center of the SkySide Cloud Platform, hanging in the air.","The Emperor's fate energy was majestic, making all the Great Yan Immortals dare not look directly at it.","Zhen Wuyang slowly approached the black-robed figure, his eyes filled with supreme authority.","\"Where did you come from, and why did you remain within a piece of bone armor?\"","The clouds rolled and the wind picked up abruptly.","Within the silent hall, the figure remained silent.","Zhen Wuyang furrowed his brow and said, \"If you won't speak, do you understand the consequences?\"","The Emperor's power descended, completely enveloping the black-robed figure.","Under such power, a substantial amount of dark purple mist spilled out from under the black robe and quickly dissipated.","Seeing this energy, not Yan power of the Great Si Region but equally formidable, Zhen Wuyang reached out and plucked a strand of dark purple radiance.","This tiny strand of dark purple radiance danced in his palm and persisted for a long time but seemed to repel Yan power, ultimately dissolving.","Zhen Wuyang tightly closed his Emperor Eyes, seemingly sensing the source of this radiance.","Within the SkySide Cloud Platform, there was an unparalleled silence, and no one dared to speak.","At this moment, Yu Chang smiled and looked at Jian Wushuang, saying in a voice only they could hear, \"Young Jian, you've gotten into trouble this time.\"","Jian Wushuang bitterly smiled, \"I never expected this outcome.\"","\"It doesn't matter; the Emperor will surely have a way,\" Yu Chang said with a narrowed smile. \"Did you have encounter anything strange on your journey?\"","Jian Wushuang hesitated for a moment and then replied, \"No, this journey to the Great Mi Heaven was nothing but heart-pounding. I didn't encounter anything else.\"","Yu Chang nodded at his response and did not say more.","Jian Wushuang secretly sighed in relief but also felt a hint of confusion. 'Could they have discovered it so quickly?'","However, he quickly suppressed this thought. After all, the Boyang Bottle was an item of Emperor Yang Jun himself, capable of concealing even the Heavenly Court. How could it fail to hide a Peak Grand Yan Immortal?","With this in mind, Jian Wushuang suddenly widened his eyes and became anxious. 'No, this is bad! Could they be fighting over it?!'","All along, the Boyang Bottle had served as his personal treasure chest, storing all the treasures he had acquired, including his trump cards.","The ink-blue crystal containing the black-robed elder was casually stuffed into the Boyang Bottle by him.","As Yu Chang's Sword Spirit, the black-robed elder had undoubtedly participated in one bloodbath after another.","In other words, it was highly likely that Yu Chang had been involved in the annihilation of the three Emperors of the Heavenly Court.","This was an irreconcilable blood feud, with no possibility of reconciliation.","If they were to fight inside the Boyang Bottle, the three Emperors, left with only their True Spirits, would undoubtedly be at a disadvantage and might even be defeated.","No matter what the situation, this was something Jian Wushuang did not want to see.","However, with two true Emperors watching him, Jian Wushuang could not open the Boyang Bottle to check what was happening inside. He could only fret silently.","At this moment, Zhen Wuyang opened his eyes, and a golden light shone in his gaze.","He seemed to have realized something, his brow furrowing and then relaxing.","After a moment, Zhen Wuyang said, \"You don't belong to the Great Si Region, or even to this era. Who are you?\"","This sentence was like a tsunami, even Yu Chang's expression turned solemn.","The weight of this sentence contained too much information.","Zhen Wuyang, who had emerged from the distant and desolate Ancinet Era and had swept through one Heavenly Court after another, must have known something profound.","The Ancient Era was already an unimaginable era, and now there was an even more era than that?","And this black-robed figure existed from that mysterious era?","Jian Wushuang realized that he had severely underestimated the age of the Heaven-Patterned Bone Armor and was filled with an indescribable emotion.","Could it be that the news from his master, Xuan Yi, had already become a secret in an era where even time and years had no meaning?","Who was he? What had he done to end up in this situation?","Jian Wushuang was shaken and looked at the black robe with a deep desire to learn some information from him.","But under the suppression of the Emperor's fate energy, the black-robed figure was once again on the brink of extinction.","\"You don't belong to this era, who are you?\" Zhen Wuyang repeated the question, somewhat annoyed.","The black robe, who had been silent, raised his head at this moment, and two dark purple cold lights shot out from under the wide hood.","It was his gaze, scrutinizing Zhen Wuyang.","Then, that old, hoarse voice spoke again, \"One who gazes upon the Secret Text shall perish!\"","\"Is that the only thing you have to say?\" Zhen Wuyang frowned. \"If you're willing to tell me, I'll let you go once, free you from suffering, and allow you to leave.\""]}]);
